rblaze",["pre"]={5922},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=5930,["minLevel"]=10},{["map"]=1450,["note"]="Speak with the Great Bear Spirit",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:goal:16:3",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Seek out the Great Bear Spirit and learn what it has to share with you about the nature of the bear."}},["y"]=0.275,["x"]=0.391,["title"]="Great Bear Spirit",["quest"]=5930},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:9:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Great Bear Spirit",["quest"]=5930,["y"]=0.3064},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:9:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11802,["y"]=0.3064,["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Back to Thunder Bluff",["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["pre"]={5930},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=5932,["minLevel"]=10},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Thunder Bluff",["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:9:6",["t"]="fly",["node"]=22,["area"]=1638}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:step:16",["text"]="Moonglade",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren"}},["detail"]="Cast Teleport: Moonglade: it lands you beside the building where Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs. The Great Bear Spirit sits in the woods to the north-west. Speak to it and go through all of its words (what it represents, the strength of the body, the strength of the heart, then ask for its blessing): the talk is the objective, there is no fight. It blends into the ground, has no quest mark and gives off a faint blue-grey glow by a group of three trees: from Nighthaven go west along the foot of the northern mountains, through the gap between the trees and the hills. If Dendrite Starblaze is missing when you return, step outside and cast Teleport: Moonglade again. Learn the Moonglade flight path (Faustron, south-west of the lake); Bunthen Plainswind in Nighthaven flies druids to Thunder Bluff."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1456,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:10:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3033,["npcName"]="Turak Runetotem",["x"]=0.7648,["title"]="Back to Thunder Bluff",["quest"]=5932,["y"]=0.2722},{["map"]=1456,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:10:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3033,["y"]=0.2722,["x"]=0.7648,["title"]="Body and Heart",["npcName"]="Turak Runetotem",["pre"]={5932},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=6002,["minLevel"]=10}},["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:10",["text"]="Back to Thunder Bluff",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:goal:18:1",["level"]=12,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Cenarion Lunardust",["item"]=15710,["x"]=0.42,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:goal:18:2",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.609,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:goal:18:3",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Lunaclaw Spirit"}},["title"]="Body and Heart",["startItemName"]="Cenarion Lunardust",["startItem"]=15710,["t"]="complete",["quest"]=6002,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:step:18",["text"]="The Moonkin Stone",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren"}},["detail"]="The Moonkin Stone stands in the Barrens just south-west of Camp Taurajo, by the road out of Mulgore. Level 20 Thunderheads roam close by: clear the way first. Use the Cenarion Lunardust by the stone: Lunaclaw (level 12-13) appears for three minutes. Kill her, then speak to the Lunaclaw Spirit that appears and ask for the strength of her body and heart: the talk is the credit. Die in the fight? Lunaclaw stays by the stone: run back and finish her."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1456,["note"]="Turak Runetotem: Bear Form",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:12:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3033,["npcName"]="Turak Runetotem",["x"]=0.7648,["title"]="Body and Heart",["quest"]=6002,["y"]=0.2722}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:12",["text"]="Body and Heart",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren"}},["detail"]="Back to Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise."},{["detail"]="Bear Form is taught on Zephras Isle. Skip this if you are still on the isle; otherwise take the skyboat from the north side of Dalaran.",["goals"]={{["map"]=1416,["x"]=0.125,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["y"]=0.518,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:goal:20:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Skyboat to Zephras Isle",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=94638}}}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:step:20",["text"]="Skyboat from Dalaran",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=94638}}},{["detail"]="Bear Form is taught on Zephras Isle. Skip this if you are still on the isle; otherwise take the skyboat from the cliffs south of Skywatcher Plateau, north of Thunder Bluff.",["goals"]={{["map"]=1412,["x"]=0.34299999999999997,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["y"]=0.258,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:goal:21:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Skyboat to Zephras Isle",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=94638}}}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:step:21",["text"]="Skyboat from Thunder Bluff",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Horde"}},["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=94638}}},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:15:1",["level"]=10,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=2521,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:goal:22:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=252359,["npcName"]="Lotheluum Starbreeze",["x"]=0.6399,["title"]="The Great Ursera Spirit",["y"]=0.7508,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=94006,["minLevel"]=10}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:step:22",["text"]="Lotheluum Starbreeze",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Lotheluum Starbreeze stands in Valanaar."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2521,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:goal:23:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=255853,["npcName"]="Urs'endris",["x"]=0.6981,["title"]="The Great Ursera Spirit",["quest"]=94006,["y"]=0.6171},{["map"]=2521,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:goal:23:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=255853,["y"]=0.6171,["x"]=0.6981,["title"]="Strength and Mercy",["npcName"]="Urs'endris",["pre"]={94006},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=94638,["minLevel"]=10},{["map"]=2521,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:goal:23:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=258443,["y"]=0.6129,["x"]=0.5698,["title"]="Strength and Mercy",["lvl"]=10,["target"]="Ur'endra",["count"]=1,["quest"]=94638,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:step:23",["text"]="Urs'endris and Ur'endra",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Urs'endris waits by the waterfall below the Shrine of Akir, north-east of Valanaar. Ur'endra (the bear you must defeat) lairs in an unmarked cave high on the cliff face west of him, where the Shen'dar Highlands meet the Gustberry Lowlands: take the path west out of Valanaar (not north), cross the river on the log bridge and reach the cave from the cliff's upper, northern side. The cave at the foot of the cliffs and the foggy cave are the wrong ones."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2521,["note"]="Urs'endris: Bear Form",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:goal:24:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=255853,["npcName"]="Urs'endris",["x"]=0.6981,["title"]="Strength and Mercy",["quest"]=94638,["y"]=0.6171}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:step:24",["text"]="Strength and Mercy",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Back to Urs'endris by the falls."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:18:1",["level"]=10,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1412,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:goal:25:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259118,["npcName"]="Muln Earthfury",["x"]=0.3342,["title"]="Child of Nature",["y"]=0.2259,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=94911,["minLevel"]=10}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:step:25",["text"]="Child of Nature",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="Muln Earthfury waits where the airship from Zephras Isle lands, in northern Mulgore beside Thunder Bluff."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1456,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:19:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3033,["npcName"]="Turak Runetotem",["x"]=0.7648,["title"]="Child of Nature",["quest"]=94911,["y"]=0.2722},{["map"]=1456,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:goal:26:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3033,["y"]=0.2722,["x"]=0.7648,["title"]="Moonglade",["npcName"]="Turak Runetotem",["pre"]={94911},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=94913,["minLevel"]=10}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:step:26",["text"]="Turak Runetotem",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="Turak Runetotem trains druids in the druids' hut on Elder Rise, over the rope bridges east of the lifts. He teaches you Teleport: Moonglade with the next quest (it stays in your spellbook, Balance tab)."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:20:1",["level"]=10,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:goal:27:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=270459,["npcName"]="Alfina Nightgaze",["x"]=0.11789999999999999,["title"]="Child of Nature",["y"]=0.5661,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=94912,["minLevel"]=10}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:step:27",["text"]="Child of Nature",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="Alfina Nightgaze stands beside Denaaris Stargale and the Skyborne Portal, west of Dalaran, where the skycutter from Zephras Isle lands. Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver offers the same quest."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:21:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5504,["npcName"]="Sheldras Moontree",["x"]=0.35840000000000005,["title"]="Child of Nature",["quest"]=94912,["y"]=0.6738},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:21:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5504,["npcName"]="Sheldras Moontree",["x"]=0.35840000000000005,["title"]="Moonglade",["y"]=0.6738,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=94914,["minLevel"]=10}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:21",["text"]="Sheldras Moontree",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="The Skyborne Portal takes you to Stormwind. Sheldras Moontree is the city's druid trainer (the arrow points at him); he teaches you Teleport: Moonglade with the next quest (it stays in your spellbook, Balance tab)."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:22:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Moonglade",["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["quest"]=94913,["y"]=0.3064},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bear-form:22:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Moonglade",["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["quest"]=94914,["y"]=0.3064},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:goal:29:3",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=10897,["npcName"]="Sindrayl",["x"]=0.48100000000000004,["y"]=0.6734,["location"]="Moonglade",["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["node"]=49,["area"]=493},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:goal:29:4",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=12740,["npcName"]="Faustron",["x"]=0.3209,["y"]=0.6661,["location"]="Moonglade",["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["node"]=69,["area"]=493}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bear-form:step:29",["text"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Cast Teleport: Moonglade: it lands you beside the building where Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs, in Nighthaven. Learn the Moonglade flight path while you are here (Faustron for the Horde, south-west of the lake; Sindrayl for the Alliance, south of it)."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1449,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison",["zoneName"]="Un'Goro Crater",["min"]=50,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Bloodpetal Poison (50-54)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=54,["classes"]={"DRUID"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:1:1",["level"]=50,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={9619},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=500,["npc"]=12042,["y"]=0.4057,["x"]=0.5253,["title"]="Torwa Pathfinder",["npcName"]="Loganaar",["closedBy"]={9052},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=9063,["minLevel"]=50}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:step:1",["text"]="Loganaar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Loganaar stands in Nighthaven; your class trainer (Turak Runetotem, Mathrengyl Bearwalker or Theridran in Stormwind) offers the same quest."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:goal:2:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1449,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:2:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9619,["npcName"]="Torwa Pathfinder",["x"]=0.7164,["title"]="Torwa Pathfinder",["quest"]=9063,["y"]=0.7595999999999999},{["map"]=1449,["crumbs"]={9063},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:goal:2:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=9619,["y"]=0.7595999999999999,["x"]=0.7164,["title"]="Bloodpetal Poison",["npcName"]="Torwa Pathfinder",["minLevel"]=50,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=9052,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:step:2",["text"]="Torwa Pathfinder",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Fly to Gadgetzan, ride west to the long ramp down into Un'Goro Crater: Torwa Pathfinder camps at its foot, in the south-east corner of the crater."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:goal:3:1",["level"]=52,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1449,["itemName"]="Gorishi Sting",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:goal:3:2",["fromNpcsAt"]="1,3,4;1,3,4;4,1,5;3,4;1,6;3,1,4;4;1,3,4,6;4,1;1,6,4,5;4,3,1;4,1,5,6,3;1,3;4,1,5,6,2;1,3,4",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.8490000000000001,["x"]=0.5637,["title"]="Bloodpetal Poison",["lvl"]=53,["item"]=22435,["count"]=8,["quest"]=9052,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1449,["itemName"]="Bloodcap",["oi"]=2,["spread"]=true,["fromId"]=164958,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=9052,["count"]=8,["y"]=0.7037,["x"]=0.5334,["item"]=22434,["from"]="Bloodpetal Sprout",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:goal:3:3",["title"]="Bloodpetal Poison",["fromKind"]="object",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:step:3",["text"]="Gorishi Stings and Bloodcap",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Eight of each. The Gorishi Wasps and Stingers (level 51-52) in and around the Slithering Scar, the hive in the south-west of the crater, drop a sting about one kill in seven; the wasps share spawn points with the other bugs, so kill whatever stands near you to make room for more wasps (respawn five minutes). The bugs' Silithid Pox makes you take more physical damage for 30 minutes; Workers call for help when hurt. The Bloodpetal Sprouts grow all over the crater (around Marshal's Refuge and the western half): open them, about every other one gives a Bloodcap, back in three to five minutes."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:step:4",["text"]="Torwa Pathfinder",["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:goal:4:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1449,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9619,["npcName"]="Torwa Pathfinder",["x"]=0.7164,["title"]="Bloodpetal Poison",["quest"]=9052,["y"]=0.7595999999999999},{["map"]=1449,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:4:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=9619,["y"]=0.7595999999999999,["x"]=0.7164,["title"]="Toxic Test",["npcName"]="Torwa Pathfinder",["pre"]={9052},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=9051,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:goal:5:1",["level"]=54,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["note"]="Devilsaur: stab it with the Devilsaur Barb",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=55},["npc"]=6498,["target"]="Devilsaur",["quest"]=9051,["map"]=1449,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:goal:5:2",["t"]="kill",["y"]=0.2368,["x"]=0.5726,["title"]="Toxic Test",["lvl"]=55,["spread"]=true,["text"]="Stab a Devilsaur with the Devilsaur Barb",["count"]=1}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:step:5",["text"]="Toxic Test",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Any Devilsaur counts, the Ironhide and Tyrant Devilsaurs too. They are elite (level 54-55), hit with Mighty Blow and outrun travel form. Grouping up is encouraged, but a druid can do it alone: Hibernate or Entangling Roots it from range, stab it with the Devilsaur Barb (the barb does not break Hibernate), then leave. The credit counts the moment the barb lands, even if you die after. The arrow points at the plain Devilsaurs of the west and north; an Ironhide Devilsaur roams the middle of the crater's south, nearer Torwa Pathfinder."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:step:6",["text"]="Torwa Pathfinder",["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:goal:6:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1449,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9619,["npcName"]="Torwa Pathfinder",["x"]=0.7164,["title"]="Toxic Test",["quest"]=9051,["y"]=0.7595999999999999},{["map"]=1449,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:6:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=9619,["y"]=0.7595999999999999,["x"]=0.7164,["title"]="A Better Ingredient",["npcName"]="Torwa Pathfinder",["pre"]={9051},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=9053,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:goal:7:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1435,["x"]=0.6990000000000001,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["y"]=0.536,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:7:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="The Temple of Atal'Hakkar",["area"]=1477},{["map"]=1435,["itemName"]="Putrid Vine",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["size"]=5,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Putrid Vine: Atal'alarion",["y"]=0.536,["x"]=0.6990000000000001,["title"]="A Better Ingredient",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:goal:7:3",["count"]=1,["item"]=22444,["quest"]=9053,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:step:7",["text"]="The Sunken Temple",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="A five-player dungeon: needs a group of five, about level 50-55. Horde: fly to Stonard; Alliance: fly to Nethergarde Keep in the Blasted Lands and ride north. The Temple of Atal'Hakkar stands in the middle of the Pool of Tears in the Swamp of Sorrows: climb the stairs on the ruin's south side, dive into the flooded hall, swim down through it and follow the stairs and passages down to the portal. Atal'alarion (level 50 elite, Sweeping Slam and Ground Tremor) only appears when the six serpent statues on the balcony ring above the altar pit are clicked in order: South, North, South-west, South-east, North-west, North-east (each turns green when right; a wrong order fails). Clear the trash by each statue and the pit below first; jumping down into the water is the quick way down, but a knockback near the edge can kill. The Putrid Vine always drops."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1449,["note"]="Torwa Pathfinder: the old item choice may be gone, count on the experience",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:8:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9619,["npcName"]="Torwa Pathfinder",["x"]=0.7164,["title"]="A Better Ingredient",["quest"]=9053,["y"]=0.7595999999999999}},["id"]="forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison:8",["text"]="A Better Ingredient",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Torwa Pathfinder in the south-east corner of Un'Goro Crater."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1450,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form",["zoneName"]="Moonglade",["min"]=20,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Cat Form (20-22)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=22,["classes"]={"DRUID"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["detail"]="Mathrengyl Bearwalker stands in the Cenarion Enclave. Skyborne far from Darnassus: cast Teleport: Moonglade and take Silva Fil'naveth's flight from the middle of Nighthaven (she flies druids to Rut'theran Village, no flight path needed), then the portal up. No Aquatic Form yet? Take A Lesson to Learn from him too: it also goes to Dendrite Starblaze, and its Trial of the Lake (the Aquatic Form guide) is in the same Moonglade.",["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:1:1",["level"]=20,["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={98393}},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=98393}}},{["map"]=1457,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:1:2",["t"]="goto",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={98393}},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=98393}},["y"]=0.11599999999999999,["x"]=0.358,["text"]="Cenarion Enclave",["area"]=1658}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:step:1",["text"]="Cenarion Enclave",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={98393}},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=98393}}},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/druid/cat-form:1:1",["level"]=20,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1457,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={11802},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:2:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=390,["npc"]=4217,["y"]=0.084,["x"]=0.35369999999999996,["title"]="The Great Cat Spirit",["npcName"]="Mathrengyl Bearwalker",["closedBy"]={98340},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=98393,["minLevel"]=20}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:step:2",["text"]="The Great Cat Spirit",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="Mathrengyl Bearwalker stands in the Cenarion Enclave. Skyborne far from Darnassus: cast Teleport: Moonglade and take Silva Fil'naveth's flight from the middle of Nighthaven (she flies druids to Rut'theran Village, no flight path needed), then the portal up. No Aquatic Form yet? Take A Lesson to Learn from him too: it also goes to Dendrite Starblaze, and its Trial of the Lake (the Aquatic Form guide) is in the same Moonglade."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cat-form:2:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="The Great Cat Spirit",["quest"]=98393,["y"]=0.3064},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={11957},["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=98394,["map"]=1450,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:3:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=775,["closedBy"]={98341,98405},["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="The Great Cat Spirit",["pre"]={98393},["y"]=0.3064,["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["minLevel"]=20},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={272054},["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=98341,["map"]=1450,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:3:3",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=775,["closedBy"]={98394,98405},["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="The Great Windborne Cat Spirit",["pre"]={98340,98393},["y"]=0.3064,["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["minLevel"]=20},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:3:4",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=10897,["npcName"]="Sindrayl",["x"]=0.48100000000000004,["location"]="Moonglade",["y"]=0.6734,["node"]=49,["area"]=493}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:step:3",["text"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs in his building in Nighthaven: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart. No Moonglade flight path yet? Learn it from Sindrayl, south of the lake: the flight master in Nighthaven flies only Druids, from her gossip, and has none to learn."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11957,["npcName"]="Great Cat Spirit",["x"]=0.545,["title"]="The Great Cat Spirit",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["quest"]=98394,["y"]=0.75},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={11957},["npc"]=11957,["npcName"]="Great Cat Spirit",["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=98396,["map"]=1450,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:4:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=775,["closedBy"]={98342,98404},["x"]=0.545,["title"]="The Great Cat Spirit",["pre"]={98394},["y"]=0.75,["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["minLevel"]=20},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:4:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=272054,["npcName"]="Avatar of Saeyleenan",["x"]=0.43920000000000003,["title"]="The Great Windborne Cat Spirit",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["quest"]=98341,["y"]=0.7343999999999999},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={272054},["npc"]=272054,["npcName"]="Avatar of Saeyleenan",["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=98404,["map"]=1450,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:4:4",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=775,["closedBy"]={98342,98396},["x"]=0.43920000000000003,["title"]="The Great Windborne Cat Spirit",["pre"]={98341},["y"]=0.7343999999999999,["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["minLevel"]=20},{["map"]=1450,["itemName"]="Relic of the Fang",["oi"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["fromId"]=672821,["t"]="collect",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["item"]=280502,["y"]=0.66,["x"]=0.7240000000000001,["title"]="The Great Cat Spirit",["from"]="Relic of the Fang",["id"]="forever/class/druid/cat-form:3:5",["count"]=1,["quest"]=98396,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1450,["itemName"]="Relic of the Claw",["oi"]=2,["fromKind"]="object",["fromId"]=673093,["t"]="collect",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["item"]=280679,["y"]=0.672,["x"]=0.752,["title"]="The Great Cat Spirit",["from"]="Relic of the Claw",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:4:6",["count"]=1,["quest"]=98396,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1450,["itemName"]="Relic of the Silent Shadow",["oi"]=3,["fromKind"]="object",["fromId"]=673094,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=98396,["count"]=1,["y"]=0.654,["x"]=0.7440000000000001,["item"]=280680,["from"]="Relic of the Silent Shadow",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:4:7",["title"]="The Great Cat Spirit",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1450,["itemName"]="Relic of the Fang",["oi"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["fromId"]=672821,["t"]="collect",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["item"]=280502,["y"]=0.66,["x"]=0.7240000000000001,["title"]="The Great Windborne Cat Spirit",["from"]="Relic of the Fang",["id"]="forever/class/druid/cat-form:3:8",["count"]=1,["quest"]=98404,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1450,["itemName"]="Relic of the Claw",["oi"]=2,["fromKind"]="object",["fromId"]=673093,["t"]="collect",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["item"]=280679,["y"]=0.672,["x"]=0.752,["title"]="The Great Windborne Cat Spirit",["from"]="Relic of the Claw",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:4:9",["count"]=1,["quest"]=98404,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1450,["itemName"]="Relic of the Silent Shadow",["oi"]=3,["fromKind"]="object",["fromId"]=673094,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=98404,["count"]=1,["y"]=0.654,["x"]=0.7440000000000001,["item"]=280680,["from"]="Relic of the Silent Shadow",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:4:10",["title"]="The Great Windborne Cat Spirit",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:4:11",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11957,["npcName"]="Great Cat Spirit",["x"]=0.545,["title"]="The Great Cat Spirit",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["quest"]=98396,["y"]=0.75},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={11802},["npc"]=11957,["npcName"]="Great Cat Spirit",["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=98731,["map"]=1450,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:4:12",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=775,["closedBy"]={98738,98739},["x"]=0.545,["title"]="Blessings of the Great Cat Spirit",["pre"]={98396},["y"]=0.75,["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["minLevel"]=20},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:4:13",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=272054,["npcName"]="Avatar of Saeyleenan",["x"]=0.43920000000000003,["title"]="The Great Windborne Cat Spirit",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["quest"]=98404,["y"]=0.7343999999999999},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={11802},["npc"]=272054,["npcName"]="Avatar of Saeyleenan",["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=98738,["map"]=1450,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:4:14",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=775,["closedBy"]={98731,98739},["x"]=0.43920000000000003,["title"]="Blessings of the Great Windborne Cat Spirit",["pre"]={98404},["y"]=0.7343999999999999,["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["minLevel"]=20}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:step:4",["text"]="The relics of the Barrow Dens",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="The Great Cat Spirit (Night Elves) waits on the hill above the bridge in southern Moonglade; the Avatar of Saeyleenan (Skyborne) stands on high ground past the twin bridges, south-west of Nighthaven: climb up to it. The relics lie in the Stormrage Barrow Dens east of the lake: leave your form and click the statue at the den's entrance for a short stealth (five minutes), then go deep into the cave and over the bridge. Enraged spirits guard the relics and attack anything they see: stay in the statue's stealth and keep moving. Each relic is a small orb beside a cat statue in an alcove: the Fang and the Claw have one spot each, the Silent Shadow two, and it is the one players camp. A relic shows as unusable while another player loots it: wait a moment and try again. Stealth gone? Walk back to the entrance statue for more."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cat-form:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Blessings of the Great Cat Spirit",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["quest"]=98731,["y"]=0.3064},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cat-form:4:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Blessings of the Great Windborne Cat Spirit",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["quest"]=98738,["y"]=0.3064},{["map"]=1450,["npc"]=11802,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={4217},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:5:3",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=160,["qlvl"]=20,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["minLevel"]=20,["closedBy"]={98362},["pre"]={98731,98738},["title"]="To Darnassus",["quest"]=98397,["y"]=0.3064},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Rut'theran Village",["id"]="forever/class/druid/cat-form:4:4",["t"]="fly",["node"]=27,["area"]=702}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:step:5",["text"]="Back to Dendrite Starblaze",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="Cast Teleport: Moonglade to land by Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven (nobody on Zephras Isle takes the Skyborne quest), then take Silva Fil'naveth's flight to Rut'theran Village: she stands in the middle of Nighthaven and flies druids there, no flight path needed. Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."},{["detail"]="Take the portal up to Mathrengyl Bearwalker, upstairs in the Cenarion Enclave: he teaches you Cat Form.",["goals"]={{["map"]=1457,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:6:1",["t"]="goto",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=98397}},["y"]=0.11599999999999999,["x"]=0.358,["text"]="Cenarion Enclave",["area"]=1658}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:step:6",["text"]="Cenarion Enclave",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=98397}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1457,["note"]="Mathrengyl Bearwalker: Cat Form",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cat-form:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4217,["npcName"]="Mathrengyl Bearwalker",["x"]=0.35369999999999996,["title"]="To Darnassus",["quest"]=98397,["y"]=0.084}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cat-form:5",["text"]="To Darnassus",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="Take the portal up to Mathrengyl Bearwalker, upstairs in the Cenarion Enclave: he teaches you Cat Form."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/druid/cat-form:6:1",["level"]=20,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1456,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={11802},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:8:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=390,["npc"]=3033,["y"]=0.2722,["x"]=0.7648,["title"]="The Great Cat Spirit",["npcName"]="Turak Runetotem",["closedBy"]={98393},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=98340,["minLevel"]=18}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:step:8",["text"]="The Great Cat 