e a cat statue in an alcove: the Fang and the Claw have one spot each, the Silent Shadow two, and it is the one players camp. A relic shows as unusable while another player loots it: wait a moment and try again. Stealth gone? Walk back to the entrance statue for more."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cat-form:9:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Blessings of the Great Cat Spirit",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren"}},["quest"]=98739,["y"]=0.3064},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cat-form:9:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Blessings of the Great Windborne Cat Spirit",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["quest"]=98738,["y"]=0.3064},{["map"]=1450,["npc"]=11802,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={3033},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:goal:11:3",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=160,["qlvl"]=20,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["minLevel"]=20,["closedBy"]={98397},["pre"]={98739,98738},["title"]="To Thunder Bluff",["quest"]=98362,["y"]=0.3064},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Thunder Bluff",["id"]="forever/class/druid/cat-form:9:4",["t"]="fly",["node"]=22,["area"]=1638}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cat-form:step:11",["text"]="Back to Dendrite Starblaze",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="Cast Teleport: Moonglade to land by Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven (nobody on Zephras Isle takes the Skyborne quest), then take Bunthen Plainswind's flight to Thunder Bluff. Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1456,["note"]="Turak Runetotem: Cat Form",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cat-form: