 at Sindrayl first if you have not)."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:goal:6:1",["level"]=16,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1439,["itemName"]="Empty Cliffspring Falls Sampler",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:goal:6:2",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.33299999999999996,["x"]=0.5489999999999999,["title"]="The Principal Source",["note"]="Empty Cliffspring Falls Sampler, at the cave mouth",["item"]=15844,["quest"]=6122,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1439,["itemName"]="Filled Cliffspring Falls Sampler",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=19463,["t"]="collect",["title"]="The Principal Source",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.3331,["x"]=0.5492,["count"]=1,["from"]="Cliffspring Falls Cave Mouth",["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:3:1",["item"]=15845,["quest"]=6122,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:6",["text"]="Cliffspring Falls",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="Head north-east from Auberdine to Cliffspring Falls. Stand at the cave mouth at the top of the waterfall, not in the river below, and use the Empty Cliffspring Falls Sampler (not the Empty Sampling Tube of another quest). Naga line the climb, a caster waits on the far bank, and filling the sampler calls two more (a Wave Rider and a Toxicologist, level 15): clear the way first and be ready to fight."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1439,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3702,["npcName"]="Alanndarian Nightsong",["x"]=0.37689999999999996,["title"]="The Principal Source",["quest"]=6122,["y"]=0.40659999999999996},{["map"]=1439,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:4:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3702,["y"]=0.40659999999999996,["x"]=0.37689999999999996,["title"]="Gathering the Cure",["npcName"]="Alanndarian Nightsong",["pre"]={6122},["qlvl"]=14,["quest"]=6123,["minLevel"]=14}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:7",["text"]="Alanndarian Nightsong",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="Back in Auberdine, at the north end of the village."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1439,["itemName"]="Lunar Fungus",["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=177750,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Gathering the Cure",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.45770000000000005,["x"]=0.4321,["count"]=12,["from"]="Lunar Fungal Bloom",["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:5:1",["item"]=15851,["quest"]=6123,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1439,["itemName"]="Earthroot",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:goal:8:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.4643,["x"]=0.42700000000000005,["title"]="Gathering the Cure",["count"]=5,["item"]=2449,["quest"]=6123,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:8",["text"]="Lunar Fungus and Earthroot",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="The Lunar Fungal Blooms are tiny white-spotted mushrooms on the floors and walls of the small moonkin caves in the hills just east and south-east of Auberdine; each gives one or two fungus, and each cave holds only a few, so go from cave to cave (they regrow in three minutes). The moonkin there are irritable. No Herbalism needed for the blooms. Earthroot needs Herbalism: herbalists pick it all over Darkshore, anyone else buys it (Maria Lumere or Bernard Gump in Stormwind, or the Auction House)."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1439,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3702,["npcName"]="Alanndarian Nightsong",["x"]=0.37689999999999996,["title"]="Gathering the Cure",["quest"]=6123,["y"]=0.40659999999999996},{["map"]=1439,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:6:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3702,["y"]=0.40659999999999996,["x"]=0.37689999999999996,["title"]="Curing the Sick",["npcName"]="Alanndarian Nightsong",["pre"]={6123},["qlvl"]=14,["quest"]=6124,["minLevel"]=14}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:9",["text"]="Alanndarian Nightsong",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="She hands you the Curative Animal Salve: ten doses, one per deer. Destroy any leftover Lunar Fungus."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1439,["oi"]=1,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:7:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=12298,["text"]="Use the Curative Animal Salve on Sickly Deer",["y"]=0.3607,["x"]=0.3856,["title"]="Curing the Sick",["spread"]=true,["target"]="Sickly Deer",["count"]=10,["quest"]=6124,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:10",["text"]="Sickly Deer",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="Use the Curative Animal Salve on living Sickly Deer (level 5, a green cloud over them): they roam Darkshore from the Cliffspring River to the Ashenvale border, many around the Blackwood furbolg camp north-east of Auberdine. Druid trick: root a deer with Entangling Roots, apply the salve before the roots tick, and the root kill counts a second time. Lost a dose on a deer that did not count? Abandon the quest and take it again from Alanndarian Nightsong for a fresh salve."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:8:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Curing the Sick",["quest"]=6124,["y"]=0.3064},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:8:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11802,["y"]=0.3064,["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Power over Poison",["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["pre"]={6124},["qlvl"]=14,["quest"]=6125,["minLevel"]=14},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Rut'theran Village",["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:8:3",["t"]="fly",["node"]=27,["area"]=702}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:11",["text"]="Curing the Sick",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="Cast Teleport: Moonglade and see Dendrite Starblaze, then take Silva Fil'naveth's flight from the middle of Nighthaven (she flies druids to Rut'theran Village, no flight path needed) and the portal up to Darnassus. Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."},{["detail"]="Mathrengyl Bearwalker, upstairs in the Cenarion Enclave, teaches you Cure Poison.",["goals"]={{["map"]=1457,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:goal:12:1",["t"]="goto",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=6125}},["y"]=0.11599999999999999,["x"]=0.358,["text"]="Cenarion Enclave",["area"]=1658}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:12",["text"]="Cenarion Enclave",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=6125}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1457,["note"]="Mathrengyl Bearwalker: Cure Poison",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:9:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4217,["npcName"]="Mathrengyl Bearwalker",["x"]=0.35369999999999996,["title"]="Power over Poison",["quest"]=6125,["y"]=0.084}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:13",["text"]="Power over Poison",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="Mathrengyl Bearwalker, upstairs in the Cenarion Enclave, teaches you Cure Poison."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:goal:14:1",["level"]=14,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1456,["note"]="Turak Runetotem, or Hana Lighthoof in northern Mulgore",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:10:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3033,["npcName"]="Turak Runetotem",["x"]=0.7648,["title"]="Lessons Anew",["y"]=0.2722,["qlvl"]=14,["quest"]=6126,["minLevel"]=14}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:14",["text"]="Lessons Anew",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="Turak Runetotem stands in the druids' hut on Elder Rise; Hana Lighthoof, the Skyborne druid trainer where the airship from Zephras Isle lands in northern Mulgore, gives the same quest. No Herbalism? Hula'mahi at the Crossroads sells Earthroot later, or buy five on the Auction House now."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:11:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Lessons Anew",["quest"]=6126,["y"]=0.3064},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:11:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11802,["y"]=0.3064,["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="The Principal Source",["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["pre"]={6126},["qlvl"]=14,["quest"]=6127,["minLevel"]=14},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Thunder Bluff",["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:11:3",["t"]="fly",["node"]=22,["area"]=1638}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:15",["text"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="Cast Teleport: Moonglade: Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs in the building beside you. He hands you the Empty Dreadmist Peak Sampler. Bunthen Plainswind flies druids to Thunder Bluff; fly on to the Crossroads from there."},{["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Crossroads",["t"]="fly",["node"]=25,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:12:1"},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Empty Dreadmist Peak Sampler",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:goal:16:2",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.18899999999999997,["x"]=0.484,["title"]="The Principal Source",["note"]="Empty Dreadmist Peak Sampler, standing in the pool",["item"]=15842,["quest"]=6127,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Filled Dreadmist Peak Sampler",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=19464,["t"]="collect",["title"]="The Principal Source",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.1889,["x"]=0.484,["count"]=1,["from"]="Dreadmist Peak Pool",["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:12:2",["item"]=15843,["quest"]=6127,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:16",["text"]="Dreadmist Peak",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="From the Crossroads head north to Dreadmist Peak and climb to the bubbling Dreadmist Peak Pool on its summit. Burning Blade cultists camp around it: pull them one or two at a time. Stand in the water and use the Empty Dreadmist Peak Sampler: three Burning Blade Toxicologists (level 13-14, curses and warlock spells) appear and attack. You need not kill them: once the sampler is full, run."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:13:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3448,["npcName"]="Tonga Runetotem",["x"]=0.5226,["title"]="The Principal Source",["quest"]=6127,["y"]=0.3193},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:13:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3448,["y"]=0.3193,["x"]=0.5226,["title"]="Gathering the Cure",["npcName"]="Tonga Runetotem",["pre"]={6127},["qlvl"]=14,["quest"]=6128,["minLevel"]=14},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Earthroot",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:13:3",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=3490,["npcName"]="Hula'mahi",["x"]=0.5139,["item"]=2449,["note"]="Earthroot; herbalists pick it on the plains",["optional"]=true,["y"]=0.302,["count"]=5}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:17",["text"]="Tonga Runetotem",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="Tonga Runetotem stands in the Crossroads. No Herbalism? Hula'mahi, a few steps away by the wind rider master, sells Earthroot for 80 copper each, three at a time until he restocks."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:goal:18:1",["level"]=15,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["itemName"]="Kodo Horn",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=15852,["quest"]=6128,["map"]=1413,["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=3234,["t"]="collect",["fromAlsoId"]=3236,["title"]="Gathering the Cure",["y"]=0.40130000000000005,["x"]=0.5482,["count"]=5,["from"]="Lost Barrens Kodo",["spread"]=true,["fromAlso"]="Barrens Kodo",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:14:1"},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Earthroot",["oi"]=1,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:14:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.41259999999999997,["x"]=0.6086,["title"]="Gathering the Cure",["count"]=5,["spread"]=true,["item"]=2449,["quest"]=6128,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:18",["text"]="Earthroot and Kodo Horns",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="Every Lost Barrens Kodo (level 14-15) drops a horn, but they are few and wander: search the far north near the Sludge Fen and the oases, above all the Stagnant Oasis south-east of the Crossroads. They charge from range and stomp. Herbalists find Earthroot all over the northern Barrens."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:15:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3448,["npcName"]="Tonga Runetotem",["x"]=0.5226,["title"]="Gathering the Cure",["quest"]=6128,["y"]=0.3193},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:15:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3448,["y"]=0.3193,["x"]=0.5226,["title"]="Curing the Sick",["npcName"]="Tonga Runetotem",["pre"]={6128},["qlvl"]=14,["quest"]=6129,["minLevel"]=14}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:19",["text"]="Tonga Runetotem",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="He hands you the Curative Animal Salve: ten doses, one per gazelle."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=1,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:16:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=12296,["text"]="Use the Curative Animal Salve on Sickly Gazelles",["y"]=0.3209,["x"]=0.545,["title"]="Curing the Sick",["spread"]=true,["target"]="Sickly Gazelle",["count"]=10,["quest"]=6129,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:20",["text"]="Sickly Gazelles",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="Use the Curative Animal Salve on living Sickly Gazelles (level 3): they graze on both sides of the road north of the Crossroads up to the Ashenvale border, north-west of the Crossroads and west of Ratchet. Druid trick: root a gazelle with Entangling Roots, apply the salve before the roots tick, and the root kill counts a second time, so five gazelles can do. Lost a dose? Abandon and retake the quest from Tonga Runetotem for a fresh salve."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:17:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Curing the Sick",["quest"]=6129,["y"]=0.3064},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:17:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11802,["y"]=0.3064,["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Power over Poison",["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["pre"]={6129},["qlvl"]=14,["quest"]=6130,["minLevel"]=14},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Thunder Bluff",["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:17:3",["t"]="fly",["node"]=22,["area"]=1638}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:21",["text"]="Curing the Sick",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="Cast Teleport: Moonglade and see Dendrite Starblaze, then take Bunthen Plainswind's flight to Thunder Bluff. Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1456,["note"]="Turak Runetotem: Cure Poison",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/druid/cure-poison:18:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3033,["npcName"]="Turak Runetotem",["x"]=0.7648,["title"]="Power over Poison",["quest"]=6130,["y"]=0.2722}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/druid/cure-poison:step:22",["text"]="Power over Poison",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise teaches you Cure Poison."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1448,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar",["zoneName"]="Felwood",["min"]=60,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Rhok'delar and Lok'delar (60-60)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=60,["classes"]={"HUNTER"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Ancient Petrified Leaf",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["size"]=40,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="accept",["note"]="from the Ancient Petrified Leaf",["title"]="The Ancient Leaf",["item"]=18703,["minLevel"]=60,["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7632,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:goal:1:1"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:step:1",["text"]="The Ancient Petrified Leaf",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Molten Core is a 40-player raid inside Blackrock Mountain. When Majordomo Executus yields, the Cache of the Firelord appears; it holds the Ancient Petrified Leaf about half the time, one per kill, so it may take several weeks of raids. Right-click the leaf to start the quest."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:2:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14524,["npcName"]="Vartrus the Ancient",["x"]=0.4778,["title"]="The Ancient Leaf",["quest"]=7632,["y"]=0.2408},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:2:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14524,["y"]=0.2408,["x"]=0.4778,["title"]="An Introduction",["npcName"]="Vartrus the Ancient",["pre"]={7632},["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7633,["minLevel"]=60},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:2:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14524,["npcName"]="Vartrus the Ancient",["x"]=0.4778,["title"]="An Introduction",["quest"]=7633,["y"]=0.2408},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:2:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14524,["y"]=0.2408,["x"]=0.4778,["title"]="Stave of the Ancients",["npcName"]="Vartrus the Ancient",["pre"]={7632},["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7636,["minLevel"]=60},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:2:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14525,["y"]=0.2229,["x"]=0.4839,["title"]="A Proper String",["npcName"]="Stoma the Ancient",["pre"]={7632},["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7635,["minLevel"]=60},{["map"]=1448,["note"]="Hastat the Ancient: the quiver, last in this guide",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:2:6",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14526,["y"]=0.24059999999999998,["x"]=0.467,["title"]="Ancient Sinew Wrapped Lamina",["npcName"]="Hastat the Ancient",["pre"]={7632},["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7634,["minLevel"]=60}},["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:2",["text"]="Vartrus the Ancient",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Vartrus, Stoma and Hastat the Ancient are petrified trees on a small island in a ring-shaped lake in Irontree Woods, north Felwood. Their spirits only appear when someone carrying the leaf climbs the island's little hill to its east edge. Alliance: fly to Talonbranch Glade; Horde: fly to Bloodvenom Post. Vartrus gives Stave of the Ancients, Stoma A Proper String, Hastat the quiver; each can be handed in on its own."},{["goals"]={{["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:goal:3:1",["t"]="task",["text"]="Learn Track Demons and get demon-slaying potions"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:step:3",["text"]="Before the demons",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The four demons are level 60 elites disguised as friendly travellers; talk to one and say you know what it is, and it turns into its demon form. Fight every one alone: no pet (dismiss it), no other player's heal, buff or attack once the fight starts, or the demon calls you a coward and vanishes, with a 3 hour wait for it to return (also after it dies). Buffs and potions you take before the pull are fine, and a friend may stand by to kill wandering monsters or enemy players, as long as they never touch the demon or you. Bring a Potion of Demon Slaying (Alchemy or the auction house), Major Mana Potions for the long kites, and a melee weapon with the Demonslaying enchant if you can. Track Demons, from your trainer, shows the disguised demons on the minimap. In a group, set loot to free for all so you can loot the head."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1449,["x"]=0.3432,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["npcName"]="Simone the Inconspicuous",["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:4:1",["t"]="talk",["npc"]=14527,["y"]=0.4079},{["itemName"]="Simone's Head",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=60},["item"]=18952,["fromRank"]=1,["quest"]=7636,["map"]=1449,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=14527,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.4079,["x"]=0.3432,["title"]="Stave of the Ancients",["from"]="Simone the Inconspicuous",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:goal:4:2"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:step:4",["text"]="Simone the Inconspicuous",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Simone the Inconspicuous, a troll with a wolf, walks a long path that starts at the lake in western Un'Goro and can reach the south of the crater; use Track Demons. Talk to her and she becomes Simone the Seductress, and her wolf Precious a Felstalker. The hardest of the four: Freezing Trap Precious and pull Simone well away from it, or kite Precious away and kill it first, let Simone reset and come back for her alone. Her Chain Lightning hits hard, so drain her mana with Viper Sting (a 15-second cooldown on Forever) and keep her busy; her Temptress' Kiss cuts your ranged attack power, so finish her in melee. Loot her head before Precious breaks free."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["x"]=0.2482,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["npcName"]="Franklin the Friendly",["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:6:1",["t"]="talk",["npc"]=14529,["y"]=0.6593000000000001},{["itemName"]="Klinfran's Head",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=60},["item"]=18953,["fromRank"]=1,["quest"]=7636,["map"]=1428,["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=14529,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.6593000000000001,["x"]=0.2482,["title"]="Stave of the Ancients",["from"]="Franklin the Friendly",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:goal:5:2"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:step:5",["text"]="Franklin the Friendly",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Franklin the Friendly, a human, wanders the western Burning Steppes south of Blackrock Mountain. Talk to him and he becomes Klinfran the Crazed, the easiest of the four. Keep Scorpid Sting on him the whole fight: while it lasts he barely hurts you. When he goes into Demonic Frenzy, remove it with Tranquilizing Shot and never stand in melee while it is up; between frenzies you can fight him in melee with Wing Clip and Raptor Strike. He cannot leave the Burning Steppes, so kite him around the trees if needed."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1451,["x"]=0.24719999999999998,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["npcName"]="Nelson the Nice",["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:5:1",["t"]="talk",["npc"]=14536,["y"]=0.7602},{["itemName"]="Solenor's Head",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=60},["item"]=18954,["fromRank"]=1,["quest"]=7636,["map"]=1451,["oi"]=3,["fromId"]=14536,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.7602,["x"]=0.24719999999999998,["title"]="Stave of the Ancients",["from"]="Nelson the Nice",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:goal:6:2"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:step:6",["text"]="Nelson the Nice",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Nelson the Nice, a gnome, walks around the gates of Ahn'Qiraj in the far south-west of Silithus. Talk to him and he becomes Solenor the Slayer. He enrages with Soul Flame as he turns: drop a Frost Trap, Feign Death, and he resets without the enrage. Wing Clip roots him for a long time; while rooted he fears you and sends beetles (Creeping Doom): kill them fast with traps and Multi-Shot before they wear you down."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["x"]=0.6031,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["npcName"]="Artorius the Amiable",["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:3:1",["t"]="talk",["npc"]=14531,["y"]=0.1318},{["itemName"]="Artorius's Head",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=60},["item"]=18955,["fromRank"]=1,["quest"]=7636,["map"]=1452,["oi"]=4,["fromId"]=14531,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.1318,["x"]=0.6031,["title"]="Stave of the Ancients",["from"]="Artorius the Amiable",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:goal:7:2"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:step:7",["text"]="Artorius the Amiable",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Artorius the Amiable, a tauren, walks a loop in the rocks of northern Winterspring, north of Everlook. Talk to him and he becomes Artorius the Doombringer. Within 30 yards of him Demonic Doom hits hard: keep your distance and kite him the whole fight, Aspect of the Cheetah on, south down the road. Serpent Sting on him adds Stinging Trauma, extra Nature damage, so keep it ticking while you run; his Demonic Frenzy can be removed with Tranquilizing Shot, but distance matters more. It is a long fight: bring mana potions and plan your kiting path."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["itemName"]="Mature Black Dragon Sinew",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["size"]=40,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Mature Black Dragon Sinew, from Onyxia",["y"]=0.758,["x"]=0.521,["title"]="A Proper String",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:goal:8:1",["count"]=1,["item"]=18705,["quest"]=7635,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:step:8",["text"]="Onyxia",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Onyxia is the 40-player raid boss of Onyxia's Lair, a cave in the Wyrmbog of southern Dustwallow Marsh; she returns once a week. She drops one Mature Black Dragon Sinew in about two kills of five, lootable without the quest, so only one hunter per kill gets it: settle who first."},{["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:8",["text"]="Back to the Ancients",["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:8:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14524,["npcName"]="Vartrus the Ancient",["x"]=0.4778,["title"]="Stave of the Ancients",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=18707,["itemName"]="Ancient Rune Etched Stave"}}},["quest"]=7636,["y"]=0.2408},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:8:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14525,["npcName"]="Stoma the Ancient",["x"]=0.4839,["title"]="A Proper String",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=18724,["itemName"]="Enchanted Black Dragon Sinew"}}},["quest"]=7635,["y"]=0.2229}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["itemName"]="Ancient Rune Etched Stave",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:9:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.24100000000000002,["x"]=0.478,["item"]=18707,["note"]="Ancient Rune Etched Stave, by Vartrus"},{["map"]=1448,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:9:2",["t"]="talk",["npc"]=14524,["npcName"]="Vartrus the Ancient",["x"]=0.4778,["note"]="Vartrus the Ancient: Lok'delar in Classic",["y"]=0.2408}},["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:9",["text"]="Rhok'delar and Lok'delar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Not confirmed in Forever. In Classic, using the Ancient Rune Etched Stave with the Enchanted Black Dragon Sinew in your bags made Rhok'delar, and talking to Vartrus once more then gave Lok'delar, Stave of the Ancient Keepers, at no extra cost."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Mature Blue Dragon Sinew",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["size"]=40,["kind"]="group"},["item"]=18704,["fromRank"]=3,["quest"]=7634,["map"]=1447,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=6109,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.804,["x"]=0.5329999999999999,["title"]="Ancient Sinew Wrapped Lamina",["from"]="Azuregos",["note"]="Mature Blue Dragon Sinew, from Azuregos",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:goal:11:1"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:step:11",["text"]="Azuregos",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Hastat's quiver needs the Mature Blue Dragon Sinew. Azuregos, a world boss for a raid, stands in southern Azshara, returns only every two to four days and drops it nearly every kill. The elite Cobalt dragonkin in and around Mazthoril, the cave south of Everlook in Winterspring, drop it about once in 200 kills; Manaclaw there a little more often. Skip the rest of this guide if you do not want the quiver."},{["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:11",["text"]="Hastat the Ancient",["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/rhokdelar:11:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14526,["npcName"]="Hastat the Ancient",["x"]=0.467,["title"]="Ancient Sinew Wrapped Lamina",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=18714,["itemName"]="Ancient Sinew Wrapped Lamina"}}},["quest"]=7634,["y"]=0.24059999999999998}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1447,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm",["zoneName"]="Azshara",["min"]=50,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="The Hunter's Charm (50-52)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=52,["classes"]={"HUNTER"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:1:1",["level"]=50,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:1:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5516,["npcName"]="Ulfir Ironbeard",["x"]=0.6759000000000001,["title"]="The Hunter's Charm",["y"]=0.3578,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8151,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:1",["text"]="The Hunter's Charm (Alliance)",["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="At 50 any Alliance hunter trainer offers it: Ulfir Ironbeard in Stormwind's Dwarven District, Olmin Burningbeard in Ironforge's Hall of Arms or Dorion in Darnassus' Cenarion Enclave."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:2:1",["level"]=50,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:2:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3352,["npcName"]="Ormak Grimshot",["x"]=0.6605,["title"]="The Hunter's Charm",["y"]=0.18530000000000002,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8151,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:2",["text"]="The Hunter's Charm (Horde)",["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="At 50 any Horde hunter trainer offers it: Ormak Grimshot in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor or Holt Thunderhorn on Hunter Rise in Thunder Bluff."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:goal:3:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:goal:3:2",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=12577,["npcName"]="Jarrodenus",["x"]=0.11900000000000001,["y"]=0.7759,["location"]="Talrendis Point",["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["node"]=64,["area"]=3137},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:goal:3:3",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=8610,["npcName"]="Kroum",["x"]=0.21960000000000002,["y"]=0.4962,["location"]="Valormok",["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["node"]=44,["area"]=1237},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:3:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8405,["npcName"]="Ogtinc",["x"]=0.424,["title"]="The Hunter's Charm",["quest"]=8151,["y"]=0.42619999999999997},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:3:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8405,["y"]=0.42619999999999997,["x"]=0.424,["title"]="Courser Antlers",["npcName"]="Ogtinc",["pre"]={8151},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8153,["minLevel"]=50}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:step:3",["text"]="Ogtinc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ogtinc lives on a raised spot on the cliffs at the north-east rim of the Ruins of Eldarath, west-central Azshara. Keep to the high ridges around the ruins: the pit below does not lead up to him. Alliance: fly to Talrendis Point; Horde: fly to Valormok, a short ride west of him."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:goal:4:1",["level"]=53,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["itemName"]="Perfect Courser Antler",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=20017,["quest"]=8153,["map"]=1447,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=8761,["t"]="collect",["spread"]=true,["title"]="Courser Antlers",["y"]=0.3539,["x"]=0.521,["count"]=2,["from"]="Mosshoof Courser",["lvl"]=53,["note"]="Perfect Courser Antler, from Mosshoof Coursers",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:goal:4:2"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:step:4",["text"]="Courser Antlers",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="You need two Perfect Courser Antlers. Mosshoof Coursers (level 52-53, deer) graze all over Azshara and drop one about one kill in twelve, so expect two dozen kills. Good herds: north of the Thalassian Base Camp in the north, and the hills north-east and south-east of Valormok; the Lake Mennar area also has elite giants and dragonkin. They Enrage at 30% health. Coursers share spawn points with the Thunderhead hippogryphs: if none are around, kill the hippogryphs and coursers may spawn instead. Respawn is about five and a half minutes."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:step:5",["text"]="Ogtinc",["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:goal:5:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8405,["npcName"]="Ogtinc",["x"]=0.424,["title"]="Courser Antlers",["quest"]=8153,["y"]=0.42619999999999997},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:5:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8405,["y"]=0.42619999999999997,["x"]=0.424,["title"]="Wavethrashing",["npcName"]="Ogtinc",["pre"]={8153},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8231,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:goal:6:1",["level"]=52,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1447,["itemName"]="Wavethrasher Scales",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:goal:6:2",["t"]="collect",["title"]="Wavethrashing",["y"]=0.309,["x"]=0.846,["count"]=6,["lvl"]=53,["spread"]=true,["item"]=20087,["quest"]=8231,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:step:6",["text"]="Wavethrashing",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="You need six Wavethrasher Scales. Wavethrashers (three-headed sea beasts) live along Azshara's coasts, mostly underwater: the Young Wavethrashers (level 51-52) of the north-east shore drop a scale about one kill in three, the Wavethrashers (52-53) of the east coast by the Tower of Eldara about as often (a few walk the beach there), the Great Wavethrashers (53-54) of the south-east shore about one in seven. Track Beasts does not show them; fight them where you can breathe, and bring water breathing if you can. Elite sharks swim the deeper water."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:step:7",["text"]="Ogtinc",["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:goal:7:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8405,["npcName"]="Ogtinc",["x"]=0.424,["title"]="Wavethrashing",["quest"]=8231,["y"]=0.42619999999999997},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:7:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8405,["y"]=0.42619999999999997,["x"]=0.424,["title"]="The Green Drake",["npcName"]="Ogtinc",["pre"]={8231},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8232,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:goal:8:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1435,["itemName"]="Tooth of Morphaz",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=52},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Tooth of Morphaz, inside the Sunken Temple",["y"]=0.54,["x"]=0.69,["title"]="The Green Drake",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:goal:8:2",["count"]=1,["item"]=20019,["quest"]=8232,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:step:8",["text"]="Morphaz in the Sunken Temple",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Morphaz is an elite green drake (level 52) inside the Sunken Temple, a five-player dungeon: needs a group of five. The temple stands in the Pool of Tears in eastern Swamp of Sorrows: climb its outer steps, dive into the flooded hall and follow the stairs down to the entrance. Horde: fly to Stonard; Alliance: fly to Nethergarde Keep or Darkshire and ride on. He is not there when you arrive: first kill the six troll guardians on the platforms around the upper ring, which opens the way down to Jammal'an the Prophet in the Pit of Sacrifice. Jammal'an's death brings out two drakes, Weaver and Dreamscythe (pull them one at a time); when both are dead, Morphaz and Hazzas appear together and cannot be split. Clear the dragonkin around the pit first, because they call for help. Morphaz uses Acid Breath and Wing Flap. The tooth always drops. Warriors in the group may want the same run for the voodoo feathers of the balcony trolls."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:9:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8405,["npcName"]="Ogtinc",["x"]=0.424,["title"]="The Green Drake",["quest"]=8232,["y"]=0.42619999999999997}},["id"]="forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm:9",["text"]="The Green Drake",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="In Classic Ogtinc let you choose the Devilsaur Eye, the Devilsaur Tooth or the Hunting Spear here. Forever's change notes say the choice is gone, though its quest page still lists three unnamed rewards: look at the reward window before you hand in."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1444,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/mage/arcane-refreshment",["zoneName"]="Feralas",["min"]=60,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Conjure Water (Arcane Refreshment) (60-60)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=60,["classes"]={"MAGE"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/mage/arcane-refreshment:1:1",["level"]=60,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/arcane-refreshment:1:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14368,["npcName"]="Lorekeeper Lydros",["x"]=0.58,["title"]="Arcane Refreshment",["y"]=0.445,["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7463,["minLevel"]=60}},["id"]="forever/class/mage/arcane-refreshment:1",["text"]="Lorekeeper Lydros",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Fly to Feathermoon (Alliance) or Camp Mojache (Horde) and ride to Dire Maul in central Feralas. Lorekeeper Lydros waits in the Athenaeum, the library, reached through the West wing, or through the North wing's courtyard doors with a Crescent Key (it drops from the imp Pusillin in the East wing; a Powerful Seaforium Charge also opens them; Blink no longer gets past). Other mages in your group can take it too: share it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Hydrospawn Essence",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["size"]=5,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Hydrospawn Essence: Hydrospawn",["y"]=0.445,["x"]=0.58,["title"]="Arcane Refreshment",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/arcane-refreshment:goal:2:1",["count"]=1,["item"]=18299,["quest"]=7463,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/arcane-refreshment:step:2",["text"]="Hydrospawn",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Hydrospawn, a level 57 elite water elemental, lives in the Warpwood Quarter (Dire Maul East): chase the imp Pusillin until he turns to fight, clear the satyr room, then take the spiral ramp down to the pool. A group of five. Frost does nothing to him, so frost mages switch to fire or arcane. Riptide hits everyone within 10 yards, so ranged stand back; at a quarter health he calls Hydrolings. The essence always drops; he does not come back until the instance resets."},{["id"]="forever/class/mage/arcane-refreshment:3",["text"]="Back to Lydros",["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["note"]="Lorekeeper Lydros: Conjure Water, and 200 Shen'dralar reputation",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/arcane-refreshment:3:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14368,["npcName"]="Lorekeeper Lydros",["x"]=0.58,["title"]="Arcane Refreshment",["quest"]=7463,["y"]=0.445}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1446,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh",["zoneName"]="Tanaris",["min"]=60,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian (60-60)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=60,["classes"]={"PRIEST","MAGE","WARLOCK","DRUID"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:1:1",["level"]=60,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["itemName"]="Splinter of Atiesh",["item"]=22726,["count"]=40,["group"]={["size"]=40,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:1:2",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["note"]="Forming Frame of Atiesh: forty splinters become the Frame of Atiesh",["item"]=22726,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:1:3",["t"]="use",["itemName"]="Splinter of Atiesh",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:step:1",["text"]="Splinters of Atiesh",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Forty Splinters of Atiesh drop in Naxxramas, the 40-player raid in the necropolis over the Plaguewood in Eastern Plaguelands: each of its twelve bosses before Sapphiron and Kel'Thuzad, and the Four Horsemen's chest, drops one about a third of the time, and the raid shares them out. It takes many weeks of clears. Keep every splinter in one stack."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Frame of Atiesh",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:2:1",["t"]="accept",["title"]="Frame of Atiesh",["qlvl"]=60,["minLevel"]=60,["quest"]=9250,["item"]=22727},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:2:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=15192,["npcName"]="Anachronos",["x"]=0.6527,["title"]="Frame of Atiesh",["quest"]=9250,["y"]=0.5003},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:2:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=15192,["y"]=0.5003,["x"]=0.6527,["title"]="Atiesh, the Befouled Greatstaff",["npcName"]="Anachronos",["pre"]={9250},["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=9251,["minLevel"]=60}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:step:2",["text"]="Anachronos",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Right-click the Frame of Atiesh to start the quest, then take it to Anachronos, the bronze dragon in elf form who stands outside the Caverns of Time in eastern Tanaris. Fly to Gadgetzan and ride east."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Staff Head of Atiesh",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=3,["lvl"]=63},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Staff Head of Atiesh: Kel'Thuzad, Naxxramas",["title"]="Atiesh, the Befouled Greatstaff",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:3:1",["count"]=1,["item"]=22733,["quest"]=9251,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1451,["itemName"]="Base of Atiesh",["oi"]=2,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=3,["lvl"]=63},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Base of Atiesh: C'Thun, Temple of Ahn'Qiraj, past the Gate of Ahn'Qiraj",["y"]=0.9359999999999999,["x"]=0.29100000000000004,["title"]="Atiesh, the Befouled Greatstaff",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:3:2",["count"]=1,["item"]=22734,["quest"]=9251,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:step:3",["text"]="The Staff Head and the Base",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Two more raid bosses, a full 40-player raid each, both pieces always drop: the Staff Head of Atiesh from Kel'Thuzad on his throne at the top of Naxxramas, the Base of Atiesh from C'Thun at the bottom of the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj, behind the Gates of Ahn'Qiraj in southern Silithus. Each boss comes back once a week."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:step:4",["text"]="Back to Anachronos",["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=15192,["npcName"]="Anachronos",["x"]=0.6527,["title"]="Atiesh, the Befouled Greatstaff",["quest"]=9251,["y"]=0.5003},{["note"]="your class's Atiesh quest; he hands you the befouled staff",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={15192},["npc"]=15192,["npcName"]="Anachronos",["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=9270,["map"]=1446,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:4:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=9950,["closedBy"]={9257,9269,9271},["x"]=0.6527,["title"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",["pre"]={9251},["y"]=0.5003,["only"]={["classes"]={"MAGE"}},["minLevel"]=60},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={15192},["npc"]=15192,["npcName"]="Anachronos",["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=9257,["map"]=1446,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:4:3",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=9950,["closedBy"]={9269,9270,9271},["x"]=0.6527,["title"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",["pre"]={9251},["y"]=0.5003,["only"]={["classes"]={"PRIEST"}},["minLevel"]=60},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={15192},["npc"]=15192,["npcName"]="Anachronos",["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=9271,["map"]=1446,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:4:4",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=9950,["closedBy"]={9257,9269,9270},["x"]=0.6527,["title"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",["pre"]={9251},["y"]=0.5003,["only"]={["classes"]={"WARLOCK"}},["minLevel"]=60},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={15192},["npc"]=15192,["npcName"]="Anachronos",["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=9269,["map"]=1446,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:4:5",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=9950,["closedBy"]={9257,9270,9271},["x"]=0.6527,["title"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",["pre"]={9251},["y"]=0.5003,["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"}},["minLevel"]=60}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1423,["itemName"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:5:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.11130000000000001,["x"]=0.2611,["item"]=22737,["note"]="the befouled staff, on the Consecrated Earth inside Stratholme"},{["map"]=1423,["note"]="Atiesh, Hand of Sargeras",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["kind"]="group"},["t"]="kill",["npc"]=16387,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:5:2",["y"]=0.11130000000000001,["x"]=0.2611,["title"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",["quest"]=9270,["target"]="Atiesh",["count"]=1,["only"]={["classes"]={"MAGE"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1423,["oi"]=1,["group"]={["kind"]="group"},["t"]="kill",["npc"]=16387,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:5:3",["y"]=0.11130000000000001,["x"]=0.2611,["title"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",["quest"]=9257,["target"]="Atiesh",["count"]=1,["only"]={["classes"]={"PRIEST"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1423,["oi"]=1,["group"]={["kind"]="group"},["t"]="kill",["npc"]=16387,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:5:4",["y"]=0.11130000000000001,["x"]=0.2611,["title"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",["quest"]=9271,["target"]="Atiesh",["count"]=1,["only"]={["classes"]={"WARLOCK"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1423,["oi"]=1,["group"]={["kind"]="group"},["t"]="kill",["npc"]=16387,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:5:5",["y"]=0.11130000000000001,["x"]=0.2611,["title"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",["quest"]=9269,["target"]="Atiesh",["count"]=1,["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:step:5",["text"]="Atiesh, Hand of Sargeras",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Take the befouled staff to Stratholme, the dungeon at the north end of Eastern Plaguelands, through the main gate. On Festival Lane find the patch of Consecrated Earth with a small white flame on it, stand on it and use the staff: Atiesh, Hand of Sargeras (level 63 boss) steps out. Bring a strong group: his Unholy Aura hurts everyone and cannot be dispelled (shadow resistance helps), his Breath of Sargeras curse must be removed at once, and a warrior's Disarm makes him drop his sword, which a melee player can pick up and use against him. He stays up to two and a half hours, so you can regroup."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["note"]="Anachronos: Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=15192,["npcName"]="Anachronos",["x"]=0.6527,["title"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=22589,["itemName"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian"}}},["only"]={["classes"]={"MAGE"}},["quest"]=9270,["y"]=0.5003},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:6:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=15192,["npcName"]="Anachronos",["x"]=0.6527,["title"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=22631,["itemName"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian"}}},["only"]={["classes"]={"PRIEST"}},["quest"]=9257,["y"]=0.5003},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:6:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=15192,["npcName"]="Anachronos",["x"]=0.6527,["title"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=22630,["itemName"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian"}}},["only"]={["classes"]={"WARLOCK"}},["quest"]=9271,["y"]=0.5003},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:goal:6:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=15192,["npcName"]="Anachronos",["x"]=0.6527,["title"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=22632,["itemName"]="Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian"}}},["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"}},["quest"]=9269,["y"]=0.5003}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/atiesh:step:6",["text"]="The Greatstaff",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1445,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb",["zoneName"]="Dustwallow Marsh",["min"]=35,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Celestial Orb and Stave (35-40)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=40,["classes"]={"MAGE"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:1:1",["level"]=35,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6546},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=320,["npc"]=5497,["y"]=0.858,["x"]=0.49560000000000004,["title"]="Return to the Marsh",["npcName"]="Jennea Cannon",["closedBy"]={1954},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=1953,["minLevel"]=35}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:step:1",["text"]="Return to the Marsh (Stormwind)",["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="Jennea Cannon at the top of the Wizard's Sanctum, Stormwind's Mage Quarter, sends you back to Tabetha; Bink in Ironforge gives the same quest."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:2:1",["level"]=35,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6546},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:2:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=320,["npc"]=5885,["y"]=0.8613,["x"]=0.3845,["title"]="Return to the Marsh",["npcName"]="Deino",["closedBy"]={1954},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=1953,["minLevel"]=35}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:step:2",["text"]="Return to the Marsh (Orgrimmar)",["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="Deino, one of Orgrimmar's mage trainers in Darkbriar Lodge, sends you back to Tabetha; Anastasia Hartwell in the Undercity and Ursyn Ghull in Thunder Bluff give the same quest."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:3:1",["level"]=39,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:3:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6546,["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Return to the Marsh",["quest"]=1953,["y"]=0.5709000000000001},{["map"]=1445,["crumbs"]={1953},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:3:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6546,["y"]=0.5709000000000001,["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="The Infernal Orb",["npcName"]="Tabetha",["minLevel"]=35,["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=1954,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:step:3",["text"]="Tabetha",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Tabetha's cottage is deep in the marsh west of Theramore, just north of the Stonemaul Ruins; come in from the west road, the elites roam its east side."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:4:1",["level"]=40,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["itemName"]="Infernal Orb",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=7291,["quest"]=1954,["map"]=1443,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=4668,["t"]="collect",["spread"]=true,["title"]="The Infernal Orb",["y"]=0.7794,["x"]=0.6648999999999999,["count"]=1,["lvl"]=39,["note"]="Infernal Orb: Burning Blade Summoner",["from"]="Burning Blade Summoner",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:4:2"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:step:4",["text"]="The Infernal Orb",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Burning Blade Summoners (level 38-39, not elite) work the Mannoroc Coven in southern Desolace, east of Shadowprey Village, and every one carries an Infernal Orb. They cast Shadow Bolt from 40 yards, keep an imp at their side and run for help at low health; Nether Maidens patrol the pillared ruin beside them, so pull with care. Horde mages: one more summoner stands alone in western Mulgore, south-west of Thunder Bluff."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6546,["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="The Infernal Orb",["quest"]=1954,["y"]=0.5709000000000001},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:5:2",["level"]=40,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:5:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6546,["y"]=0.5709000000000001,["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["limit"]=180,["title"]="The Exorcism",["pre"]={1954},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=1955,["minLevel"]=35},{["map"]=1445,["note"]="Demon of the Orb (elite, 40)",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=40},["t"]="kill",["npc"]=6549,["y"]=0.5697,["x"]=0.4579,["title"]="The Exorcism",["count"]=1,["target"]="Demon of the Orb",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:5:4",["quest"]=1955,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:5:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6546,["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="The Exorcism",["quest"]=1955,["y"]=0.5709000000000001},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:5:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6546,["y"]=0.5709000000000001,["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Power in Uldaman",["npcName"]="Tabetha",["pre"]={1955},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=1956,["minLevel"]=35}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:step:5",["text"]="The Exorcism",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back at Tabetha's. Hand in the orb now; The Exorcism waits for level 40. Kill the critters around the cottage first: they join the fight. Accepting The Exorcism starts a 3 minute timer, and Tabetha calls the Demon of the Orb out in her garden: a level 40 elite that resists many spells, roots and slows. Grouping up is encouraged: a mage of 40 may need help or potions, at about 45 it is soloable. You can pull it from range from the dock. The timer keeps running after it dies, so hand the quest in straight away. If time runs out, abandon the quest and take it again; she calls the demon again."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:6:1",["level"]=41,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1418,["itemName"]="Obsidian Power Source",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=42},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Obsidian Power Source: Obsidian Sentinel",["y"]=0.13699999999999998,["x"]=0.491,["title"]="Power in Uldaman",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:6:2",["count"]=1,["item"]=8053,["quest"]=1956,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:step:6",["text"]="Power in Uldaman",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Uldaman is a dungeon in the northern Badlands: a group of five, from level 40 here. Go in by the rear entrance, a cave in Dustwind Gulch south-east of the main entrance (elite dragons fly nearby): the Obsidian Sentinel (level 42 elite) stands just past the first door. At 80, 60, 40 and 20 percent it breaks off an Obsidian Shard, an elite too; while a shard lives, both reflect targeted spells, so use area spells and your wand on them. A solo trick: step out through the nearby zone line each time a shard appears; the Sentinel heals but keeps shrinking. It always drops the power source, and takes 2 hours to come back."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:7:1",["level"]=40,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6546,["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Power in Uldaman",["quest"]=1956,["y"]=0.5709000000000001},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:7:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6546,["y"]=0.5709000000000001,["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["limit"]=600,["title"]="Mana Surges",["pre"]={1956},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=1957,["minLevel"]=35},{["map"]=1445,["oi"]=1,["id"]="forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:7:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=6550,["y"]=0.5694,["x"]=0.4583,["title"]="Mana Surges",["target"]="Mana Surge",["count"]=12,["quest"]=1957,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:7:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6546,["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Mana Surges",["quest"]=1957,["y"]=0.5709000000000001},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:7:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6546,["y"]=0.5709000000000001,["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Celestial Power",["npcName"]="Tabetha",["pre"]={1957},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=1958,["minLevel"]=35},{["map"]=1445,["note"]="Celestial Power: the Celestial Orb (off-hand) or the Celestial Stave",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:7:6",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6546,["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Celestial Power",["rewards"]={["choices"]={{["item"]=7515,["itemName"]="Celestial Orb"},{["item"]=9517,["itemName"]="Celestial Stave"}}},["quest"]=1958,["y"]=0.5709000000000001}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:step:7",["text"]="Mana Surges",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Tabetha. Accepting Mana Surges opens a rift beside her cottage and starts a 10 minute timer: twelve Mana Surges (level 40, Shock and Lightning Bolt) come out about four at a time. Attacking one does not pull the rest. Standing at the edge of the field draws them all; the tree south-west of it is out of their reach but in your spell range. Kill twelve and hand in before the timer runs out."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:8:1",["level"]=45,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["note"]="Jennea Cannon, Stormwind",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6546},["npc"]=5497,["npcName"]="Jennea Cannon",["qlvl"]=46,["quest"]=2861,["map"]=1453,["optional"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:8:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=410,["closedBy"]={2846},["x"]=0.49560000000000004,["title"]="Tabetha's Task",["y"]=0.858,["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["minLevel"]=40},{["note"]="Deino, Orgrimmar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6546},["npc"]=5885,["npcName"]="Deino",["qlvl"]=46,["quest"]=2861,["map"]=1454,["optional"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:8:3",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=410,["closedBy"]={2846},["x"]=0.3845,["title"]="Tabetha's Task",["y"]=0.8613,["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["minLevel"]=40},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:8:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6546,["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Tabetha's Task",["quest"]=2861,["y"]=0.5709000000000001},{["map"]=1445,["optional"]=true,["crumbs"]={2861},["group"]={["map"]=209,["kind"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6546,["y"]=0.5709000000000001,["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Tiara of the Deep",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:8:5",["qlvl"]=46,["minLevel"]=40,["quest"]=2846,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:step:8",["text"]="Tabetha's Task (optional)",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="At 40 the mage trainers who send you to Tabetha (Jennea Cannon, Bink, Anastasia Hartwell, Deino) also have Tabetha's Task, a quest any class can do. Tabetha then wants the Tiara of the Deep from Hydromancer Velratha, a level 46 elite naga in Zul'Farrak, the troll dungeon in north-western Tanaris: a group of five, level 44-54. The reward window shows the Spellshifter Rod and the Gemshale Pauldrons."},{["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:9:1",["level"]=46,["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={2846}}}},{["map"]=1446,["itemName"]="Tiara of the Deep",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["map"]=209,["kind"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Tiara of the Deep: Hydromancer Velratha, Zul'Farrak",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={2846}}},["y"]=0.2,["x"]=0.387,["title"]="Tiara of the Deep",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:9:2",["count"]=1,["item"]=9234,["quest"]=2846,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["map"]=209,["kind"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6546,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={2846}}},["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Tiara of the Deep",["y"]=0.5709000000000001,["quest"]=2846,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:goal:9:3"}},["detail"]="Zul'Farrak, the troll dungeon in north-western Tanaris, needs a group of five; the guide waits for level 46. Hydromancer Velratha is one of the bosses by the sacred pool, and the tiara always drops.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/celestial-orb:step:9",["text"]="Tiara of the Deep in Zul'Farrak",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={2846}}}}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1447,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz",["zoneName"]="Azshara",["min"]=50,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Destroy Morphaz (50-54)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=54,["classes"]={"MAGE"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:1:1",["level"]=50,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:1:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=331,["npcName"]="Maginor Dumas",["x"]=0.4925,["title"]="Magecraft",["y"]=0.8776999999999999,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8250,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:1",["text"]="Magecraft (Stormwind)",["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="Maginor Dumas, the Master Mage, stands in the Wizard's Sanctum in Stormwind's Mage Quarter; Dink in Ironforge gives the same quest."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:2:1",["level"]=50,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:2:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7311,["npcName"]="Uthel'nay",["x"]=0.39159999999999995,["title"]="Magecraft",["y"]=0.8626999999999999,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8250,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:2",["text"]="Magecraft (Orgrimmar)",["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="Uthel'nay, one of Orgrimmar's mage trainers in Darkbriar Lodge, gives it; so do Pierce Shackleton in the Undercity and Archmage Shymm in Thunder Bluff."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:goal:3:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:3:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8395,["npcName"]="Sanath Lim-yo",["x"]=0.2811,["title"]="Magecraft",["quest"]=8250,["y"]=0.5009},{["map"]=1447,["note"]="Archmage Xylem, in the tower",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:3:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8379,["y"]=0.4021,["x"]=0.2925,["title"]="Magic Dust",["npcName"]="Archmage Xylem",["pre"]={8250},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8251,["minLevel"]=50}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:step:3",["text"]="Sanath Lim-yo",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Fly to Talrendis Point (Alliance) or Valormok (Horde). Sanath Lim-yo camps below his master's tower, a short way east of Valormok: from the fork of Azshara's main road at the Ruins of Eldarath, head straight north to the cliffs. Get off your mount before he teleports you up, or the teleport may not take you. A trail with no enemies climbs to Archmage Xylem at the top of the tower; an attendant at the top sends you back down, as often as you like."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:goal:4:1",["level"]=53,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1447,["itemName"]="Glittering Dust",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:goal:4:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.295,["x"]=0.5546,["title"]="Magic Dust",["lvl"]=53,["count"]=10,["item"]=20028,["quest"]=8251,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:step:4",["text"]="Glittering Dust",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The blood elves hold the Thalassian Base Camp on the hills of north-eastern Azshara. Blood Elf Surveyors (51-52, Fire Nova up close) and Reclaimers (52-53, Fireball, and they heal and Renew each other) each drop the dust about one time in four; they spot you from far off, so pull at the edges. They come back after 5 1/2 minutes."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:goal:5:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8379,["npcName"]="Archmage Xylem",["x"]=0.2925,["title"]="Magic Dust",["quest"]=8251,["y"]=0.4021},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:5:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8379,["y"]=0.4021,["x"]=0.2925,["title"]="The Siren's Coral",["npcName"]="Archmage Xylem",["pre"]={8251},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8252,["minLevel"]=50}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:step:5",["text"]="Archmage Xylem",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Sanath Lim-yo, who teleports you up to the tower."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:goal:6:1",["level"]=52,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["itemName"]="Enchanted Coral",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=20029,["quest"]=8252,["map"]=1447,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=6195,["t"]="collect",["spread"]=true,["title"]="The Siren's Coral",["y"]=0.4802,["x"]=0.36329999999999996,["count"]=6,["from"]="Spitelash Siren",["lvl"]=52,["note"]="Enchanted Coral: Spitelash Siren",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:goal:6:2"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:step:6",["text"]="Enchanted Coral",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Spitelash Sirens (level 50-52) walk the ruins and beaches around the Ruins of Eldarath and the bay east of Valormok, often three together, and a few stand inside the Temple of Zin-Malor; each drops a coral about one time in four. The Spitelash Screamers look almost the same but never drop it. Killing the other naga there makes more Sirens appear in their spots. Lingering Highborne ghosts wander the ruins: watch your back."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:goal:7:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8379,["npcName"]="Archmage Xylem",["x"]=0.2925,["title"]="The Siren's Coral",["quest"]=8252,["y"]=0.4021},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:7:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8379,["y"]=0.4021,["x"]=0.2925,["title"]="Destroy Morphaz",["npcName"]="Archmage Xylem",["pre"]={8252},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8253,["minLevel"]=50}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:step:7",["text"]="Archmage Xylem again",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Sanath Lim-yo and up to the tower."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:goal:8:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1435,["itemName"]="Arcane Shard",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=52},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Arcane Shard: Morphaz",["y"]=0.536,["x"]=0.6990000000000001,["title"]="Destroy Morphaz",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:goal:8:2",["count"]=1,["item"]=20085,["quest"]=8253,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:step:8",["text"]="Morphaz",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Temple of Atal'Hakkar, the Sunken Temple, lies in the Pool of Tears: climb the steps into the sunken building, swim down through it and follow the passage down to the portal. A group of five, level 50-54. Morphaz is not waiting when you arrive. First kill the six troll guardians (elites of 50-52) on the platforms around the upper ring; that opens the way down (the left-hand ramp from the entrance) to Jammal'an the Prophet and Ogom the Wretched in the Pit of Sacrifice. Once Jammal'an dies, two green drakes, Weaver and Dreamscythe, come out and patrol the pit: pull them one at a time. When both are dead, Morphaz (level 52 elite, Acid Breath and Wing Flap) and Hazzas appear together and cannot be split, so fight both. The shard always drops. Hunters, Priests and Rogues of 50 need Morphaz too: a group of them shares one clear."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:9:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8379,["npcName"]="Archmage Xylem",["x"]=0.2925,["title"]="Destroy Morphaz",["quest"]=8253,["y"]=0.4021}},["id"]="forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz:9",["text"]="The Arcane Shard",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Azshara, Sanath Lim-yo and the tower. Look at the reward window before you hand in: Classic offered the Arcane Crystal Pendant, the Fire Ruby or the Glacial Spike, and Forever's notes say the choice may be gone."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1445,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand",["zoneName"]="Dustwallow Marsh",["min"]=30,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Mage's Wand (30-40)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=40,["classes"]={"MAGE"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:1:1",["level"]=30,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:1:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5497,["npcName"]="Jennea Cannon",["x"]=0.49560000000000004,["title"]="Journey to the Marsh",["y"]=0.858,["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=1947,["minLevel"]=30}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:1",["text"]="Journey to the Marsh (Stormwind)",["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="Jennea Cannon at the top of the Wizard's Sanctum, Stormwind's Mage Quarter, sends you to Tabetha; Bink in Ironforge gives the same quest."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:2:1",["level"]=30,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:2:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5885,["npcName"]="Deino",["x"]=0.3845,["title"]="Journey to the Marsh",["y"]=0.8613,["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=1947,["minLevel"]=30}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:2",["text"]="Journey to the Marsh (Orgrimmar)",["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="Deino, one of Orgrimmar's mage trainers in Darkbriar Lodge, sends you to Tabetha; Anastasia Hartwell in the Undercity and Ursyn Ghull in Thunder Bluff give the same quest."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand:goal:3:1",["level"]=39,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:3:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6546,["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Journey to the Marsh",["quest"]=1947,["y"]=0.5709000000000001},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:3:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6546,["y"]=0.5709000000000001,["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Hidden Secrets",["npcName"]="Tabetha",["pre"]={1947},["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=1949,["minLevel"]=30},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:7:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6546,["y"]=0.5709000000000001,["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Items of Power",["npcName"]="Tabetha",["pre"]={1947},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=1948,["minLevel"]=30}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand:step:3",["text"]="Tabetha",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Tabetha, a hermit, lives in a cottage deep in the marsh west of Theramore, just north of the Stonemaul Ruins. Level 38-41 elites roam the east side of her farm, and swimming in passes level 42 Muckshells: come in from the west along the road from the Barrens. Her cottage is no refuge: mobs follow you inside. Take both her quests."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1441,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6548,["npcName"]="Magus Tirth",["x"]=0.7829,["title"]="Hidden Secrets",["quest"]=1949,["y"]=0.757},{["map"]=1441,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:4:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6548,["y"]=0.757,["x"]=0.7829,["title"]="Get the Scoop",["npcName"]="Magus Tirth",["pre"]={1949},["qlvl"]=30,["quest"]=1950,["minLevel"]=30}},["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:4",["text"]="Magus Tirth",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Magus Tirth spends his days at the race track in the Shimmering Flats, south-east Thousand Needles."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand:goal:5:1",["level"]=39,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1441,["note"]="\"Plucky\" Johnson",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand:goal:5:2",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="\"Plucky\" Johnson"}},["y"]=0.7559999999999999,["x"]=0.7959999999999999,["title"]="Get the Scoop",["quest"]=1950},{["map"]=1441,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:5:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6548,["npcName"]="Magus Tirth",["x"]=0.7829,["title"]="Get the Scoop",["quest"]=1950,["y"]=0.757},{["map"]=1441,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:5:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6548,["y"]=0.757,["x"]=0.7829,["title"]="Rituals of Power",["npcName"]="Magus Tirth",["pre"]={1950},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=1951,["minLevel"]=30}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand:step:5",["text"]="\"Plucky\" Johnson",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Tirth's apprentice is \"Plucky\" Johnson, a small grey chicken pecking around the foot of the race track's lookout tower; at night type /target plucky. Target him and type /beckon (not /chicken or /wave): he turns human for a moment. Talk to him and ask for the phrase. Do not attack him. If he is gone, he is back within 5 minutes."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand:goal:6:1",["level"]=40,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1417,["itemName"]="Witherbark Totem Stick",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand:goal:6:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.4571,["x"]=0.42869999999999997,["item"]=7273,["lvl"]=35,["fromNpcsAt"]="1;1;2,4;3,5,4;3,4,5;3,4,5;3,4;4,5;5,4;5,6,4;3;1,2,5;1;2;4,1;4,5;3,4,5;3;3,4,5;5,4,6;6,5,4",["spread"]=true,["count"]=10},{["map"]=1417,["itemName"]="Witherbark Totem Stick",["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand:goal:6:3",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.5074000000000001,["x"]=0.5204,["title"]="Items of Power",["note"]="at the middle stone of the Circle of Outer Binding",["item"]=7273,["quest"]=1948,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1417,["itemName"]="Bolt Charged Bramble",["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=103662,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Items of Power",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.5074000000000001,["x"]=0.5204,["count"]=1,["from"]="Bolt Charged Bramble",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand:goal:6:4",["item"]=7272,["quest"]=1948,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand:step:6",["text"]="Witherbark trolls and the Bolt Charged Bramble",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Witherbark trolls (level 30-36) hold the villages in south-eastern Arathi and south of Hammerfall; every kind of them drops a Witherbark Totem Stick about two times in five: you need ten. Then go to the Circle of Outer Binding (the outer one, not the Inner circle). Three elementals (level 33-39) stand around its middle stone: pull them one at a time and clear them first. Stand at the middle stone and use a totem stick; about ten seconds later the Bolt Charged Bramble forms on the stone: click it. If you die before you pick it up, the bramble and the sticks are lost and you need ten more."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand:goal:7:1",["level"]=40,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1417,["itemName"]="Jade",["oi"]=1,["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:8:3",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.5044,["x"]=0.5428999999999999,["title"]="Items of Power",["count"]=1,["spread"]=true,["item"]=1529,["quest"]=1948,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand:step:7",["text"]="Jade",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Tabetha also wants one Jade, a green gem. Miners sometimes find one in ore veins; the Auction House sells it; the Torn Fin Coastrunners on the coast south-west of Southshore drop one about every fifth kill. Do not sell it to a vendor by mistake."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand:goal:8:1",["level"]=40,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1420,["itemName"]="Rituals of Power",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand:goal:8:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.33799999999999997,["x"]=0.826,["title"]="Rituals of Power",["note"]="Rituals of Power: Scarlet Monastery Library",["item"]=7274,["count"]=1,["quest"]=1951,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand:step:8",["text"]="Rituals of Power",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Tirth sold the book to the Scarlet Crusade. The Scarlet Monastery stands in north-eastern Tirisfal Glades; take the Library wing with a group of five. The book is in the last long hallway, the one that ends in Arcanist Doan's round room: on the left-hand shelf as you face his room, next to the Compendium of the Fallen. Take the thick, highlighted blue book sticking out of the shelf; a magnifying-glass cursor means a book you can only read."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6546,["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Rituals of Power",["quest"]=1951,["y"]=0.5709000000000001},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:9:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6546,["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Items of Power",["quest"]=1948,["y"]=0.5709000000000001},{["map"]=1445,["preAll"]={1948,1951},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:9:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6546,["y"]=0.5709000000000001,["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Mage's Wand",["npcName"]="Tabetha",["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=1952,["minLevel"]=30},{["map"]=1445,["note"]="Mage's Wand",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/mages-wand:9:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6546,["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Mage's Wand",["rewards"]={["choices"]={{["item"]=7514,["itemName"]="Icefury Wand"},{["item"]=11263,["itemName"]="Nether Force Wand"},{["item"]=7513,["itemName"]="Ragefire Wand"}}},["quest"]=1952,["y"]=0.5709000000000001}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/mages-wand:step:9",["text"]="Tabetha's ritual",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Tabetha. With both quests handed in she starts the ritual: wait a few seconds, then talk to her again and pick your wand: Icefury (frost), Nether Force (arcane) or Ragefire (fire)."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1447,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/mage/polymorph-pig",["zoneName"]="Azshara",["min"]=60,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Polymorph: Pig (60-60)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=60,["classes"]={"MAGE"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/mage/polymorph-pig:1:1",["level"]=60,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/polymorph-pig:1:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8379,["npcName"]="Archmage Xylem",["x"]=0.2925,["title"]="Warlord Krellian",["y"]=0.4021,["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=9362,["minLevel"]=60}},["id"]="forever/class/mage/polymorph-pig:1",["text"]="Xylem's tower",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Fly to Talrendis Point (Alliance) or Valormok (Horde). Sanath Lim-yo camps below Archmage Xylem's tower, a short way east of Valormok: from the fork of Azshara's main road at the Ruins of Eldarath, head straight north to the cliffs. Dismount, and he teleports you up; a trail climbs to the Archmage at the top of the tower."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1447,["itemName"]="Prismatic Shell",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Prismatic Shell: Warlord Krellian",["fromId"]=8408,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=9362,["count"]=1,["y"]=0.5305,["x"]=0.4102,["item"]=23250,["from"]="Warlord Krellian",["id"]="forever/class/mage/polymorph-pig:2:1",["title"]="Warlord Krellian",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="forever/class/mage/polymorph-pig:2",["text"]="Warlord Krellian",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Warlord Krellian (level 55, not elite, Strike and Demoralizing Roar) hides behind his Spitelash guards in the Temple of Zin-Malor, the biggest building in the middle of the Ruins of Eldarath. He always drops the Prismatic Shell and is back 5 1/2 minutes after a kill. Leave any raid group first: a raid gets no credit, a party is fine."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/polymorph-pig:3:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8379,["npcName"]="Archmage Xylem",["x"]=0.2925,["title"]="Warlord Krellian",["quest"]=9362,["y"]=0.4021},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/polymorph-pig:3:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8379,["y"]=0.4021,["x"]=0.2925,["title"]="Fragmented Magic",["npcName"]="Archmage Xylem",["pre"]={9362},["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=9364,["minLevel"]=60}},["id"]="forever/class/mage/polymorph-pig:3",["text"]="Archmage Xylem",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Sanath Lim-yo and up to the tower. Xylem hands the shell back with the next quest: keep it in your bags."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1447,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/polymorph-pig:goal:4:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=16479,["y"]=0.5351,["x"]=0.2994,["title"]="Fragmented Magic",["lvl"]=10,["target"]="Polymorph Clone",["count"]=50,["quest"]=9364,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/mage/polymorph-pig:step:4",["text"]="Polymorph Clones",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to the Ruins of Eldarath, full of Spitelash naga. Cast your sheep Polymorph (the turtle one does nothing) on a naga and wait a few seconds: it splits into two to six Polymorph Clones of about 150 health that run off fast. Stand next to the sheep and hit them the moment they appear with Frost Nova and Arcane Explosion. Fifty clones are needed, so it takes a while; not in a raid group."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1447,["note"]="Archmage Xylem: Polymorph (pig)",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/mage/polymorph-pig:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8379,["npcName"]="Archmage Xylem",["x"]=0.2925,["title"]="Fragmented Magic",["quest"]=9364,["y"]=0.4021}},["id"]="forever/class/mage/polymorph-pig:5",["text"]="Fragmented Magic",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Sanath Lim-yo and up to the tower."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1423,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/priest/benediction",["zoneName"]="Eastern Plaguelands",["min"]=60,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Benediction and Anathema (60-60)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=60,["classes"]={"PRIEST"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/benediction:goal:1:1",["t"]="talk",["npc"]=14387,["npcName"]="Lothos Riftwaker",["x"]=0.264,["note"]="Lothos Riftwaker: the way into Molten Core once attuned",["y"]=0.245},{["map"]=1428,["itemName"]="The Eye of Divinity",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["size"]=40,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.245,["x"]=0.264,["item"]=18646,["note"]="The Eye of Divinity: Molten Core, through Blackrock Mountain",["count"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/benediction:goal:1:2"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/benediction:step:1",["text"]="The Eye of Divinity",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Eye of Divinity comes from the Cache of the Firelord, the chest that appears when Majordomo Executus yields in Molten Core, a 40-player raid (it is in the cache about half the time). Molten Core's portal is at the bottom of Blackrock Depths; once you have done Attunement to the Core (a Core Fragment from beside that portal), Lothos Riftwaker inside Blackrock Mountain ports you straight in. Nothing in this chain starts without the Eye: Eris Havenfire is invisible until you equip it."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/priest/benediction:2:1",["level"]=60,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1423,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/priest/benediction:2:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14494,["npcName"]="Eris Havenfire",["x"]=0.1721,["title"]="A Warning",["y"]=0.12789999999999999,["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7621,["minLevel"]=60},{["map"]=1423,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/priest/benediction:2:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14494,["npcName"]="Eris Havenfire",["x"]=0.1721,["title"]="A Warning",["quest"]=7621,["y"]=0.12789999999999999},{["map"]=1423,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/priest/benediction:2:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14494,["y"]=0.12789999999999999,["x"]=0.1721,["title"]="The Balance of Light and Shadow",["npcName"]="Eris Havenfire",["pre"]={7621},["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7622,["minLevel"]=60}},["id"]="forever/class/priest/benediction:2",["text"]="Eris Havenfire",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Equip The Eye of Divinity, then find Eris Havenfire, a ghost on the hillside in the north-west of the Eastern Plaguelands, west of Stratholme's gate (if she does not show, take the Eye off and put it back on). A Warning is only talk; The Balance of Light and Shadow starts the moment you accept it, so prepare first: full mana, Major Mana Potions, Demonic or Dark Runes, mana food or Nightfin Soup, and a stack of Oil of Immolation or Stratholme Holy Water for the skeletons."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1423,["note"]="beside Eris Havenfire, where the peasants walk to",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/benediction:goal:3:1",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="The Balance of Light and Shadow"}},["y"]=0.12240000000000001,["x"]=0.17420000000000002,["title"]="The Balance of Light and Shadow",["quest"]=7622}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/benediction:step:3",["text"]="The Balance of Light and Shadow",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Save 50 peasants before 15 die (the Death Post by the path counts the dead). They walk from the cave towards Eris Havenfire in waves, catch diseases and draw skeletons and skeleton archers. Cure the purple-glowing diseases first (Abolish Disease), keep Renew on the hurt ones, Flash Heal the nearly dead, and kill skeletons as they spawn: one Holy Nova of rank 3 or more kills them, oil takes two ticks while they hit you. Shield yourself at the start of each wave; friendly nameplates make the hurt peasants easy to pick out. Friends may buff you before you accept and may heal or cure peasants, but they must not heal or buff you, attack a skeleton or bring a pet once it starts, or a demon appears and kills everyone. Fail, and Eris Havenfire is gone for a while (players report anything from 15 minutes to two hours); talk to her again when she is back."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/benediction:step:4",["text"]="Benediction",["goals"]={{["map"]=1423,["note"]="Eris Havenfire: Splinter of Nordrassil",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/priest/benediction:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14494,["npcName"]="Eris Havenfire",["x"]=0.1721,["title"]="The Balance of Light and Shadow",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=18659,["itemName"]="Splinter of Nordrassil"}}},["quest"]=7622,["y"]=0.12789999999999999}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1419,["itemName"]="The Eye of Shadow",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=3,["lvl"]=63},["t"]="collect",["fromId"]=12397,["y"]=0.7498,["x"]=0.3554,["item"]=18665,["from"]="Lord Kazzak",["count"]=1,["fromRank"]=3,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/benediction:goal:5:1"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/benediction:step:5",["text"]="The Eye of Shadow",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The splinter needs The Eye of Shadow as well. Lord Kazzak, a world boss in the Blasted Lands (a raid), always drops it; Manahounds and Doomguard Commanders there drop it rarely (about 3% and 2%), the Hederine of Winterspring hardly ever. It can be traded: check the Auction House first."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/benediction:goal:6:1",["text"]="Use the Splinter of Nordrassil with both Eyes in your bags: Benediction",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="task"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/benediction:step:6",["text"]="Benediction",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="With the Splinter of Nordrassil, The Eye of Divinity and The Eye of Shadow in your bags, use the splinter wherever you are: it becomes Benediction. Use Benediction to turn it into Anathema, the shadow staff, and back (a 30-minute cooldown)."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1447,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz",["zoneName"]="Azshara",["min"]=50,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Blood of Morphaz (50-52)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=52,["classes"]={"PRIEST"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["detail"]="At 50 in Ironforge, High Priest Rohan in the Hall of Mysteries (Mystic Ward) offers Cenarion Aid. Before you leave a city, buy an Ichor of Undeath at the Auction House (a few silver): the third quest asks for one and it drops rarely.",["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:goal:1:1",["level"]=50,["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["name"]="Ironforge",["k"]="zone",["area"]=1537},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={8254}}}},{["map"]=1455,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11406,["soloWhen"]={{["name"]="Ironforge",["k"]="zone",["area"]=1537},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={8254}}},["npcName"]="High Priest Rohan",["x"]=0.2473,["title"]="Cenarion Aid",["y"]=0.0816,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8254,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:step:1",["text"]="Cenarion Aid: High Priest Rohan",["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["soloWhen"]={{["name"]="Ironforge",["k"]="zone",["area"]=1537},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={8254}}}},{["detail"]="At 50, Brother Joshua at the altar of Stormwind's Cathedral of Light offers Cenarion Aid (High Priest Rohan in Ironforge has it too). Before you leave, buy an Ichor of Undeath at the Auction House in the Trade District (a few silver): the third quest asks for one and it drops rarely.",["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:goal:2:1",["level"]=50,["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={8254}}}},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:goal:2:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5489,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={8254}}},["npcName"]="Brother Joshua",["x"]=0.495,["title"]="Cenarion Aid",["y"]=0.4521,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8254,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:step:2",["text"]="Cenarion Aid: Brother Joshua",["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={8254}}}},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:1:1",["level"]=50,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:2:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6018,["npcName"]="Ur'kyo",["x"]=0.35590000000000005,["title"]="Cenarion Aid",["y"]=0.8782,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8254,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:2",["text"]="Cenarion Aid: Ur'kyo",["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="At 50, Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits offers Cenarion Aid. Before you leave, buy an Ichor of Undeath at the Auction House (a few silver): the third quest asks for one and it drops rarely."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:goal:4:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:goal:4:2",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=12577,["npcName"]="Jarrodenus",["x"]=0.11900000000000001,["y"]=0.7759,["location"]="Talrendis Point",["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["node"]=64,["area"]=3137},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:goal:4:3",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=8610,["npcName"]="Kroum",["x"]=0.21960000000000002,["y"]=0.4962,["location"]="Valormok",["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["node"]=44,["area"]=1237},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:3:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8405,["npcName"]="Ogtinc",["x"]=0.424,["title"]="Cenarion Aid",["quest"]=8254,["y"]=0.42619999999999997},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:3:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8405,["y"]=0.42619999999999997,["x"]=0.424,["title"]="Of Coursers We Know",["npcName"]="Ogtinc",["pre"]={8254},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8255,["minLevel"]=50}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:step:4",["text"]="Ogtinc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ogtinc, a furbolg, lives on the clifftop north-east of the Ruins of Eldarath. Alliance: fly to Talrendis Point; Horde: fly to Valormok. Ride east and leave the road at the fork before the ruins, then follow the northern cliff edge east to him: the naga ruins and the beach below are walled in by cliffs with no way up."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:goal:5:1",["level"]=53,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["itemName"]="Healthy Courser Gland",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=20027,["quest"]=8255,["map"]=1447,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=8761,["t"]="collect",["spread"]=true,["y"]=0.3539,["x"]=0.521,["title"]="Of Coursers We Know",["from"]="Mosshoof Courser",["count"]=4,["lvl"]=53,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:goal:5:2"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:step:5",["text"]="Of Coursers We Know",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Mosshoof Coursers (level 52-53, not elite) graze all over Azshara, thickest north-east of Ogtinc and south of the mountains; about one in three drops a Healthy Courser Gland, so plan on a dozen kills for four. They enrage at 30% health: finish them fast. Killing them costs no Cenarion Circle reputation. Keep any Ichor of Undeath you loot."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:step:6",["text"]="Ogtinc",["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:goal:6:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8405,["npcName"]="Ogtinc",["x"]=0.424,["title"]="Of Coursers We Know",["quest"]=8255,["y"]=0.42619999999999997},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:5:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8405,["y"]=0.42619999999999997,["x"]=0.424,["title"]="The Ichor of Undeath",["npcName"]="Ogtinc",["pre"]={8255},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8256,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:goal:7:1",["level"]=52,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1447,["itemName"]="Ichor of Undeath",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:goal:7:2",["t"]="collect",["title"]="The Ichor of Undeath",["y"]=0.46130000000000004,["x"]=0.4028,["count"]=1,["lvl"]=50,["spread"]=true,["item"]=7972,["quest"]=8256,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:step:7",["text"]="The Ichor of Undeath",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Carrying an Ichor of Undeath already? It counts at once. Otherwise any undead may drop one, rarely: the Lingering Highborne (level 48) in the Ruins of Eldarath below Ogtinc's cliff drop it about one kill in ten, the highborne ghosts on Azshara's border with Ashenvale (level 45-46) a little less, the Anguished and Suffering Highborne in Winterspring (54-55) about one in eight. The Auction House is usually quicker."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:step:8",["text"]="Ogtinc",["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:goal:8:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8405,["npcName"]="Ogtinc",["x"]=0.424,["title"]="The Ichor of Undeath",["quest"]=8256,["y"]=0.42619999999999997},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:7:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8405,["y"]=0.42619999999999997,["x"]=0.424,["title"]="Blood of Morphaz",["npcName"]="Ogtinc",["pre"]={8256},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8257,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:goal:9:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1435,["itemName"]="Blood of Morphaz",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["size"]=5,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Blood of Morphaz: the Sunken Temple entrance",["y"]=0.54,["x"]=0.69,["title"]="Blood of Morphaz",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:goal:9:2",["count"]=1,["item"]=20025,["quest"]=8257,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:step:9",["text"]="Morphaz in the Sunken Temple",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Morphaz is a level 52 elite green dragon inside the Sunken Temple, a five-player dungeon: bring a group of five (a level 60 group clears it with ease). Horde: fly to Stonard; Alliance: fly to Nethergarde Keep in the Blasted Lands and ride north. The temple stands in the middle of the Pool of Tears: climb the steps on its south side, swim down through the flooded hall and take the stairs to the portal. Inside, Morphaz only appears late: kill the six troll minibosses on the upper balconies, then Jammal'an the Prophet below them; that wakes the drakes Weaver and Dreamscythe in the Pit of Sacrifice, and killing both brings Morphaz and Hazzas. The pair patrols together and cannot be split: pull them into a hallway and have the tank face them away from the group (breath and a knockback). Loot him in a party, not a raid group: the blood always drops."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:9:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10922,["npcName"]="Greta Mosshoof",["x"]=0.5121,["title"]="Blood of Morphaz",["quest"]=8257,["y"]=0.8210999999999999}},["id"]="forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz:9",["text"]="Greta Mosshoof",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Greta Mosshoof is at the Emerald Sanctuary in southern Felwood. Horde: fly to Bloodvenom Post and ride south-east; Alliance: fly to Astranaar in Ashenvale and ride north into Felwood. She takes the blood for experience and gold. Look at the reward window before you hand in: Classic let you pick Blessed Prayer Beads, Circle of Hope or Woestave, and Forever's notes say that choice may be gone."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1424,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt",["zoneName"]="Hillsbrad Foothills",["min"]=24,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Ravenholdt (24-36)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=36,["classes"]={"ROGUE"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:1:1",["level"]=24,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["itemName"]="Elegant Letter",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:1:2",["t"]="accept",["title"]="The Manor, Ravenholdt",["qlvl"]=24,["minLevel"]=24,["quest"]=6681,["item"]=17126}},["id"]="forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:1",["text"]="The Elegant Letter",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="At 24 any capital's rogue trainer (Master Mathias Shaw or Osborne the Night Man in Stormwind, Gest or Ormok in Orgrimmar, and the others) has an Elegant Letter from Ravenholdt for you: ask for it in their talk window. Open it: the quest gives you the Seal of Ravenholdt for Fahrad. Learn Detect Traps from your trainer first if you have not; the way in is a test of it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Rite of Cunning: Detect Traps beside the tunnel chest",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:2:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=13936,["y"]=0.1784,["x"]=0.7864,["title"]="The Manor, Ravenholdt",["target"]="Ravenholdt",["count"]=1,["quest"]=6681,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:2:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6707,["npcName"]="Fahrad",["x"]=0.8445,["title"]="The Manor, Ravenholdt",["quest"]=6681,["y"]=0.8031999999999999},{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:2:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=13085,["y"]=0.8038,["x"]=0.8493,["title"]="Syndicate Sabotage",["npcName"]="Myrokos Silentform",["pre"]={6681},["qlvl"]=24,["quest"]=96779,["minLevel"]=24}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:step:2",["text"]="Ravenholdt Manor",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Horde fly to Tarren Mill, Alliance to Southshore. The trail to the manor is hard to see: it starts behind the plateau north of Durnholde Keep, east of Tarren Mill, climbs into the hills and bends twice to a small tunnel. A chest sits in the tunnel: do not open it. Cast Detect Traps near it and walk up close; that is the Rite of Cunning (it comes back after 5 minutes). Opening the chest calls Milton, an elite rogue of about level 32. Through the tunnel lies Ravenholdt Manor: Fahrad is upstairs inside. Do not attack anyone at the manor: it costs Ravenholdt reputation."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:3:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=266216,["y"]=0.4539,["x"]=0.7940999999999999,["title"]="Syndicate Sabotage",["lvl"]=24,["target"]="Lord Tomas",["count"]=1,["quest"]=96779,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1424,["itemName"]="Syndicate Emblem",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:3:2",["fromNpcsAt"]="1,3,6;1,6,3;1,6,3;1,6,3;1,6,3;3,1,6;3,1,6;4,5;5,4,2",["y"]=0.45549999999999996,["x"]=0.7954000000000001,["item"]=17124,["lvl"]=22,["t"]="collect",["optional"]=true,["spread"]=true,["text"]="Pick Pocket Syndicate members for Syndicate Emblems"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:step:3",["text"]="Lord Tomas",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Lord Tomas is inside Durnholde Keep, the Syndicate fortress south of the manor; he can stand in any of fifteen spots in the keep, so search. Quick and quiet, says Myrokos Silentform. Pick the pockets of the level 20-21 Syndicate Rogues, Shadow Mages and Watchmen on your way: they carry Syndicate Emblems for the guards' repeatable reputation quest."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:step:4",["text"]="Myrokos Silentform",["goals"]={{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=13085,["npcName"]="Myrokos Silentform",["x"]=0.8493,["title"]="Syndicate Sabotage",["quest"]=96779,["y"]=0.8038},{["map"]=1416,["note"]="Ravenholdt Guard: one emblem each time, 100 reputation",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["optional"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:4:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6766,["title"]="Syndicate Emblems",["npcName"]="Ravenholdt Guard",["x"]=0.8527,["qlvl"]=60,["y"]=0.7956,["pre"]={6681},["direct"]=true,["quest"]=6701,["minLevel"]=24}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:5:1",["level"]=36,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:5:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=13085,["y"]=0.8038,["x"]=0.8493,["title"]="What's the Big Idea?",["npcName"]="Myrokos Silentform",["pre"]={6681},["qlvl"]=36,["quest"]=96781,["minLevel"]=24},{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:5:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=13085,["y"]=0.8038,["x"]=0.8493,["title"]="A Way In",["npcName"]="Myrokos Silentform",["pre"]={6681},["qlvl"]=36,["quest"]=96783,["minLevel"]=24},{["itemName"]="Barton's Scouting Report",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=275482,["quest"]=96781,["map"]=1416,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=266357,["t"]="collect",["text"]="Pick Pocket Barton for Barton's Scouting Report",["y"]=0.469,["x"]=0.626,["title"]="What's the Big Idea?",["lvl"]=36,["count"]=1,["from"]="Barton",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:5:4"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:step:5",["text"]="What's the Big Idea?",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="In your mid 30s Myrokos Silentform has two more jobs; take both. Barton leads a Syndicate scouting party at Strahnbrad, in the east of the Alterac Mountains, inside one of the houses with stealthed Syndicate around him. Pick his pocket for the report and do not kill him: he does not drop it. If you are lower than him he sees through stealth; Master of Deception helps, or Distract him, Vanish and come in from behind. Pick Pocket can miss several times in a row."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:6:1",["level"]=36,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=13085,["npcName"]="Myrokos Silentform",["x"]=0.8493,["title"]="What's the Big Idea?",["quest"]=96781,["y"]=0.8038},{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:6:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=13085,["y"]=0.8038,["x"]=0.8493,["title"]="Covert Extraction",["npcName"]="Myrokos Silentform",["pre"]={96781},["qlvl"]=36,["quest"]=96782,["minLevel"]=24},{["map"]=1416,["itemName"]="Royal Aegis of Perenolde",["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:6:4",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.40159999999999996,["x"]=0.41350000000000003,["title"]="Covert Extraction",["note"]="Royal Aegis of Perenolde, in the northern tower",["item"]=275636,["count"]=1,["quest"]=96782,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1416,["itemName"]="Blade of House Perenolde",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:6:5",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.58,["x"]=0.385,["title"]="Covert Extraction",["note"]="Blade of House Perenolde, in the southern tower",["item"]=275635,["count"]=1,["quest"]=96782,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:6:6",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=13085,["npcName"]="Myrokos Silentform",["x"]=0.8493,["title"]="Covert Extraction",["quest"]=96782,["y"]=0.8038}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:step:6",["text"]="Covert Extraction",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Myrokos Silentform; the report sends you after the Perenolde heirlooms. Two towers stand among the Ruins of Alterac, in the middle of the Alterac Mountains, held by ogres: the shield lies in the northern tower, the sword in the southern one, which elite ogres ring and watch from far off. Stay stealthed; nothing guards the heirlooms inside."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1417,["note"]="Syndicate Footlocker, Northfold Manor",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.266,["x"]=0.32299999999999995,["title"]="A Way In",["objName"]="Syndicate Footlocker",["quest"]=96783,["object"]=656157},{["map"]=1417,["note"]="Master of Disguise: the Syndicate Uniform",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:7:2",["t"]="accept",["object"]=656157,["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["y"]=0.266,["x"]=0.32299999999999995,["qlvl"]=36,["objName"]="Syndicate Footlocker",["pre"]={96783},["minLevel"]=24,["quest"]=96784,["title"]="Master of Disguise"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:step:7",["text"]="A Way In",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Stromgarde Keep in western Arathi is a Syndicate stronghold; to get in you need a uniform. Northfold Manor, in north-western Arathi, is held by Syndicate Highwaymen, Pathstalkers and Mercenaries (level 30-32): find the Syndicate Footlocker there and take the uniform; that ends A Way In."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:8:1",["level"]=35,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1417,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:8:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=266847,["npcName"]="Anastasia Miller",["x"]=0.268,["title"]="Master of Disguise",["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["quest"]=96784,["y"]=0.644},{["map"]=1417,["note"]="Ain't No Telling",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:8:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=266847,["y"]=0.644,["x"]=0.268,["title"]="Ain't No Telling",["npcName"]="Anastasia Miller",["pre"]={96784},["qlvl"]=36,["quest"]=96785,["minLevel"]=24}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:step:8",["text"]="Anastasia Miller",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Stromgarde's Syndicate Prowlers and Conjurors are elite (level 35-36): a rogue of 36 can slip past them, but fighting one alone is hard, so stay hidden or bring a friend. Put on the Syndicate Uniform (Master of Disguise hands it to you at the footlocker) to pass as one of them; stealth or suspicious acts can break it. If the footlocker gave you no uniform, Anastasia hands you one with Ain't No Telling. Anastasia Miller is not inside the keep: she stands on a ledge on the outside of the castle wall. Jump across to it from the roof of the house beside the ledge."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:9:1",["level"]=36,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1417,["itemName"]="Stolen Funds",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:9:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.6509999999999999,["x"]=0.295,["title"]="Ain't No Telling",["note"]="Stolen Funds: Anastasia's Stash",["item"]=275709,["count"]=1,["quest"]=96785,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1417,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:9:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=266847,["npcName"]="Anastasia Miller",["x"]=0.268,["title"]="Ain't No Telling",["quest"]=96785,["y"]=0.644},{["map"]=1417,["note"]="The Syndicate Sting",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:9:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=266847,["y"]=0.644,["x"]=0.268,["title"]="The Syndicate Sting",["npcName"]="Anastasia Miller",["pre"]={96785},["qlvl"]=36,["quest"]=96786,["minLevel"]=24}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:step:9",["text"]="Ain't No Telling",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="She will not talk without something to bargain with. Her stash is upstairs in a house close to the keep: take the Stolen Funds. If it is already open, wait for it to come back."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:10:1",["level"]=35,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1417,["itemName"]="Intercepted Shipment",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:10:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.43,["x"]=0.155,["title"]="The Syndicate Sting",["count"]=1,["item"]=275882,["quest"]=96786,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:step:10",["text"]="The Syndicate Sting",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Falconcrest's men make the handoff at the southern end of Thoradin's Wall, the old wall between Arathi and Hillsbrad. Kill the two guarding the box and take the Intercepted Shipment. Keep the Syndicate Uniform: Myrokos Silentform wants it back with the shipment."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:step:11",["text"]="Back to Myrokos Silentform",["goals"]={{["map"]=1416,["note"]="Myrokos Silentform: 70 silver, 300 Ravenholdt reputation",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt:goal:11:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=13085,["npcName"]="Myrokos Silentform",["x"]=0.8493,["title"]="The Syndicate Sting",["quest"]=96786,["y"]=0.8038}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1416,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key",["zoneName"]="Alterac Mountains",["min"]=50,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="The Azure Key (50-52)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=52,["classes"]={"ROGUE"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:1:1",["level"]=50,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6768},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=500,["npc"]=918,["y"]=0.6531,["x"]=0.7743000000000001,["title"]="A Simple Request",["npcName"]="Osborne the Night Man",["closedBy"]={8234},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8233,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:step:1",["text"]="A Simple Request (Alliance)",["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="At 50 Osborne the Night Man in Stormwind's Old Town has it; so do Syurna in Darnassus and Hulfdan Blackbeard in Ironforge."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:2:1",["level"]=50,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6768},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:goal:2:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=500,["npc"]=3328,["y"]=0.5463,["x"]=0.439,["title"]="A Simple Request",["npcName"]="Ormok",["closedBy"]={8234},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8233,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:step:2",["text"]="A Simple Request (Horde)",["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="At 50 Ormok in the Cleft of Shadow has it; so does Miles Dexter in the Undercity's Rogues' Quarter."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:goal:3:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:3:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6768,["npcName"]="Lord Jorach Ravenholdt",["x"]=0.8602,["title"]="A Simple Request",["quest"]=8233,["y"]=0.7888},{["map"]=1416,["crumbs"]={8233},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:goal:3:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6768,["y"]=0.7888,["x"]=0.8602,["title"]="Sealed Azure Bag",["npcName"]="Lord Jorach Ravenholdt",["minLevel"]=50,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8234,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:step:3",["text"]="Lord Jorach Ravenholdt",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ravenholdt Manor hides in the hills east of Tarren Mill. Horde fly to Tarren Mill, Alliance to Southshore. The trail starts behind the plateau north of Durnholde Keep, climbs into the hills and runs through a small tunnel into the Alterac Mountains; Lord Jorach is inside the manor. Do not attack anyone at the manor: lost Ravenholdt reputation makes him refuse to speak to you."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:goal:4:1",["level"]=52,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:goal:4:2",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=12577,["npcName"]="Jarrodenus",["x"]=0.11900000000000001,["y"]=0.7759,["location"]="Talrendis Point",["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["node"]=64,["area"]=3137},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:goal:4:3",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=8610,["npcName"]="Kroum",["x"]=0.21960000000000002,["y"]=0.4962,["location"]="Valormok",["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["node"]=44,["area"]=1237},{["map"]=1447,["itemName"]="Sealed Azure Bag",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:goal:4:4",["t"]="collect",["count"]=1,["quest"]=8234,["y"]=0.266,["x"]=0.442,["title"]="Sealed Azure Bag",["lvl"]=51,["note"]="Sealed Azure Bag: Timbermaw Shaman",["item"]=19775,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:step:4",["text"]="Sealed Azure Bag",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Alliance fly to Talrendis Point, Horde to Valormok. Only the level 50-51 Timbermaw Shamans in the furbolg hills of northern Azshara carry the bag (the level 47-49 furbolgs further south do not): about one kill in thirty drops it. Pick Pocket them instead and you lose no Timbermaw reputation; if you are Unfriendly or better with Timbermaw Hold, mark them At War in your reputation panel first. They cast Lightning Bolt and Lightning Cloud, heal each other and run at low health."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:goal:5:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8379,["npcName"]="Archmage Xylem",["x"]=0.2925,["title"]="Sealed Azure Bag",["quest"]=8234,["y"]=0.4021},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:5:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8379,["y"]=0.4021,["x"]=0.2925,["title"]="Encoded Fragments",["npcName"]="Archmage Xylem",["pre"]={8234},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8235,["minLevel"]=50}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:step:5",["text"]="Archmage Xylem",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Sanath Lim-yo, camped below the cliffs just east of Valormok, teleports you up (dismount first); a trail leads to Xylem's tower."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:goal:6:1",["level"]=53,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["itemName"]="Encoded Fragment",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=20023,["quest"]=8235,["map"]=1447,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=8766,["t"]="collect",["spread"]=true,["title"]="Encoded Fragments",["y"]=0.6786,["x"]=0.3616,["count"]=10,["from"]="Forest Ooze",["lvl"]=53,["note"]="Encoded Fragment: Forest Ooze",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:goal:6:2"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:step:6",["text"]="Encoded Fragments",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Forest Oozes (level 52-53, Diseased Slime up close) drop a fragment four times in five: the biggest group, seven of them, is in the Bitter Reaches hills of north-eastern Azshara, four more south-east of Valormok. Pick their pockets before the kill for an extra fragment or two. Killing the Mistwing Ravagers and hippogryphs that share their spots makes more oozes appear."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:step:7",["text"]="Back to Xylem",["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:goal:7:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8379,["npcName"]="Archmage Xylem",["x"]=0.2925,["title"]="Encoded Fragments",["quest"]=8235,["y"]=0.4021},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:7:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8379,["y"]=0.4021,["x"]=0.2925,["title"]="The Azure Key",["npcName"]="Archmage Xylem",["pre"]={8235},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8236,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:goal:8:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1435,["itemName"]="Azure Key",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=52},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Azure Key: Morphaz, inside the temple",["y"]=0.536,["x"]=0.6990000000000001,["title"]="The Azure Key",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:goal:8:2",["count"]=1,["item"]=20022,["quest"]=8236,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:step:8",["text"]="Morphaz in the Sunken Temple",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Morphaz, a level 52 elite green drake, lives deep in the Sunken Temple: a group of five, level 50-54. The temple stands in the Pool of Tears; climb into the sunken building, swim down through it and follow the passage to the portal. Horde: fly to Stonard; Alliance: fly to Nethergarde Keep and ride on. He is not there when you arrive: first kill the six troll guardians (elites of 50-52) on the platforms around the upper ring, which opens the way down (the left-hand ramp from the entrance) to Jammal'an the Prophet in the Pit of Sacrifice. Jammal'an's death brings out two drakes, Weaver and Dreamscythe; when both are dead, Morphaz and Hazzas appear together and fight as a pair. Their Acid Breath is nature damage: nature protection potions help; poisons and Blind do not work on them. The key always drops. Hunters, Priests and Mages of 50 need Morphaz too: one clear serves them all."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:9:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6768,["npcName"]="Lord Jorach Ravenholdt",["x"]=0.8602,["title"]="The Azure Key",["quest"]=8236,["y"]=0.7888}},["id"]="forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key:9",["text"]="Lord Ravenholdt",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Look at the reward window before you hand in: Classic offered the Duskbat Drape, the Ebon Mask or the Whisperwalk Boots, and Forever's notes say the choice may be gone."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1421,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-eye-of-bhossca",["zoneName"]="Silverpine Forest",["min"]=30,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="The Eye of Bhossca (30-35)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=35,["classes"]={"ROGUE"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-eye-of-bhossca:goal:1:1",["level"]=34,["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=78307}}},{["map"]=1421,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-eye-of-bhossca:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=78307}},["y"]=0.7099,["x"]=0.47119999999999995,["title"]="The Eye of Bhossca",["objName"]="Dead Drop",["qlvl"]=35,["minLevel"]=30,["quest"]=78676,["object"]=410369}},["detail"]="C's next job comes by letter: once you are level 30 and have done the horn job (The Horn of Xelthos, its payment from this Dead Drop handed in), visit any capital city and C's letter arrives in the mailbox; only then does the Dead Drop near Pyrewood Village, in southern Silverpine just south of Shadowfang Keep, offer it. The quest data lists a minimum of 25, but players get the letter, and the job, at 30.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-eye-of-bhossca:step:1",["text"]="C's dead drop",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=78307}}},{["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-eye-of-bhossca:goal:2:1",["level"]=35,["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=78307}}},{["map"]=1420,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-eye-of-bhossca:goal:2:2",["t"]="goto",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=78307}},["y"]=0.33799999999999997,["x"]=0.826,["text"]="Scarlet Monastery",["area"]=796},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-eye-of-bhossca:goal:2:3",["text"]="Solo route: Graveyard key, Library letter, Graveyard benches and coffer, then Library reliquary for the eye. Read the letter before the bench puzzle; check the disguise each time you change wings.",["t"]="note",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=78307}}},{["map"]=1420,["itemName"]="Eye of Bhossca",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-eye-of-bhossca:goal:2:4",["t"]="collect",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=78307}},["y"]=0.33799999999999997,["x"]=0.826,["title"]="The Eye of Bhossca",["note"]="the locked reliquary in the Library",["item"]=210953,["count"]=1,["quest"]=78676,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["detail"]="The monastery stands in the far north-east of Tirisfal Glades. Go in alone, out of any group. Before entering, take the Scarlet Initiate's Uniform from the Supply Locker in the stables behind the monastery and wear it; stealth and suspicious actions remove it, so put it back on after each wing change. In the Graveyard, in the Chamber of Atonement (the first big room), Pick Pocket a Scarlet Scryer or Scarlet Crier for the Scryer's Key. In the Library, open the Personal Letterbox in the Athenaeum with it and read the Confidential Message. It sends you back to sit on both benches between the two statues in the Graveyard. Watch for the mechanism's messages, then take the Reliquary Key from the stone coffer: an elite stands by the coffer with a patrol behind it, but from beside the northern mausoleum you can turn the camera until the box shows and click it through the wall (an interact key works too). An elite ghost walks near the mausoleum; the broken piece at its edge keeps you out of its path. Then return to the Library for the locked reliquary and the eye. Avoid fighting through the instance.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-eye-of-bhossca:step:2",["text"]="The Scarlet Monastery",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=78307}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1421,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-eye-of-bhossca:goal:3:1",["t"]="turnin",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=78307}},["y"]=0.7099,["x"]=0.47119999999999995,["title"]="The Eye of Bhossca",["objName"]="Dead Drop",["quest"]=78676,["object"]=410369},{["map"]=1421,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-eye-of-bhossca:goal:3:2",["t"]="accept",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=78307}},["y"]=0.7099,["x"]=0.47119999999999995,["title"]="The Eye of Bhossca",["objName"]="Dead Drop",["qlvl"]=35,["minLevel"]=25,["quest"]=78699,["object"]=410369},{["map"]=1421,["note"]="Ruby-Adorned Blade",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-eye-of-bhossca:goal:3:3",["t"]="turnin",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=78307}},["y"]=0.7099,["x"]=0.47119999999999995,["title"]="The Eye of Bhossca",["objName"]="Dead Drop",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=277246,["itemName"]="Ruby-Adorned Blade"}}},["quest"]=78699,["object"]=410369}},["detail"]="Place the eye in the Dead Drop near Pyrewood. Check a capital mailbox for C's payment letter on your next planned city visit, then return here for the reward quest. The payment may not be available immediately; do not repeat the infiltration just because the reward has not appeared.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-eye-of-bhossca:step:3",["text"]="Back to the dead drop",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=78307}}}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1421,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos",["zoneName"]="Silverpine Forest",["min"]=23,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="The Horn of Xelthos (23-26)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=26,["classes"]={"ROGUE"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos:1:1",["level"]=23,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1421,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["y"]=0.7099,["x"]=0.47119999999999995,["title"]="The Horn of Xelthos",["objName"]="Dead Drop",["qlvl"]=23,["minLevel"]=1,["quest"]=78261,["object"]=410369}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos:step:1",["text"]="C's dead drop",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Dead Drop is a chest in a house just outside Pyrewood Village in southern Silverpine, south of Shadowfang Keep. Open it and read C's note: the job has to be done alone, out of any group."},{["goals"]={{["npcName"]="Veenix",["x"]=0.5821999999999999,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["map"]=1442,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos:2:1",["t"]="talk",["npc"]=4086,["y"]=0.5174},{["map"]=1442,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos:goal:2:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4086,["npcName"]="Veenix",["x"]=0.5821999999999999,["title"]="Goblin Lockpicks",["y"]=0.5174,["qlvl"]=23,["quest"]=78270,["minLevel"]=1},{["map"]=1442,["itemName"]="Venture Co. Work Order",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos:goal:2:3",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.5226,["x"]=0.5943999999999999,["item"]=210187,["lvl"]=20,["text"]="Pick Pocket a Venture Co. Logger for a Venture Co. Work Order",["spread"]=true,["count"]=1},{["map"]=1442,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos:2:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4086,["npcName"]="Veenix",["x"]=0.5821999999999999,["title"]="Goblin Lockpicks",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=210186,["itemName"]="Breaching Charge"}}},["quest"]=78270,["y"]=0.5174}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos:step:2",["text"]="Veenix",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Veenix, a goblin friendly to both factions, stands among the Venture Co. in the Windshear Crag, east Stonetalon, a short way north-east of Sun Rock Retreat. Horde fly to Sun Rock Retreat; Alliance to Stonetalon Peak. He wants a Venture Co. Work Order before he hands over explosives: the Venture Co. Loggers (level 18) working around him carry them in their pockets. Stealth up behind one and Pick Pocket it; killing them does not give it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1421,["itemName"]="Horn of Xelthos",["oi"]=1,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos:3:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.6779999999999999,["x"]=0.44799999999999995,["title"]="The Horn of Xelthos",["note"]="Horn of Xelthos, inside Shadowfang Keep",["item"]=210183,["count"]=1,["quest"]=78261,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos:3",["text"]="Shadowfang Keep",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Go in alone and use the Breaching Charge at the courtyard gate. Players also report a freed prisoner opening the courtyard door for you: if you die while he is opening it, stay dead until it is open; it stays open once you release. If you know Vanish, bring Flash Powder and check its cooldown before entering; keep it ready for a failed approach. Pickpocket the sister in the dining hall for the Sister's Half-Key, then the brother in the room reached by turning right at the top of the stairs for the Brother's Half-Key (a level 20 rogue without Vanish may need ranks in Master of Deception to reach the second one unseen). Combine them somewhere safe: this breaks stealth. Free a bag slot first: opening the chest with full bags can use up the key without giving the horn. Return to the courtyard stables and use the combined key on the chest for the horn. Stay clear of the nearby elites; the minimum quest level does not guarantee a safe approach."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1421,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos:goal:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.7099,["x"]=0.47119999999999995,["title"]="The Horn of Xelthos",["objName"]="Dead Drop",["quest"]=78261,["object"]=410369},{["map"]=1421,["note"]="Pyrewood Signet Ring",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=277210,["itemName"]="Pyrewood Signet Ring"}}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos:goal:4:2",["t"]="turnin",["qlvl"]=23,["direct"]=true,["y"]=0.7099,["x"]=0.47119999999999995,["title"]="The Horn of Xelthos",["objName"]="Dead Drop",["pre"]={78261},["minLevel"]=1,["quest"]=78307,["object"]=410369}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-horn-of-xelthos:step:4",["text"]="Back to the dead drop",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Open the Dead Drop again, the chest outside Pyrewood you took the job from, and hand in the horn there. C's payment is a second hand-in at the same chest, with nothing to accept first, and it may not be there right away: players have waited from a quarter of an hour to two hours. Check a capital mailbox for C's follow-up letter on your next planned city visit, then return to this chest for it. Do not repeat the dungeon just because the payment is not yet offered."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1413,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe",["zoneName"]="The Barrens",["min"]=31,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe (31-38)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=38,["classes"]={"WARLOCK"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:1:1",["level"]=31,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6266},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=625,["npc"]=461,["y"]=0.8495999999999999,["x"]=0.3924,["title"]="In Search of Menara Voidrender",["npcName"]="Demisette Cloyce",["closedBy"]={1796,4736,4737,4739},["qlvl"]=31,["quest"]=4738,["minLevel"]=31}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:step:1",["text"]="In Search of Menara Voidrender (Stormwind)",["only"]={["races"]={"Human"}},["detail"]="At 31 Demisette Cloyce in the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet. Buy a Robes of Arcana and a Gold Bar first (next steps) to save a trip."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:2:1",["level"]=31,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1455,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6266},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:2:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=625,["npc"]=5172,["y"]=0.056600000000000004,["x"]=0.5035000000000001,["title"]="In Search of Menara Voidrender",["npcName"]="Briarthorn",["closedBy"]={1796,4737,4738,4739},["qlvl"]=31,["quest"]=4736,["minLevel"]=31}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:step:2",["text"]="In Search of Menara Voidrender (Ironforge)",["only"]={["races"]={"Gnome"}},["detail"]="At 31 Briarthorn in Ironforge sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet. Buy a Robes of Arcana and a Gold Bar first (next steps) to save a trip."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:3:1",["level"]=31,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6266},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:3:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=625,["npc"]=3326,["y"]=0.4543,["x"]=0.48469999999999996,["title"]="In Search of Menara Voidrender",["npcName"]="Zevrost",["closedBy"]={1796,4736,4738,4739},["qlvl"]=31,["quest"]=4737,["minLevel"]=31}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:step:3",["text"]="In Search of Menara Voidrender (Orgrimmar)",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["detail"]="At 31 Zevrost in the Cleft of Shadow sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet. Buy a Robes of Arcana and a Gold Bar first (next steps) to save a trip."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:4:1",["level"]=31,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1458,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6266},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:4:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=625,["npc"]=4563,["y"]=0.1593,["x"]=0.8621,["title"]="In Search of Menara Voidrender",["npcName"]="Kaal Soulreaper",["closedBy"]={1796,4736,4737,4738},["qlvl"]=31,["quest"]=4739,["minLevel"]=31}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:step:4",["text"]="In Search of Menara Voidrender (Undercity)",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="At 31 Kaal Soulreaper in the Magic Quarter sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet; the zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades flies to Durotar. Buy a Robes of Arcana and a Gold Bar first (next steps) to save a trip."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1453,["itemName"]="Robes of Arcana",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:5:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.713,["x"]=0.612,["item"]=5770,["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["note"]="Robes of Arcana: the Auction House"},{["map"]=1454,["itemName"]="Robes of Arcana",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:5:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.627,["x"]=0.5589999999999999,["item"]=5770,["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["note"]="Robes of Arcana: the Auction House"},{["map"]=1453,["itemName"]="Gold Bar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:5:3",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.713,["x"]=0.612,["item"]=3577,["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["note"]="Gold Bar: the Auction House"},{["map"]=1454,["itemName"]="Gold Bar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:5:4",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.627,["x"]=0.5589999999999999,["item"]=3577,["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["note"]="Gold Bar: the Auction House"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:step:5",["text"]="Robes of Arcana and a Gold Bar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Tailors sew the Robes of Arcana from a rare pattern; miners smelt Gold Bars from Gold Ore. Everyone else buys both at the Auction House. If you wear the robe, take it off: Menara Voidrender keeps it."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:6:1",["level"]=33,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="In Search of Menara Voidrender",["only"]={["races"]={"Human"}},["quest"]=4738,["y"]=0.35450000000000004},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:5:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="In Search of Menara Voidrender",["only"]={["races"]={"Gnome"}},["quest"]=4736,["y"]=0.35450000000000004},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:5:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="In Search of Menara Voidrender",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["quest"]=4737,["y"]=0.35450000000000004},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:5:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="In Search of Menara Voidrender",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["quest"]=4739,["y"]=0.35450000000000004},{["map"]=1413,["crumbs"]={4736,4737,4738,4739},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:6:6",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6266,["y"]=0.35450000000000004,["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["minLevel"]=31,["qlvl"]=31,["quest"]=1796,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",["quest"]=1796,["y"]=0.35450000000000004},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:6:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6266,["y"]=0.35450000000000004,["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["pre"]={1796},["qlvl"]=34,["quest"]=4781,["minLevel"]=31}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:step:6",["text"]="Menara Voidrender",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Menara Voidrender stands by Strahad Farsan's tower on the hill above Ratchet, behind the engineers' hut. She takes the robe, then sends the gold bar to Xizk Goodstitch in Booty Bay."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2670,["npcName"]="Xizk Goodstitch",["x"]=0.2871,["title"]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",["quest"]=4781,["y"]=0.7689},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:7:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2670,["y"]=0.7689,["x"]=0.2871,["title"]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",["npcName"]="Xizk Goodstitch",["pre"]={4781},["qlvl"]=34,["quest"]=4782,["minLevel"]=31}},["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:7",["text"]="Xizk Goodstitch",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The boat from Ratchet sails to Booty Bay. Xizk Goodstitch runs A Tailor to Cities on an upper level of the town. Give him the Gold Bar; he will spin the thread later."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:8:1",["level"]=36,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:8:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",["quest"]=4782,["y"]=0.35450000000000004},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:8:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6266,["y"]=0.35450000000000004,["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["pre"]={4782},["qlvl"]=37,["quest"]=4783,["minLevel"]=31}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:step:8",["text"]="Back to Menara Voidrender",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="You need no thread yet: Menara Voidrender wants demon parts from Desolace next."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:9:1",["level"]=37,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1443,["itemName"]="Vial of Hatefury Blood",["oi"]=1,["fromNpcsAt"]="6,1;6,1,3,4,2;1,4,5;1,6,2,3,4;3,5,1,2,4;2,3,4,5,6;3,1,2,4,6;1,2,3,6;5,6,1,4;2,4;2;2,1,6;3,4,6;2,3,5;4,2,3,5,6;4,6,1,2,5,7;5,2,3,4,6;3,5,4",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:9:2",["t"]="collect",["quest"]=4783,["count"]=10,["y"]=0.1782,["x"]=0.747,["item"]=6989,["lvl"]=33,["note"]="Vials of Hatefury Blood",["title"]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:step:9",["text"]="Hatefury satyrs",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Hatefury satyrs (level 31-32) hold Sargeron in the far north-east of Desolace, past Nijel's Point: two kills in five give a vial, so plan on about 25."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:10:1",["level"]=39,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["itemName"]="Lesser Infernal Stone",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=6990,["quest"]=4783,["map"]=1443,["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=4676,["t"]="collect",["fromAlsoId"]=11937,["title"]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",["y"]=0.7112999999999999,["x"]=0.568,["count"]=1,["lvl"]=39,["from"]="Lesser Infernal",["fromAlso"]="Demon Portal Guardian",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:10:2"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:step:10",["text"]="Mannoroc Coven",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Lesser Infernals (36-37) and Demon Portal Guardians (38) of Mannoroc Coven, in the south of Desolace, drop the stone half the time. The guide waits for level 39 first: at 31 they are too strong to solo. They resist fire, so use Shadow Bolt and Corruption."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:step:11",["text"]="Menara Voidrender again",["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:11:1",["level"]=36,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:10:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",["quest"]=4783,["y"]=0.35450000000000004},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:10:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6266,["y"]=0.35450000000000004,["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["pre"]={4783},["qlvl"]=37,["quest"]=4784,["minLevel"]=31}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:12:1",["level"]=36,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Xizk Goodstitch: Fine Gold Thread, handed straight back",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:12:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2670,["y"]=0.7689,["npcName"]="Xizk Goodstitch",["x"]=0.2871,["title"]="Fine Gold Thread",["direct"]=true,["pre"]={4783},["qlvl"]=37,["quest"]=4785,["minLevel"]=31},{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Fine Gold Thread",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=2670,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.7689,["x"]=0.2871,["count"]=1,["from"]="Xizk Goodstitch",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:12:3",["item"]=12293,["quest"]=4784,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:step:12",["text"]="Fine Gold Thread",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Xizk Goodstitch in Booty Bay: he offers Fine Gold Thread as a quest you hand straight back to him. He may show no quest marker; talk to him anyway."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:13:1",["level"]=39,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1417,["itemName"]="Smoldering Coal",["oi"]=2,["count"]=2,["fromId"]=2760,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=4784,["lvl"]=39,["y"]=0.304,["x"]=0.2561,["item"]=6991,["from"]="Burning Exile",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:13:2",["title"]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1417,["itemName"]="Soul Shard",["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:13:3",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.305,["x"]=0.249,["title"]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",["note"]="Soul Shard: Drain Soul on an Exile as it dies",["item"]=6265,["count"]=1,["quest"]=4784,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:step:13",["text"]="Smoldering Coal",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Burning Exiles (level 38-39), fire elementals at the Circle of West Binding in western Arathi Highlands, drop the coal about one time in three. The guide waits for level 39 first: below it they hit too hard to solo. They resist fire: Shadow Bolt and Corruption. The Cresting Charms from the Cresting Exiles near Hammerfall finish one off once you have hurt it. Make a Soul Shard with Drain Soul on the way."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:14:1",["level"]=38,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:13:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",["quest"]=4784,["y"]=0.35450000000000004},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:13:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6266,["y"]=0.35450000000000004,["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="The Completed Robe",["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["pre"]={4784},["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=4786,["minLevel"]=31},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Wait beside Menara Voidrender while she finishes the robe",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:goal:14:4",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Menara Voidrender"}},["y"]=0.354,["x"]=0.625,["title"]="The Completed Robe",["quest"]=4786},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Menara Voidrender: Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:13:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="The Completed Robe",["quest"]=4786,["y"]=0.35450000000000004}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe:step:14",["text"]="The Completed Robe",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Menara Voidrender with the thread, the coals and a Soul Shard. Then wait beside her while she works the robe (do not attack her: the quest log calls it a kill), and speak to her again."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1448,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request",["zoneName"]="Felwood",["min"]=50,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="An Imp's Request (50-54)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=54,["classes"]={"WARLOCK"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["detail"]="At 50 Demisette Cloyce in the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Impsy in Felwood with a piece of Felcloth.",["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:1:1",["level"]=51,["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["name"]="Felwood",["k"]="zone",["area"]=361}}},{["map"]=1453,["xp"]=3800,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={14470},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=461,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["name"]="Felwood",["k"]="zone",["area"]=361}},["y"]=0.8495999999999999,["x"]=0.3924,["title"]="An Imp's Request",["npcName"]="Demisette Cloyce",["closedBy"]={8420},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8419,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:step:1",["text"]="An Imp's Request (Stormwind)",["only"]={["races"]={"Human"}},["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["name"]="Felwood",["k"]="zone",["area"]=361}}},{["detail"]="At 50 Briarthorn in Ironforge sends you to Impsy in Felwood with a piece of Felcloth.",["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:2:1",["level"]=51,["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["name"]="Felwood",["k"]="zone",["area"]=361}}},{["map"]=1455,["xp"]=3800,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={14470},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:2:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5172,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["name"]="Felwood",["k"]="zone",["area"]=361}},["y"]=0.056600000000000004,["x"]=0.5035000000000001,["title"]="An Imp's Request",["npcName"]="Briarthorn",["closedBy"]={8420},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8419,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:step:2",["text"]="An Imp's Request (Ironforge)",["only"]={["races"]={"Gnome"}},["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["name"]="Felwood",["k"]="zone",["area"]=361}}},{["detail"]="At 50 Zevrost in the Cleft of Shadow sends you to Impsy in Felwood with a piece of Felcloth.",["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:3:1",["level"]=51,["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["name"]="Felwood",["k"]="zone",["area"]=361}}},{["map"]=1454,["xp"]=3800,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={14470},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:3:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3326,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["name"]="Felwood",["k"]="zone",["area"]=361}},["y"]=0.4543,["x"]=0.48469999999999996,["title"]="An Imp's Request",["npcName"]="Zevrost",["closedBy"]={8420},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8419,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:step:3",["text"]="An Imp's Request (Orgrimmar)",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["name"]="Felwood",["k"]="zone",["area"]=361}}},{["detail"]="At 50 Kaal Soulreaper in the Magic Quarter sends you to Impsy in Felwood with a piece of Felcloth.",["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:4:1",["level"]=51,["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["name"]="Felwood",["k"]="zone",["area"]=361}}},{["map"]=1458,["xp"]=3800,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={14470},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:4:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4563,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["name"]="Felwood",["k"]="zone",["area"]=361}},["y"]=0.1593,["x"]=0.8621,["title"]="An Imp's Request",["npcName"]="Kaal Soulreaper",["closedBy"]={8420},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8419,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:step:4",["text"]="An Imp's Request (Undercity)",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["name"]="Felwood",["k"]="zone",["area"]=361}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["itemName"]="Felcloth",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:5:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.6711,["x"]=0.3223,["item"]=14256,["lvl"]=51,["spread"]=true,["fromNpcsAt"]="8,6,1,11;8,6,11;4,5,9,7;3,5;5;9,10,13;7,10;7;6;6;6;6;6,8;6,11;11,8,6;5;6;5;5;2,12;6;6;9;10,7,9;7,9,10;7,10"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:step:5",["text"]="Felcloth",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="One Felcloth: the Jadefire satyrs of Felwood drop it about one kill in fourteen, and so do the Legashi satyrs and the Felguard Sentries you hunt for Niby's essences. Quicker: buy one at the Auction House. You need it for the trainer's An Imp's Request or for Impsy's own Hot and Itchy, the same errand: whichever you hold."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14470,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={8419}}},["npcName"]="Impsy",["x"]=0.41359999999999997,["title"]="An Imp's Request",["quest"]=8419,["y"]=0.45020000000000004}},["detail"]="Impsy waits beside Niby the Almighty on a rise just north-east of Bloodvenom Post: coming north over the Bloodvenom Falls bridge, they stand off the road to the east, past a few oozes. Hand him the trainer's An Imp's Request with the cloth. Next he wants ten Rotting Wood and four Bloodvenom Essence.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:step:6",["text"]="Impsy",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={8419}}}},{["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:7:1",["level"]=51,["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=8419}}},{["note"]="Impsy: Hot and Itchy",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={14470},["npc"]=14470,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=8419}},["npcName"]="Impsy",["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8420,["map"]=1448,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:7:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=3800,["closedBy"]={8419},["x"]=0.41359999999999997,["title"]="Hot and Itchy",["y"]=0.45020000000000004,["minLevel"]=50},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:7:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14470,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=8419}},["npcName"]="Impsy",["x"]=0.41359999999999997,["title"]="Hot and Itchy",["quest"]=8420,["y"]=0.45020000000000004}},["detail"]="Impsy waits beside Niby the Almighty on a rise just north-east of Bloodvenom Post: coming north over the Bloodvenom Falls bridge, they stand off the road to the east, past a few oozes. Take his own Hot and Itchy and hand him the cloth at once. Next he wants ten Rotting Wood and four Bloodvenom Essence.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:step:7",["text"]="Impsy: Hot and Itchy",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=8419}}},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:8:1",["level"]=53,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1448,["note"]="Impsy: The Wrong Stuff",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:6:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14470,["y"]=0.45020000000000004,["x"]=0.41359999999999997,["title"]="The Wrong Stuff",["npcName"]="Impsy",["pre"]={8419,8420},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8421,["minLevel"]=50},{["map"]=1448,["itemName"]="Rotting Wood",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:8:3",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.2984,["x"]=0.4851,["title"]="The Wrong Stuff",["lvl"]=53,["count"]=10,["item"]=20613,["quest"]=8421,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["itemName"]="Bloodvenom Essence",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=20614,["quest"]=8421,["map"]=1448,["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=7092,["t"]="collect",["spread"]=true,["y"]=0.4635,["x"]=0.4399,["title"]="The Wrong Stuff",["from"]="Tainted Ooze",["count"]=4,["lvl"]=52,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:8:4"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:step:8",["text"]="Rotting Wood and Bloodvenom",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Irontree treants (level 52) of Irontree Woods, in northern Felwood west of Talonbranch Glade, drop Rotting Wood one time in four; the big Withered Protector (55) often drops three at once but hits hard and dazes. The Tainted Oozes (51) around Impsy and along the Bloodvenom drop the essence one time in five."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:9:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:8:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14470,["npcName"]="Impsy",["x"]=0.41359999999999997,["title"]="The Wrong Stuff",["quest"]=8421,["y"]=0.45020000000000004},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:8:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14470,["y"]=0.45020000000000004,["x"]=0.41359999999999997,["title"]="Trolls of a Feather",["npcName"]="Impsy",["pre"]={8421},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8422,["minLevel"]=50}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:step:9",["text"]="Impsy again",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Impsy now wants six Voodoo Feathers from the Sunken Temple: a dungeon run."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:10:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1435,["itemName"]="Amber Voodoo Feather",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["size"]=5,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Amber Voodoo Feathers: Gasher, Zul'Lor",["y"]=0.54,["x"]=0.69,["title"]="Trolls of a Feather",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:10:2",["count"]=2,["item"]=20606,["quest"]=8422,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1435,["itemName"]="Blue Voodoo Feather",["oi"]=2,["group"]={["size"]=5,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Blue Voodoo Feathers: Hukku, Mijan",["y"]=0.54,["x"]=0.69,["title"]="Trolls of a Feather",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:10:3",["count"]=2,["item"]=20607,["quest"]=8422,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1435,["itemName"]="Green Voodoo Feather",["oi"]=3,["group"]={["size"]=5,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Green Voodoo Feathers: Zolo, Loro",["y"]=0.54,["x"]=0.69,["title"]="Trolls of a Feather",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:goal:10:4",["count"]=2,["item"]=20608,["quest"]=8422,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:step:10",["text"]="The Sunken Temple",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Sunken Temple (Temple of Atal'Hakkar, level 50-56, a group of five) stands in the middle of the Pool of Tears: swim down into the temple and take the stairs to the entrance. The six troll guardians (level 51-52, elite) stand on the balconies around the central pit, each with adds; each drops his feather every time: Gasher and Zul'Lor the Amber, Hukku and Mijan the Blue, Zolo and Loro the Green. Not soloable at 52."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:10:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14470,["npcName"]="Impsy",["x"]=0.41359999999999997,["title"]="Trolls of a Feather",["rewards"]={["choices"]={{["item"]=20536,["itemName"]="Soul Harvester"},{["item"]=20534,["itemName"]="Abyss Shard"},{["item"]=20530,["itemName"]="Robes of Servitude"}}},["quest"]=8422,["y"]=0.45020000000000004}},["id"]="forever/class/warlock/impsys-request:10",["text"]="Trolls of a Feather",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Choose the Soul Harvester (staff), the Abyss Shard (off-hand) or the Robes of Servitude."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1413,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil",["zoneName"]="The Barrens",["min"]=35,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Orb of Orahil (35-40)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=40,["classes"]={"WARLOCK"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:1:1",["level"]=35,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6266},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=1350,["npc"]=461,["y"]=0.8495999999999999,["x"]=0.3924,["title"]="Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil",["npcName"]="Demisette Cloyce",["closedBy"]={1799,4965,4967,4969},["qlvl"]=35,["quest"]=4968,["minLevel"]=35}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:step:1",["text"]="Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (Stormwind)",["only"]={["races"]={"Human"}},["detail"]="At 35 Demisette Cloyce in the Slaughtered Lamb, in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:2:1",["level"]=35,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1455,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6266},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:2:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=1350,["npc"]=5172,["y"]=0.056600000000000004,["x"]=0.5035000000000001,["title"]="Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil",["npcName"]="Briarthorn",["closedBy"]={1799,4967,4968,4969},["qlvl"]=35,["quest"]=4965,["minLevel"]=35}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:step:2",["text"]="Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (Ironforge)",["only"]={["races"]={"Gnome"}},["detail"]="At 35 Briarthorn in Ironforge sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:3:1",["level"]=35,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6266},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:3:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=1350,["npc"]=3326,["y"]=0.4543,["x"]=0.48469999999999996,["title"]="Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil",["npcName"]="Zevrost",["closedBy"]={1799,4965,4968,4969},["qlvl"]=35,["quest"]=4967,["minLevel"]=35}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:step:3",["text"]="Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (Orgrimmar)",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["detail"]="At 35 Zevrost in the Cleft of Shadow sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:4:1",["level"]=35,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1458,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6266},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:4:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=1350,["npc"]=4563,["y"]=0.1593,["x"]=0.8621,["title"]="Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil",["npcName"]="Kaal Soulreaper",["closedBy"]={1799,4965,4967,4968},["qlvl"]=35,["quest"]=4969,["minLevel"]=35}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:step:4",["text"]="Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil (Undercity)",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="At 35 Kaal Soulreaper in the Magic Quarter sends you to Menara Voidrender in Ratchet. The zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades flies to Durotar."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:5:1",["level"]=39,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil",["only"]={["races"]={"Human"}},["quest"]=4968,["y"]=0.35450000000000004},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:5:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil",["only"]={["races"]={"Gnome"}},["quest"]=4965,["y"]=0.35450000000000004},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:5:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["quest"]=4967,["y"]=0.35450000000000004},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:5:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["quest"]=4969,["y"]=0.35450000000000004},{["map"]=1413,["crumbs"]={4965,4967,4968,4969},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:5:6",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6266,["y"]=0.35450000000000004,["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="Fragments of the Orb of Orahil",["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["minLevel"]=35,["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=1799,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:step:5",["text"]="Menara Voidrender",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Menara Voidrender and her two acolytes stand in Strahad Farsan's tower on the hill above Ratchet."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:6:1",["level"]=39,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Acolyte Wytula: she gives you the Felhas Ruby",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6266},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:6:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6254,["xp"]=2350,["npcName"]="Acolyte Wytula",["x"]=0.6264,["qlvl"]=40,["y"]=0.353,["closedBy"]={4963},["title"]="Shard of a Felhound",["quest"]=4962,["minLevel"]=35},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Acolyte Magaz: he gives you the Infus Emerald",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6266},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:6:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6252,["xp"]=2350,["npcName"]="Acolyte Magaz",["x"]=0.6256,["qlvl"]=40,["y"]=0.35229999999999995,["closedBy"]={4962},["title"]="Shard of an Infernal",["quest"]=4963,["minLevel"]=35}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:step:6",["text"]="Choose an acolyte",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Pick one acolyte: you can take only one of their quests. Acolyte Wytula's felhound path ends with the Orb or Staff of Dar'Orahil, the shadow versions; Acolyte Magaz's infernal path with the Orb or Staff of Noh'Orahil, much the same items on the fire side. Most warlocks lean on shadow, but compare the four in their tooltips first. The guide follows the one you take. Keep the ruby or the emerald: it is handed back."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:7:1",["level"]=40,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["itemName"]="Infernal Orb",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=7291,["quest"]=1799,["map"]=1443,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=4668,["t"]="collect",["spread"]=true,["title"]="Fragments of the Orb of Orahil",["y"]=0.7794,["x"]=0.6648999999999999,["count"]=1,["lvl"]=39,["note"]="Infernal Orb, from the Burning Blade Summoners",["from"]="Burning Blade Summoner",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:7:2"},{["itemName"]="Imprisoned Felhound Spirit",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=12648,["quest"]=4962,["map"]=1443,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=4678,["t"]="collect",["lvl"]=38,["y"]=0.6814,["x"]=0.5291,["title"]="Shard of a Felhound",["from"]="Mana Eater",["count"]=1,["note"]="Imprisoned Felhound Spirit, from a Mana Eater, Mage Hunter or Ley Hunter",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:7:3"},{["itemName"]="Imprisoned Infernal Spirit",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=12649,["quest"]=4963,["map"]=1443,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=4676,["t"]="collect",["lvl"]=37,["y"]=0.7114,["x"]=0.5431,["title"]="Shard of an Infernal",["from"]="Lesser Infernal",["count"]=1,["note"]="Imprisoned Infernal Spirit, from a Lesser Infernal",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:7:4"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:step:7",["text"]="Mannoroc Coven",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Mannoroc Coven fills south-central Desolace, east of Shadowprey Village. The Burning Blade Summoners (level 38-39, warlocks with imps) carry the Infernal Orb every time. For the spirit, bring your demon to low health with your damage over time, then channel the ruby or the emerald on it and keep channelling while it dies, as with Drain Soul: the gem does no damage of its own. The ruby works on the coven's felhounds: the two Mana Eaters (37-38) in the north, and the Mage Hunters (38) and Ley Hunters (39) further south. The emerald works on the Lesser Infernals (36-37, sixteen of them, fire-resistant)."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:8:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="Shard of a Felhound",["quest"]=4962,["y"]=0.35450000000000004},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:8:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="Shard of an Infernal",["quest"]=4963,["y"]=0.35450000000000004}},["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:8",["text"]="The demon's spirit",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Menara Voidrender in the tower above Ratchet with the spirit and the gem first: her orb follows from it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:9:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6546,["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Fragments of the Orb of Orahil",["quest"]=1799,["y"]=0.5709000000000001},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:9:2",["level"]=40,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1445,["preAll"]={1799,4962},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:9:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6546,["y"]=0.5709000000000001,["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Cleansing of the Orb of Orahil",["npcName"]="Tabetha",["limit"]=180,["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=4961,["minLevel"]=35},{["map"]=1445,["oi"]=1,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=40},["t"]="kill",["npc"]=6549,["y"]=0.5697,["x"]=0.4579,["title"]="Cleansing of the Orb of Orahil",["count"]=1,["target"]="Demon of the Orb",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:9:4",["quest"]=4961,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:9:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6546,["npcName"]="Tabetha",["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Cleansing of the Orb of Orahil",["quest"]=4961,["y"]=0.5709000000000001},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:9:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6546,["y"]=0.5709000000000001,["x"]=0.4606,["title"]="Returning the Cleansed Orb",["npcName"]="Tabetha",["pre"]={4961},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=4976,["minLevel"]=35}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:step:9",["text"]="Tabetha",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Tabetha lives at her farm in the middle of Dustwallow Marsh, south of the road from the Barrens and south-west of Theramore; a spirit healer stands beside it. Deadmire, a level 45 crocolisk, patrols the creeks just north-east. Hand in the orb now; Cleansing waits for level 40. Before you accept it, clear the spiders and crocolisks around her paddock. Accepting starts a 3-minute timer: she walks to the paddock and lets the Demon of the Orb out. It is elite (level 40): grouping up is encouraged; a warlock of about 40 can solo it with Fear or Banish and damage over time, a level 38 one brings a friend. The timer keeps running after the kill, so hand in at once. If time runs out, abandon the quest and take it from Tabetha again."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:10:1",["level"]=40,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:10:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="Returning the Cleansed Orb",["quest"]=4976,["y"]=0.35450000000000004},{["map"]=1413,["preAll"]={4976},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6266},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:10:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6266,["xp"]=3900,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["qlvl"]=40,["y"]=0.35450000000000004,["closedBy"]={4963},["title"]="The Completed Orb of Dar'Orahil",["quest"]=4964,["minLevel"]=35},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Wait beside Menara Voidrender while she makes the orb",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:10:4",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Menara Voidrender"}},["y"]=0.354,["x"]=0.625,["title"]="The Completed Orb of Dar'Orahil",["quest"]=4964},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:10:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="The Completed Orb of Dar'Orahil",["rewards"]={["choices"]={{["item"]=15108,["itemName"]="Orb of Dar'Orahil"},{["item"]=15106,["itemName"]="Staff of Dar'Orahil"}}},["quest"]=4964,["y"]=0.35450000000000004}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:step:10",["text"]="The Orb of Dar'Orahil",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Menara Voidrender in the tower above Ratchet with the cleansed orb. On the felhound path, accept her last quest and wait beside her while she completes the Orb of Dar'Orahil (do not attack her: the quest log calls it a kill), then speak to her again and pick the off-hand orb or the staff."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:11:1",["level"]=40,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1413,["preAll"]={4976},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6266},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:11:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6266,["xp"]=3900,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["qlvl"]=40,["y"]=0.35450000000000004,["closedBy"]={4962},["title"]="The Completed Orb of Noh'Orahil",["quest"]=4975,["minLevel"]=35},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Wait beside Menara Voidrender while she makes the orb",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:goal:11:3",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Menara Voidrender"}},["y"]=0.354,["x"]=0.625,["title"]="The Completed Orb of Noh'Orahil",["quest"]=4975},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:11:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6266,["npcName"]="Menara Voidrender",["x"]=0.6251,["title"]="The Completed Orb of Noh'Orahil",["rewards"]={["choices"]={{["item"]=15107,["itemName"]="Orb of Noh'Orahil"},{["item"]=15105,["itemName"]="Staff of Noh'Orahil"}}},["quest"]=4975,["y"]=0.35450000000000004}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-orahil:step:11",["text"]="The Orb of Noh'Orahil",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="On the infernal path, accept her last quest and wait beside Menara Voidrender while she completes the Orb of Noh'Orahil, then speak to her again and pick the off-hand orb or the staff."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1413,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-soranruk",["zoneName"]="The Barrens",["min"]=22,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Orb of Soran'ruk (22-30)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=30,["classes"]={"WARLOCK"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-soranruk:goal:1:1",["level"]=24,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-soranruk:1:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6247,["npcName"]="Doan Karhan",["x"]=0.49310000000000004,["title"]="The Orb of Soran'ruk",["y"]=0.5721,["qlvl"]=25,["quest"]=1740,["minLevel"]=20}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-soranruk:step:1",["text"]="Doan Karhan",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Doan Karhan camps beside Takar the Seer, at a tent just north-east of Camp Taurajo in the southern Barrens. Alliance warlocks reach him from Ratchet or Theramore; Horde ones head south from the Crossroads. He wants fragments from two dungeons: take the quest before your Blackfathom Deeps and Shadowfang Keep runs."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-soranruk:goal:2:1",["level"]=25,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1440,["itemName"]="Soran'ruk Fragment",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=25},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Soran'ruk Fragments, from the Twilight Acolytes inside",["y"]=0.142,["x"]=0.145,["title"]="The Orb of Soran'ruk",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-soranruk:goal:2:2",["count"]=3,["item"]=6914,["quest"]=1740,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-soranruk:step:2",["text"]="Blackfathom Deeps",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Blackfathom Deeps (level 24-32, a group of five) opens in the ruins on the north-west coast of Ashenvale, under the water at Zoram Strand. The Twilight Acolytes (level 24-25, elite, healers) stand in the last halls, around Twilight Lord Kelris and the altar before Aku'mai; each one drops a fragment, but only three spawn in a run and they do not come back for two hours, so one run covers one warlock: kill them first, before they heal the rest."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-soranruk:goal:3:1",["level"]=25,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1421,["itemName"]="Large Soran'ruk Fragment",["oi"]=2,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=21},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Large Soran'ruk Fragment, from the Shadowfang Darksouls inside",["y"]=0.6779999999999999,["x"]=0.44799999999999995,["title"]="The Orb of Soran'ruk",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-soranruk:goal:3:2",["count"]=1,["item"]=6915,["quest"]=1740,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/orb-of-soranruk:step:3",["text"]="Shadowfang Keep",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Shadowfang Keep (level 22-30, a group of five) stands on the hill south of the Sepulcher. Free the prisoner in the cells right of the entrance and he opens the way into the courtyard. The Shadowfang Darksouls (level 20-21, elite) are not in the courtyard: they walk the halls past it, up the ramp that curves left and in the building after. About twelve stand in a run and one in five drops the Large Fragment, so clear every Darksoul and run it again if it does not drop."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-soranruk:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6247,["npcName"]="Doan Karhan",["x"]=0.49310000000000004,["title"]="The Orb of Soran'ruk",["rewards"]={["choices"]={{["item"]=6898,["itemName"]="Orb of Soran'ruk"},{["item"]=15109,["itemName"]="Staff of Soran'ruk"}}},["quest"]=1740,["y"]=0.5721}},["id"]="forever/class/warlock/orb-of-soranruk:4",["text"]="Back to Doan Karhan",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Choose the off-hand Orb of Soran'ruk or the two-handed Staff of Soran'ruk."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1448,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame",["zoneName"]="Felwood",["min"]=50,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Shard of the Green Flame (50-56)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=56,["classes"]={"WARLOCK"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:goal:1:1",["level"]=54,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:1:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14469,["npcName"]="Niby the Almighty",["x"]=0.4138,["title"]="What Niby Commands",["y"]=0.4485,["qlvl"]=50,["quest"]=7601,["minLevel"]=50},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:1:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14470,["npcName"]="Impsy",["x"]=0.41359999999999997,["title"]="What Niby Commands",["quest"]=7601,["y"]=0.45020000000000004},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:1:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14470,["y"]=0.45020000000000004,["x"]=0.41359999999999997,["title"]="Flawless Fel Essence",["npcName"]="Impsy",["pre"]={7601},["qlvl"]=55,["quest"]=7602,["minLevel"]=50}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:step:1",["text"]="Niby the Almighty",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="At 50 Niby the Almighty and his imp Impsy wait on a rise in central Felwood just north-east of Bloodvenom Post: coming north over the Bloodvenom Falls bridge, they stand off the road to the east, past a few oozes. Niby the Almighty sends you to Impsy, beside him, who wants three Flawless Fel Essences from three places."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:goal:2:1",["level"]=54,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["itemName"]="Flawless Fel Essence (Azshara)",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=18624,["quest"]=7602,["map"]=1447,["oi"]=1,["fromAlsoId"]=6201,["fromId"]=6200,["t"]="collect",["fromAlso"]="Legashi Rogue",["spread"]=true,["y"]=0.20920000000000002,["x"]=0.6142,["title"]="Flawless Fel Essence",["lvl"]=53,["from"]="Legashi Satyr",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:goal:2:2"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:step:2",["text"]="Azshara",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Legashi satyrs (level 51-53) hold the Legash Encampment on Azshara's northern coast. Every kind drops the essence three times in four; the satyrs burn mana and the Hellcallers rain fire, so pull them singly."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:goal:3:1",["level"]=54,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1448,["itemName"]="Flawless Fel Essence (Jaedenar)",["oi"]=2,["count"]=1,["fromId"]=9862,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=7602,["lvl"]=55,["y"]=0.5021,["x"]=0.37579999999999997,["item"]=18622,["from"]="Jaedenar Legionnaire",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:goal:3:2",["title"]="Flawless Fel Essence",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:step:3",["text"]="Jaedenar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Jaedenar lies just south of Bloodvenom Post, west of the road. The guide waits for level 54 first: its Legionnaires are 55. Of its two caves, Shadow Hold is the northern one, further up the hill; the other has no Legionnaires. Shadow Hold's tunnels run north under the hills, and the Jaedenar Legionnaires (level 55) stand in its deeper halls, from the first ramps on toward Lord Banehollow's chamber; they Uppercut anyone in melee. Three kills in four give the essence, but only about eleven spawn: clear your way in and wait out a five-minute respawn if you must. The cultists of Jaedenar and Shadow Hold are all hostile."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:goal:4:1",["level"]=55,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1419,["itemName"]="Flawless Fel Essence (Dark Portal)",["oi"]=3,["count"]=1,["fromId"]=6011,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=7602,["lvl"]=55,["y"]=0.5123,["x"]=0.5852,["item"]=18623,["from"]="Felguard Sentry",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:goal:4:2",["title"]="Flawless Fel Essence",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:step:4",["text"]="The Dark Portal",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Felguard Sentries (level 54) walk around the The Dark Portal in the south of the Blasted Lands, each with a felhunter. Leave the level 57 Servants of Razelikh alone: they cannot be killed without their own quest."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:goal:5:1",["level"]=54,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14470,["npcName"]="Impsy",["x"]=0.41359999999999997,["title"]="Flawless Fel Essence",["quest"]=7602,["y"]=0.45020000000000004},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:5:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14470,["y"]=0.45020000000000004,["x"]=0.41359999999999997,["title"]="Kroshius' Infernal Core",["npcName"]="Impsy",["pre"]={7602},["qlvl"]=55,["quest"]=7603,["minLevel"]=50}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:step:5",["text"]="Impsy",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Impsy. He hands you the Fel Fire: keep it, it wakes the infernal Kroshius."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:goal:6:1",["level"]=54,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1448,["itemName"]="Fel Fire",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:6:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.348,["x"]=0.457,["item"]=18626,["note"]="Fel Fire, at Kroshius' Remains"},{["map"]=1448,["oi"]=1,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=55},["t"]="kill",["npc"]=14467,["y"]=0.34759999999999996,["x"]=0.457,["title"]="Kroshius' Infernal Core",["count"]=1,["target"]="Kroshius",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:goal:6:3",["quest"]=7603,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["itemName"]="Kroshius' Infernal Core",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=55},["item"]=18625,["fromRank"]=1,["quest"]=7603,["map"]=1448,["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=14467,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.34759999999999996,["x"]=0.457,["title"]="Kroshius' Infernal Core",["from"]="Kroshius",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:goal:6:4"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:step:6",["text"]="Kroshius",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Kroshius' remains lie in Shatter Scar Vale, the burnt crater north of Niby the Almighty: follow the road north from his camp; the remains lie a little east of it. Use the Fel Fire beside them and wait for him to rise. Kroshius is elite (level 55): grouping up is encouraged; a warlock of 55 or more can solo him with Fear and damage over time, or with Enslave Demon, but fire spells do nothing to him and he knocks you back. If you die he heals to full; he rises again three minutes after he dies. An elite infernal patrols the pool south of the remains: pull Kroshius away from it. He always drops his core. Lost the Fel Fire? Abandon the quest and take it again from Impsy."},{["id"]="forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:7",["text"]="Back to Niby the Almighty",["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["note"]="Niby the Almighty: Shard of the Green Flame",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/shard-of-the-green-flame:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14469,["npcName"]="Niby the Almighty",["x"]=0.4138,["title"]="Kroshius' Infernal Core",["quest"]=7603,["y"]=0.4485}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1419,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice",["zoneName"]="Blasted Lands",["min"]=60,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Tome of Sacrifice (60-60)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=60,["classes"]={"WARLOCK"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice:1:1",["level"]=60,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1419,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice:1:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14463,["npcName"]="Daio the Decrepit",["x"]=0.34130000000000005,["title"]="The Prison's Bindings",["y"]=0.5014,["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7581,["minLevel"]=60},{["map"]=1419,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice:1:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14463,["npcName"]="Daio the Decrepit",["x"]=0.34130000000000005,["title"]="The Prison's Casing",["y"]=0.5014,["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7582,["minLevel"]=60}},["id"]="forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice:1",["text"]="Daio the Decrepit",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="At 60 Daio the Decrepit waits in the Tainted Scar, the demon-filled hollow in the west of the Blasted Lands. The Scar is full of hard-hitting elites: Soulstone yourself first, then keep to the right-hand wall going in, or ride through mounted. Daio the Decrepit gives you two errands at once."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Satyr Blood",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["size"]=5,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Satyr Blood, from the Wildspawn inside",["y"]=0.451,["x"]=0.5920000000000001,["title"]="The Prison's Bindings",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice:goal:2:1",["count"]=15,["item"]=18603,["quest"]=7581,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice:step:2",["text"]="Satyr Blood",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Wildspawn satyrs (level 55-57, elite) fill the Warpwood Quarter, Dire Maul's eastern wing: bring a group of five. Four in five drop a blood, but they do not come back for two hours and one full clear may come up short of fifteen; reset and run it again. The back door at Lariss Pavilion needs the Crescent Key, which drops inside this wing; until someone has it, go in by Dire Maul's main gate in central Feralas."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Tears of the Hederine",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=18604,["fromRank"]=1,["quest"]=7582,["map"]=1452,["oi"]=1,["fromAlsoId"]=7462,["fromId"]=7461,["t"]="collect",["fromAlso"]="Hederine Manastalker",["spread"]=true,["y"]=0.8225,["x"]=0.583,["title"]="The Prison's Casing",["lvl"]=60,["from"]="Hederine Initiate",["count"]=5,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice:goal:3:1"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice:step:3",["text"]="Tears of the Hederine",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Hederine demons (level 57-60, elite) hold Darkwhisper Gorge in the far south of Winterspring: grouping up is encouraged. Two Slayers guard the gorge past the bridge; the western tunnel leads to more Initiates, the easiest of them (watch for their Dominate Mind). A warlock can solo them one at a time with Fear or Banish and damage over time, but slowly. Any of them can drop the Tears, four kills in five."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1419,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14463,["npcName"]="Daio the Decrepit",["x"]=0.34130000000000005,["title"]="The Prison's Bindings",["quest"]=7581,["y"]=0.5014},{["map"]=1419,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice:4:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14463,["npcName"]="Daio the Decrepit",["x"]=0.34130000000000005,["title"]="The Prison's Casing",["quest"]=7582,["y"]=0.5014},{["map"]=1419,["preAll"]={7581,7582},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice:4:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14463,["y"]=0.5014,["x"]=0.34130000000000005,["title"]="Suppression",["npcName"]="Daio the Decrepit",["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7583,["minLevel"]=60},{["map"]=1419,["itemName"]="Glowing Crystal Prison",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice:goal:4:4",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.637,["x"]=0.345,["title"]="Suppression",["note"]="Glowing Crystal Prison, on a Doomguard Commander",["item"]=18601,["quest"]=7583,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["itemName"]="Imprisoned Doomguard",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["rank"]=1,["kind"]="elite",["near"]=true,["lvl"]=63},["item"]=18605,["quest"]=7583,["map"]=1419,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=179644,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.6373,["x"]=0.3455,["title"]="Suppression",["from"]="Imprisoned Doomguard",["note"]="Imprisoned Doomguard, click it",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice:goal:4:5"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice:step:4",["text"]="Suppression",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Hand both in to Daio the Decrepit and take the Glowing Crystal Prison. Find a Doomguard Commander (level 61, elite) standing alone in the Tainted Scar, open from about 30 yards with your voidwalker on him, and channel the prison on him for about 20 seconds: he attacks you to break free, and his War Stomp can interrupt the channel, so sacrifice the voidwalker for its shield if you must. Grouping up is encouraged: a second player to tank makes it easy. When the channel finishes he becomes the Imprisoned Doomguard: click it. If the channel breaks, kill him or run, and try another."},{["id"]="forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice:5",["text"]="Back to Daio the Decrepit",["goals"]={{["map"]=1419,["note"]="Daio the Decrepit: Tome of Sacrifice",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14463,["npcName"]="Daio the Decrepit",["x"]=0.34130000000000005,["title"]="Suppression",["quest"]=7583,["y"]=0.5014}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1444,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar",["zoneName"]="Feralas",["min"]=60,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Quel'Serrar (60-60)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=60,["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Nostro's Compendium of Dragon Slaying",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["size"]=5,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="accept",["note"]="from Nostro's Compendium of Dragon Slaying",["title"]="Foror's Compendium",["item"]=18401,["minLevel"]=60,["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7507,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar:goal:1:1"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar:step:1",["text"]="Nostro's Compendium of Dragon Slaying",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The book is a rare random drop from the bosses of all three Dire Maul wings (Alzzin, Hydrospawn and the rest of the East, Tendris, Illyanna, Kalendris, Immol'thar and the West, King Gordok and the North's guards) and very rarely from the tribute chest; it can be traded, so the auction house may have one. Dire Maul is a five-player dungeon in the ruins of central Feralas: needs a group of five. Right-click the book to start the quest; it stays in your bags."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["note"]="Lorekeeper Lydros, in the Athenaeum",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["size"]=5,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14368,["npcName"]="Lorekeeper Lydros",["x"]=0.5920000000000001,["title"]="Foror's Compendium",["y"]=0.451,["quest"]=7507,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar:goal:2:1"},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["map"]=429,["kind"]="dungeon",["name"]="Dire Maul"},["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14368,["y"]=0.451,["npcName"]="Lorekeeper Lydros",["x"]=0.5920000000000001,["title"]="The Forging of Quel'Serrar",["minLevel"]=60,["pre"]={7507},["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7508,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar:goal:2:2"},{["map"]=1444,["note"]="Lorekeeper Lydros: hand back the Dull and Flat Elven Blade",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["map"]=429,["kind"]="dungeon",["name"]="Dire Maul"},["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14368,["npcName"]="Lorekeeper Lydros",["x"]=0.5920000000000001,["title"]="The Forging of Quel'Serrar",["y"]=0.451,["quest"]=7508,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar:goal:2:3"},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["map"]=249,["kind"]="raid",["name"]="Onyxia's Lair"},["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14368,["y"]=0.451,["npcName"]="Lorekeeper Lydros",["x"]=0.5920000000000001,["title"]="The Forging of Quel'Serrar",["minLevel"]=60,["pre"]={7508},["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7509,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar:goal:2:4"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar:step:2",["text"]="Lorekeeper Lydros",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Lorekeeper Lydros stands in the Athenaeum, the library at the far end of Dire Maul West, past the Court of the Highborne and the Prison of Immol'thar. The West door needs the Crescent Key, which Pusillin drops in Dire Maul East (he runs; chase him), or a rogue to pick it. Clearing to the library needs your group of five. He takes the book, hands you A Dull and Flat Elven Blade to give straight back, then the Unfired Ancient Blade. Keep that blade: lose it, and you must abandon the quest and take it again."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["itemName"]="Unfired Ancient Blade",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["size"]=40,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="use",["y"]=0.758,["x"]=0.521,["item"]=18489,["note"]="Unfired Ancient Blade: plant it in her breath",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar:goal:3:1"},{["map"]=1445,["itemName"]="Heated Ancient Blade",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar:goal:3:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.758,["x"]=0.521,["item"]=18488,["note"]="click the heated blade on the ground"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar:step:3",["text"]="Onyxia's breath",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Onyxia is the 40-player raid boss of Onyxia's Lair, a cave in the Wyrmbog of southern Dustwallow Marsh; she returns once a week. Tell the raid first. Late in the fight (around 10-15% health, when she has landed again) use the Unfired Ancient Blade to plant it in the path of her fire breath, usually by the main tank's feet. When her breath has heated it, click the Ancient Heated Blade to take the Heated Ancient Blade: from then you have 20 minutes. Her breath can kill you while you plant or pick up the blade; if you die and nobody brings you back before she dies, wait for next week. Planted in the wrong place? Abandon the quest, take it again from Lydros for a new blade."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["size"]=40,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="kill",["npc"]=10184,["y"]=0.758,["x"]=0.521,["target"]="Onyxia",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar:goal:4:1"},{["map"]=1445,["itemName"]="Heated Ancient Blade",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["map"]=249,["kind"]="raid",["name"]="Onyxia's Lair"},["t"]="use",["y"]=0.758,["x"]=0.521,["title"]="The Forging of Quel'Serrar",["note"]="Heated Ancient Blade, on her corpse",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar:goal:4:2",["item"]=18488,["quest"]=7509,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1445,["itemName"]="Treated Ancient Blade",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["map"]=249,["kind"]="raid",["name"]="Onyxia's Lair"},["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.758,["x"]=0.521,["title"]="The Forging of Quel'Serrar",["count"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar:goal:4:3",["item"]=18492,["quest"]=7509,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar:step:4",["text"]="Onyxia's corpse",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Kill Onyxia, then target her corpse and use the Heated Ancient Blade on it before the 20 minutes run out. It becomes the Treated Ancient Blade, with no time limit."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["note"]="Lorekeeper Lydros: Quel'Serrar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["size"]=5,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14368,["npcName"]="Lorekeeper Lydros",["x"]=0.5920000000000001,["title"]="The Forging of Quel'Serrar",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=18348,["itemName"]="Quel'Serrar"}}},["y"]=0.451,["quest"]=7509,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar:goal:5:1"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/quelserrar:step:5",["text"]="The Forging of Quel'Serrar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Lorekeeper Lydros in the Athenaeum of Dire Maul West: through the West door with the Crescent Key again, and a group to reach the library."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1435,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers",["zoneName"]="Swamp of Sorrows",["min"]=50,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Voodoo Feathers (50-52)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=52,["classes"]={"WARRIOR"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:1:1",["level"]=50,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={7572},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=500,["npc"]=5479,["y"]=0.5987,["x"]=0.8055,["title"]="A Troubled Spirit",["npcName"]="Wu Shen",["closedBy"]={8423},["qlvl"]=50,["quest"]=8417,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:step:1",["text"]="A Troubled Spirit (Stormwind)",["only"]={["races"]={"Human","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="At 50, Wu Shen, beside Ilsa Corbin in the warrior trainers' building of Old Town, sends you to the Fallen Hero of the Horde in the Swamp of Sorrows."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:2:1",["level"]=50,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1455,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={7572},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:2:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=500,["npc"]=5113,["y"]=0.9065000000000001,["x"]=0.7034,["title"]="A Troubled Spirit",["npcName"]="Kelv Sternhammer",["closedBy"]={8423},["qlvl"]=50,["quest"]=8417,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:step:2",["text"]="A Troubled Spirit (Ironforge)",["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf","Gnome"}},["detail"]="At 50, Kelv Sternhammer, the warrior trainer of Ironforge, sends you to the Fallen Hero of the Horde in the Swamp of Sorrows."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:3:1",["level"]=50,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1457,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={7572},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:3:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=500,["npc"]=7315,["y"]=0.35350000000000004,["x"]=0.5893999999999999,["title"]="A Troubled Spirit",["npcName"]="Darnath Bladesinger",["closedBy"]={8423},["qlvl"]=50,["quest"]=8417,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:step:3",["text"]="A Troubled Spirit (Darnassus)",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["detail"]="At 50, Darnath Bladesinger, the warrior trainer of Darnassus, sends you to the Fallen Hero of the Horde in the Swamp of Sorrows."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:4:1",["level"]=50,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={7572},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:4:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=500,["npc"]=3354,["y"]=0.32380000000000003,["x"]=0.8039000000000001,["title"]="A Troubled Spirit",["npcName"]="Sorek",["closedBy"]={8423},["qlvl"]=50,["quest"]=8417,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:step:4",["text"]="A Troubled Spirit (Orgrimmar)",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="At 50, Sorek in the Valley of Honor sends you to the Fallen Hero of the Horde in the Swamp of Sorrows."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:5:1",["level"]=50,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1456,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={7572},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:5:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=500,["npc"]=3041,["y"]=0.8737,["x"]=0.5724,["title"]="A Troubled Spirit",["npcName"]="Torm Ragetotem",["closedBy"]={8423},["qlvl"]=50,["quest"]=8417,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:step:5",["text"]="A Troubled Spirit (Thunder Bluff)",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren"}},["detail"]="At 50, Torm Ragetotem, the warrior trainer of Thunder Bluff, sends you to the Fallen Hero of the Horde in the Swamp of Sorrows."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:6:1",["level"]=50,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1458,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={7572},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:6:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=500,["npc"]=4593,["y"]=0.1523,["x"]=0.4693,["title"]="A Troubled Spirit",["npcName"]="Christoph Walker",["closedBy"]={8423},["qlvl"]=50,["quest"]=8417,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:step:6",["text"]="A Troubled Spirit (Undercity)",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="At 50, Christoph Walker, a warrior trainer of the Undercity, sends you to the Fallen Hero of the Horde in the Swamp of Sorrows."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:7:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1435,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7572,["npcName"]="Fallen Hero of the Horde",["x"]=0.3429,["title"]="A Troubled Spirit",["quest"]=8417,["y"]=0.6614},{["map"]=1435,["crumbs"]={8417},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:7:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7572,["y"]=0.6614,["x"]=0.3429,["title"]="Warrior Kinship",["npcName"]="Fallen Hero of the Horde",["minLevel"]=50,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8423,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:step:7",["text"]="The Fallen Hero of the Horde",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Fallen Hero of the Horde, a ghost, stands in the south-west of the Swamp of Sorrows, at the pass into the Blasted Lands, a short ride south-west of Stonard. Horde: fly to Stonard. Alliance: fly to Nethergarde Keep in the Blasted Lands and ride north through the pass. High-level beasts roam the way."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:8:1",["level"]=53,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1419,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:8:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=5993,["count"]=7,["y"]=0.4269,["x"]=0.498,["title"]="Warrior Kinship",["lvl"]=53,["target"]="Helboar",["quest"]=8423,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:step:8",["text"]="Helboars",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Seven Helboars (level 52-53, not elite) roam the north-west of the Blasted Lands, south-west of Nethergarde Keep; some stand near the ogres on the mountainside by the road. They charge from 25 yards and cast Fire Nova. They share spawn points with the Felbeasts and scorpids: if no boars are around, kill those and boars may appear instead. Back in 5 minutes."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:step:9",["text"]="War on the Shadowsworn",["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:9:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1435,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:9:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7572,["npcName"]="Fallen Hero of the Horde",["x"]=0.3429,["title"]="Warrior Kinship",["quest"]=8423,["y"]=0.6614},{["map"]=1435,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:9:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7572,["y"]=0.6614,["x"]=0.3429,["title"]="War on the Shadowsworn",["npcName"]="Fallen Hero of the Horde",["pre"]={8423},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8424,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:10:1",["level"]=53,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1419,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:10:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=6006,["y"]=0.3821,["x"]=0.6502,["title"]="War on the Shadowsworn",["lvl"]=53,["target"]="Shadowsworn Adept",["count"]=20,["quest"]=8424,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1419,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:10:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=6004,["y"]=0.4094,["x"]=0.6391,["title"]="War on the Shadowsworn",["lvl"]=52,["target"]="Shadowsworn Cultist",["count"]=10,["quest"]=8424,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1419,["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:10:4",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=6005,["y"]=0.42310000000000003,["x"]=0.6386,["title"]="War on the Shadowsworn",["lvl"]=53,["target"]="Shadowsworn Thug",["count"]=20,["quest"]=8424,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:step:10",["text"]="Shadowsworn camps",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Shadowsworn camp around the mouth of the Serpent's Coil cave, south of Nethergarde Keep on the way to the Dark Portal. You need 20 Adepts (level 52-53, they leech blood and heal hurt allies: kill them first), 10 Cultists (51-52, they throw from range, so close in) and 20 Thugs (52-53, Thrash and Kick). Thugs can run short before the others: kill every Shadowsworn you pass."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:step:11",["text"]="Voodoo Feathers",["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:11:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1435,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:11:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7572,["npcName"]="Fallen Hero of the Horde",["x"]=0.3429,["title"]="War on the Shadowsworn",["quest"]=8424,["y"]=0.6614},{["map"]=1435,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:11:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7572,["y"]=0.6614,["x"]=0.3429,["title"]="Voodoo Feathers",["npcName"]="Fallen Hero of the Horde",["pre"]={8424},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=8425,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:12:1",["level"]=51,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1435,["itemName"]="Amber Voodoo Feather",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["size"]=5,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Amber Voodoo Feather, from Gasher and Zul'Lor",["y"]=0.536,["x"]=0.6990000000000001,["title"]="Voodoo Feathers",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:12:2",["count"]=2,["item"]=20606,["quest"]=8425,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1435,["itemName"]="Blue Voodoo Feather",["oi"]=2,["group"]={["size"]=5,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Blue Voodoo Feather, from Hukku and Mijan",["y"]=0.536,["x"]=0.6990000000000001,["title"]="Voodoo Feathers",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:12:3",["count"]=2,["item"]=20607,["quest"]=8425,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1435,["itemName"]="Green Voodoo Feather",["oi"]=3,["group"]={["size"]=5,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Green Voodoo Feather, from Zolo and Loro",["y"]=0.536,["x"]=0.6990000000000001,["title"]="Voodoo Feathers",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:goal:12:4",["count"]=2,["item"]=20608,["quest"]=8425,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:step:12",["text"]="The Sunken Temple",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="You need two feathers of each colour from the six Atal'ai troll guardians (level 51-52, elite) on the Sunken Temple's balcony, who hold the barrier in front of Jammal'an the Prophet: Gasher and Zul'Lor drop the amber, Hukku and Mijan the blue, Zolo and Loro the green, every kill; each player on the quest loots their own set. The Sunken Temple is a five-player dungeon: needs a group of five. It lies in the Pool of Tears in eastern Swamp of Sorrows: climb the temple's outer steps, dive into the flooded hall and follow the stairs down to the entrance. Inside, reach the balcony by the stairs or the path on the right, not the spiral stairs. Hukku calls guardians and casts Shadow Bolt Volley and Curse of Blood; Mijan heals the others (Renew, a Healing Ward, Healing Wave below half health): kill her or her ward fast; Zul'Lor cleaves."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1435,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:13:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7572,["npcName"]="Fallen Hero of the Horde",["x"]=0.3429,["title"]="Voodoo Feathers",["quest"]=8425,["y"]=0.6614}},["id"]="forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers:13",["text"]="Back to the Fallen Hero",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="In Classic the Fallen Hero let you choose the Diamond Flask, the Fury Visor or the Razorsteel Shoulders here. Forever's change notes say the choice is gone, though its quest page still lists three unnamed rewards: look at the reward window before you hand in."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1413,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon",["zoneName"]="The Barrens",["min"]=30,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Whirlwind Weapon (30-40)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=40,["classes"]={"WARRIOR"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:1:1",["level"]=30,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:1:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5479,["npcName"]="Wu Shen",["x"]=0.8055,["title"]="The Islander",["y"]=0.5987,["qlvl"]=30,["quest"]=1718,["minLevel"]=30}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:1",["text"]="The Islander (Stormwind)",["only"]={["races"]={"Human","NightElf","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["detail"]="At 30, Wu Shen, beside Ilsa Corbin in the warrior trainers' building of Old Town, sends you to Klannoc Macleod on Fray Island in the Barrens."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:2:1",["level"]=30,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1455,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:2:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5113,["npcName"]="Kelv Sternhammer",["x"]=0.7034,["title"]="The Islander",["y"]=0.9065000000000001,["qlvl"]=30,["quest"]=1718,["minLevel"]=30}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:2",["text"]="The Islander (Ironforge)",["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf","Gnome"}},["detail"]="At 30, Kelv Sternhammer, the warrior trainer of Ironforge, sends you to Klannoc Macleod on Fray Island in the Barrens."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:3:1",["level"]=30,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:3:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3354,["npcName"]="Sorek",["x"]=0.8039000000000001,["title"]="The Islander",["y"]=0.32380000000000003,["qlvl"]=30,["quest"]=1718,["minLevel"]=30}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:3",["text"]="The Islander (Orgrimmar)",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll","Skyborne"},["factions"]={"Horde"}},["detail"]="At 30, Sorek in the Valley of Honor sends you to Klannoc Macleod on Fray Island in the Barrens."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:4:1",["level"]=30,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1456,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:4:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3041,["npcName"]="Torm Ragetotem",["x"]=0.5724,["title"]="The Islander",["y"]=0.8737,["qlvl"]=30,["quest"]=1718,["minLevel"]=30}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:4",["text"]="The Islander (Thunder Bluff)",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren"}},["detail"]="At 30, Torm Ragetotem, the warrior trainer of Thunder Bluff, sends you to Klannoc Macleod on Fray Island in the Barrens."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:5:1",["level"]=30,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1458,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:5:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4595,["npcName"]="Baltus Fowler",["x"]=0.474,["title"]="The Islander",["y"]=0.1729,["qlvl"]=30,["quest"]=1718,["minLevel"]=30}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:5",["text"]="The Islander (Undercity)",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="At 30, Baltus Fowler, a warrior trainer of the Undercity, sends you to Klannoc Macleod on Fray Island in the Barrens."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6236,["npcName"]="Klannoc Macleod",["x"]=0.6862,["title"]="The Islander",["quest"]=1718,["y"]=0.4916},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:6:2",["level"]=32,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:6:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6236,["y"]=0.4916,["npcName"]="Klannoc Macleod",["x"]=0.6862,["limit"]=600,["title"]="The Affray",["pre"]={1718},["qlvl"]=30,["quest"]=1719,["minLevel"]=30}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:step:6",["text"]="Fray Island",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Fly to Ratchet and go south along the Merchant Coast. Fray Island lies offshore to the south-east: wade across on the shallow sand bar; off it the water is deep and fatigue sets in. Klannoc Macleod stands by the arena."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:7:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=6238,["y"]=0.48700000000000004,["x"]=0.6859999999999999,["title"]="The Affray",["target"]="Big Will",["count"]=1,["quest"]=1719,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Klannoc Macleod: Berserker Stance",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:6:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6236,["npcName"]="Klannoc Macleod",["x"]=0.6862,["title"]="The Affray",["quest"]=1719,["y"]=0.4916},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:6:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6236,["y"]=0.4916,["x"]=0.6862,["title"]="The Windwatcher",["npcName"]="Klannoc Macleod",["pre"]={1719},["qlvl"]=30,["quest"]=1791,["minLevel"]=30}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:step:7",["text"]="The Affray",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="You have 10 minutes. Eat and drink to full, then step onto the grate in the middle of the crowd: Twiggy Flathead announces the challengers (level 26-27), who come one at a time, 15-20 seconds apart, and only while you stand near the grate. After each kill, step off the grate to eat or bandage; step back on when ready for the next. Six of them, then Big Will (level 33, not elite) walks out; he stays neutral until you attack him, so bandage or eat first. Do not use Demoralizing Shout: it sends the challengers running and more of them pile in at once. If nothing starts, step off and on the grate again, or abandon the quest and take it again."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:8:1",["level"]=39,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6176,["npcName"]="Bath'rah the Windwatcher",["x"]=0.805,["title"]="The Windwatcher",["quest"]=1791,["y"]=0.6692},{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:7:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6176,["y"]=0.6692,["x"]=0.805,["title"]="Cyclonian",["npcName"]="Bath'rah the Windwatcher",["pre"]={1791},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=1712,["minLevel"]=30}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:step:8",["text"]="Bath'rah the Windwatcher",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Bath'rah the Windwatcher camps by ruins on the east bank of the river that runs past Tarren Mill, a short walk north-east of the town, just over the border in Alterac Mountains; his cauldron stands beside him. Horde: fly to Tarren Mill. Alliance: fly to Southshore and go north along the river; Tarren Mill's guards are level 42 elites, so keep away from the town. Accepting Cyclonian gives you Bath'rah's Parchment, the list of what he needs: 8 Liferoot, 30 Bloodscalp Tusks and the Essence of the Exile from his cauldron. The cauldron's Essence of the Exile is not a quest you take: it never shows in your quest log. Come back with its charms and hand them in at the cauldron."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:9:1",["level"]=40,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1416,["itemName"]="Liferoot",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:9:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.644,["x"]=0.7720999999999999,["title"]="Cyclonian",["count"]=8,["spread"]=true,["item"]=3357,["quest"]=1712,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:step:9",["text"]="Liferoot",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="You need 8 Liferoot. Herbalists pick it by rivers and lakes in the Wetlands, Arathi Highlands and Stranglethorn Vale; otherwise the auction house. Herb vendors keep only one at a time and restock every two hours: Bernard Gump and Maria Lumere in Stormwind, Antonio Perelli on the road in eastern Elwynn, Jeeda at Sun Rock Retreat in Stonetalon, Montarr in Thousand Needles. Kurzen Medicine Men in northern Stranglethorn drop one about one kill in twelve."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:10:1",["level"]=40,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Bloodscalp Tusk",["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:10:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.1354,["x"]=0.324,["title"]="Cyclonian",["fromNpcsAt"]=";11;1;8,1;9;9;8,9,1;6,2,10;1,9;6,3,2,10;6,2,3,10;6,2,4,7,3,5,10;2,6,3;4,7,5,10;2,6,3;7,4,3,10;7;5;5,7;4,5,7",["item"]=3901,["count"]=30,["quest"]=1712,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:step:10",["text"]="Bloodscalp Tusks",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="You need 30 tusks. Every Bloodscalp troll (level 33-37) of north-west Stranglethorn drops one about one kill in three, so plan on some 80 kills: the camps and ruins north and north-west of Grom'gol Base Camp and around the Bal'lal Ruins on the coast. They enrage below 30% health and the Warriors disarm; back in 5 minutes."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:11:1",["level"]=38,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1417,["itemName"]="Burning Charm",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:11:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.304,["x"]=0.2561,["item"]=4479,["lvl"]=39,["note"]="Burning Charm, from Burning Exiles",["count"]=8},{["map"]=1417,["itemName"]="Thundering Charm",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:11:3",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.5083,["x"]=0.5039,["item"]=4480,["lvl"]=39,["note"]="Thundering Charm, from Thundering Exiles",["count"]=8},{["map"]=1417,["itemName"]="Cresting Charm",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:11:4",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.31010000000000004,["x"]=0.6536,["item"]=4481,["lvl"]=39,["note"]="Cresting Charm, from Cresting Exiles",["count"]=8}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:step:11",["text"]="The exiles of Arathi",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The cauldron wants 8 of each charm, 24 in all, and each exile drops its charm about one kill in three, so plan on some 70 kills. All are level 38-39, not elite: the guide waits for level 38 first, and a friend helps. Burning Exiles (fire) by the Circle of West Binding in the north-west, north-west of Refuge Pointe; Thundering Exiles (air) by the Circle of Outer Binding south-east of Refuge Pointe, casting Lightning Bolt from 40 yards; Cresting Exiles (water) by the Circle of East Binding, north-west of Hammerfall, with Frost Nova. About a dozen of each, back in under 7 minutes. The charms trade and sell on the auction house; using one banishes another kind of exile for a while (Burning on Thundering, Thundering on Cresting, Cresting on Burning)."},{["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:12:1",["level"]=39,["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["item"]=4479,["k"]="has",["n"]=8},{["item"]=4480,["k"]="has",["n"]=8},{["item"]=4481,["k"]="has",["n"]=8}}},{["map"]=1416,["note"]="Bath'rah's Cauldron: Essence of the Exile",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["qlvl"]=37,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:12:2",["t"]="turnin",["title"]="Essence of the Exile",["soloWhen"]={{["item"]=4479,["k"]="has",["n"]=8},{["item"]=4480,["k"]="has",["n"]=8},{["item"]=4481,["k"]="has",["n"]=8}},["y"]=0.6679999999999999,["x"]=0.7931999999999999,["object"]=89931,["objName"]="Bath'rah's Cauldron",["direct"]=true,["minLevel"]=30,["quest"]=1714,["parent"]=1712},{["map"]=1416,["itemName"]="Essence of the Exile",["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:12:3",["t"]="collect",["soloWhen"]={{["item"]=4479,["k"]="has",["n"]=8},{["item"]=4480,["k"]="has",["n"]=8},{["item"]=4481,["k"]="has",["n"]=8}},["y"]=0.669,["x"]=0.805,["title"]="Cyclonian",["note"]="Essence of the Exile, from the cauldron by Bath'rah the Windwatcher",["item"]=6851,["count"]=1,["quest"]=1712,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["detail"]="Click Bath'rah's Cauldron with the 24 charms in your bags and Cyclonian in your log. Its window asks for the charms straight away, with nothing to accept: Continue, then Complete, and it hands you the Essence of the Exile.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:step:12",["text"]="Essence of the Exile",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["item"]=4479,["k"]="has",["n"]=8},{["item"]=4480,["k"]="has",["n"]=8},{["item"]=4481,["k"]="has",["n"]=8}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:11:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6176,["npcName"]="Bath'rah the Windwatcher",["x"]=0.805,["title"]="Cyclonian",["quest"]=1712,["y"]=0.6692},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:13:2",["level"]=39,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:11:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6176,["y"]=0.6692,["x"]=0.805,["title"]="The Summoning",["npcName"]="Bath'rah the Windwatcher",["pre"]={1712},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=1713,["minLevel"]=30},{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["size"]=3,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="kill",["npc"]=6239,["y"]=0.6214,["x"]=0.8031999999999999,["target"]="Cyclonian",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:13:4"},{["itemName"]="Whirlwind Heart",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=40},["item"]=6894,["fromRank"]=1,["quest"]=1713,["map"]=1416,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=6239,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.6214,["x"]=0.8031999999999999,["title"]="The Summoning",["from"]="Cyclonian",["note"]="Whirlwind Heart, from Cyclonian",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:goal:13:5"},{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:11:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6176,["npcName"]="Bath'rah the Windwatcher",["x"]=0.805,["title"]="The Summoning",["quest"]=1713,["y"]=0.6692},{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:11:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6176,["y"]=0.6692,["x"]=0.805,["title"]="Whirlwind Weapon",["npcName"]="Bath'rah the Windwatcher",["pre"]={1713},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=1792,["minLevel"]=30},{["map"]=1416,["note"]="Bath'rah the Windwatcher: Whirlwind Axe, Sword or Warhammer",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:11:6",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6176,["npcName"]="Bath'rah the Windwatcher",["x"]=0.805,["title"]="Whirlwind Weapon",["rewards"]={["choices"]={{["item"]=6975,["itemName"]="Whirlwind Axe"},{["item"]=6977,["itemName"]="Whirlwind Sword"},{["item"]=6976,["itemName"]="Whirlwind Warhammer"}}},["quest"]=1792,["y"]=0.6692}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon:step:13",["text"]="The Summoning",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Bath'rah the Windwatcher. Accepting The Summoning starts his ritual, and Cyclonian appears just north of his camp. Cyclonian is elite (level 40): grouping up is encouraged; it needs a group of two or three around level 40. It deals nature damage (a Nature Protection Potion soaks it), whirls, and Knock Away throws you far while it heals itself as you run back: fight with your back to a slope or rock. The Whirlwind Heart always drops. If the fight fails Bath'rah the Windwatcher stops answering: abandon The Summoning and take it again for a new summon; the earlier items are not needed again."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1428,["id"]="polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed",["zoneName"]="Burning Steppes",["min"]=60,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Warlock Dreadsteed (60-60)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=60,["classes"]={"WARLOCK"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:1:1",["level"]=60,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={14436},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=625,["npc"]=5520,["y"]=0.8453,["x"]=0.3953,["title"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",["npcName"]="Spackle Thornberry",["closedBy"]={7563},["qlvl"]=58,["quest"]=7562,["minLevel"]=60}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:step:1",["text"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer (Stormwind)",["only"]={["races"]={"Human"}},["detail"]="At 60 Spackle Thornberry, the demon trainer in the Slaughtered Lamb, sends you to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:2:1",["level"]=60,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1455,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={14436},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:2:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=625,["npc"]=6382,["y"]=0.0608,["x"]=0.527,["title"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",["npcName"]="Jubahl Corpseseeker",["closedBy"]={7563},["qlvl"]=58,["quest"]=7562,["minLevel"]=60}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:step:2",["text"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer (Ironforge)",["only"]={["races"]={"Gnome"}},["detail"]="At 60 Jubahl Corpseseeker, the demon trainer in Ironforge, sends you to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:3:1",["level"]=60,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={14436},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:3:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=625,["npc"]=5815,["y"]=0.4672,["x"]=0.4752,["title"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",["npcName"]="Kurgul",["closedBy"]={7563},["qlvl"]=58,["quest"]=7562,["minLevel"]=60}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:step:3",["text"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer (Orgrimmar)",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["detail"]="At 60 Kurgul, the demon trainer in the Cleft of Shadow, sends you to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:4:1",["level"]=60,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1458,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={14436},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:4:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=625,["npc"]=5753,["y"]=0.16079999999999997,["x"]=0.857,["title"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",["npcName"]="Martha Strain",["closedBy"]={7563},["qlvl"]=58,["quest"]=7562,["minLevel"]=60}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:step:4",["text"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer (Undercity)",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="At 60 Martha Strain, the demon trainer in the Magic Quarter, sends you to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14436,["npcName"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",["x"]=0.12689999999999999,["title"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",["quest"]=7562,["y"]=0.3164},{["map"]=1428,["crumbs"]={7562},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:5:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14436,["y"]=0.3164,["x"]=0.12689999999999999,["title"]="Rage of Blood",["npcName"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",["minLevel"]=60,["qlvl"]=58,["quest"]=7563,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:step:5",["text"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer and his goblin Gorzeeki Wildeyes camp on the hill across the road from the Altar of Storms, in the far north-west of the Burning Steppes, west of Blackrock Mountain. The chain is long: about 420 gold in Gorzeeki Wildeyes's and Ur'dan's goods, a pile of crafted materials, the Scholomance and Dire Maul. Start buying or gathering the materials of the next steps now."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["itemName"]="Raging Beast's Blood",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:6:1",["t"]="collect",["title"]="Rage of Blood",["y"]=0.3943,["x"]=0.4316,["count"]=30,["lvl"]=55,["spread"]=true,["item"]=18590,["quest"]=7563,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:step:6",["text"]="Raging Beast's Blood",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Every owlbeast of Winterspring (level 53-58, none elite) drops the blood about one time in three: about ninety kills for thirty. Owl Wing Thicket, in the north-east, and the Hidden Grove's surroundings are packed with them, and they respawn in five and a half minutes."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14436,["npcName"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",["x"]=0.12689999999999999,["title"]="Rage of Blood",["quest"]=7563,["y"]=0.3164},{["map"]=1428,["note"]="he gives you the Case of Blood",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:7:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14436,["y"]=0.3164,["x"]=0.12689999999999999,["title"]="Wildeyes",["npcName"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",["pre"]={7563},["qlvl"]=58,["quest"]=7564,["minLevel"]=60},{["map"]=1428,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:7:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14437,["npcName"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",["x"]=0.1244,["title"]="Wildeyes",["quest"]=7564,["y"]=0.31629999999999997},{["map"]=1428,["note"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer: Bell of Dethmoora",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:7:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14436,["y"]=0.3164,["x"]=0.12689999999999999,["title"]="Bell of Dethmoora",["npcName"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",["pre"]={7564},["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7626,["minLevel"]=60},{["map"]=1428,["note"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer: Wheel of the Black March",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:7:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14436,["y"]=0.3164,["x"]=0.12689999999999999,["title"]="Wheel of the Black March",["npcName"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",["pre"]={7564},["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7627,["minLevel"]=60},{["map"]=1428,["note"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer: Doomsday Candle",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:7:6",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14436,["y"]=0.3164,["x"]=0.12689999999999999,["title"]="Doomsday Candle",["npcName"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",["pre"]={7564},["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7628,["minLevel"]=60},{["map"]=1428,["note"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes: Lord Banehollow",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:7:7",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14437,["y"]=0.31629999999999997,["x"]=0.1244,["title"]="Lord Banehollow",["npcName"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",["pre"]={7564},["qlvl"]=58,["quest"]=7623,["minLevel"]=60},{["map"]=1428,["itemName"]="Shadowy Potion",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:7:8",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=14437,["npcName"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",["x"]=0.1244,["item"]=18802,["note"]="Shadowy Potion, from Gorzeeki Wildeyes",["y"]=0.31629999999999997,["count"]=3}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:step:7",["text"]="Wildeyes",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Mor'zul Bloodbringer: he gives you the Case of Blood for Gorzeeki Wildeyes beside him. Then Mor'zul Bloodbringer asks for the bell, the wheel and the candle, and Gorzeeki Wildeyes sends you to Lord Banehollow in Jaedenar: buy three Shadowy Potions from him for that trip (6 gold each: one to walk in, one after Ulathek, and a spare in case one runs out) and bring 150 gold for the stardust."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1453,["itemName"]="Elixir of Shadow Power",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:8:1",["t"]="collect",["note"]="Elixir of Shadow Power: the Auction House",["y"]=0.713,["x"]=0.612,["title"]="Bell of Dethmoora",["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["count"]=10,["item"]=9264,["quest"]=7626,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1454,["itemName"]="Elixir of Shadow Power",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:8:2",["t"]="collect",["note"]="Elixir of Shadow Power: the Auction House",["y"]=0.627,["x"]=0.5589999999999999,["title"]="Bell of Dethmoora",["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["count"]=10,["item"]=9264,["quest"]=7626,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1453,["itemName"]="Large Brilliant Shard",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:8:3",["t"]="collect",["note"]="Large Brilliant Shard: the Auction House",["y"]=0.713,["x"]=0.612,["title"]="Wheel of the Black March",["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["count"]=6,["item"]=14344,["quest"]=7627,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1454,["itemName"]="Large Brilliant Shard",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:8:4",["t"]="collect",["note"]="Large Brilliant Shard: the Auction House",["y"]=0.627,["x"]=0.5589999999999999,["title"]="Wheel of the Black March",["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["count"]=6,["item"]=14344,["quest"]=7627,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1428,["itemName"]="Dark Iron Ore",["oi"]=2,["fromKind"]="object",["fromId"]=165658,["t"]="collect",["spread"]=true,["item"]=11370,["y"]=0.4778,["x"]=0.5605,["title"]="Wheel of the Black March",["from"]="Dark Iron Deposit",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:8:5",["count"]=25,["quest"]=7627,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1428,["itemName"]="Black Dragonscale",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:8:6",["t"]="collect",["title"]="Doomsday Candle",["y"]=0.6061,["x"]=0.5633,["count"]=35,["lvl"]=54,["spread"]=true,["item"]=15416,["quest"]=7628,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:step:8",["text"]="The ritual pieces",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes wants 10 Elixirs of Shadow Power (Alchemy: 3 Ghost Mushrooms and a Crystal Vial each), 6 Large Brilliant Shards (Enchanting: disenchant level 51+ blue items), 25 Dark Iron Ore (Mining 230: the Dark Iron Deposits of the Burning Steppes and Blackrock Depths) and 35 Black Dragonscales (Skinning: the black dragonkin of the Burning Steppes, a few percent a kill, best from the Flamescale Wyrmkin). Make or gather what your professions allow and buy the rest at the Auction House; it can take a while to find 35 scales."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:9:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14437,["npcName"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",["x"]=0.1244,["title"]="Bell of Dethmoora",["quest"]=7626,["y"]=0.31629999999999997},{["map"]=1428,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:9:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14437,["npcName"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",["x"]=0.1244,["title"]="Wheel of the Black March",["quest"]=7627,["y"]=0.31629999999999997},{["map"]=1428,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:9:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14437,["npcName"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",["x"]=0.1244,["title"]="Doomsday Candle",["quest"]=7628,["y"]=0.31629999999999997},{["map"]=1428,["preAll"]={7626,7627,7628},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:9:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14437,["y"]=0.31629999999999997,["x"]=0.1244,["title"]="Arcanite",["npcName"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7630,["minLevel"]=60},{["map"]=1453,["itemName"]="Arcanite Bar",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:9:5",["t"]="collect",["note"]="Arcanite Bar: the Auction House",["y"]=0.713,["x"]=0.612,["title"]="Arcanite",["only"]={["factions"]={"Alliance"}},["count"]=3,["item"]=12360,["quest"]=7630,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1454,["itemName"]="Arcanite Bar",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:9:6",["t"]="collect",["note"]="Arcanite Bar: the Auction House",["y"]=0.627,["x"]=0.5589999999999999,["title"]="Arcanite",["only"]={["factions"]={"Horde"}},["count"]=3,["item"]=12360,["quest"]=7630,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1428,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:9:6",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14437,["npcName"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",["x"]=0.1244,["title"]="Arcanite",["quest"]=7630,["y"]=0.31629999999999997}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:step:9",["text"]="Arcanite",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Hand the three pieces to Gorzeeki Wildeyes. He then wants 3 Arcanite Bars for the Black Lodestone: alchemists transmute them (an Arcane Crystal and a Thorium Bar each, on a long cooldown); everyone else buys them."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["x"]=0.354,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["y"]=0.586,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:10:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Shadow Hold",["area"]=1770},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:10:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9516,["npcName"]="Lord Banehollow",["x"]=0.359,["title"]="Lord Banehollow",["quest"]=7623,["y"]=0.444},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:10:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=9516,["y"]=0.44420000000000004,["x"]=0.3593,["title"]="Ulathek the Traitor",["npcName"]="Lord Banehollow",["pre"]={7623},["qlvl"]=58,["quest"]=7624,["minLevel"]=60}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:step:10",["text"]="Lord Banehollow",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Jaedenar lies just south of Bloodvenom Post in western Felwood, west of the road; of its two caves, Shadow Hold is the northern one, further up the hill. Drink a Shadowy Potion at its mouth: for 20 minutes the Shadow Council there treat you as one of their own (Taint of Shadow). The oozes in the red pool and the succubus Rakaiah beyond them still attack: hug the wall past them. Go down past the second, red pool, up the ramp and across two bridges to Lord Banehollow, a great winged dreadlord at the back. He talks to you only while the potion lasts."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:11:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=14523,["y"]=0.4842,["x"]=0.40759999999999996,["target"]="Ulathek"},{["map"]=1448,["itemName"]="The Traitor's Heart",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=14523,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Ulathek the Traitor",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.4842,["x"]=0.40759999999999996,["count"]=1,["from"]="Ulathek",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:11:2",["item"]=18719,["quest"]=7624,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:11:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9516,["npcName"]="Lord Banehollow",["x"]=0.359,["title"]="Ulathek the Traitor",["quest"]=7624,["y"]=0.444},{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:11:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=9516,["y"]=0.44420000000000004,["x"]=0.3593,["title"]="Xorothian Stardust",["npcName"]="Lord Banehollow",["pre"]={7624},["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7625,["minLevel"]=60}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:step:11",["text"]="Ulathek the Traitor",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ulathek waits in a small side room up a bridge you passed on the way down. Speak to him and he and four guards attack (all level 57, none elite): let your voidwalker hold the guards and burn Ulathek, sacrificing it if you must. Or click off your Taint of Shadow aura to start the fight, kill Ulathek, then drink another potion: the guards stop at once. Take his heart back to Lord Banehollow with a potion active."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["itemName"]="Xorothian Stardust",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:12:1",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=14522,["npcName"]="Ur'dan",["x"]=0.3618,["item"]=18687,["note"]="Xorothian Stardust, from Ur'dan",["y"]=0.4446}},["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:12",["text"]="Xorothian Stardust",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ur'dan, beside Lord Banehollow, sells the Xorothian Stardust for 150 gold. He deals with you only while a Shadowy Potion is active."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["itemName"]="Xorothian Stardust",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:13:1",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=14522,["npcName"]="Ur'dan",["x"]=0.3618,["item"]=18687,["note"]="Xorothian Stardust, from Ur'dan",["y"]=0.4446},{["map"]=1428,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:13:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14437,["npcName"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",["x"]=0.1244,["title"]="Xorothian Stardust",["quest"]=7625,["y"]=0.31629999999999997},{["map"]=1428,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:13:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14437,["y"]=0.31629999999999997,["x"]=0.1244,["title"]="Imp Delivery",["npcName"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",["pre"]={7625},["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7629,["minLevel"]=60}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:step:13",["text"]="Imp Delivery",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Gorzeeki Wildeyes with the stardust; with the Arcanite also done he gives you the Imp in a Jar for the Scholomance. Put a group of five together now: a party, not a raid group."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["note"]="Use the Imp in a Jar at the alchemy lab inside",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["size"]=5,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="J'eevee"}},["y"]=0.732,["x"]=0.6970000000000001,["title"]="Imp Delivery",["startItemName"]="Imp in a Jar",["startItem"]=18688,["quest"]=7629,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:14:1"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:step:14",["text"]="The Scholomance",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Scholomance (level 58-60, a group of five) lies under Caer Darrow, the island town in the south-east of the Western Plaguelands: someone needs the Skeleton Key or a rogue to open the door. Fight down to Ras Frostwhisper's room and use the Imp in a Jar at the alchemy lab tables to the right: J'eevee makes the parchment. You need not kill Ras, but it only counts at this lab and only in a party."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:15:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14437,["npcName"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",["x"]=0.1244,["title"]="Imp Delivery",["quest"]=7629,["y"]=0.31629999999999997},{["map"]=1428,["preAll"]={7629,7630},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:15:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14436,["y"]=0.3164,["x"]=0.12689999999999999,["title"]="Dreadsteed of Xoroth",["npcName"]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=7631,["minLevel"]=60},{["map"]=1428,["itemName"]="J'eevee's Jar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:15:3",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=14437,["npcName"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",["x"]=0.1244,["item"]=18663,["note"]="J'eevee's Jar, 150 gold",["y"]=0.31629999999999997},{["map"]=1428,["itemName"]="Black Lodestone",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:15:4",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=14437,["npcName"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",["x"]=0.1244,["item"]=18629,["note"]="Black Lodestone, 50 gold",["y"]=0.31629999999999997},{["map"]=1428,["itemName"]="Xorothian Glyphs",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:15:5",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=14437,["npcName"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",["x"]=0.1244,["item"]=18670,["note"]="Xorothian Glyphs, 50 gold",["y"]=0.31629999999999997}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:step:15",["text"]="Dreadsteed of Xoroth",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Gorzeeki Wildeyes, then Mor'zul Bloodbringer hands you his instructions. Buy J'eevee's Jar (150 gold), the Black Lodestone (50) and the Xorothian Glyphs (50) from Gorzeeki Wildeyes; a warlock friend who owns them can bring theirs instead. Every other warlock who will recharge the nodes needs a Lodestone of their own. Carry 15 or more Soul Shards."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["note"]="Immol'thar, inside the west wing",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["size"]=5,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="kill",["npc"]=11496,["y"]=0.302,["x"]=0.603,["target"]="Immol'thar",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:16:1"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:step:16",["text"]="Into Dire Maul West",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Dire Maul stands in the ruins of central Feralas: from the gate at the foot of the ruins, walk up through the outer courtyards to the west wing's door at the north end. That door and an inner door need the Crescent Key (it drops from Pusillin in Dire Maul East) or a rogue with 300 Lockpicking. Bring a party of five. Lower Immol'thar's shield by killing the guardians of the five pylons (two stand in his own room), then kill Immol'thar: his dais is the summoning circle. Rest and rebuff before you start."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="J'eevee's Jar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:17:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.302,["x"]=0.603,["item"]=18663,["note"]="J'eevee's Jar, on Immol'thar's dais"},{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Xorothian Glyphs",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:17:2",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.302,["x"]=0.603,["item"]=18670,["note"]="Xorothian Glyphs, once the circle is complete"},{["map"]=1444,["oi"]=1,["group"]={["size"]=5,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="kill",["npc"]=14502,["y"]=0.302,["x"]=0.603,["title"]="Dreadsteed of Xoroth",["count"]=1,["target"]="Xorothian Dreadsteed",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:17:3",["quest"]=7631,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1444,["note"]="Dreadsteed Spirit: Summon Dreadsteed",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:goal:17:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14504,["npcName"]="Dreadsteed Spirit",["x"]=0.603,["title"]="Dreadsteed of Xoroth",["quest"]=7631,["y"]=0.302}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed:step:17",["text"]="The ritual",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Stand on the dais and use J'eevee's Jar: J'eevee sets out the Bell, the Wheel and the Candle. The Bell heals warlocks, the Wheel shields the party, the Candle burns the imps: ignore the imps and kill the Dread Guards (elite felguards, about ten, sometimes two at once); Banish or Enslave helps. Give one player each node to watch: when one sags, tilts and sounds, a warlock with a Lodestone recharges it, a 3-second cast that any hit breaks (a Soul Shard each), so keep attackers off them. If all three fail, the ritual ends and you start again; while one stands it survives even a wipe. After about six minutes nine symbols glow and a red vortex closes the circle: walk out and the remaining demons vanish at its edge. Rest, then use the Xorothian Glyphs. Kill the Xorothian Dreadsteed (level 62, elite); at half health Lord Hel'nurath joins, a hard hitter who knocks you back. Speak to the Dreadsteed Spirit: every warlock in the party who is on this quest can bind it."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1413,["id"]="polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed",["zoneName"]="The Barrens",["min"]=40,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Warlock Felsteed (40-60)",["category"]="Class",["max"]=60,["classes"]={"WARLOCK"},["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:1:1",["level"]=40,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6251},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=320,["npc"]=461,["y"]=0.8495999999999999,["x"]=0.3924,["title"]="Summon Felsteed",["npcName"]="Demisette Cloyce",["closedBy"]={3631,4487,4489},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=4488,["minLevel"]=40}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:step:1",["text"]="Summon Felsteed (Stormwind)",["only"]={["races"]={"Human"}},["detail"]="At 40 Demisette Cloyce, in the cellar of the Slaughtered Lamb in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. No quest offered? Finish the felhunter chain first: players report the mount comes after it."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:2:1",["level"]=40,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1455,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6251},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:goal:2:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=320,["npc"]=5172,["y"]=0.056600000000000004,["x"]=0.5035000000000001,["title"]="Summon Felsteed",["npcName"]="Briarthorn",["closedBy"]={3631,4488,4489},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=4487,["minLevel"]=40}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:step:2",["text"]="Summon Felsteed (Ironforge)",["only"]={["races"]={"Gnome"}},["detail"]="At 40 Briarthorn, by the warlock trainers in Ironforge, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. No quest offered? Finish the felhunter chain first: players report the mount comes after it."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:3:1",["level"]=40,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6251},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:goal:3:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=320,["npc"]=3326,["y"]=0.4543,["x"]=0.48469999999999996,["title"]="Summon Felsteed",["npcName"]="Zevrost",["closedBy"]={4487,4488,4489},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=3631,["minLevel"]=40}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:step:3",["text"]="Summon Felsteed (Orgrimmar)",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["detail"]="At 40 Zevrost, in the Cleft of Shadow, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. No quest offered? Finish the felhunter chain first: players report the mount comes after it."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:4:1",["level"]=40,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1458,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6251},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:goal:4:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=320,["npc"]=4563,["y"]=0.1593,["x"]=0.8621,["title"]="Summon Felsteed",["npcName"]="Kaal Soulreaper",["closedBy"]={3631,4487,4488},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=4489,["minLevel"]=40}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:step:4",["text"]="Summon Felsteed (Undercity)",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="At 40 Kaal Soulreaper, in the Magic Quarter, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. The zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades flies to Durotar; Ratchet is a short flight from Orgrimmar. No quest offered? Finish the felhunter chain first: players report the mount comes after it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6251,["npcName"]="Strahad Farsan",["x"]=0.6263000000000001,["title"]="Summon Felsteed",["only"]={["races"]={"Human"}},["quest"]=4488,["y"]=0.355},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:5:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6251,["npcName"]="Strahad Farsan",["x"]=0.6263000000000001,["title"]="Summon Felsteed",["only"]={["races"]={"Gnome"}},["quest"]=4487,["y"]=0.355},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:5:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6251,["npcName"]="Strahad Farsan",["x"]=0.6263000000000001,["title"]="Summon Felsteed",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["quest"]=3631,["y"]=0.355},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:5:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6251,["npcName"]="Strahad Farsan",["x"]=0.6263000000000001,["title"]="Summon Felsteed",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["quest"]=4489,["y"]=0.355},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:5:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6251,["y"]=0.355,["x"]=0.6263000000000001,["title"]="Summon Felsteed",["npcName"]="Strahad Farsan",["pre"]={3631,4487,4488,4489},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=4490,["minLevel"]=40},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Strahad Farsan: Summon Felsteed",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:5:6",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6251,["npcName"]="Strahad Farsan",["x"]=0.6263000000000001,["title"]="Summon Felsteed",["quest"]=4490,["y"]=0.355}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed:step:5",["text"]="Strahad Farsan in Ratchet",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ratchet is the goblin port on the Barrens coast, east of the Crossroads; from the Alliance side take the boat from Booty Bay. Strahad Farsan stands by his small tower on the hill above the town, not down at the docks. Hand in, then take his own Summon Felsteed and hand it straight back: that teaches you the mount. No fight, and the quests ask for nothing."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1436,["id"]="polestar:forever/alliance/02-westfall",["next"]="polestar:forever/alliance/03-darkshore",["max"]=18,["min"]=11,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Westfall (11-18)",["faction"]="Alliance",["category"]="Leveling",["zoneName"]="Westfall",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/02-westfall:goal:1:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=241,["npcName"]="Remy \"Two Times\"",["x"]=0.4214,["title"]="A Fishy Peril",["y"]=0.6726000000000001,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=40,["minLevel"]=7},{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/02-westfall:goal:1:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=240,["npcName"]="Marshal Dughan",["x"]=0.4211,["title"]="A Fishy Peril",["quest"]=40,["y"]=0.6593000000000001},{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/02-westfall:goal:1:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=240,["y"]=0.6593000000000001,["x"]=0.4211,["title"]="Further Concerns",["npcName"]="Marshal Dughan",["pre"]={40},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=35,["minLevel"]=7},{["map"]=1429,["note"]="Marshal Dughan: for Gryan Stoutmantle at Sentinel Hill",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/02-westfall:goal:1:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=240,["npcName"]="Marshal Dughan",["x"]=0.4211,["title"]="Report to Gryan Stoutmantle",["y"]=0.6593000000000001,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=109,["minLevel"]=9}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/02-westfall:step:1",["text"]="Goldshire",["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf","Gnome"}},["detail"]="On the road from Stormwind to Westfall, Goldshire is the first stop: Remy \"Two Times\" stands outside the inn, Marshal Dughan beside him. Remy \"Two Times\"'s A Fishy Peril goes straight to Dughan, who then gives Further Concerns; his Report to Gryan Stoutmantle goes with you to Westfall."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/02-westfall:goal:2:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=248248,["npcName"]="Blixie Fitzwink",["x"]=0.632,["title"]="Stolen Enchanting Supplies",["y"]=0.726,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=91725,["minLevel"]=7}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/02-westfall:step:2",["text"]="The Tower of Azora",["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf","Gnome"}},["detail"]="East along the road past Crystal Lake: Hamish Bergwort and Blixie Fitzwink stand at the foot of the tower."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/02-westfall:goal:3:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=261,["npcName"]="Guard Thomas",["x"]=0.7397,["title"]="Further Concerns",["quest"]=35,["y"]=0.7218000000000001},{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/02-westfall:goal:3:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=261,["y"]=0.7218000000000001,["x"]=0.7397,["title"]="Find the Lost Guards",["npcName"]="Guard Thomas",["pre"]={35},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=37,["minLevel"]=7},{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/02-westfall:goal:3:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=261,["npcName"]="Guard Thomas",["x"]=0.7397,["title"]="Protect the Frontier",["y"]=0.7218000000000001,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=52,["minLevel"]=7},{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/02-westfall:goal:3:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=248265,["npcName"]="Ormin Pelford",["x"]=0.7654000000000001,["title"]="Downstre