 the Lake",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"},["races"]={"NightElf","Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs in his building in Nighthaven: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart. Shrine Baubles lie in the containers on the floor of Lake Elune'ara, below Nighthaven: take one to the Shrine of Remulos in the north-west, use it there and speak to Tajarri. Trial of the Lake runs on a timer: no teleport or Hearthstone until Tajarri has it. Then fly back to Auberdine from Nighthaven."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1439,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-darkshore:goal:20:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2167,["count"]=8,["y"]=0.5437,["x"]=0.3956,["title"]="How Big a Threat?",["lvl"]=13,["target"]="Blackwood Pathfinder",["quest"]=985,["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf","Gnome","Human","Skyborne"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1439,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-darkshore:goal:20:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2324,["count"]=5,["y"]=0.5404,["x"]=0.3962,["title"]="How Big a Threat?",["lvl"]=14,["target"]="Blackwood Windtalker",["quest"]=985,["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf","Gnome","Human","Skyborne"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-darkshore:step:20",["text"]="Blackwood furbolgs",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Blackwood Pathfinders and Windtalkers hold the camp south-east of Auberdine."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1439,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-darkshore:goal:21:1",["t"]="interact",["y"]=0.6182,["x"]=0.42369999999999997,["title"]="Bashal'Aran",["objName"]="Ancient Flame",["object"]=16393,["quest"]=957,["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf","Gnome","Human","Skyborne"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-darkshore:step:21",["text"]="The Ancient Flame",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detai