 Corners."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:goal:39:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1070,["npcName"]="Deputy Feldon",["x"]=0.2564,["title"]="Assessing the Threat",["quest"]=246,["y"]=0.6},{["map"]=1433,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:goal:39:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1070,["npcName"]="Deputy Feldon",["x"]=0.2564,["title"]="Show of Force",["quest"]=98407,["y"]=0.6}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:step:39",["text"]="Deputy Feldon",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="East along the road to the gryphon master; Deputy Feldon stands beside her."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["itemName"]="Oslow's Toolbox",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Oslow's Toolbox; underwater",["fromId"]=32,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="object",["item"]=1309,["y"]=0.5466,["x"]=0.3643,["title"]="The Lost Tools",["from"]="Sunken Chest",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:goal:40:1",["count"]=1,["quest"]=125,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1433,["itemName"]="Spotted Sunfish",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:goal:40:2",["fromNpcsAt"]="6,3,5,1,4;3,5,1,4,6;6,1,4,3,5;6;3,5;1,4;1,4,6,7;6;3,5,2",["t"]="collect",["spread"]=true,["y"]=0.5564,["x"]=0.3567,["item"]=1467,["lvl"]=19,["count"]=10,["title"]="Selling Fish",["quest"]=127,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:step:40",["text"]="Sunken Chest",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back toward town, swim east from the bridge into Lake Everstill; the chest lies on the lake bed beside a sunken boat. Murloc Flesheaters and Tidecallers line the south shore around it: any of them can carry a Spotted Sunfish.\nCareful: Lake Threshers, level 25 elites, swim in the lake: keep your distance from them while you dive for the chest."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["itemName"]="Hilary's Necklace",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Hilary's Necklace; underwater",["fromId"]=154357,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="object",["item"]=10958,["y"]=0.545,["x"]=0.3281,["title"]="Hilary's Necklace",["from"]="Glinting Mud",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:goal:41:1",["count"]=1,["quest"]=3741,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:step:41",["text"]="Hilary's Necklace",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Then west under the bridge: a Glinting Mud mound on the lake bed beside town holds the necklace. Only one mound shows at a time, anywhere from under the dock to past the bridge."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:goal:42:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8962,["npcName"]="Hilary",["x"]=0.2415,["title"]="Hilary's Necklace",["quest"]=3741,["y"]=0.5363},{["map"]=1433,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:goal:42:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=341,["npcName"]="Foreman Oslow",["x"]=0.2705,["title"]="The Lost Tools",["quest"]=125,["y"]=0.4864},{["map"]=1433,["note"]="Its pikes and rivets come from the gnolls north of the lake, on the loop after Westfall",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:goal:42:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=341,["y"]=0.4864,["x"]=0.2705,["title"]="The Everstill Bridge",["npcName"]="Foreman Oslow",["pre"]={125},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=89,["minLevel"]=15},{["map"]=1433,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/03-loch-modan:goal:42:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=381,["npcName"]="Dockmaster Baren",["x"]=0.2263,["title"]="Sellin