,["detail"]="Rabid Dire Wolves roam the woods around the cemetery and Abercrombie, Starving Dire Wolves the hills north-east of him. Pygmy Venom Web Spiders are the small spiders, and few: most crawl along the The Hushed Bank west of Raven Hill, fewer up north towards Sven Yorgen's camp; they drop the venom too. Every ghoul of the cemetery's northern half can drop a fang. Wolves and the bigger spiders share the Westfall border, so pull with care."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1431,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:goal:20:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=289,["npcName"]="Abercrombie",["x"]=0.2811,["title"]="The Hermit",["quest"]=165,["y"]=0.3146},{["map"]=1431,["crumbs"]={165},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:goal:20:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=289,["y"]=0.3146,["x"]=0.2811,["title"]="Supplies from Darkshire",["npcName"]="Abercrombie",["minLevel"]=20,["qlvl"]=24,["quest"]=148,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:step:20",["text"]="Abercrombie",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The hermit's shack stands in the woods north-east of the Raven Hill Cemetery."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1431,["itemName"]="Ghoul Fang",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:goal:21:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.32880000000000004,["x"]=0.258,["title"]="The Totem of Infliction",["count"]=10,["spread"]=true,["item"]=1129,["quest"]=101,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1431,["itemName"]="Skeleton Finger",["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:goal:21:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.6816,["x"]=0.7692,["title"]="The Totem of Infliction",["count"]=10,["item"]=2378,["quest"]=101,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:step:21",["text"]="Raven Hill Cemetery: kill these as you meet them",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The cemetery lies north of the village. Skeletal Horrors and Skeletal Fiends (23-25) walk its southern half and carry the fingers; for the fangs, Flesh Eaters (24-25) drop the most, so leave the Bone Chewers, Plague Spreaders and Fetid Corpses (26-30) further in alone. Mor'Ladim, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him.\nCareful: Eliza, a level 31 elite, rises from her grave at the cemetery's north end: keep away from it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1431,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:goal:22:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=888,["npcName"]="Watcher Dodds",["x"]=0.4512,["title"]="Eight-Legged Menaces",["quest"]=245,["y"]=0.6703}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:step:22",["text"]="Watcher Dodds",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Head back east along the road to the Yorgen Farmstead."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1431,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:goal:23:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.7770999999999999,["x"]=0.4985,["title"]="Sven's Revenge",["objName"]="Mound of loose dirt",["quest"]=95,["object"]=59},{["map"]=1431,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:goal:23:2",["t"]="accept",["object"]=59,["y"]=0.7770999999999999,["x"]=0.4985,["qlvl"]=25,["objName"]="Mound of loose dirt",["pre"]={95},["minLevel"]=20,["quest"]=230,["title"]="Sven's Camp"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains:step:23",["text"]="Yorgen Farmstead",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The mound of loose dirt lies south of the farmhouse, by the old stump."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b