ents, where Kerlonian Evershade sleeps beside Arbal. Take his quest: it gives you the Horn of Awakening. Use the horn to wake him and lead him south along the road to his bag at the southern edge of Darkshore; blow it again whenever he falls asleep. Then go on to Liladris Moonriver at Maestra's Post.\nCareful: Scripted ambushes of three mobs each attack along the road."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:step:2",["text"]="Ashenvale",["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["x"]=0.262,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["y"]=0.387,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:goal:2:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Maestra's Post",["area"]=413}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:step:3",["text"]="Maestra's Post",["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:6:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3663,["npcName"]="Delgren the Purifier",["x"]=0.262,["title"]="The Tower of Althalaxx",["quest"]=967,["y"]=0.387},{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:6:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3663,["y"]=0.387,["x"]=0.262,["title"]="The Tower of Althalaxx",["npcName"]="Delgren the Purifier",["pre"]={967},["qlvl"]=21,["quest"]=970,["minLevel"]=13},{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:6:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3847,["npcName"]="Orendil Broadleaf",["x"]=0.2644,["title"]="Bathran's Hair",["y"]=0.3859,["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=1010,["minLevel"]=20},{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11219,["npcName"]="Liladris Moonriver",["x"]=0.2726,["title"]="The Sleeper Has Awakened",["quest"]=5321,["y"]=0.3558}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["itemName"]="Glowing Soul Gem",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/allian