, walk up the pier: Karl Boran on the pier, James Halloran by the docks to the north, Valstag Ironjaw in the keep, the inn (First Mate Fitzsimmons) east of it with Caitlin Grassman and Sida beside it, Tarrel Rockweaver by the north gate on the way out east."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["itemName"]="Khaz Modan Timber",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:goal:34:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.5329999999999999,["x"]=0.12,["title"]="Spoils of War",["count"]=6,["item"]=279821,["quest"]=98197,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1437,["itemName"]="Khaz Modan Iron",["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=670774,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Spoils of War",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.53,["x"]=0.114,["count"]=30,["from"]="Khaz Modan Iron",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:goal:34:2",["item"]=279822,["quest"]=98197,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:step:34",["text"]="Spoils of War",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Timber and iron piles lie around the keep and along the harbor's walls. Careful: Nightveiled Rotheap, a level 31 elite, roams the Wetlands' shores and roads: if it comes by, give it room."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:goal:35:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=1024,["y"]=0.4232,["x"]=0.127,["title"]="Claws from the Deep",["lvl"]=21,["target"]="Bluegill Murloc",["count"]=12,["quest"]=279,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1437,["itemName"]="Gobbler's Head",["oi"]=2,["count"]=1,["fromId"]=1259,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=279,["lvl"]=22,["y"]=0.41450000000000004,["x"]=0.1521,["item"]=3618,["from"]="Gobbler",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:goal:35:2",["title"]="Claws from the Deep",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:step:35",["text"]="Bluegill Marsh",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Follow the coast north out of Menethil. Bluegill Murlocs fill the marsh; Gobbler walks with a pack in the middle of it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["itemName"]="Young Crocolisk Skin",["oi"]=1,["spread"]=true,["fromId"]=1417,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=484,["count"]=6,["y"]=0.4639,["x"]=0.1577,["item"]=3397,["from"]="Young Wetlands Crocolisk",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:goal:36:1",["title"]="Young Crocolisk Skins",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:step:36",["text"]="Young crocolisks",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="From the marsh head east across the Wetlands. Young Wetlands Crocolisks lurk in the pools north of the excavation site."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["note"]="Merrin Rockweaver, below ground",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:41:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1076,["npcName"]="Merrin Rockweaver",["x"]=0.38909999999999995,["title"]="In Search of the Excavation Team",["quest"]=305,["y"]=0.5234000000000001},{["map"]=1437,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:41:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=1076,["y"]=0.5234000000000001,["x"]=0.38909999999999995,["title"]="In Search of the Excavation Team",["npcName"]="Merrin Rockweaver",["pre"]={305},["qlvl"]=24,["quest"]=306,["minLevel"]=21},{["map"]=1437,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:41:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=1078,["npcName"]="Ormer Ironbraid",["x"]=0.3818,["title"]="Ormer's Revenge",["y"]=0.5089,["qlvl"]=24,["quest"]=294,["minLevel"]=22}},["id"]="forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:41",["text"]="Whelgar's Excavation Site",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The excavation site sits on the hill south of the road."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["note"]="Mottled Screecher; careful: Nightveiled Rotheap, a level 31 elite, roams these hills",["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:goal:38:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=1021,["count"]=10,["y"]=0.44060000000000005,["x"]=0.302,["title"]="Ormer's Revenge",["lvl"]=25,["target"]="Mottled Screecher",["quest"]=294,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1437,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:goal:38:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=1020,["count"]=10,["y"]=0.4239,["x"]=0.29460000000000003,["title"]="Ormer's Revenge",["lvl"]=23,["target"]="Mottled Raptor",["quest"]=294,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:step:38",["text"]="The raptor hills",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Mottled Raptors and Screechers roam the hills west of the excavation site.\nCareful: Once a Mottled Screecher drops to 30% health, it calls for help from creatures within 20 yd. Mottled Screechers frequently come in packs of three, and raptors summoned by their calls for help may also join the fight."},{["id"]="forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:43",["text"]="Ormer Ironbraid",["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:43:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1078,["npcName"]="Ormer Ironbraid",["x"]=0.3818,["title"]="Ormer's Revenge",["quest"]=294,["y"]=0.5089},{["map"]=1437,["note"]="Ormer Ironbraid: the bigger raptors in the valley west of the dig are for your next Wetlands visit, at about 27",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:43:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=1078,["y"]=0.5089,["x"]=0.3818,["title"]="Ormer's Revenge",["npcName"]="Ormer Ironbraid",["pre"]={294},["qlvl"]=27,["quest"]=295,["minLevel"]=22}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:48:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1244,["npcName"]="Rethiel the Greenwarden",["x"]=0.5637,["title"]="The Greenwarden",["quest"]=463,["y"]=0.40399999999999997},{["map"]=1437,["crumbs"]={463},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:goal:40:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=1244,["y"]=0.40399999999999997,["x"]=0.5637,["title"]="Tramping Paws",["npcName"]="Rethiel the Greenwarden",["minLevel"]=20,["qlvl"]=21,["quest"]=276,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:step:40",["text"]="The Green Belt",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Einar Stonegrip camps by the road; Rethiel the Greenwarden stands farther east, by the river."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["itemName"]="Unruptured Stalker Gland",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:goal:41:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.6093999999999999,["x"]=0.5618,["title"]="Alchemical Hazards",["lvl"]=22,["count"]=1,["item"]=280319,["quest"]=98282,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:step:41",["text"]="Thelgen Rock",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Cave Stalkers and Leech Stalkers fill Thelgen Rock, the cave south-east of the excavation site. Careful: Highland Lurkers and Horrors, level 28 elites, walk the same cave among them: pull the stalkers one at a time and keep clear of the elites."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:goal:42:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=1007,["count"]=15,["y"]=0.6371,["x"]=0.6051,["title"]="Tramping Paws",["lvl"]=21,["target"]="Mosshide Gnoll",["quest"]=276,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1437,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:goal:42:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=1008,["count"]=10,["y"]=0.6431,["x"]=0.6074,["title"]="Tramping Paws",["lvl"]=22,["target"]="Mosshide Mongrel",["quest"]=276,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:step:42",["text"]="The Mosshide gnolls",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Mosshide Gnolls and Mongrels hold the hills south-east of the The Green Belt."},{["id"]="forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:50",["text"]="Rethiel the Greenwarden",["goals"]={{["map"]=1437,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:50:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1244,["npcName"]="Rethiel the Greenwarden",["x"]=0.5637,["title"]="Tramping Paws",["quest"]=276,["y"]=0.40399999999999997},{["map"]=1437,["note"]="Its flint comes from the Mosshide Fenrunners on the way to Ironbeard's Tomb; Rethiel the Greenwarden takes it on your next Wetlands visit",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:50:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=1244,["y"]=0.40399999999999997,["x"]=0.5637,["title"]="Fire Taboo",["npcName"]="Rethiel the Greenwarden",["pre"]={276},["qlvl"]=23,["quest"]=277,["minLevel"]=20}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Crude Flint",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=2611,["carriedTo"]="forever/alliance/06-wetlands",["quest"]=277,["fromAlsoId"]=1010,["map"]=1437,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:goal:44:1",["oi"]=1,["fromNpcsAt"]="3,1;1,3;1,2,3;1,2;3,1,4;3,1;1,2,3,6;3;3,1;4,3,5,7,6;4;1,3;4,5,7,6;4,5,7,6;4,5,7;1;1;1,4;3,4,6,5,7;1,2;1;3,4;3;2",["fromId"]=1009,["t"]="collect",["from"]="Mosshide Mistweaver",["title"]="Fire Taboo",["y"]=0.30820000000000003,["x"]=0.5123,["count"]=9,["lvl"]=24,["fromAlso"]="Mosshide Fenrunner",["note"]="Crude Flint: Mosshide Fenrunners and Mistweavers",["fromKind"]="npc",["spread"]=true},{["map"]=1437,["itemName"]="Sida's Bag",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-ashenvale:goal:44:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.256,["x"]=0.446,["title"]="