ses",["npcName"]="Kayneth Stillwind",["pre"]={4581},["qlvl"]=29,["quest"]=1011,["minLevel"]=24},{["map"]=1440,["note"]="Maseara Autumnmoon: her husband's trail in Satyrnaar, on the way back from the lake",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:55:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=221269,["npcName"]="Maseara Autumnmoon",["x"]=0.8623999999999999,["title"]="Vengeful Trail",["y"]=0.4586,["qlvl"]=28,["quest"]=98417,["minLevel"]=23}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:55",["text"]="Forest Song",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Forest Song, the Night Elf outpost at the eastern end of the road: Kayneth Stillwind stands there, Maseara Autumnmoon a few steps east of her."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["itemName"]="Iron Pommel",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=19021,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Raene's Cleansing",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.6457999999999999,["x"]=0.7826000000000001,["count"]=1,["from"]="Rusty Chest",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:56:1",["item"]=5519,["quest"]=1027,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1440,["itemName"]="Bottle of Disease",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=18036,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Forsaken Diseases",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.718,["x"]=0.7526999999999999,["count"]=1,["from"]="Bottle of Disease",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:56:2",["item"]=5440,["quest"]=1011,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:56",["text"]="The Dor'Danil Barrow Den: kill these as you meet them",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Forsaken's camp lies in the woods south of Forest Song.\nRusty chests lie around the Shadethicket furbolg camps west of the Forsaken; open them until one holds the pommel.\nCareful: Non-elite Forsaken of about level 28-30 guard the camp. Some of them are stealthed, and the ones around the table often aggro together."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["itemName"]="Fallen Moonstone",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=3931,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Fallen Sky Lake",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.8217,["x"]=0.6666,["count"]=1,["from"]="Shadethicket Oracle",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:57:1",["item"]=5508,["quest"]=1035,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1440,["note"]="Gleaming Crescent Pendant: for Maliynn in Astranaar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:57:2",["t"]="accept",["y"]=0.7156,["x"]=0.6299,["title"]="Gleaming Crescent Necklace",["objName"]="Gleaming Crescent Pendant",["qlvl"]=26,["minLevel"]=22,["quest"]=98027,["object"]=669176}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:57",["text"]="Fallen Sky Lake",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Shadethicket Oracle walks the shore of Fallen Sky Lake, south-west of the chests; the Gleaming Crescent Pendant lies north of the lake, on the way.\nCareful: Other mobs, some of them underwater, sit near the island. Clear them first so they don't join the fight when you pull the Oracle."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:58:1",["t"]="interact",["y"]=0.4857,["x"]=0.816,["title"]="The Tower of Althalaxx",["objName"]="Circle of Imprisonment",["object"]=20352,["quest"]=1140,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1440,["itemName"]="Vine-Wrapped Scroll",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Vine-Wrapped Scroll, from Kurothel's Knapsack",["fromId"]=673431,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="object",["item"]=281014,["y"]=0.49200000000000005,["x"]=0.8170000000000001,["title"]="Vengeful Trail",["from"]="Kurothel's Knapsack",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:58:2",["count"]=1,["quest"]=98417,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:58",["text"]="Satyrnaar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="North from the lake to the satyr camp of Satyrnaar, just west of Forest Song: the Circle of Imprisonment stands in it, and Kurothel's Knapsack lies beside it with the Vine-Wrapped Scroll.\nCareful: The Felmusk Rogues in Night Run often go stealthed, and Satyrnaar has satyr casters."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:59:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3848,["npcName"]="Kayneth Stillwind",["x"]=0.8523999999999999,["title"]="Forsaken Diseases",["quest"]=1011,["y"]=0.4471},{["map"]=1440,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:59:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3848,["y"]=0.4471,["x"]=0.8523999999999999,["title"]="Insane Druids",["npcName"]="Kayneth Stillwind",["pre"]={1011},["qlvl"]=32,["quest"]=1012,["minLevel"]=24},{["map"]=1440,["note"]="Maseara Autumnmoon, a few steps east",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:59:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=221269,["npcName"]="Maseara Autumnmoon",["x"]=0.8623999999999999,["title"]="Vengeful Trail",["quest"]=98417,["y"]=0.4586}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:59",["text"]="Kayneth Stillwind",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Optional: Kayneth Stillwind also offers Insane Druids, three level 32 druids deep in The Dor'Danil Barrow Den, a cave of quickly respawning, stealthed mobs, and back to her afterwards. It is above your level here: take it only if you are grouped or want the extra XP; the guide doesn't need it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:60:1",["t"]="goto",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=1012},{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1012}}},["y"]=0.7545000000000001,["x"]=0.7595000000000001,["text"]="The Dor'Danil Barrow Den",["area"]=432}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:60",["text"]="The Dor'Danil Barrow Den's entrance",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=1012},{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1012}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["note"]="Taneel Darkwood, inside The Dor'Danil Barrow Den",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:61:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=3940,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=1012},{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1012}}},["y"]=0.7399,["x"]=0.7718,["title"]="Insane Druids",["target"]="Taneel Darkwood",["count"]=1,["quest"]=1012,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1440,["note"]="Uthil Mooncall, inside The Dor'Danil Barrow Den",["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:61:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=3941,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=1012},{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1012}}},["y"]=0.7273999999999999,["x"]=0.7796,["title"]="Insane Druids",["target"]="Uthil Mooncall",["count"]=1,["quest"]=1012,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1440,["note"]="Mavoris Cloudsbreak, inside The Dor'Danil Barrow Den",["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:61:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=3942,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=1012},{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1012}}},["y"]=0.742,["x"]=0.7505,["title"]="Insane Druids",["target"]="Mavoris Cloudsbreak",["count"]=1,["quest"]=1012,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["detail"]="The three druids are inside The Dor'Danil Barrow Den, apart from each other: go in at its mouth, south of the Forsaken camp, not over the hill above them. Taneel Darkwood is in the eastern halls, Uthil Mooncall deepest down at the north-east end and Mavoris Cloudsbreak at the western end.\nCareful: The den has many mobs that respawn quickly, including stealthed undead and patrols, so extra mobs often join a fight.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:61",["text"]="Insane druids",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=1012},{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1012}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:62:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3848,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=1012},{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1012}}},["npcName"]="Kayneth Stillwind",["x"]=0.8523999999999999,["title"]="Insane Druids",["quest"]=1012,["y"]=0.4471}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:62",["text"]="Forest Song",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=1012},{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1012}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:63:1",["t"]="interact",["y"]=0.57,["x"]=0.6662,["title"]="The Tower of Althalaxx",["objName"]="Circle of Imprisonment",["object"]=19901,["quest"]=1140,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:63",["text"]="Night Run",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The second Circle of Imprisonment lies in the valley of Night Run, on the way west."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:64",["text"]="Shael'dryn",["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:64:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3916,["npcName"]="Shael'dryn",["x"]=0.5354,["title"]="Raene's Cleansing",["quest"]=1027,["y"]=0.4622},{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:64:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3916,["y"]=0.4622,["x"]=0.5354,["title"]="Raene's Cleansing",["npcName"]="Shael'dryn",["pre"]={1027},["qlvl"]=28,["quest"]=1028,["minLevel"]=18}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:65:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.49200000000000005,["x"]=0.5635,["title"]="Raene's Cleansing",["objName"]="Hidden Shrine",["quest"]=1028,["object"]=19024},{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:65:2",["t"]="accept",["object"]=19024,["y"]=0.49200000000000005,["x"]=0.5635,["qlvl"]=28,["objName"]="Hidden Shrine",["pre"]={1028},["minLevel"]=18,["quest"]=1055,["title"]="Raene's Cleansing"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:65",["text"]="Hidden Shrine",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The shrine sits on the hill just south-east of the moonwell; follow the winding path up."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:66",["text"]="Shael'dryn",["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:66:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3916,["npcName"]="Shael'dryn",["x"]=0.5354,["title"]="Raene's Cleansing",["quest"]=1055,["y"]=0.4622},{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:66:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3916,["y"]=0.4622,["x"]=0.5354,["title"]="Raene's Cleansing",["npcName"]="Shael'dryn",["pre"]={1055},["qlvl"]=28,["quest"]=1029,["minLevel"]=18}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:67:1",["t"]="interact",["y"]=0.39130000000000004,["x"]=0.5049,["title"]="The Howling Vale",["objName"]="Tome of Mel'Thandris",["object"]=19027,["quest"]=1022,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:67",["text"]="The Howling Vale",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Take the tunnel into the Howling Vale; the tome lies in the ruins at its west end. Careful: Terrowulf Fleshrippers and Shadow Weavers (28-30) stand in tight packs around the tome, and the Terrowulf Packlord, a level 32 rare, walks the vale. Pull the wolves one at a time from the tunnel and let the Packlord pass first."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:68:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3691,["npcName"]="Raene Wolfrunner",["x"]=0.36619999999999997,["title"]="Raene's Cleansing",["quest"]=1029,["y"]=0.49579999999999996},{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:68:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3691,["y"]=0.49579999999999996,["x"]=0.36619999999999997,["title"]="Raene's Cleansing",["npcName"]="Raene Wolfrunner",["pre"]={1029},["qlvl"]=28,["quest"]=1030,["minLevel"]=18},{["map"]=1440,["note"]="Raene Wolfrunner: An Aggressive Defense, the Foulweald on the way to Krolg",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:68:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3691,["y"]=0.49579999999999996,["x"]=0.36619999999999997,["title"]="An Aggressive Defense",["npcName"]="Raene Wolfrunner",["pre"]={1023},["qlvl"]=24,["quest"]=1025,["minLevel"]=18},{["map"]=1440,["note"]="Raene Wolfrunner: Culling the Threat, Dal Bloodclaw on the way back from Maestra's Post",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:68:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3691,["npcName"]="Raene Wolfrunner",["x"]=0.36619999999999997,["title"]="Culling the Threat",["y"]=0.49579999999999996,["qlvl"]=25,["quest"]=1054,["minLevel"]=18},{["map"]=1440,["note"]="Maliynn, in the inn",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:68:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3961,["npcName"]="Maliynn",["x"]=0.36619999999999997,["title"]="Gleaming Crescent Necklace",["quest"]=98027,["y"]=0.49979999999999997},{["map"]=1440,["note"]="Pelturas Whitemoon, inside the building south of the inn",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:68:6",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3894,["npcName"]="Pelturas Whitemoon",["x"]=0.3737,["title"]="Fallen Sky Lake",["quest"]=1035,["y"]=0.5179}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:68",["text"]="Astranaar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Raene Wolfrunner and Maliynn are in the inn; Pelturas Whitemoon is inside the building just south of it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:69:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=3746,["y"]=0.599,["x"]=0.4997,["title"]="An Aggressive Defense",["lvl"]=25,["target"]="Foulweald Den Watcher",["count"]=1,["quest"]=1025,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1440,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:69:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=3749,["y"]=0.5963,["x"]=0.5019,["title"]="An Aggressive Defense",["lvl"]=25,["target"]="Foulweald Ursa",["count"]=2,["quest"]=1025,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1440,["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:69:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=3750,["y"]=0.6067,["x"]=0.5065,["title"]="An Aggressive Defense",["lvl"]=24,["target"]="Foulweald Totemic",["count"]=10,["quest"]=1025,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1440,["oi"]=4,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:69:4",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=3743,["y"]=0.6051,["x"]=0.5112,["title"]="An Aggressive Defense",["lvl"]=24,["target"]="Foulweald Warrior",["count"]=12,["quest"]=1025,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:69",["text"]="The Foulweald",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="On the way south-east to Krolg: the Foulweald furbolgs live in the woods south of the road, south-east of Astranaar. The Den Watcher and the Ursas guard the den."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:70:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3885,["npcName"]="Sentinel Velene Starstrike",["x"]=0.498,["title"]="Elemental Bracers",["y"]=0.6720999999999999,["qlvl"]=24,["quest"]=1016,["minLevel"]=20},{["itemName"]="Intact Elemental Bracer",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=12220,["map"]=1440,["optional"]=true,["fromId"]=3917,["t"]="collect",["fromAlsoId"]=12759,["from"]="Befouled Water Elemental",["y"]=0.6742,["x"]=0.5092,["count"]=5,["lvl"]=25,["note"]="Underwater",["fromAlso"]="Tideress",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:70:2"},{["map"]=1440,["itemName"]="Divined Scroll",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:70:3",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.713,["x"]=0.496,["title"]="Elemental Bracers",["note"]="Kill the elementals for 5 Intact Elemental Bracers, then use the Divining Scroll",["item"]=5455,["count"]=1,["quest"]=1016,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:70:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3885,["npcName"]="Sentinel Velene Starstrike",["x"]=0.498,["title"]="Elemental Bracers",["quest"]=1016,["y"]=0.6720999999999999}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:70",["text"]="Mystral Lake",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Sentinel Velene Starstrike stands at the Silverwind Refuge on the east shore of Mystral Lake, just north of the road to Krolg. Befouled Water Elementals wade in the lake; Tideress, a level 27 water elemental, walks among them and drops the bracers too."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:71:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3897,["npcName"]="Krolg",["x"]=0.5084000000000001,["title"]="Raene's Cleansing",["quest"]=1030,["y"]=0.7508},{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:71:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3897,["y"]=0.7508,["x"]=0.5084000000000001,["title"]="Raene's Cleansing",["npcName"]="Krolg",["pre"]={1030},["qlvl"]=30,["quest"]=1045,["minLevel"]=18}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:step:71",["text"]="Krolg",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Krolg, a furbolg untouched by the corruption, sits south of the road below Mystral Lake. Use Dartol's Rod of Transformation near him first: he only speaks to you in furbolg form."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:72:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=3932,["y"]=0.7595999999999999,["x"]=0.5493,["title"]="Raene's Cleansing",["lvl"]=28,["target"]="Bloodtooth Guard",["count"]=4,["quest"]=1045,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1440,["itemName"]="Ran Bloodtooth's Skull",["oi"]=2,["note"]="Ran Bloodtooth's Skull, from Ran Bloodtooth",["fromId"]=3696,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=1045,["count"]=1,["y"]=0.7962,["x"]=0.5475,["item"]=5388,["from"]="Ran Bloodtooth",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/06-wetlands:goal:72:2",["title"]="Raene's Cleansing",["fromKind"]="npc",["s