lie at the ruins' east edge. Pick up Green Hills pages as they drop.\nCareful: the Bloodscalp Berserkers, Headhunters and Witch Doctors (36-37) hold the ruins' core: pull them one at a time."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/04b-stranglethorn-vale:goal:12:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=686,["count"]=10,["y"]=0.20679999999999998,["x"]=0.3197,["title"]="Raptor Mastery",["lvl"]=36,["target"]="Lashtail Raptor",["quest"]=195,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/04b-stranglethorn-vale:step:12",["text"]="The Lashtail raptors",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="East from the ruins to the hilltop south-west of Nesingwary's camp: the Lashtail Raptors run in the jungle around it. Leave Sin'Dall, the great tiger (37) on the hilltop, to the 40-50 Stranglethorn guide: you're about 35 here. Then on to the hunters' tents."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/04b-stranglethorn-vale:step:13",["text"]="Nesingwary's Expedition",["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/04b-stranglethorn-vale:goal:13:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=716,["npcName"]="Barnil Stonepot",["x"]=0.3566,["title"]="Chapter I",["quest"]=339,["y"]=0.10529999999999999},{["map"]=1434,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/04b-stranglethorn-vale:goal:13:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=716,["npcName"]="Barnil Stonepot",["x"]=0.3566,["title"]="Chapter II",["quest"]=340,["y"]=0.10529999999999999},{["map"]=1434,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/04b-stranglethorn-vale:goal:13:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=716,["npcName"]="Barnil Stonepot",["x"]=0.3566,["title"]="Ch