 coast to the goblins' cove; Lolo keeps watch on the rocks above it.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:45",["text"]="Faldir's Cove",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=665}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1417,["x"]=0.33899999999999997,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:46:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.8059999999999999,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=665}}},{["title"]="Sunken Treasure",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Defend Professor Phizzlethorpe"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["escort"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:46:2",["t"]="complete",["quest"]=665,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=665}}}},["detail"]="Escort the professor up the hill to the cave above the cove and guard him while he works. Two level 40 water elementals ambush him there, and they are immune to frost. Hold them at the cave mouth, away from him: if the fight happens inside the cave, he joins in instead of working and more elementals keep coming.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:46",["text"]="Phizzlethorpe",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=665}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1417,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:47:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2774,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=665}},["npcName"]="Doctor Draxlegauge",["x"]=0.3386,["title"]="Sunken Treasure",["quest"]=665,["y"]=0.8045},{["map"]=1417,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:47:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2774,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=665}},["y"]=0.8045,["x"]=0.3386,["title"]="Sunken Treasure",["npc