together in the Valley of Fangs, in the middle of the Badlands."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.624,["x"]=0.5089,["title"]="Find Agmond",["objName"]="Battered Dwarven Skeleton",["quest"]=738,["object"]=2875}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:step:9",["text"]="Agmond's End",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The battered skeleton lies just east of the ogres, at the edge of the Stonevault trogg camp; the Bonesnappers and Shamans around it drop the flakes. Theldurin sits by the ruined camp further south."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["itemName"]="Buzzard Wing",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:goal:10:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.6385000000000001,["x"]=0.5525,["title"]="Barbecued Buzzard Wings",["count"]=4,["spread"]=true,["item"]=3404,["quest"]=703,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1418,["itemName"]="Buzzard Gizzard",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:goal:10:2",["fromNpcsAt"]=";;2;2;;;1;1;",["t"]="collect",["spread"]=true,["y"]=0.6,["x"]=0.5,["item"]=7847,["note"]="Buzzard Gizzard, if you still need one: the Buzzards east of Agmond's End drop it only rarely",["count"]=5,["title"]="Badlands Reagent Run",["quest"]=2500,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1418,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:goal:10:3",["t"]="accept",["object"]=2875,["y"]=0.624,["x"]=0.5089,["qlvl"]=42,["objName"]="Battered Dwarven Skeleton",["pre"]={738},["minLevel"]=30,["quest"]=739,["title"]="Murdaloc"},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:goal:10:4",["text"]="Murdaloc himself (42) walks among the Bonesnappers: leave him for the later Badlands guide at 43, and kill the Bonesnappers for this quest now.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"},{["itemName"]="Indurium Flake",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=5797,["quest"]=1108,["map"]=1418,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=2893,["t"]="collect",["fromAlsoId"]=2894,["title"]="Indurium",["y"]=0.6436,["x"]=0.5092,["count"]=10,["lvl"]=41,["from"]="Stonevault Bonesnapper",["fromAlso"]="Stonevault Shaman",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:goal:10:5"},{["map"]=1418,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:goal:10:6",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2893,["carriedTo"]="forever/alliance/40-50/02-badlands",["y"]=0.6436,["x"]=0.5092,["title"]="Murdaloc",["lvl"]=40,["target"]="Stonevault Bonesnapper",["count"]=12,["quest"]=739,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1418,["itemName"]="Unstudied Artifact",["oi"]=1,["title"]="Safety Checks",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:goal:10:7",["t"]="collect",["quest"]=97617,["count"]=8,["y"]=0.6436,["x"]=0.5092,["item"]=278402,["lvl"]=41,["note"]="Unstudied Artifact, from the Shadowforge diggers and the Bonesnappers",["carriedTo"]="forever/alliance/40-50/02-badlands",["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:step:10",["text"]="Agmond's End: kill these as you meet them",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Buzzards circle the plain to the east. Careful: the Dustbelcher Maulers, Shamans and Wyrmhunters (40-43) camp far to the south-west: leave them.\nThe battered skeleton lies at the edge of the Stonevault trogg camp; Murdaloc, Agmond's killer, walks among the Bonesnappers.\nCareful: the Stonevault Bonesnappers are 39-40 and the Shamans 40-41, a level or two over you here: pull them from the camp's edge, one at a time.\nCareful: Dustbelcher Lords are level 44-45. They use Battle Shout and Demoralizing Shout, and below 50% health they call for help from allies within 15 yd. Seven of them stand about 750 yd south of Kargath."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:goal:11:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2785,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=709}},["npcName"]="Theldurin the Lost",["x"]=0.5139,["title"]="Solution to Doom",["y"]=0.7687,["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=709,["minLevel"]=30}},["detail"]="Theldurin sits by the ruined camp south of the trogg camp. His tablet lies just inside Uldaman's cave mouth, beside level 38 elites: a quest for a group.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:step:11",["text"]="Theldurin the Lost",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=709}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:9:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2921,["npcName"]="Lotwil Veriatus",["x"]=0.2595,["title"]="Study of the Elements: Rock",["y"]=0.4487,["qlvl"]=37,["quest"]=710,["minLevel"]=35}},["id"]="forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:9",["text"]="Lotwil Veriatus",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Head west into the Dustbowl; Lotwil Veriatus works by his machines in the middle of it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["itemName"]="Small Stone Shard",["oi"]=1,["count"]=10,["fromId"]=2735,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=710,["lvl"]=39,["y"]=0.4547,["x"]=0.2353,["item"]=4626,["from"]="Lesser Rock Elemental",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:goal:13:1",["title"]="Study of the Elements: Rock",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1418,["itemName"]="Rock Elemental Shard",["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:goal:13:2",["t"]="collect",["count"]=5,["quest"]=2500,["y"]=0.4547,["x"]=0.2353,["title"]="Badlands Reagent Run",["lvl"]=40,["fromNpcsAt"]="1;1;4,1;6;4;4;4;4;4;3;2;2;2,5;1;2,5;2,5;2,5",["item"]=7848,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1418,["itemName"]="Scrap Metal",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:goal:13:3",["fromNpcsAt"]="2,1;2,1;3,4",["t"]="collect",["title"]="Scrounging",["y"]=0.593,["x"]=0.295,["item"]=4630,["lvl"]=40,["count"]=7,["note"]="Scrap Metal, from the Dustbelcher Ogres",["quest"]=733,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:step:13",["text"]="Lesser Rock Elementals",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Lesser Rock Elementals wander the Dustbowl west of Lotwil Veriatus; every rock elemental can drop Ghak Healtouch's Rock Elemental Shards. The Dustbelcher Ogres (38-39) on the Dustbowl's west side drop Sigrun Ironhew's scrap. Careful: a Malevolent Mirage, a level 42 elite, drifts about the Dustbowl: give it a wide berth.\nCareful: the Lesser Rock Elementals are 37-39 and hit hard: fight them one at a time."},{["id"]="forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:11",["text"]="Lotwil Veriatus",["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:11:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2921,["npcName"]="Lotwil Veriatus",["x"]=0.2595,["title"]="Study of the Elements: Rock",["quest"]=710,["y"]=0.4487},{["map"]=1418,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:11:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2921,["y"]=0.4487,["x"]=0.2595,["title"]="Study of the Elements: Rock",["npcName"]="Lotwil Veriatus",["pre"]={710},["qlvl"]=39,["quest"]=711,["minLevel"]=35}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Tablet of Ryun'eh",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["rank"]=1,["kind"]="elite",["near"]=true,["lvl"]=38},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=709}},["item"]=4631,["quest"]=709,["map"]=1418,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=126260,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.1882,["x"]=0.3934,["title"]="Solution to Doom",["from"]="Ancient Chest",["note"]="Tablet of Ryun'eh; below ground",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:goal:15:1"}},["detail"]="Head north to Uldaman's entrance, in the north of the Badlands: the chest lies just inside the cave mouth. Magregan Deepshadow and the Obsidian Golems (38) stand beside it and Shadowforge Diggers (35-36) work the tunnel, all elite: keep your group together.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:step:15",["text"]="The Ancient Chest",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=709}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:8:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4618,["npcName"]="Martek the Exiled",["x"]=0.42219999999999996,["title"]="Indurium",["quest"]=1108,["y"]=0.5268999999999999},{["map"]=1418,["note"]="For Fizzle Brassbolts at the Mirage Raceway: the Tanaris guide passes him at 45, keep it",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:8:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4618,["y"]=0.5268999999999999,["x"]=0.42219999999999996,["title"]="News for Fizzle",["npcName"]="Martek the Exiled",["pre"]={1108},["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=1137,["minLevel"]=28},{["map"]=1418,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:8:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2817,["npcName"]="Rigglefuzz",["x"]=0.4239,["title"]="Barbecued Buzzard Wings",["quest"]=703,["y"]=0.5293}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:step:16",["text"]="Valley of Fangs",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Martek the Exiled and Rigglefuzz camp in the Valley of Fangs, on the road between Uldaman and Agmond's End."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:17:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2860,["npcName"]="Sigrun Ironhew",["x"]=0.5379999999999999,["title"]="Scrounging",["quest"]=733,["y"]=0.433}},["id"]="forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:17",["text"]="Sigrun Ironhew",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="East from the Valley of Fangs to Hammertoe's Digsite: Sigrun Ironhew takes the scrap metal."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:goal:18:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2785,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=709}},["npcName"]="Theldurin the Lost",["x"]=0.5139,["title"]="Solution to Doom",["quest"]=709,["y"]=0.7687},{["map"]=1418,["note"]="for Gerrig Bonegrip in Ironforge: keep it",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:goal:18:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2785,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=709}},["y"]=0.7687,["x"]=0.5139,["title"]="To Ironforge for Yagyin's Digest",["npcName"]="Theldurin the Lost",["pre"]={709},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=727,["minLevel"]=30}},["detail"]="Head south to Agmond's End.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:step:18",["text"]="Theldurin the Lost",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=709}}},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Large Stone Slab",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=4627,["quest"]=711,["map"]=1418,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=92,["t"]="collect",["spread"]=true,["y"]=0.7764,["x"]=0.461,["title"]="Study of the Elements: Rock",["from"]="Rock Elemental",["count"]=3,["lvl"]=40,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:goal:19:1"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:step:19",["text"]="Rock Elementals",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Rock Elementals roam south-east of Lotwil Veriatus; Giant Buzzards and Elder Crag Coyotes share the plain to their west. Careful: a Malevolent Mirage, a level 42 elite, drifts about the Dustbowl: give it a wide berth."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:step:20",["text"]="Lotwil Veriatus",["goals"]={{["map"]=1418,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:13:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2921,["npcName"]="Lotwil Veriatus",["x"]=0.2595,["title"]="Study of the Elements: Rock",["quest"]=711,["y"]=0.4487}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:step:21",["text"]="To Stoutlager Inn",["goals"]={{["map"]=1432,["x"]=0.355,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["y"]=0.484,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:goal:21:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Stoutlager Inn",["area"]=2101}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:step:22",["text"]="Thelsamar",["goals"]={{["map"]=1432,["note"]="Ghak Healtouch, in the inn; below ground",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/30-40/06-badlands:19:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1470,["npcName"]="Ghak Healtouch",["x"]=0.37070000000000003,["title"]="Badlands Reagent Run",["quest"]=2500,["y"]=0.4938}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1443,["id"]="polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06b-desolace",["next"]="polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale",["max"]=39,["min"]=38,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Desolace (38-39)",["faction"]="Alliance",["category"]="Leveling",["zoneName"]="Desolace",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/30-40/06b-desolace:step:1",["text"]="Fly to Menethil Harbor",["goals"]={{["map"]=1432,["x"]=0.33899999999999997,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:fore