}},{["detail"]="At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Skyborne learn it from Genn Fairweather, the stablemaster and riding trainer at the Fairweather Stables in Valanaar on Zephras Isle, who also sells the Galestriders: the skyboat to the isle leaves the north side of Dalaran about every five minutes. Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists the Galestriders.",["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:22:1",["text"]="Riding and Galestriders: Genn Fairweather, at the Fairweather Stables in Valanaar on Zephras Isle.",["t"]="note",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}}},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:goal:22:2",["text"]="Skyboat to Zephras Isle: the north side of Dalaran, about every five minutes.",["t"]="note",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}}}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:22",["text"]="Riding at 40",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="level",["n"]=40}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:18:1",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=16227,["npcName"]="Bragok",["x"]=0.6308,["location"]="Ratchet",["y"]=0.3716,["node"]=80,["area"]=392},{["map"]=1413,["x"]=0.634,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:18:2",["text"]="Boat to Booty Bay",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.385}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:23",["text"]="Boat to Booty Bay",["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf","Gnome","NightElf","Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Head north-west into the Barrens and up the coast to Ratchet: the boat to Booty Ba