 letter lies in the Bloodsail camp on the beach, where \"Pretty Boy\" Duncan walks.\nCareful: the Bloodsail Mages and Warlocks here are level 40-43 and cast from range: pull one at a time and fight with your back to the open beach."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:step:29",["text"]="Booty Bay",["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:21:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2490,["npcName"]="First Mate Crazz",["x"]=0.281,["title"]="The Bloodsail Buccaneers",["quest"]=597,["y"]=0.7622},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:21:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2490,["y"]=0.7622,["x"]=0.281,["title"]="The Bloodsail Buccaneers",["npcName"]="First Mate Crazz",["pre"]={597},["qlvl"]=41,["quest"]=599,["minLevel"]=37},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:21:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2493,["y"]=0.759,["x"]=0.2859,["title"]="Keep An Eye Out",["npcName"]="Dizzy One-Eye",["pre"]={597},["qlvl"]=42,["quest"]=576,["minLevel"]=37},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:21:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2487,["npcName"]="Fleet Master Seahorn",["x"]=0.2717,["title"]="The Bloodsail Buccaneers",["quest"]=599,["y"]=0.7701},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="keep it: the Wild Shore camp's charts and Swashbucklers (41-43) wait for the level-48 Booty Bay stop",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:21:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2487,["y"]=0.7701,["x"]=0.2717,["title"]="The Bloodsail Buccaneers",["npcName"]="Fleet Master Seahorn",["pre"]={599},["qlvl"]=43,["quest"]=604,["minLevel"]=37},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Deeg, on the top floor",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale:21:6",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2488,["y"]=0.7735,["x"]=0.2692,