ets, for later in this guide",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:24:7",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=257591,["npcName"]="Ashe Amberhall",["x"]=0.6675,["title"]="Curious Trinkets",["y"]=0.8109999999999999,["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=94881,["minLevel"]=36},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Scraps of Knowledge, for later in this guide",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:24:8",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=257591,["npcName"]="Ashe Amberhall",["x"]=0.6675,["title"]="Scraps of Knowledge",["y"]=0.8109999999999999,["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=94879,["minLevel"]=36},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Cassandra Wheeler, by the inn: Love Thy Neighbor, for Turner's Logging Camp later in this guide",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:24:9",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259863,["npcName"]="Cassandra Wheeler",["x"]=0.6466,["title"]="Love Thy Neighbor",["y"]=0.8288,["qlvl"]=37,["quest"]=95330,["minLevel"]=36},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Barracks Master Harlan, at the inn",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:24:10",["t"]="sethome",["npc"]=257595,["npcName"]="Barracks Master Harlan",["x"]=0.6498,["location"]="Farholde Keep",["y"]=0.8238,["area"]=16724}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:24",["text"]="Farholde Keep",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="On east along the road to Farholde Keep. Gretchen Mayberry, the gryphon master, stands at its western gate; Bertrand Ironbrow and Ember Bladewhisper are on the way in, Brother Lowley tends the wounded by the barracks, Demar Brant and Ashe Amberhall wait in the keep at the east end, and the inn is in the south of the walls."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Bats in the Belfry",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:25:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=262031,["npcName"]="Sister Rowland",["x"]=0.6182,["title"]="Bats in the Belfry",["y"]=0.8308,["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=95603,["minLevel"]=36},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:25:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=262037,["y"]=0.8323,["x"]=0.6179,["title"]="Bats in the Belfry",["lvl"]=38,["target"]="Roosting Duskbat",["count"]=5,["quest"]=95603,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:25:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=262031,["npcName"]="Sister Rowland",["x"]=0.6182,["title"]="Bats in the Belfry",["quest"]=95603,["y"]=0.8308},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Keeping the Light On",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:25:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=262031,["y"]=0.8308,["x"]=0.6182,["title"]="Keeping the Light On",["npcName"]="Sister Rowland",["pre"]={95603},["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=95613,["minLevel"]=36},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Holy Candle",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:25:5",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=272437,["npcName"]="Marla Bell",["x"]=0.622,["item"]=17028,["note"]="Holy Candle, from Marla Bell",["y"]=0.86,["count"]=5},{["map"]=2548,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:25:6",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=262031,["npcName"]="Sister Rowland",["x"]=0.6182,["title"]="Keeping the Light On",["quest"]=95613,["y"]=0.8308},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="In Memoriam",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglade