e's training grounds north of Rog'mar, where this guide goes later: grouping up is advised.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:38",["text"]="WANTED: Blademaster Kaijo",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=95912}}},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Ghostmaw's Fang",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=42},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=95991}},["item"]=271828,["fromRank"]=1,["quest"]=95991,["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=263380,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.578,["x"]=0.529,["title"]="WANTED: Ghostmaw",["from"]="Ghostmaw",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:39:1"}},["detail"]="Ghostmaw, the elite, hunts along the river between Wheeler's Grange and Terral's Watch, on your way north.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:39",["text"]="Ghostmaw",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=95991}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Fuzzle: Biting the Hand",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:40:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259158,["npcName"]="Fuzzle",["x"]=0.47200000000000003,["title"]="Biting the Hand",["y"]=0.512,["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=94961,["minLevel"]=36},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Apprentice Claire: Abominable Magics",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:40:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=256831,["npcName"]="Apprentice Claire",["x"]=0.47600000000000003,["title"]="Abominable Magics",["y"]=0.47200000000000003,["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=95642,["minLevel"]=36},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Indiscriminate Purge",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglade