er",["lvl"]=42,["y"]=0.415,["level"]=44,["spread"]=true,["grind"]=257901}},["detail"]="Before the second wave: its raiders and bombardiers (43-45) and the pirates' ships after them are a level over you below 44.4. Top up on the first camp's buccaneers and musketeers (41-43) at its south-west end, away from the port. Gul'gash, a rare elite of level 49, roams these cliffs: if you see him, keep well away. Or, with a group, run the Uldaman dungeon instead.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:68",["text"]="Level 44.4 on the Eastsea pirates",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["frac"]=0.4,["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=44}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:69:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=257915,["count"]=8,["y"]=0.424,["x"]=0.8345999999999999,["title"]="Unchecked Expansion",["lvl"]=45,["target"]="Eastsea Raider",["quest"]=95122,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:69:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=257916,["y"]=0.33799999999999997,["x"]=0.7909999999999999,["title"]="Unchecked Expansion",["lvl"]=44,["target"]="Eastsea Bombardier",["count"]=8,["quest"]=95122,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Eastsea Powder Keg",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=629451,["t"]="collect",["title"]="A Blast Ye Scurvy Dogs!",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.33,["x"]=0.7979999999999999,["count"]=5,["from"]="Eastsea Powder Keg",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:69:3",["item"]=268346,["quest"]=95123,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:69",["text"]="The pirates' second wave",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="North along the coast from the port: the Eastsea raiders and bombardiers have dug in on the slopes west of the buccaneers' camp, among their powder kegs. They stand close together: pull them one at a time. Gul'gash, a rare elite of level 49, roams these cliffs and the beach below: if you see him, keep well away."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:70:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=260390,["npcName"]="Captain Bentcoin",["x"]=0.912,["title"]="Smuggler's Special",["quest"]=95293,["y"]=0.397},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Captain Haynes: Smuggler's Bargain",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:70:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=260391,["y"]=0.39799999999999996,["x"]=0.912,["title"]="Smuggler's Bargain",["npcName"]="Captain Haynes",["pre"]={95293},["qlvl"]=42,["quest"]=95294,["minLevel"]=38}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:70",["text"]="Captain Bentcoin",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="East along the cliffs to the far end of the pirates' camp: Captain Bentcoin waits by the water, Captain Haynes beside him."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:71:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259961,["npcName"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz",["x"]=0.7945,["title"]="Unchecked Expansion",["quest"]=95122,["y"]=0.5271},{["map"]=2548,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:71:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259961,["npcName"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz",["x"]=0.7945,["title"]="A Blast Ye Scurvy Dogs!",["quest"]=95123,["y"]=0.5271},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="See Ya, Scallywags!",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:71:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259961,["y"]=0.5271,["x"]=0.7945,["title"]="See Ya, Scallywags!",["npcName"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz",["pre"]={95123},["qlvl"]=44,["quest"]=95165,["minLevel"]=38},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Admiral Lamora",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:71:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259961,["y"]=0.5271,["x"]=0.7945,["title"]="Admiral Lamora",["npcName"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz",["pre"]={95123},["qlvl"]=45,["quest"]=95124,["minLevel"]=38},{["map"]=2548,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:71:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=255897,["npcName"]="Friz Frazzlespark",["x"]=0.7709999999999999,["title"]="Smuggler's Bargain",["quest"]=95294,["y"]=0.529}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:71",["text"]="Powderfuse Port",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to the port."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Remote Explosive Charge",["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:72:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.395,["x"]=0.909,["title"]="See Ya, Scallywags!",["note"]="Remote Explosive Charge, the southern ship",["item"]=268505,["quest"]=95165,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:72:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=257861,["y"]=0.3,["x"]=0.9059999999999999,["title"]="Admiral Lamora",["lvl"]=45,["target"]="Admiral Lamora",["count"]=1,["quest"]=95124,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Lamora's Loot",["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=629472,["group"]={["rank"]=2,["kind"]="elite",["near"]=true,["lvl"]=49},["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="object",["item"]=268506,["y"]=0.294,["x"]=0.905,["title"]="Admiral Lamora",["from"]="Lamora's Loot",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:72:3",["count"]=1,["quest"]=95124,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Remote Explosive Charge",["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:72:4",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.29600000000000004,["x"]=0.9059999999999999,["title"]="See Ya, Scallywags!",["note"]="the middle ship",["item"]=268505,["quest"]=95165,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Remote Explosive Charge",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:72:5",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.258,["x"]=0.883,["title"]="See Ya, Scallywags!",["note"]="the northern ship",["item"]=268505,["quest"]=95165,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:72",["text"]="The pirates' ships",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Out to the pirates' cliffs once more. Plant Whizzbuzz's charges on the three ships moored below the camp, south to north; Admiral Lamora (level 45) stands by the middle one, with her loot chest beside her. Keep an eye out for Gul'gash on the way."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Rotflesh Mushroom",["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=630588,["t"]="collect",["title"]="It Takes Guts",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.26,["x"]=0.7559999999999999,["count"]=8,["from"]="Rotflesh Mushroom",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:73:1",["item"]=268664,["quest"]=95261,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:73",["text"]="Rotflesh Mushrooms",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="West from the northern ship, up the ridge: the Rotflesh Mushrooms grow among the rocks, close to the Twilight ogres' camp. The Mature Paletusks on the ridge give entrails too."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:74:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259057,["npcName"]="Dunston Willis",["x"]=0.6862,["title"]="In Need of Relief",["quest"]=96125,["y"]=0.127},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="An Ogre's Captive",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:74:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259057,["y"]=0.127,["x"]=0.6862,["title"]="An Ogre's Captive",["npcName"]="Dunston Willis",["pre"]={96125},["qlvl"]=44,["quest"]=96126,["minLevel"]=38}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:74",["text"]="Bolder'ok",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="North-west to Bolder'ok, the ogres' town. Its ogres side with the Horde and attack you on sight, and Clugfist on his hill in the middle is an elite (level 50): keep to the town's north-eastern edge, where Dunston Willis hides."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Gronok's Key",["oi"]=1,["fromFaction"]="H",["fromId"]=263749,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="npc",["lvl"]=44,["y"]=0.1402,["x"]=0.6779000000000001,["title"]="An Ogre's Captive",["from"]="Gronok the Butcher",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:75:1",["item"]=272190,["quest"]=96126,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:75",["text"]="Gronok's Key",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Gronok the Butcher (level 44) carries the key: he paces the lanes south of Dunston Willis's hut.\nThe Bloodmaster's Ring lies just west of the lanes: its fighters (elites, 41-45) only fight in a bout, so leave them be."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:76:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259057,["npcName"]="Dunston Willis",["x"]=0.6862,["title"]="An Ogre's Captive",["quest"]=96126,["y"]=0.127},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Dunston Checks Out",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:76:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259057,["y"]=0.127,["x"]=0.6862,["title"]="Dunston Checks Out",["npcName"]="Dunston Willis",["pre"]={96126},["qlvl"]=44,["quest"]=94927,["minLevel"]=38},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="help Dunston Willis break out of Bolder'ok",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:76:3",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Help Dunston break out of Bolder'ok"}},["y"]=0.126,["x"]=0.687,["title"]="Dunston Checks Out",["quest"]=94927}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:76",["text"]="Dunston Willis",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Free him, then get him out: Dunston Willis fights his way out of Bolder'ok, and you keep the ogres off him. If he falls, take the quest from him again."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Beast Entrails",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:77:1",["t"]="collect",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["item"]=268632,["k"]="has",["n"]=15}},["y"]=0.498,["x"]=0.787,["title"]="It Takes Guts",["count"]=15,["item"]=268632,["quest"]=95261,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["detail"]="South-east out of the hills towards the port: the shore crawlers on the beach north of the docks are the quickest entrails. Gul'gash wanders down to this beach too.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:77",["text"]="Finish the Beast Entrails",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["item"]=268632,["k"]="has",["n"]=15}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b