e from the camp's edge, and take the Brutes (42-43) on the slopes first."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Thick Yeti Hide",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=8973,["quest"]=2821,["map"]=1444,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=5292,["t"]="collect",["fromAlsoId"]=5293,["title"]="The Mark of Quality",["y"]=0.5881000000000001,["x"]=0.5588000000000001,["count"]=10,["lvl"]=44,["from"]="Feral Scar Yeti",["fromAlso"]="Hulking Feral Scar",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:13:1"},{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Groddoc Liver",["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:13:2",["t"]="collect",["title"]="Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail",["y"]=0.565,["x"]=0.575,["carriedTo"]="forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris",["lvl"]=43,["item"]=6259,["count"]=3,["quest"]=1452,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:13",["text"]="Feral Scar Vale",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride north into the yeti valley. Every Feral Scar yeti can drop a thick hide; Bloodroar the Stalker (level 48) prowls the middle."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Mysterious Relic",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Mysterious Relic; below ground",["fromId"]=8136,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=2870,["count"]=1,["y"]=0.705,["x"]=0.285,["item"]=9248,["from"]="Lord Shalzaru",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:14:1",["title"]="Against Lord Shalzaru",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:14",["text"]="Isle of Dread",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Isle of Dread is the island just south of Sardor Isle: swim over. Hatecrest Serpent Guards and Sorceresses hold it; Lord Shalzaru (level 47) waits in the cave at its south end. Pull his guards first."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:11:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7877,["npcName"]="Latronicus Moonspear",["x"]=0.3038,["title"]="Against Lord Shalzaru",["quest"]=2870,["y"]=0.4617},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:11:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7877,["y"]=0.4617,["x"]=0.3038,["title"]="Delivering the Relic",["npcName"]="Latronicus Moonspear",["pre"]={2870},["qlvl"]=45,["quest"]=2871,["minLevel"]=40},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:11:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7878,["npcName"]="Vestia Moonspear",["x"]=0.30079999999999996,["title"]="Delivering the Relic",["quest"]=2871,["y"]=0.4506},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:9:7",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7900,["npcName"]="Angelas Moonbreeze",["x"]=0.31829999999999997,["title"]="The High Wilderness",["quest"]=2982,["y"]=0.4561},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:9:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7880,["npcName"]="Ginro Hearthkindle",["x"]=0.3186,["title"]="Boat Wreckage",["quest"]=4127,["y"]=0.45130000000000003},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:9:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7880,["y"]=0.45130000000000003,["x"]=0.3186,["title"]="The Knife Revealed",["npcName"]="Ginro Hearthkindle",["pre"]={4127},["qlvl"]=44,["quest"]=4129,["minLevel"]=40},{["map"]=1444,["note"]="Quintis Jonespyre, upstairs",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:9:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7879,["npcName"]="Quintis Jonespyre",["x"]=0.3245,["title"]="The Knife Revealed",["quest"]=4129,["y"]=0.4379},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:9:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7879,["y"]=0.4379,["x"]=0.3245,["title"]="Psychometric Reading",["npcName"]="Quintis Jonespyre",["pre"]={4129},["qlvl"]=44,["quest"]=4130,["minLevel"]=40},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:9:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7880,["npcName"]="Ginro Hearthkindle",["x"]=0.3186,["title"]="Psychometric Reading",["quest"]=4130,["y"]=0.45130000000000003},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:9:6",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7880,["y"]=0.45130000000000003,["x"]=0.3186,["title"]="The Woodpaw Gnolls",["npcName"]="Ginro Hearthkindle",["pre"]={4130},["qlvl"]=44,["quest"]=4131,["minLevel"]=40},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:9:8",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7852,["npcName"]="Pratt McGrubben",["x"]=0.3063,["title"]="The Mark of Quality",["quest"]=2821,["y"]=0.42710000000000004},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:15:12",["text"]="Pratt McGrubben's next order, Improved Quality, wants Rage Scar hides from yetis of 46-49: skip it.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:15",["text"]="Feathermoon Stronghold",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Coming from the south: Latronicus Moonspear and Vestia Moonspear first, then Angelas Moonbreeze beside Ginro Hearthkindle's building, then the stairs. Ginro Hearthkindle stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart. Pratt McGrubben is by the flight master, on the way out."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["x"]=0.303,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["text"]="Feathermoon flight master",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:16:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.433,["soloWhen"]={{["name"]="Thalanaar",["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi"}}},{["area"]=489,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Thalanaar",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:16:2",["t"]="fly",["node"]=31,["soloWhen"]={{["name"]="Thalanaar",["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi"}}}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:16",["text"]="Fly to Thalanaar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["name"]="Thalanaar",["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi"}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:17:1",["t"]="goto",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["name"]="Thalanaar",["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi"}},["y"]=0.42700000000000005,["x"]=0.433,["text"]="Forgotten Coast",["area"]=1108}},["detail"]="You came into Feralas from Shen'dralas, so Thalanaar's flight path is still to learn: take the boat back to the coast and ride east along the road; you pick up the flight path when this guide ends at Thalanaar.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:17",["text"]="Back to the coast",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["name"]="Thalanaar",["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi"}}},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:18",["text"]="Feralas",["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["x"]=0.659,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:18:1",["text"]="Grimtotem camp",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.457}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:19:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7956,["y"]=0.45649999999999996,["x"]=0.6594,["title"]="Freedom for All Creatures",["npcName"]="Kindal Moonweaver",["limit"]=360,["qlvl"]=47,["quest"]=2969,["minLevel"]=38},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:19:2",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Save at least 6 Sprite Darters from capture"}},["title"]="Freedom for All Creatures",["startItemName"]="Bamboo Cage Key",["startItem"]=12301,["t"]="complete",["quest"]=2969,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:12:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7956,["npcName"]="Kindal Moonweaver",["x"]=0.6594,["title"]="Freedom for All Creatures",["quest"]=2969,["y"]=0.45649999999999996},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:12:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7957,["y"]=0.4561,["x"]=0.6595,["title"]="Doling Justice",["npcName"]="Jer'kai Moonweaver",["pre"]={2969},["qlvl"]=47,["quest"]=2970,["minLevel"]=38}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:19",["text"]="Grimtotem camp",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="From Thalanaar ride west along the road to the Grimtotem camp north of it. Kindal Moonweaver waits outside it; free the Sprite Darters from the pen in the middle and keep Kindal Moonweaver and at least six of them alive."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:20:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7726,["y"]=0.4622,["x"]=0.6683,["title"]="Doling Justice",["lvl"]=42,["target"]="Grimtotem Naturalist",["count"]=12,["quest"]=2970,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1444,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:20:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7725,["y"]=0.4619,["x"]=0.6661,["title"]="Doling Justice",["lvl"]=43,["target"]="Grimtotem Raider",["count"]=10,["quest"]=2970,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1444,["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:20:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7727,["y"]=0.46380000000000005,["x"]=0.6663,["title"]="Doling Justice",["lvl"]=44,["target"]="Grimtotem Shaman",["count"]=6,["quest"]=2970,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:20",["text"]="Grimtotem tauren",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Careful: Namida Grimtotem, an elite of level 43, stands at the camp's north-east edge, around 67,39: pull the Naturalists, Raiders and Shamans away from her."},{["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:14",["text"]="Jer'kai Moonweaver",["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:14:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7957,["npcName"]="Jer'kai Moonweaver",["x"]=0.6595,["title"]="Doling Justice",["quest"]=2970,["y"]=0.4561},{["map"]=1444,["note"]="for Tyrande in Darnassus: the route takes you there at 47",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:14:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7957,["y"]=0.4561,["x"]=0.6595,["title"]="Doling Justice",["npcName"]="Jer'kai Moonweaver",["pre"]={2970},["qlvl"]=47,["quest"]=2972,["minLevel"]=38}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:15:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.5631,["x"]=0.7332,["title"]="The Woodpaw Gnolls",["objName"]="Large Leather Backpacks",["quest"]=4131,["object"]=164953},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:15:2",["t"]="accept",["object"]=164953,["y"]=0.5631,["x"]=0.7332,["qlvl"]=46,["objName"]="Large Leather Backpacks",["pre"]={4131},["minLevel"]=40,["quest"]=4135,["title"]="The Writhing Deep"},{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Undelivered Parcel",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["fromId"]=164953,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.5631,["x"]=0.7332,["item"]=11463,["from"]="Large Leather Backpacks",["note"]="Undelivered Parcel, from the backpacks",["fromKind"]="object",["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:15:3"},{["itemName"]="Undelivered Parcel",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:15:4",["t"]="accept",["title"]="Thalanaar Delivery",["qlvl"]=44,["pre"]={4131},["minLevel"]=40,["quest"]=4281,["item"]=11463},{["map"]=1444,["note"]="Zukk'ash Pod, inside",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:15:5",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.6372,["x"]=0.7206999999999999,["title"]="The Writhing Deep",["objName"]="Zukk'ash Pod",["quest"]=4135,["object"]=164954},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:15:6",["t"]="accept",["object"]=164954,["y"]=0.6372,["x"]=0.7206999999999999,["qlvl"]=46,["objName"]="Zukk'ash Pod",["pre"]={4135},["minLevel"]=40,["quest"]=4265,["title"]="Freed from the Hive"},{["title"]="Freed from the Hive",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Free Raschal."}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:22:7",["t"]="complete",["quest"]=4265,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:22",["text"]="The Writhing Deep",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride south-east to the Woodpaw gnolls; the courier's backpacks lie in their southern camp, and a parcel inside them starts a delivery to Thalanaar. The Zukk'ash hive is just south: fight down to the pod that holds Raschal, free him and keep him alive on the way out."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["note"]="grind on Feral Scar Yeti at Feral Scar Vale, Feralas",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:23:1",["t"]="level",["npcName"]="Feral Scar Yeti",["x"]=0.5652,["lvl"]=44,["level"]=45,["y"]=0.565,["grind"]=5292}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:23",["text"]="Grind to 45",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride west into Feral Scar Vale: its yetis are 43-45. The Rage Scar yetis in the hills to the north are 46-49: leave them. Or, with a group, run the Zul'Farrak dungeon instead."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Ironfur Liver",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["carriedTo"]="forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris",["fromRank"]=4,["quest"]=1452,["map"]=1444,["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=5352,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.473,["x"]=0.532,["count"]=3,["from"]="Old Grizzlegut",["title"]="Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail",["item"]=6258,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:24:1"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:24",["text"]="Ironfur bears",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride north out of Feral Scar Vale: the Ironfur Bears (41-42) at the foot of the High Wilderness drop Rhapsody's last liver.\nCareful: Ironfur Patriarchs (48-49) and the Rage Scar yetis (46-49) roam the hills further north: stay at their edge."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:21:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7880,["npcName"]="Ginro Hearthkindle",["x"]=0.3186,["title"]="Freed from the Hive",["quest"]=4265,["y"]=0.45130000000000003},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:21:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7880,["y"]=0.45130000000000003,["x"]=0.3186,["title"]="A Hero's Welcome",["npcName"]="Ginro Hearthkindle",["pre"]={4265},["qlvl"]=46,["quest"]=4266,["minLevel"]=40},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:21:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3936,["npcName"]="Shandris Feathermoon",["x"]=0.3028,["title"]="A Hero's Welcome",["quest"]=4266,["y"]=0.4617},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:25:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3936,["y"]=0.4617,["x"]=0.3028,["title"]="Rise of the Silithid",["npcName"]="Shandris Feathermoon",["pre"]={4266},["qlvl"]=46,["quest"]=4267,["minLevel"]=40}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:25",["text"]="Feathermoon Stronghold",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ginro Hearthkindle stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:26",["text"]="Feathermoon Stronghold",["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:21:5",["text"]="Shandris Feathermoon then asks you to carry news to Darnassus: skip it, Gadgetzan sends you there instead.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["x"]=0.303,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["text"]="Feathermoon flight master",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:27:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.433,["soloWhen"]={{["name"]="Thalanaar",["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi"}}},{["area"]=489,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Thalanaar",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:27:2",["t"]="fly",["node"]=31,["soloWhen"]={{["name"]="Thalanaar",["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi"}}}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:27",["text"]="Fly to Thalanaar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["name"]="Thalanaar",["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi"}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:goal:28:1",["t"]="goto",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["name"]="Thalanaar",["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi"}},["y"]=0.45899999999999996,["x"]=0.895,["text"]="Thalanaar",["area"]=489}},["detail"]="No flight path to Thalanaar yet: take the boat back to the coast and ride east along the road to Thalanaar, on the Thousand Needles border.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas:step:28",["text"]="Ride to Thalanaar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["name"]="Thalanaar",["node"]=31,["k"]="taxi"}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["not