:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:step:10",["text"]="Lost Rigger Cove: kill these as you meet them",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Follow the coast south to the pirate cove. Southsea pirates crowd the beach and the boats: work along the edge and pull one at a time. Andre Firebeard stands on the far side; Stoley's stolen cargo lies in the camp.\nCareful: Two or three pirates stand with Andre Firebeard, and many more pirates from the town join the fight once it starts."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:step:11",["text"]="Steamwheedle Port",["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["note"]="Stoley, inside",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7881,["npcName"]="Stoley",["x"]=0.6711,["title"]="Stoley's Shipment",["quest"]=2873,["y"]=0.2398},{["map"]=1446,["note"]="\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley in Booty Bay: the route takes you there at the end of the Hinterlands guide, keep it",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:11:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7881,["y"]=0.2398,["x"]=0.6711,["title"]="Deliver to MacKinley",["npcName"]="Stoley",["pre"]={2873},["qlvl"]=45,["quest"]=2874,["minLevel"]=40},{["map"]=1446,["note"]="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle, inside",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:7:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7882,["npcName"]="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle",["x"]=0.6706,["title"]="WANTED: Andre Firebeard",["quest"]=2875,["y"]=0.2389},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:7:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7882,["npcName"]="Security Chief Bilgewhizzle",["x"]=0.6706,["title"]="Southsea Shakedown",["quest"]=8366,["y"]=0.2389},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:7:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=15165,["npcName"]="Haughty Modiste",["x"]=0.6656,["title"]="Pirate Hats Ahoy!",["quest"]=8365,["y"]=0.2227}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Wastewander Water Pouch",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=8483,["spread"]=true,["map"]=1446,["fromId"]=5617,["fromNpcsAt"]="3,1;1,3;2,4;2,4,5;2,4,5;4;4,2;2,4,5;6;1,3;2,4,5;1,3;1,3;3;2,4,5;1,3;4,2,5;2,5,4;2,4,5",["fromAlsoId"]=5616,["from"]="Wastewander Shadow Mage",["y"]=0.2909,["x"]=0.6393,["count"]=5,["lvl"]=45,["fromAlso"]="Wastewander Thief",["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:12:1"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:step:12",["text"]="Noonshade Ruins",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Careful: Thieves cast Disarm. Rogues stay hidden with Sneak. Assassins use Execute when your health is at 20% or lower."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["y"]=0.2845,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:13:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7408,["soloWhen"]={{["item"]=8483,["k"]="has",["n"]=5}},["npcName"]="Spigot Operator Luglunket",["x"]=0.5249,["title"]="Water Pouch Bounty",["direct"]=true,["pre"]={1707},["qlvl"]=44,["quest"]=1878,["minLevel"]=40}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:step:13",["text"]="Gadgetzan",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["item"]=8483,["k"]="has",["n"]=5}}},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:step:14",["text"]="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle",["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:11:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7407,["npcName"]="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle",["x"]=0.5246,["title"]="More Wastewander Justice",["quest"]=1691,["y"]=0.2851}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["itemName"]="Untapped Dowsing Widget",["oi"]=1,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:12:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.284,["x"]=0.39899999999999997,["title"]="Gadgetzan Water Survey",["note"]="Gives the Tapped Dowsing Widget",["item"]=8584,["text"]="Pool by Sandsorrow Watch",["quest"]=992,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:12",["text"]="The pool by Sandsorrow Watch",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride north-west to the Sandfury troll camp at Sandsorrow Watch. Use the Untapped Dowsing Widget at the edge of its pool to tap it; the trolls stand close, so pull the nearest first.\nCareful: tapping the pool brings Scarabs (level 44-47) out of the sand to attack you: tap it, then step away from the trolls and fight the Scarabs one by one."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:16:1",["t"]="goto",["soloWhen"]={{["map"]=209,["k"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={2865,2768,3042}}},["y"]=0.201,["x"]=0.387,["location"]="Zul'Farrak",["area"]=978},{["map"]=1446,["note"]="Scarab Shells: the Scarabs, inside",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["map"]=209,["kind"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=5,["text"]="Uncracked Scarab Shell"}},["soloWhen"]={{["map"]=209,["k"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={2865,2768,3042}}},["y"]=0.201,["x"]=0.387,["title"]="Scarab Shells",["quest"]=2865,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:16:2"},{["map"]=1446,["note"]="Troll Temper: the Sandfury trolls, inside",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["map"]=209,["kind"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=20,["text"]="Troll Temper"}},["soloWhen"]={{["map"]=209,["k"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={2865,2768,3042}}},["y"]=0.201,["x"]=0.387,["title"]="Troll Temper",["quest"]=3042,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:16:3"},{["map"]=1446,["note"]="Divino-matic Rod: Sergeant Bly, inside",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["map"]=209,["kind"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Divino-matic Rod"}},["soloWhen"]={{["map"]=209,["k"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={2865,2768,3042}}},["y"]=0.201,["x"]=0.387,["title"]="Divino-matic Rod",["quest"]=2768,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:16:4"}},["detail"]="Zul'Farrak is a dungeon for a group of five; its quests here are level 45 to 47. Its gate lies about 400 yards north of the pool.\nInside: the Scarabs drop the shells, every Sandfury troll can drop Troll Temper, and Sergeant Bly carries the Divino-matic Rod.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:step:16",["text"]="Zul'Farrak",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["map"]=209,["k"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={2865,2768,3042}}}},{["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:13",["text"]="Gadgetzan",["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:13:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7724,["npcName"]="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser",["x"]=0.5021,["title"]="Gadgetzan Water Survey",["quest"]=992,["y"]=0.2748},{["map"]=1446,["note"]="keep it: the Noxious Lair's Centipaar (48-50) wait for the Un'Goro guide's Gadgetzan landing at about 49.5",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/40-50/04-tanaris:13:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7724,["y"]=0.2748,["x"]=0.5021,["title"]="Noxious Lair Investigation",["npcName"]="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser",["pre"]={992},["qlvl"]=47,["quest"]=82,["minLevel"]=39}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["map"]=209,["kind"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7876,["sol