2989}},["detail"]="Ride south-east to the Altar of Zul, the stepped Vilebranch temple in the south of the The Hinterlands, and climb to the top. Qiaga and Morta'gya the Keeper (elite, 50) stand up there: touch the top and come straight back down.\nCareful: Elite trolls guard the top platform, including Qiaga the Keeper and Morta'gya the Keeper, along with several Vilebranch Soothsayers. The soothsayers cast spells and are linked to the rest of the group.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:step:1",["text"]="The Altar of Zul",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={2989}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1425,["itemName"]="Vilebranch Totem",["oi"]=1,["count"]=12,["fromId"]=4467,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=86616,["lvl"]=47,["y"]=0.667,["x"]=0.45299999999999996,["item"]=279225,["from"]="Vilebranch Soothsayer",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:2:1",["title"]="Repurposed Totems",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:step:2",["text"]="Vilebranch Soothsayers",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Vilebranch Soothsayers (46-47) walk the ground around the foot of the Altar of Zul: their totems are for Maret Firetend. Careful: Qiaga the Keeper and Morta'gya the Keeper (50, elites) stand on the altar's south-east side: take the Soothsayers on its west side, away from them, and stay off the altar."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1425,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:goal:3:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2655,["count"]=10,["y"]=0.5537,["x"]=0.4886,["title"]="Skulk Rock Clean-up",["lvl"]=47,["target"]="Green Sludge",["quest"]=2877,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1425,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/05-t