Compound",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride south to the ogre compound. Brutes and Enforcers (46-48) fill it; Gor'marok the Ravager (49) stands in the middle with guards around him: clear them first."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["itemName"]="Laden Dew Gland",["oi"]=1,["count"]=1,["fromId"]=5481,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=2605,["lvl"]=48,["y"]=0.6472,["x"]=0.3124,["item"]=8428,["from"]="Thistleshrub Dew Collector",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:goal:10:1",["title"]="The Thirsty Goblin",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1446,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:goal:10:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=5485,["y"]=0.6531999999999999,["x"]=0.31010000000000004,["title"]="Thistleshrub Valley",["lvl"]=50,["target"]="Thistleshrub Rootshaper",["count"]=8,["quest"]=3362,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1446,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:goal:10:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=5490,["y"]=0.6554000000000001,["x"]=0.3122,["title"]="Thistleshrub Valley",["lvl"]=49,["target"]="Gnarled Thistleshrub",["count"]=8,["quest"]=3362,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:step:10",["text"]="Thistleshrub Valley: kill these as you meet them",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride west into Thistleshrub Valley. The Dew Collectors drop the glands; only some are full, so keep the Laden one. Gnarled Thistleshrubs and Rootshapers share the valley.\nCareful: the thistleshrubs wander a lot, so you can easily pull extra mobs."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater:goal:11:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11758,["npcName"]="Andi Lynn",["x"]=0.5282,["title"]="The Dunemaul Compound",["