p through Sanath Lim-yo's teleport."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:29:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8405,["npcName"]="Ogtinc",["x"]=0.424,["title"]="The Ichor of Undeath",["only"]={["classes"]={"PRIEST"}},["quest"]=8256,["y"]=0.42619999999999997}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:29",["text"]="Ogtinc",["only"]={["classes"]={"PRIEST"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:16:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8392,["npcName"]="Pilot Xiggs Fuselighter",["x"]=0.7781,["title"]="Arcane Runes",["quest"]=3449,["y"]=0.914},{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:16:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8392,["y"]=0.914,["x"]=0.7781,["title"]="Return to Tymor",["npcName"]="Pilot Xiggs Fuselighter",["pre"]={3449},["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=3461,["minLevel"]=45}},["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:16",["text"]="Ravencrest Monument",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Swim to the small island off the southern tip of Azshara. If Pilot Xiggs Fuselighter isn't there, fire your Standard Issue Flare Gun to signal him, and wait for him to land."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:31:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=239822,["npcName"]="Commander Truesong",["x"]=0.11810000000000001,["title"]="Preserving Eldarath",["quest"]=88809,["y"]=0.7836}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:31",["text"]="Talrendis Point",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Truesong at Talrendis Point before you hearth."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["x"]=0.1815,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:32:1",["text"]="Ironforge inn",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.5145000000000001}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:32",["text"]="To Ironforge",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Your Hearthstone is set at Ironforge (the Hinterlands guide binds it there): hearth back to the inn."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:33",["text"]="Ironforge",["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["note"]="Tymor, Mystic Ward",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:17:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8507,["npcName"]="Tymor",["x"]=0.3096,["title"]="Return to Tymor",["quest"]=3461,["y"]=0.0483}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:34:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8879,["npcName"]="Royal Historian Archesonus",["x"]=0.3837,["title"]="The Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan",["y"]=0.5531,["qlvl"]=54,["quest"]=3702,["minLevel"]=50},{["map"]=1455,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:34:2",["t"]="talk",["npc"]=8879,["npcName"]="Royal Historian Archesonus",["x"]=0.3837,["title"]="The Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan",["y"]=0.5531,["quest"]=3702,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1455,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:34:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8879,["npcName"]="Royal Historian Archesonus",["x"]=0.3837,["title"]="The Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan",["quest"]=3702,["y"]=0.5531}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:34",["text"]="Royal Historian Archesonus",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Archesonus stands beside King Magni in the High Seat."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["note"]="The relics are in the Burning Steppes: keep it",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:35:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8879,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=3701}},["y"]=0.5531,["x"]=0.3837,["title"]="The Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan",["npcName"]="Royal Historian Archesonus",["pre"]={3702},["qlvl"]=54,["quest"]=3701,["minLevel"]=50}},["detail"]="The Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan is a group quest at this level: its relics stand among War Reavers and Firewalkers of 53-55, with Thauris Balgarr (57) close by, two to five over you, and the route has no later Burning Steppes visit. Grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Skip it if you are alone.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:35",["text"]="Royal Historian Archesonus",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=3701}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["x"]=0.5589999999999999,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["text"]="Ironforge flight master",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:36:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.479,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2944}}},{["area"]=348,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Aerie Peak",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:36:2",["t"]="fly",["node"]=43,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2944}}}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:36",["text"]="Fly to Aerie Peak",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2944}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["x"]=0.5589999999999999,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["text"]="Ironforge flight master",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:37:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.479,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=2944}}},{["area"]=271,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Southshore",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:37:2",["t"]="fly",["node"]=14,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=2944}}}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:37",["text"]="Fly to Southshore",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=2944}}},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Snapshot of Gammerita",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["size"]=2,["kind"]="group"},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2944}},["item"]=9330,["fromRank"]=1,["quest"]=2944,["map"]=1425,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=7977,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.5820000000000001,["x"]=0.804,["title"]="The Super Snapper FX",["from"]="Gammerita",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:38:1"},{["map"]=1425,["itemName"]="Super Snapper FX",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:38:2",["t"]="use",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2944}},["y"]=0.5820000000000001,["x"]=0.804,["title"]="The Super Snapper FX",["item"]=9328,["quest"]=2944,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["detail"]="These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Gammerita (level 48 elite) needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.\nGammerita walks the Hinterlands shore below the Overlook Cliffs, from the arrow south to about 75,66 and north to about 82,52: if she isn't at the arrow, follow the shore.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:38",["text"]="The Super Snapper FX",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2944}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1425,["x"]=0.111,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["text"]="Aerie Peak flight master",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:39:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.461,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2944}}},{["area"]=271,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Southshore",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:39:2",["t"]="fly",["node"]=14,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2944}}}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:39",["text"]="Fly to Southshore",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2944}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1416,["x"]=0.21600000000000003,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:40:1",["text"]="Orphan Matron Aria",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.732},{["map"]=1416,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:40:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=34365,["npcName"]="Orphan Matron Aria",["x"]=0.2162,["title"]="The Orphan",["y"]=0.7318000000000001,["qlvl"]=54,["quest"]=96797,["minLevel"]=45}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:40",["text"]="Orphan Matron Aria",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride north from Southshore into Alterac and west to the walls of Dalaran: Orphan Matron Aria stands outside them. Her quest goes to Lieutenant Connar in Nethergarde Keep, where this guide flies later."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["x"]=0.429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["y"]=0.85,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:41:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Chillwind Camp",["area"]=3197}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:s