the Scourge here drop Scourgestones.\nCareful: These undead notice you from far away, and other undead nearby join the fight when one is pulled.\nCareful: The Eye of Naxxramas (3 spawns, 15 min respawn) turns invisible when out of combat and calls in Rockwing Gargoyles once a fight starts."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:44:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10838,["npcName"]="Commander Ashlam Valorfist",["x"]=0.42700000000000005,["title"]="Clear the Way",["quest"]=5092,["y"]=0.8403},{["map"]=1422,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:44:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10838,["y"]=0.8403,["x"]=0.42700000000000005,["title"]="The Scourge Cauldrons",["npcName"]="Commander Ashlam Valorfist",["pre"]={5092},["qlvl"]=53,["quest"]=5215,["minLevel"]=50},{["map"]=1422,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:44:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11053,["npcName"]="High Priestess MacDonnell",["x"]=0.42969999999999997,["title"]="The Scourge Cauldrons",["quest"]=5215,["y"]=0.845},{["map"]=1422,["note"]="keep it: the Felstone Field cauldron waits for the Winterspring guide's Chillwind stop, at about 55",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:44:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11053,["y"]=0.845,["x"]=0.42969999999999997,["title"]="Target: Felstone Field",["npcName"]="High Priestess MacDonnell",["pre"]={5215},["qlvl"]=53,["quest"]=5216,["minLevel"]=50}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:44",["text"]="Chillwind Camp",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride back south to the camp."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["note"]="Upstairs",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:45:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10778,["npcName"]="Janice Felstone",["x"]=0.384,["title"]="Better Late Than Never",["y"]=0.5405,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=5021,["minLevel"]=50},{["map"]=1422,["note"]="Janice's Parcel, inside",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:45:2",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.5524,["x"]=0.3873,["title"]="Better Late Than Never",["objName"]="Janice's Parcel",["quest"]=5021,["object"]=175894},{["map"]=1422,["note"]="For Stormwind: keep it",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:45:3",["t"]="accept",["object"]=175894,["y"]=0.5524,["x"]=0.3873,["qlvl"]=52,["objName"]="Janice's Parcel",["pre"]={5021},["minLevel"]=50,["quest"]=5022,["title"]="Better Late Than Never"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:45",["text"]="Janice Felstone",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Janice Felstone's ghost wanders by the farmhouse of Felstone Field, west of Dalson's Tears; her parcel lies inside."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["x"]=0.43,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["text"]="Chillwind Camp flight master",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:46:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.851,["soloWhen"]={{["name"]="Morgan's Vigil",["node"]=71,["k"]="taxi"}}},{["area"]=2418,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Morgan's Vigil",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:46:2",["t"]="fly",["node"]=71,["soloWhen"]={{["name"]="Morgan's Vigil",["node"]=71,["k"]="taxi"}}}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:46",["text"]="Fly to Morgan's Vigil",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["s