star:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:49",["text"]="Morgan's Vigil",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Morgan's Vigil sits in the south-east of the Steppes, at the top of the pass up from Redridge."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["x"]=0.787,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["text"]="Firegut Ogre",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:50:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.447,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=52}}},{["map"]=1428,["note"]="grind on Firegut Ogre",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:50:2",["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=52}},["npcName"]="Firegut Ogre",["x"]=0.7829999999999999,["lvl"]=51,["level"]=52,["y"]=0.4355,["grind"]=7033}},["detail"]="Top up first to level 52 on the Firegut Ogres (50-51) on the near side of Dreadmaul Rock, north of the Vigil: the Brutes on its east side are 52-53. Or, with a group, run the Sunken Temple dungeon instead.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:50",["text"]="Level 52 at Dreadmaul Rock",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=52}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["note"]="Firegut Ogre Mage, below ground",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:51:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7034,["y"]=0.4404,["x"]=0.7895,["title"]="Extinguish the Firegut",["lvl"]=52,["target"]="Firegut Ogre Mage",["count"]=15,["quest"]=3823,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1428,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:51:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7033,["y"]=0.4355,["x"]=0.7829999999999999,["title"]="Extinguish the Firegut",["lvl"]=51,["target"]="Firegut Ogre",["count"]=15,["quest"]=3823,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1428,["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:51:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7035,["y"]=0.4302,["x"]=0.7915000000000001,["title"]="Extinguish the Firegut",["lvl"]=53,["target"]="Firegut Brute",["count"]=7,["quest"]=3823,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:51",["text"]="Dreadmaul Rock",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Firegut ogres hold the great rock north of the Vigil, with the Brutes on its east side.\nCareful: Escaped Core Hounds (level 60) roam the Steppes, a few on the slopes west and south of Dreadmaul Rock: pull the ogres on the rock itself and look around before each pull."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:52",["text"]="Morgan's Vigil",["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:21:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9177,["npcName"]="Oralius",["x"]=0.8456,["title"]="Extinguish the Firegut",["quest"]=3823,["y"]=0.6868000000000001},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:52:2",["text"]="Oralius' next tasks (Gor'tesh, and fifty Blackrock Medallions) send you among the Blackrock orcs of 55-58 at the foot of Blackrock Mountain: skip them.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:22:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10267,["npcName"]="Tinkee Steamboil",["x"]=0.6524,["title"]="Broodling Essence",["y"]=0.24,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=4726,["minLevel"]=50}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:53",["text"]="Flame Crest",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Follow the road west, then climb north to the goblin camp on Flame Crest."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["itemName"]="Broodling Essence",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=175264,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Broodling Essence",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.3124,["x"]=0.6113000000000001,["count"]=8,["from"]="Broodling Essence",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:54:1",["item"]=12283,["quest"]=4726,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1428,["itemName"]="Draco-Incarcinatrix 900",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:54:2",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.28,["x"]=0.81,["title"]="Broodling Essence",["item"]=12284,["quest"]=4726,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:54",["text"]="Ruins of Thaurissan: kill these as you meet them",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Use the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on a Black Broodling on the slopes east of Flame Crest just before it dies, then loot the essence it leaves.\nCareful: a Malfunctioning Reaver (level 56, rare) walks the slopes by the broodlings, and the Black Dragonspawn and Wyrmkin around them are elite: use the Incarcinatrix on a broodling at the edge and look around before each pull."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:55:1",["t"]="interact",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=3701},{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={3701}}},["y"]=0.3393,["x"]=0.7239,["title"]="The Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan",["objName"]="Thaurissan Relic",["object"]=153556,["quest"]=3701,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["detail"]="The relics are the carved stones scattered through the Ruins of Thaurissan around Flame Crest: click them until the information is recovered. Take the ones on the ruins' southern edge, nearest Flame Crest.\nCareful: the ruins' War Reavers and Thaurissan Firewalkers are 53-55, and Thauris Balgarr (57) holds the Dark Iron camp south-west of Flame Crest: take the relics at the edge of the ruins, pull one at a time, and keep away from the camp.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:55",["text"]="Ruins of Thaurissan",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=3701},{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={3701}}}},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:step:56",["text"]="Flame Crest",["goals"]={{["map"]=1428,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:26:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10267,["npcName"]="Tinkee Steamboil",["x"]=0.6524,["title"]="Broodling Essence",["quest"]=4726,["y"]=0.24},{["map"]=1428,["note"]="Ends with Felnok Steelspring in Everlook, Winterspring: keep it",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:26:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10267,["y"]=0.24,["x"]=0.6524,["title"]="Felnok Steelspring",["npcName"]="Tinkee Steamboil",["pre"]={4726},["qlvl"]=54,["quest"]=4808,["minLevel"]=50}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["note"]="Below ground",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={9459},["npc"]=9459,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=3481}},["npcName"]="Cyrus Therepentous",["qlvl"]=54,["quest"]=4022,["map"]=1428,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes:goal:57:1",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=5450,["closedBy"]={4023},["x"]=0.9509000000000001,["title"]="A Taste of Flame",["pre"]={3481},["y"]=0.3156,["minLevel"]=52},{["itemName"]="Black Dragonflight Molt",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=3481}},["item"]=10575,["fromRank"]=1,["quest"]=4022,["map"]=1428,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=9461,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.318,["x"]=0.9440000000000001,["title"]="A Taste of Flame",["from"]="Frenzied Black Drake",["note"]="Black Dragonflight Molt, from the hoard",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever