th of Timbermaw Hold; Nafien guards it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/02-felwood:goal:22:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7156,["y"]=0.0605,["x"]=0.6368,["title"]="Deadwood of the North",["lvl"]=54,["target"]="Deadwood Den Watcher",["count"]=6,["quest"]=8461,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1448,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/02-felwood:goal:22:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7157,["y"]=0.0733,["x"]=0.6296,["title"]="Deadwood of the North",["lvl"]=55,["target"]="Deadwood Avenger",["count"]=6,["quest"]=8461,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1448,["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/02-felwood:goal:22:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7158,["y"]=0.07139999999999999,["x"]=0.6271,["title"]="Deadwood of the North",["lvl"]=54,["target"]="Deadwood Shaman",["count"]=6,["quest"]=8461,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1448,["itemName"]="Deadwood Ritual Totem",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/02-felwood:goal:22:4",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.07139999999999999,["x"]=0.6271,["item"]=20741,["lvl"]=55},{["itemName"]="Deadwood Ritual Totem",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/02-felwood:goal:22:5",["t"]="accept",["title"]="Deadwood Ritual Totem",["qlvl"]=55,["minLevel"]=45,["quest"]=8470,["item"]=20741}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/02-felwood:step:22",["text"]="Felpaw Village",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Deadwood furbolgs of Felpaw Village fill the hills west of the cave. Keep killing them until one drops a Deadwood Ritual Totem, about one kill in thirty, then right-click it: Kernda in Timbermaw Hold takes it once the Timbermaw are Neutral to you, now if they already are, or when the last guide passes the cave again at 58.\nCareful: Den Watchers are level 53-54 and the Avengers 54-55; they call nearby allies within 25 yd once below 50% health and run off for help below 15%."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/02-felwood:step:23",["text"]="Nafien",["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/02-felwood:17:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=15395,["npcName"]="Nafien",["x"]=0.6476999999999999,["title"]="Deadwood of the North",["quest"]=8461,["y"]=0.08130000000000001},{["map"]=1448,["note"]="Salfa stands at the Winterspring end of the tunnel: keep it",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/02-felwood:17:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=15395,["y"]=0.08130000000000001,["x"]=0.6476999999999999,["title"]="Speak to Salfa",["npcName"]="Nafien",["pre"]={8461},["qlvl"]=55,["quest"]=8465,["minLevel"]=45}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["y"]=0.08130000000000001,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/02-felwood:goal:24:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=15395,["soloWhen"]={{["item"]=21377,["k"]="has",["n"]=5}},["npcName"]="Nafien",["x"]=0.6476999999999999,["title"]="Feathers for Nafien",["direct"]=true,["pre"]={8461},["qlvl"]=55,["quest"]=8467,["minLevel"]=45}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/02-felwood:step:24",["text"]="Nafien",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["item"]=21377,["k"]="has",["n"]=5}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/02-felwood:18:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11558,["npcName"]="Kernda",["x"]=0.655,["title"]="Deadwood Ritual Totem",["note"]="Kernda: the Timbermaw speak to you only from Neutral; walks around here: look inside the circle on the map",["quest"]=8470,["y"]=0.0352}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/02-felwood:step:25",["text"]="