er/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:step:64",["text"]="Rockbiter",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The giant Rockbiter sits just north-west of Gregan Brewspewer's camp."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Evoroot",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["fromId"]=164798,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.102,["x"]=0.445,["item"]=11242,["from"]="Evoroot",["fromKind"]="object",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:goal:65:1"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:step:65",["text"]="Evoroot",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Evoroot grows inside a ruined building north of Rockbiter: climb in through the break in its wall from the ledge beside it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:goal:66:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7774,["npcName"]="Shay Leafrunner",["x"]=0.3822,["title"]="The Giant Guardian",["quest"]=2844,["y"]=0.10300000000000001},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["escort"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:goal:66:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7774,["limit"]=900,["y"]=0.10300000000000001,["x"]=0.3822,["minLevel"]=44,["title"]="Wandering Shay",["pre"]={2844},["qlvl"]=49,["quest"]=2845,["npcName"]="Shay Leafrunner"},{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Shay's Bell",["oi"]=1,["count"]=1,["fromId"]=144054,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="object",["item"]=9189,["y"]=0.10289999999999999,["x"]=0.3825,["escort"]=true,["from"]="Shay's Chest",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:goal:66:3",["title"]="Wandering Shay",["quest"]=2845,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:step:66",["text"]="Shay Leafrunner",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride west into the Ravenwind Ruins: Shay Leafrunner hides in the small round building at the back. Open the chest beside her for Shay's Bell: it lasts 15 minutes, like the quest."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:goal:67:1",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Shay's Bell"},{["count"]=1,["text"]="Take Shay Leafrunner to Rockbiter's camp"}},["y"]=0.21899999999999997,["x"]=0.423,["title"]="Wandering Shay",["quest"]=2845,["escort"]=true},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:goal:67:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7765,["npcName"]="Rockbiter",["x"]=0.4239,["title"]="Wandering Shay",["quest"]=2845,["y"]=0.22}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:step:67",["text"]="Wandering Shay",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Lead Shay Leafrunner back to Rockbiter at walking pace: she wanders off, so ring the bell to call her back (not in combat), and clear the harpies on the way before she reaches them."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["y"]=0.2557,["parent"]=3909,["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7775,["soloWhen"]={{["item"]=11242,["k"]="has",["n"]=1}},["npcName"]="Gregan Brewspewer",["x"]=0.4512,["title"]="The Videre Elixir",["minLevel"]=47,["direct"]=true,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=4041,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/04-western-plaguelands:goal:68:1"},{["itemName"]="Videre Elixir",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["item"]=11242,["k"]="has",["n"]=1}},["fromFaction"]="AH",["item"]=11243,["quest"]=3909,["map"]=1444,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=7775,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.2557,["x"]=0.4512,["title"]="The Videre Elixir",["from"]="Gregan Brewspewer",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:fo