the ground and the Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers carry them too. Every cultist can drop an Encrypted Twilight Text: keep twenty, ten for Bor Wildmane and ten for Hermit Ortell later.\nCareful: take the texts from the Twilight Avengers and Geolords; leave the Twilight Flamereavers (60) and stay out of the hive's mouth, where the Hive'Ashi elites (59-60) wait."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1451,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:19:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=17080,["npcName"]="Marshal Bluewall",["x"]=0.3329,["title"]="Report to Marshal Bluewall",["quest"]=9415,["y"]=0.5106},{["map"]=1451,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:19:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=17080,["y"]=0.5106,["x"]=0.3329,["title"]="Scouring the Desert",["npcName"]="Marshal Bluewall",["pre"]={9415},["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=9419,["minLevel"]=1},{["title"]="Scouring the Desert",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Silithus Dust Turnin Quest Doodad"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:35:3",["t"]="complete",["quest"]=9419,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1451,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:19:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=17080,["npcName"]="Marshal Bluewall",["x"]=0.3329,["title"]="Scouring the Desert",["quest"]=9419,["y"]=0.5106}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:35",["text"]="Hive'Zora",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Marshal Bluewall camps outside Hive'Zora, the western hive. Pick up a Silithyst at one of the red geysers nearby and carry it to the Alliance extractor at his camp.\nCareful: You lose the Silithyst if you mount, stealth, use Divine Shield, Feign Death or Vanish. Blink and Power Word: Shield do not drop it."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:36",["text"]="Cenarion Hold",["goals"]={{["map"]=1451,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:21:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=15306,["npcName"]="Bor Wildmane",["x"]=0.4857,["title"]="Secret Communication",["quest"]=8318,["y"]=0.3778},{["map"]=1451,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:21:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=15183,["npcName"]="Geologist Larksbane",["x"]=0.49670000000000003,["title"]="The Twilight Mystery",["quest"]=8284,["y"]=0.3746},{["map"]=1451,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:21:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=15183,["y"]=0.3746,["x"]=0.49670000000000003,["title"]="The Deserter",["npcName"]="Geologist Larksbane",["pre"]={8284},["qlvl"]=59,["quest"]=8285,["minLevel"]=54}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1451,["itemName"]="Reliquary of Purity",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Dusty Reliquary; inside",["fromId"]=179565,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="object",["item"]=22201,["y"]=0.5535,["x"]=0.6323,["title"]="A Reliquary of Purity",["from"]="Dusty Reliquary",["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:22:1",["count"]=1,["quest"]=5527,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:22",["text"]="Southwind Village",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride east to the ruins of Southwind Village. The Dusty Reliquary lies among the ruined buildings, watched by Tortured Sentinels."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1451,["note"]="Below ground",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:23:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=15194,["npcName"]="Hermit Ortell",["x"]=0.6718999999999999,["title"]="The Deserter",["quest"]=8285,["y"]=0.6976},{["map"]=1451,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:23:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=15194,["y"]=0.6976,["x"]=0.6718999999999999,["title"]="The Twilight Lexicon",["npcName"]="Hermit Ortell",["pre"]={8285},["qlvl"]=60,["quest"]=8279,["minLevel"]=54}},["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:23",["text"]="Hermit Ortell",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The hermit hides among the rocks south-east of Southwind Village."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1451,["itemName"]="Noggle's Satchel",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["rank"]=1,["kind"]="elite",["near"]=true,["lvl"]=59},["fromId"]=180435,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="object",["item"]=20379,["y"]=0.9138,["x"]=0.4456,["title"]="Noggle's Lost Satchel",["from"]="Noggle's Satchel",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:39:1",["count"]=1,["quest"]=8282,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1451,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:39:2",["t"]="talk",["npc"]=15171,["npcName"]="Frankal Stonebridge",["x"]=0.4081,["title"]="Dearest Natalia",["y"]=0.8886,["quest"]=8304,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1451,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:39:3",["t"]="talk",["npc"]=15170,["npcName"]="Rutgar Glyphshaper",["x"]=0.4128,["title"]="Dearest Natalia",["y"]=0.8845000000000001,["quest"]=8304,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:39",["text"]="Bronzebeard's Encampment",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride south-west to the dwarves' camp near the southern mountains and question Frankal Stonebridge and Rutgar Glyphshaper. Noggle Ficklespragg's satchel lies in the sand south-east of the camp, where Deathclasp, an elite scorpid, patrols: grab it while he is away."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1451,["itemName"]="Twilight Lexicon - Chapter 2",["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=11803,["t"]="collect",["title"]="The Twilight Lexicon",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.8637,["x"]=0.1609,["count"]=1,["from"]="Twilight Keeper Exeter",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:40:1",["item"]=20395,["quest"]=8279,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-202