 wanders by the farmhouse of Felstone Field, west of Andorhal. The Jabbering Ghouls in the field carry the other half of the charm: combine the two halves."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:50:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.31989999999999996,["x"]=0.48340000000000005,["title"]="A Plague Upon Thee",["objName"]="Termite Barrel",["quest"]=5904,["object"]=177491},{["map"]=1422,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:50:2",["t"]="accept",["object"]=177491,["y"]=0.31989999999999996,["x"]=0.48340000000000005,["qlvl"]=55,["objName"]="Termite Barrel",["pre"]={5904},["minLevel"]=48,["quest"]=6389,["title"]="A Plague Upon Thee"}},["id"]="forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:50",["text"]="Northridge Lumber Camp",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride north up the road to the lumber mill and set the termite barrel down in the middle of it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:97:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11610,["y"]=0.28059999999999996,["x"]=0.5192,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["npcName"]="Kirsta Deepshadow",["pre"]={6004},["qlvl"]=57,["quest"]=6023,["minLevel"]=50}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:step:97",["text"]="Kirsta Deepshadow",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Kirsta Deepshadow hides at the Northridge lumber camp's edge."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:98:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=11613,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={6023}}},["y"]=0.361,["x"]=0.5783,["title"]="Unfinished Business",["target"]="Huntsman Radley",["count"]=1,["quest"]=6023,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1422,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus:goal:98:2",["t"]="k