er/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:step:87",["text"]="The west hills and the Algaz Station",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="North through the hills west of the road to Mountaineer Stormpike at the Algaz Station. The Tunnel Rat kobolds dig in the hills on the way; Elder Black Bears, Mountain Boars and Forest Lurkers roam the same ground."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1432,["itemName"]="Miners' Gear",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Miners' Gear, from the crates",["fromId"]=271,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=307,["count"]=4,["y"]=0.23440000000000003,["x"]=0.349,["item"]=2640,["from"]="Miners' League Crates",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:goal:88:1",["title"]="Filthy Paws",["fromKind"]="object",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["itemName"]="Fire Tar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=5026,["quest"]=94466,["map"]=1432,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=1174,["t"]="collect",["lvl"]=13,["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.23929999999999998,["x"]=0.3515,["count"]=1,["from"]="Tunnel Rat Geomancer",["note"]="Fire Tar: Tunnel Rat Geomancers",["title"]="Call of Fire",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:goal:88:2"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:step:88",["text"]="Silver Stream Mine",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="East along the hills to the mine at the north end of the loch: the Miners' League crates sit in its tunnels, among more Tunnel Rats. Shamans: the Tunnel Rat Geomancers (level 12-13) here carry the Fire Tar.\nCareful: the Tunnel Rat Geomancers (12-13) cast from range in the narrow tunnels: pull them one at a time."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:step:89",["text"]="Back to the Algaz Station",["goals"]={{["map"]=1432,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:goal:89:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1343,["npcName"]="Mountaineer Stormpike",["x"]=0.24760000000000001,["title"]="Filthy Paws",["quest"]=307,["y"]=0.184}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1432,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:goal:90:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1340,["npcName"]="Mountaineer Kadrell",["x"]=0.33799999999999997,["title"]="Rat Catching",["quest"]=416,["y"]=0.483},{["map"]=1432,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:goal:90:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1963,["npcName"]="Vidra Hearthstove",["x"]=0.3483,["title"]="Thelsamar Blood Sausages",["quest"]=418,["y"]=0.4928},{["location"]="Ironforge",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","MAGE","WARLOCK","DRUID"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:goal:90:3",["t"]="fly",["node"]=6,["area"]=1537}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:step:90",["text"]="Thelsamar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="South down the road to Thelsamar, finishing the ears, meat and ichor on the way. Mountaineer Kadrell walks the road through town."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Reagent Pouch",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=6652,["quest"]=94466,["map"]=1432,["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=1166,["t"]="collect",["spread"]=true,["title"]="Call of Fire",["y"]=0.7775,["x"]=0.3675,["count"]=1,["from"]="Stonesplinter Seer",["lvl"]=14,["note"]="Reagent Pouch: Stonesplinter Seers",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:goal:91:1"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:step:91",["text"]="The Reagent Pouch",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"}},["detail"]="South down the road past the tunnel post into Stonesplinter Valley: the Stonesplinter Seers (level 13-14) stand among the troggs in its middle. Stay out of the far south end, where Shamans and Bonesnappers (level 15-16) camp, and keep clear of Headsplitter (15) on his walk. The Seers come with other troggs and cast from range: pull one at a time."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1432,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:goal:92:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=257808,["npcName"]="Braldir Ashmantle",["x"]=0.32170000000000004,["title"]="Call of Fire",["quest"]=94466,["y"]=0.6597},{["map"]=1432,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:goal:92:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=257808,["y"]=0.6597,["x"]=0.32170000000000004,["title"]="Call of Fire",["npcName"]="Braldir Ashmantle",["pre"]={94466},["qlvl"]=14,["quest"]=94467,["minLevel"]=10},{["map"]=1432,["itemName"]="Fire Sapta",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:goal:92:3",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.645,["x"]=0.319,["title"]="Call of Fire",["note"]="Fire Sapta, beside the Spirit Stone",["item"]=6636,["quest"]=94467,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1432,["itemName"]="Glowing Ember",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Glowing Ember: Minor Manifestation of Fire",["fromId"]=5893,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="npc",["item"]=6655,["y"]=0.645,["x"]=0.319,["title"]="Call of Fire",["from"]="Minor Manifestation of Fire",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:goal:92:4",["count"]=1,["quest"]=94467,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1432,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:goal:92:5",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.645,["x"]=0.319,["title"]="Call of Fire",["objName"]="Brazier of the Dormant Flame",["quest"]=94467,["object"]=61934},{["map"]=1432,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:goal:92:6",["t"]="accept",["object"]=61934,["y"]=0.645,["x"]=0.319,["qlvl"]=14,["objName"]="Brazier of the Dormant Flame",["pre"]={94467},["minLevel"]=10,["quest"]=94468,["title"]="Call of Fire"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:step:92",["text"]="The Fire Spirit Stone",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"}},["detail"]="Back north to Braldir Ashmantle's camp above the tunnel. Braldir Ashmantle gives you the Fire Sapta. Climb to the peak above his camp, drink the Sapta beside the Spirit Stone and defeat the Minor Manifestation of Fire, then place its Glowing Ember in the Brazier of the Dormant Flame, atop the Shrine of Eternal Flame."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1426,["note"]="Bruegs Kindleborn: Searing Totem, your Fire Totem and the Totem of Charged Flames",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:goal:93:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=257597,["npcName"]="Bruegs Kindleborn",["x"]=0.8794,["title"]="Call of Fire",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=5176,["itemName"]="Fire Totem"},{["item"]=263412,["itemName"]="Totem of Charged Flames"}}},["quest"]=94468,["y"]=0.44799999999999995}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:step:93",["text"]="Back to Bruegs Kindleborn",["only"]={["classes"]={"SHAMAN"}},["detail"]="Back through the tunnel to Bruegs Kindleborn' cave above the farm, then west along the road to Ironforge."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["note"]="Golnir Bouldertoe, in the Great Forge",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/dwarf/01-dun-morogh:goal:94:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4256,["npcName"]="Golnir Bouldertoe",["x"]=0.5152,["title"]="Ride to Ironforge",["quest"