ome/01-dun-morogh:step:95",["text"]="The Tome of Divinity",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["detail"]="West from the Forlorn Cavern into the Mystic Ward: Brandur Ironhammer, Tiza Battleforge and Muiredon Battleforge are in the Hall of Mysteries, Tiza and Muiredon on its upper floor: the stairs up start just north-east of Brandur Ironhammer. John Turner, a beggar, wanders the city. He asks for ten Linen Cloth: the troggs and trolls of Dun Morogh drop it, and the Auction House sells it."},{["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:goal:96:1",["t"]="level",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["level"]=12}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:step:96",["text"]="Narm Faulk",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["detail"]="Head back out of Ironforge and east along the road to Helm's Bed Lake. Narm Faulk lies dead by its shore: use the Symbol of Life on him. The Dark Iron Spies sneaking around the lake carry the script."},{["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:goal:97:1",["t"]="level",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["level"]=12}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:step:97",["text"]="Muiredon Battleforge",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["note"]="High Priestess Mims: Confounding Flash, her own copy of the letter",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={258785},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/gnome/01-dun-morogh:goal:98:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=258785,["y"]=0.1,["npcName"]="High Priestess Mims",["x"]=0.2459,["title"]="Confounding Flash",["only"]={["classes"]={"PRIEST"},["races"]={"Gnome"}},["closedBy"]={94821,94822,94823,94824,94825,94826},["qlvl"]=10,["quest