aten body",["quest"]=37,["object"]=55},{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:41:2",["t"]="accept",["object"]=55,["y"]=0.6034,["x"]=0.7265999999999999,["qlvl"]=10,["objName"]="A half-eaten body",["pre"]={37},["minLevel"]=7,["quest"]=45,["title"]="Discover Rolf's Fate"}},["id"]="forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:41",["text"]="A half-eaten body",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="It lies by the river north-west of the logging camp."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["itemName"]="Red Linen Bandana",["oi"]=1,["t"]="collect",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:68:1",["fromNpcsAt"]="1;1;1;1;2;2,3,5,6;2;7,8,9;2;2;2;2;2,1;4;2;2;2;2;1;2;2;2,1;1,2",["quest"]=83,["count"]=6,["y"]=0.5640999999999999,["x"]=0.725,["item"]=1019,["lvl"]=9,["note"]="Red Linen Bandanas",["title"]="Red Linen Goods",["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:42:2",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.555,["x"]=0.7979999999999999,["title"]="Discover Rolf's Fate",["objName"]="Rolf's corpse",["quest"]=45,["object"]=56},{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:42:3",["t"]="accept",["object"]=56,["y"]=0.555,["x"]=0.7979999999999999,["qlvl"]=10,["objName"]="Rolf's corpse",["pre"]={45},["minLevel"]=7,["quest"]=71,["title"]="Report to Thomas"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:step:68",["text"]="Stone Cairn Lake",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Defias Rogue Wizards camp on the shores of Stone Cairn Lake; they drop the Red Linen Bandanas too. Rolf's corpse lies in the murloc village on the north-east shore.\nCareful: the Rogue Wizards cast from range and a Defias Bodyguard (10) walks the shore with them: pull them one at a time."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["itemName"]="Stolen Enchanting Supplies",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=561159,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Stolen Enchanting Supplies",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.511,["x"]=0.688,["count"]=5,["from"]="Stolen Enchanting Supplies",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:69:1",["item"]=247805,["quest"]=91725,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:step:69",["text"]="The gnoll camps",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Riverpaw gnolls camp in the hills west of Stone Cairn Lake; the Stolen Enchanting Supplies lie in their camps."},{["id"]="forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:44",["text"]="The Jasperlode Mine's entrance",["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["x"]=0.616,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["y"]=0.541,["id"]="forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:44:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Jasperlode Mine",["area"]=54}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["itemName"]="Mining Tools",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=562114,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Good Steel",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.535,["x"]=0.617,["count"]=4,["from"]="Mining Tools",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:71:1",["item"]=247816,["quest"]=91732,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1429,["note"]="Walk into the mine",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:71:2",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Scout through the Jasperlode Mine"}},["y"]=0.49200000000000005,["x"]=0.602,["title"]="The Jasperlode Mine",["quest"]=76},{["map"]=1429,["note"]="Kobold Geomancer walks around Jasperlode Mine: look inside the circle on the map",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:71:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=476,["y"]=0.4926,["x"]=0.6114999999999999,["title"]="Delicate Instruments",["lvl"]=8,["target"]