ame it with the Taming Rod",["oi"]=1,["count"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:87:4",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=1922,["spread"]=true,["y"]=0.6213000000000001,["x"]=0.5844,["title"]="Taming the Beast",["lvl"]=8,["target"]="Gray Forest Wolf",["text"]="Tame Gray Forest Wolf",["quest"]=94863,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:87:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=251507,["npcName"]="Josephine Carson",["x"]=0.4115,["title"]="Taming the Beast",["quest"]=94863,["y"]=0.6623},{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:87:6",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=251507,["y"]=0.6623,["x"]=0.4115,["title"]="Taming the Beast",["npcName"]="Josephine Carson",["pre"]={94863},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=94864,["minLevel"]=10},{["map"]=1429,["note"]="Young Forest Bear: tame it with the Taming Rod",["oi"]=1,["t"]="kill",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:87:7",["text"]="Tame Young Forest Bear",["npc"]=822,["spread"]=true,["y"]=0.804,["x"]=0.434,["count"]=1,["lvl"]=9,["target"]="Young Forest Bear",["title"]="Taming the Beast",["quest"]=94864,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1429,["note"]="Tame Beast",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:87:8",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=251507,["npcName"]="Josephine Carson",["x"]=0.4115,["title"]="Taming the Beast",["quest"]=94864,["y"]=0.6623},{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:87:9",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=251507,["y"]=0.6623,["x"]=0.4115,["title"]="Training the Beast",["npcName"]="Josephine Carson",["pre"]={94864},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=94793,["minLevel"]=10},{["map"]=1429,["note"]="Isaac Chan, beside her: Beast Training",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:87:10",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=258930,["npcName"]="Isaac Chan",["x"]=0.4179,["title"]="Training the Beast",["quest"]=94793,["y"]=0.6637000000000001}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:step:87",["text"]="Taming the Beast",["only"]={["classes"]={"HUNTER"}},["detail"]="Josephine Carson stands with the Goldshire trainers. Each of her quests hands you a Taming Rod: use it on the beast she names, then bring the rod back to her. Rockhide Boars and Young Forest Bears roam the hills south of the Maclure Vineyards, Gray Forest Wolves the woods east of Crystal Lake."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["note"]="Inside",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:49:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=251,["npcName"]="Maybell Maclure",["x"]=0.4315,["title"]="The Escape",["quest"]=114,["y"]=0.8962}},["id"]="forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:23",["text"]="Maybell Maclure",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="South down the road to the Maclure Vineyards."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:50:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=244,["npcName"]="Ma Stonefield",["x"]=0.34659999999999996,["title"]="Princess Must Die!",["quest"]=88,["y"]=0.8448},{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:50:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=246,["npcName"]="\"Auntie\" Bernice Stonefield",["x"]=0.34490000000000004,["title"]="Goldtooth",["quest"]=87,["y"]=0.8425},{["map"]=1429,["itemName"]="Shiny Red Apple",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:50:3",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=894,["npcName"]="Homer Stonefield",["x"]=0.3369,["item"]=4536,["note"]="Shiny Red Apples, from Homer Stonefield, for the Applejack Still",["y"]=0.8290000000000001,["count"]=4}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:step:89",["text"]="The Stonefield Farm",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Homer Stonefield sells the Shiny Red Apples for the Applejack Still. Apples looted from kobolds and crates count too: the purchase ticks itself once you have four."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:90:1",["t"]="turnin",["object"]=562131,["soloWhen"]={{["item"]=4536,["k"]="has",["n"]=4},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=91738}},["y"]=0.5804,["x"]=0.2455,["qlvl"]=1,["objName"]="Applejack Still",["direct"]=true,["minLevel"]=1,["quest"]=91736,["title"]="Applejack Still"},{["map"]=1429,["itemName"]="Thunder Applejack",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:90:2",["t"]="collect",["soloWhen"]={{["item"]=4536,["k"]="has",["n"]=4},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=91738}},["y"]=0.58,["x"]=0.24600000000000002,["item"]=247824,["note"]="Thunder Applejack, from the still",["count"]=1}},["detail"]="The Applejack Still stands north of the Westbrook Garrison. Click it with four Shiny Red Apples in your bags: it takes them and gives you a Thunder Applejack on the spot (the quest never shows in your quest log). Keep the Applejack for Sergeant De Vries: don't drink it.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:step:90",["text"]="The Applejack Still",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["item"]=4536,["k"]="has",["n"]=4},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=91738}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:52:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=963,["npcName"]="Deputy Rainer",["x"]=0.24230000000000002,["title"]="Westbrook Garrison Needs Help!",["quest"]=239,["y"]=0.7445},{["map"]=1429,["note"]="Deputy Rainer: for Gryan Stoutmantle at Sentinel Hill",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:91:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=963,["npcName"]="Deputy Rainer",["x"]=0.24230000000000002,["title"]="Report to Gryan Stoutmantle",["y"]=0.7445,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=109,["minLevel"]=9},{["map"]=1429,["crumbs"]={239},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:91:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=963,["y"]=0.7445,["npcName"]="Deputy Rainer",["x"]=0.24230000000000002,["title"]="Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty",["minLevel"]=6,["pre"]={76},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=11,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:step:91",["text"]="Westbrook Garrison",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Follow the road south to the Westbrook Garrison, on the way into Westfall. Deputy Rainer stands outside the barracks; Sergeant De Vries stands inside. He has An Apple Treat only while you carry the Thunder Applejack: talk to him and it goes straight to the hand-in."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["note"]="Sergeant De Vries: he wants your Thunder Applejack; inside",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:92:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=955,["soloWhen"]={{["item"]=247824,["k"]="has",["n"]=1}},["y"]=0.732,["x"]=0.2408,["title"]="An Apple Treat",["npcName"]="Sergeant De Vries",["direct"]=true,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=91738,["minLevel"]=7}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:step:92",["text"]="Sergeant De Vries",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["item"]=247824,["k"]="has",["n"]=1}}},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Painted Gnoll Armband",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=782,["spread"]=true,["map"]=1429,["quest"]=11,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:goal:93:1",["fromId"]=97,["fromAlso"]="Riverpaw Outrunner",["t"]="collect",["note"]="Painted Gnoll Armbands",["y"]=0.7989,["x"]=0.27449999999999997,["title"]="Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty",["from"]="Riverpaw Runt",["lvl"]=10,["count"]=8,["fromKind"]="npc",["fromAlsoId"]=478}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:step:93",["text"]="Forest's Edge",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Riverpaw Runts and Outrunners hold the hills south of the garrison, along the Westfall border."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:step:94",["text"]="Westbrook Garrison",["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/human/01-elwynn-forest:54:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=963,["npcName"]="Deputy Rainer",["x"]=0.24230000000000002,["title"]="Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty",["quest"]=11,["y"]=0.7445}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["max"]=11,["name"]="Elwynn Forest (1-11)",["min"]=1,["availability"]="source-listed",["races"]={"Human"},["faction"]="Alliance",["category"]="Leveling",["zoneName"]="Elwynn Forest",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["next"]="polestar:forever/alliance/02-westfall"},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1438,["id"]="polestar:forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["map"]=1438,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil:1:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2079,["npcName"]="Conservator Ilthalaine",["x"]=0.5869,["title"]="The Balance of Nature",["y"]=0.44270000000000004,["qlvl"]=2,["quest"]=456,["minLevel"]=1},{["map"]=1438,["note"]="Melithar Staghelm, by the path",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["