 Sea Creature lies on the shore west of the Grove, another further south near Remtravel's Excavation. Three more remains lie further south-west among Greymist Oracles and Tidehunters (18-20): the guide leaves them for the last loop, when you are closer to their level."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1439,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/nightelf/02-darkshore:goal:16:1",["t"]="interact",["y"]=0.618,["x"]=0.424,["title"]="Bashal'Aran",["objName"]="Ancient Flame",["object"]=16393,["quest"]=957,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/nightelf/02-darkshore:step:16",["text"]="Ameth'Aran",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back north to Ameth'Aran: the flame burns in the south of the ruins."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1439,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/nightelf/02-darkshore:goal:17:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.4868,["x"]=0.4732,["title"]="As Water Cascades",["objName"]="Mysterious Red Crystal",["quest"]=4812,["object"]=175524},{["map"]=1439,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/nightelf/02-darkshore:goal:17:2",["t"]="accept",["object"]=175524,["y"]=0.4868,["x"]=0.4732,["qlvl"]=14,["objName"]="Mysterious Red Crystal",["pre"]={4812},["minLevel"]=12,["quest"]=4813,["title"]="The Fragments Within"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/nightelf/02-darkshore:step:17",["text"]="The red crystal",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back north-east into the mountains to the crystal."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1439,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/alliance/nightelf/02-darkshore:goal:18:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3650,["npcName"]="Asterion",["x"]=0.44170000000000004,["title"]="Bashal'Aran",["quest"]=957,["y"]=0.3629}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forev