sh letter for High Priestess Mims in Ironforge (the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District).",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/confounding-flash-and-contingency-plan:step:3",["text"]="Confounding Flash: High Priestess Laurena",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["name"]="Stormwind City",["k"]="zone",["area"]=1519},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94817,94821,94822,94823,94824,94825,94826}}}},{["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/confounding-flash-and-contingency-plan:goal:4:1",["level"]=10,["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94817,94821,94822,94823,94824,94825,94826}}}},{["map"]=1455,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={258785},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/confounding-flash-and-contingency-plan:goal:4:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=258785,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94817,94821,94822,94823,94824,94825,94826}}},["y"]=0.1,["x"]=0.2459,["title"]="Confounding Flash",["npcName"]="High Priestess Mims",["closedBy"]={94821,94822,94823,94824,94825,94826},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=94817,["minLevel"]=10},{["map"]=1455,["note"]="High Priestess Mims: Confounding Flash",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/confounding-flash-and-contingency-plan:goal:4:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=258785,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94817,94821,94822,94823,94824,94825,94826}}},["npcName"]="High Priestess Mims",["x"]=0.2459,["title"]="Confounding Flash",["quest"]=94817,["y"]=0.1}},["detail"]="At 10, go to High Priestess Mims in the Hall of Mysteries, Ironforge's Mystic Ward (north-west of the city), right beside High Priest Rohan: she gives Confounding Flash and takes it back at once. No letter needed. Confounding Flash confuses up to five enemies around you for 3 seconds (any damage wakes them