riend below half health and clears Weakened Soul, so you can shield them again (5-minute cooldown); it does not work on yourself. Human priests do not get Desperate Prayer in Forever: this is their spell instead.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/divine-grace-and-feedback:step:3",["text"]="Divine Grace: High Priestess Laurena",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94773,94774,94775,94776,94777,94778,94779}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1453,["note"]="High Priestess Laurena: Divine Grace",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/divine-grace-and-feedback:goal:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=376,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94774}}},["npcName"]="High Priestess Laurena",["x"]=0.4953,["title"]="Divine Grace",["quest"]=94774,["y"]=0.446}},["detail"]="Hand Josetta's letter to High Priestess Laurena at the altar of the Cathedral of Light: she teaches Divine Grace.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/divine-grace-and-feedback:step:4",["text"]="Divine Grace: Josetta's letter",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94774}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1453,["note"]="High Priestess Laurena: Divine Grace",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/divine-grace-and-feedback:goal:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=376,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94775}}},["npcName"]="High Priestess Laurena",["x"]=0.4953,["title"]="Divine Grace",["quest"]=94775,["y"]=0.446}},["detail"]="Hand Laurna Morninglight's letter to High Priestess Laurena at the altar of Stormwind's Cathedral of Light (from Teldrassil: the boat from Rut'theran Village to Auberdine, then the boat to Stormwind Harbor): she teaches Divine Grace.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/divine-grace-and-feedback:step:5",["text"]="Div