 Harbor) to Auberdine, the boat on to Rut'theran Village, then the portal up into Darnassus.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/starshards-and-elunes-grace:step:18",["text"]="Elune's Grace: Rohan's letter",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5675}}}}},["max"]=20,["name"]="Starshards and Elune's Grace (10-20)",["min"]=10,["availability"]="source-listed",["races"]={"NightElf"},["category"]="Class",["classes"]={"PRIEST"},["faction"]="Alliance",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["zoneName"]="Darnassus"},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1429,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance",["zoneName"]="Elwynn Forest",["max"]=12,["min"]=10,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Blade of Cunning (Alliance) (10-12)",["faction"]="Alliance",["classes"]={"ROGUE"},["category"]="Class",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:1:1",["level"]=10,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:1:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=917,["npcName"]="Keryn Sylvius",["x"]=0.4387,["title"]="Seek out SI: 7",["y"]=0.6594,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=2205,["minLevel"]=10}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:1",["text"]="Seek out SI: 7",["only"]={["races"]={"Human","Skyborne"}},["detail"]="At 10 Keryn Sylvius, the rogue trainer upstairs in the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire, gives you a package for Master Mathias Shaw in Stormwind. Train Pick Pocket if you lack it: this chain needs it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:2:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=332,["npcName"]="Master Mathias Shaw",["x"]=0.7831,["title"]="Seek out SI: 7",["quest"]=2205,["y"]=0.7073999999999999},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:2:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=332,["y"]=0.7073999999999999,["x"]=0.7831,["title"]="Snatch and Grab",["npcName"]="Master Mathias Shaw",["pre"]={2205},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=2206,["minLevel"]=10}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:2",["text"]="Master Mathias Shaw",["only"]={["races"]={"Human","Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Head north to Stormwind. Shaw stands upstairs in the SI:7 building in Old Town (the quest says the Barracks; it means SI:7)."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1429,["itemName"]="Defias Shipping Schedule",["oi"]=1,["text"]="Pick Pocket the Defias Dockmaster for the Defias Shipping Schedule",["fromId"]=6846,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=2206,["count"]=1,["y"]=0.8695999999999999,["x"]=0.4806,["item"]=7675,["from"]="Defias Dockmaster",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:goal:3:1",["title"]="Snatch and Grab",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:step:3",["text"]="Defias Dockmaster",["only"]={["races"]={"Human","Skyborne"}},["detail"]="The Defias Dockmaster (level 10, a goblin) works in the dock house at Jerod's Landing, on the river at Elwynn's southern edge, south of Goldshire. Stealth in and Pick Pocket him from behind: the schedule never drops from his corpse. Do not open with Sap or a fight: he calls in three waves of bodyguards. Keep away from the fireplaces in the house; they burn you out of stealth. He is back 2 to 5 minutes after a death."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1453,["note"]="Master Mathias Shaw, SI:7",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=332,["npcName"]="Master Mathias Shaw",["x"]=0.7831,["title"]="Snatch and Grab",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=7298,["itemName"]="Blade of Cunning"}}},["quest"]=2206,["y"]=0.7073999999999999}},["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:4",["text"]="Back to Mathias Shaw",["only"]={["races"]={"Human","Skyborne"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:5:1",["level"]=10,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1426,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:5:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=1234,["npcName"]="Hogral Bakkan",["x"]=0.4756,["title"]="Road to Salvation",["y"]=0.5261,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=2218,["minLevel"]=10}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:5",["text"]="Road to Salvation",["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf","Gnome"}},["detail"]="At 10 Hogral Bakkan, the rogue trainer in the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos, sends you to Hulfdan Blackbeard in Ironforge."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5165,["npcName"]="Hulfdan Blackbeard",["x"]=0.5196000000000001,["title"]="Road to Salvation",["quest"]=2218,["y"]=0.1484},{["map"]=1455,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:6:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5165,["y"]=0.1484,["x"]=0.5196000000000001,["title"]="Simple Subterfugin'",["npcName"]="Hulfdan Blackbeard",["pre"]={2218},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=2238,["minLevel"]=10}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:6",["text"]="Hulfdan Blackbeard",["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf","Gnome"}},["detail"]="Hulfdan Blackbeard is in the Forlorn Cavern, the rogue quarter in the north of Ironforge: go into the building with a shady dealer outside and down the stairs."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1426,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6886,["npcName"]="Onin MacHammar",["x"]=0.2516,["title"]="Simple Subterfugin'",["quest"]=2238,["y"]=0.4445},{["map"]=1426,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:7:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6886,["y"]=0.4445,["x"]=0.2516,["title"]="Onin's Report",["npcName"]="Onin MacHammar",["pre"]={2238},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=2239,["minLevel"]=10}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:7",["text"]="Onin MacHammar",["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf","Gnome"}},["detail"]="Head west to Gnomeregan. Beside the road to its entrance stands a wooden spiral tower: Onin MacHammar waits stealthed on the top platform, next to a level 10 Leper Gnome, so you only see him up close."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["note"]="Hulfdan Blackbeard, Ironforge",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:8:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5165,["npcName"]="Hulfdan Blackbeard",["x"]=0.5196000000000001,["title"]="Onin's Report",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=7298,["itemName"]="Blade of Cunning"}}},["quest"]=2239,["y"]=0.1484}},["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:8",["text"]="Back to Hulfdan Blackbeard",["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf","Gnome"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:9:1",["level"]=10,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1438,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:9:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3599,["npcName"]="Jannok Breezesong",["x"]=0.5638000000000001,["title"]="The Apple Falls",["y"]=0.6014,["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=2241,["minLevel"]=10}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:9",["text"]="The Apple Falls",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["detail"]="At 10 Jannok Breezesong, the rogue trainer in the Dolanaar inn, gives you a rose for Syurna in Darnassus. If you lose the rose, abandon the quest and take it again."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1457,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:10:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4163,["npcName"]="Syurna",["x"]=0.3699,["title"]="The Apple Falls",["quest"]=2241,["y"]=0.2191},{["map"]=1457,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:10:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4163,["y"]=0.2191,["x"]=0.3699,["title"]="Destiny Calls",["npcName"]="Syurna",["pre"]={2241},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=2242,["minLevel"]=10}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:10",["text"]="Syurna",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["detail"]="Head west to Darnassus. Syurna is below ground in the Cenarion Enclave: the way down is the opening at the foot of the split tree left of the Arch Druid's tree, near the nightsaber trainer. Her map marker shows above ground."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:goal:11:1",["level"]=12,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1438,["itemName"]="Sethir's Journal",["oi"]=1,["text"]="Pick Pocket Sethir the Ancient for Sethir's Journal",["fromId"]=6909,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=2242,["count"]=1,["y"]=0.22829999999999998,["x"]=0.3711,["item"]=7737,["from"]="Sethir the Ancient",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:goal:11:2",["title"]="Destiny Calls",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:step:11",["text"]="Sethir the Ancient",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["detail"]="Sethir the Ancient (level 12 satyr) lives out on a great branch north of the Oracle Glade: go through the V-shaped gap in the wall north of the glade and out along the branch. Pick his pocket for the journal; killing him does not give it, and a fight brings out three Minions of Sethir. He walks between the main branch and a side branch: wait stealthed at the far end of the main branch and pick him from behind when he comes back. Then Sprint away. He is back 8 1/2 minutes after a death."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1457,["note"]="Syurna, Darnassus",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:12:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4163,["npcName"]="Syurna",["x"]=0.3699,["title"]="Destiny Calls",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=7298,["itemName"]="Blade of Cunning"}}},["quest"]=2242,["y"]=0.2191}},["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-alliance:12",["text"]="Back to Syurna",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1453,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery",["zoneName"]="Stormwind City",["max"]=20,["min"]=16,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Certificate of Thievery (16-20)",["faction"]="Alliance",["classes"]={"ROGUE"},["category"]="Class",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:1:1",["level"]=16,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1429,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6946},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=120,["npc"]=917,["y"]=0.6594,["x"]=0.4387,["title"]="SI:7",["npcName"]="Keryn Sylvius",["closedBy"]={2281,2260,2298},["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=2300,["minLevel"]=16}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:step:1",["text"]="SI:7 (Goldshire)",["only"]={["races"]={"Human","Skyborne"}},["detail"]="At 16 Keryn Sylvius, the rogue trainer upstairs in the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire, sends you to Renzik \"The Shiv\" in Stormwind. Taking it shuts out the other towns' breadcrumbs."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:2:1",["level"]=16,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1426,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={5165},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:goal:2:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=120,["npc"]=1234,["y"]=0.5261,["x"]=0.4756,["title"]="To Hulfdan!",["npcName"]="Hogral Bakkan",["closedBy"]={2298,2259},["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=2299,["minLevel"]=16}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:step:2",["text"]="To Hulfdan! (Kharanos)",["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf","Gnome"}},["detail"]="At 16 Hogral Bakkan in the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos sends you to Hulfdan Blackbeard in Ironforge's Forlorn Cavern."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1455,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:3:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5165,["npcName"]="Hulfdan Blackbeard",["x"]=0.5196000000000001,["title"]="To Hulfdan!",["quest"]=2299,["y"]=0.1484},{["map"]=1455,["npc"]=5165,["crumbs"]={2299},["endNpcs"]={6946},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:goal:3:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=120,["qlvl"]=16,["npcName"]="Hulfdan Blackbeard",["x"]=0.5196000000000001,["minLevel"]=16,["closedBy"]={2260,2300},["title"]="Kingly Shakedown",["y"]=0.1484,["quest"]=2298,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:step:3",["text"]="Hulfdan Blackbeard",["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf","Gnome"}},["detail"]="Hulfdan Blackbeard is in the house with a shady dealer outside, in the Forlorn Cavern, down the stairs. Then fly or take the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:4:1",["level"]=16,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1438,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={4214},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:goal:4:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=120,["npc"]=3599,["y"]=0.6014,["x"]=0.5638000000000001,["title"]="Erion Shadewhisper",["npcName"]="Jannok Breezesong",["closedBy"]={2260,2299},["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=2259,["minLevel"]=16}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:step:4",["text"]="Erion Shadewhisper (Dolanaar)",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["detail"]="At 16 Jannok Breezesong in the Dolanaar inn sends you to Erion Shadewhisper in Darnassus."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1457,["note"]="Erion Shadewhisper, Darnassus",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4214,["npcName"]="Erion Shadewhisper",["x"]=0.3452,["title"]="Erion Shadewhisper",["quest"]=2259,["y"]=0.2593},{["map"]=1457,["npc"]=4214,["crumbs"]={2259},["endNpcs"]={6946},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:goal:5:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=575,["qlvl"]=16,["npcName"]="Erion Shadewhisper",["x"]=0.3452,["minLevel"]=16,["closedBy"]={2298,2300},["title"]="Erion's Behest",["y"]=0.2593,["quest"]=2260,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:step:5",["text"]="Erion Shadewhisper",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["detail"]="Erion Shadewhisper stands in the Cenarion Enclave. Then the boat from Rut'theran Village to Auberdine, and the boat from Auberdine to Stormwind Harbor."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6946,["npcName"]="Renzik \"The Shiv\"",["x"]=0.7829,["title"]="SI:7",["only"]={["races"]={"Human","Skyborne"}},["quest"]=2300,["y"]=0.7114},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:6:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6946,["npcName"]="Renzik \"The Shiv\"",["x"]=0.7829,["title"]="Kingly Shakedown",["only"]={["races"]={"Dwarf","Gnome"}},["quest"]=2298,["y"]=0.7114},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:6:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6946,["npcName"]="Renzik \"The Shiv\"",["x"]=0.7829,["title"]="Erion's Behest",["only"]={["races"]={"NightElf"}},["quest"]=2260,["y"]=0.7114},{["map"]=1453,["crumbs"]={2300},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:goal:6:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6946,["y"]=0.7114,["x"]=0.7829,["title"]="Redridge Rendezvous",["npcName"]="Renzik \"The Shiv\"",["minLevel"]=16,["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=2281,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:step:6",["text"]="Renzik \"The Shiv\"",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Renzik \"The Shiv\" stands upstairs in the SI:7 building in Old Town, behind the rogue trainers. Before you leave: if you lack Pick Lock, Lord Tony Romano in the SI:7 building teaches it; Lockpicking is the test of the next quest."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:goal:7:1",["level"]=19,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1433,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6966,["npcName"]="Lucius",["x"]=0.2297,["title"]="Redridge Rendezvous",["quest"]=2281,["y"]=0.5204},{["map"]=1433,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:7:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6966,["y"]=0.5204,["x"]=0.2297,["title"]="Alther's Mill",["npcName"]="Lucius",["pre"]={2281},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=2282,["minLevel"]=16}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:step:7",["text"]="Lucius",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Head east through Elwynn Forest into Redridge, or fly to Lakeshire. Lucius stands on a crate on one of the Lakeshire docks, south of town; he gives you Thieves' Tools with the job (Gerald Crawley in Lakeshire sells more). Pick Lock does not work without the tools in your bags."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:goal:8:1",["level"]=20,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1433,["itemName"]="Token of Thievery",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Token of Thievery: Lucius's Lockbox",["fromId"]=121264,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="object",["item"]=7871,["y"]=0.44689999999999996,["x"]=0.46950000000000003,["title"]="Alther's Mill",["from"]="Lucius's Lockbox",["id"]="forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:8:1",["count"]=1,["quest"]=2282,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:step:8",["text"]="Alther's Mill",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Alther's Mill stands east of Lakeshire, up off the road; Blackrock orcs roam near it. Inside, the Practice Lockboxes come back almost at once: pick them until Lucius's Lockbox opens for you (about 25 Lockpicking). Your Lockpicking cap rises 5 per level, so a low character may stall. Some boxes are trapped (a frost trap, for one); the skill still goes up. On Forever level 20 spiders wander near the boxes: clear them first or bring a friend. The lockbox always holds the token and is back two seconds after use. Practise on while it still gives skill: the next class quest needs about 75."},{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:9",["text"]="Back to Lucius",["goals"]={{["map"]=1433,["note"]="Lucius: Certificate of Thievery",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/certificate-of-thievery:9:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6966,["npcName"]="Lucius",["x"]=0.2297,["title"]="Alther's Mill",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=7907,["itemName"]="Certificate of Thievery"}}},["quest"]=2282,["y"]=0.5204}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1453,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance",["zoneName"]="Stormwind City",["max"]=24,["min"]=20,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Poisons (Alliance) (20-24)",["faction"]="Alliance",["classes"]={"ROGUE"},["category"]="Class",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:1:1",["level"]=20,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:1:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=332,["npcName"]="Master Mathias Shaw",["x"]=0.7831,["title"]="Mathias and the Defias",["y"]=0.7073999999999999,["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=2360,["minLevel"]=20}},["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:1",["text"]="Mathias and the Defias",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="At 20 Master Mathias Shaw, upstairs in the SI:7 building in Old Town, sends you to Agent Kearnen in Westfall. This chain is how you learn Poisons on Forever, so do not skip it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1436,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:2:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7024,["npcName"]="Agent Kearnen",["x"]=0.6849,["title"]="Mathias and the Defias",["quest"]=2360,["y"]=0.7008},{["map"]=1436,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:2:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7024,["y"]=0.7008,["x"]=0.6849,["title"]="Klaven's Tower",["npcName"]="Agent Kearnen",["pre"]={2360},["qlvl"]=24,["quest"]=2359,["minLevel"]=20}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:step:2",["text"]="Agent Kearnen",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Kearnen hides stealthed against the west side of a big tree with two small trees in front of it, just north of Klaven Mortwake's Defias tower in the far east of Westfall, by the Duskwood border. Read Kearnen's Journal for the tower's layout if you like."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Defias Tower Key",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2359}},["item"]=7923,["quest"]=2359,["map"]=1436,["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=7051,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.7399,["x"]=0.6947,["title"]="Klaven's Tower",["from"]="Malformed Defias Drone",["text"]="Pick Pocket the Malformed Defias Drone for the Defias Tower Key",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:goal:3:1"},{["itemName"]="Klaven Mortwake's Journal",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["rank"]=1,["kind"]="elite",["near"]=true,["lvl"]=26},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2359}},["item"]=7908,["quest"]=2359,["map"]=1436,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=123214,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.74,["x"]=0.7040000000000001,["title"]="Klaven's Tower",["from"]="Duskwood Chest",["note"]="Klaven Mortwake's Journal: the Duskwood Chest, top floor",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:goal:3:2"}},["detail"]="Klaven Mortwake on the top floor is a level 26 elite: easier at 24 or with a friend. Get the key first: the Malformed Defias Drone (level 23, the spiky-haired one trailing yellow sparkles) walks a loop around the tower; stealth up and Pick Pocket it from behind. Then up the tower past the Defias Tower Patrollers (23) and Sentries (24) to the Duskwood Chest beside Klaven's desk (Lockpicking about 70-75). Opening it poisons you with the Touch of Zanzil, which stops your stealth for a while.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:step:3",["text"]="Klaven's Tower, with a group",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2359}}},{["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:goal:4:1",["level"]=24,["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=2359}}},{["itemName"]="Defias Tower Key",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=2359}},["item"]=7923,["quest"]=2359,["map"]=1436,["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=7051,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.7399,["x"]=0.6947,["title"]="Klaven's Tower",["from"]="Malformed Defias Drone",["text"]="Pick Pocket the Malformed Defias Drone for the Defias Tower Key",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:goal:4:2"},{["itemName"]="Klaven Mortwake's Journal",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["rank"]=1,["kind"]="elite",["near"]=true,["lvl"]=26},["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=2359}},["item"]=7908,["quest"]=2359,["map"]=1436,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=123214,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.74,["x"]=0.7040000000000001,["title"]="Klaven's Tower",["from"]="Duskwood Chest",["note"]="Klaven Mortwake's Journal: the Duskwood Chest, top floor",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:goal:4:3"}},["detail"]="Get the key first. The Malformed Defias Drone (level 23, not elite) starts at the tower entrance and walks a loop around the outside; it is the spiky-haired one trailing yellow sparkles. Stealth up and Pick Pocket it from behind: it always has the key. It hits hard: if stealth breaks, Sprint away. Watch for the pair of Defias Drones that also patrol. Then sneak up the tower. Defias Tower Patrollers (23) and Sentries (24) guard the floors; an Ambush with a dagger kills them outright if you would rather clear them. Klaven Mortwake, a level 26 elite, waits on the top floor: Sap him, or bring a friend. The Duskwood Chest beside his desk needs Lockpicking of about 70-75 (practise on the boxes at Alther's Mill in Redridge first). A trick: while the Sentries are away, jump from the chair to the lamp to the bookshelf above the chest, step out of stealth and open the chest from there. Opening it poisons you with the Touch of Zanzil, which stops your stealth for a while and lets the drone see you; that is why the key comes first. Then get out.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:step:4",["text"]="Klaven's Tower, solo",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=2359}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1453,["note"]="Master Mathias Shaw: Poisons",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:3:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=332,["npcName"]="Master Mathias Shaw",["x"]=0.7831,["title"]="Klaven's Tower",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=18160,["itemName"]="Recipe: Thistle Tea"}}},["quest"]=2359,["y"]=0.7073999999999999},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:3:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=332,["y"]=0.7073999999999999,["x"]=0.7831,["title"]="The Touch of Zanzil",["npcName"]="Master Mathias Shaw",["pre"]={2359},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=2607,["minLevel"]=20}},["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:3",["text"]="Master Mathias Shaw",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Head north through Elwynn to Stormwind; Mathias Shaw is upstairs in SI:7. He teaches Poisons and gives you the Thistle Tea recipe. Poisons are made, not bought: each batch of Instant Poison takes a Dust of Decay and an Empty Vial, which Jasper Fel and Sloan McCoy sell in Old Town next to SI:7. Buy a stack of each, open Poisons from your spellbook to make them, then use a poison on your weapon."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7207,["npcName"]="Doc Mixilpixil",["x"]=0.8006,["title"]="The Touch of Zanzil",["quest"]=2607,["y"]=0.6990000000000001},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:4:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7207,["y"]=0.6990000000000001,["x"]=0.8006,["title"]="The Touch of Zanzil",["npcName"]="Doc Mixilpixil",["pre"]={2607},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=2608,["minLevel"]=20},{["map"]=1453,["note"]="/lay with the Doc targeted",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:goal:6:3",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Diagnosis Complete"}},["y"]=0.6990000000000001,["x"]=0.8006,["title"]="The Touch of Zanzil",["quest"]=2608},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:4:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7207,["npcName"]="Doc Mixilpixil",["x"]=0.8006,["title"]="The Touch of Zanzil",["quest"]=2608,["y"]=0.6990000000000001},{["map"]=1453,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:4:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7207,["y"]=0.6990000000000001,["x"]=0.8006,["title"]="The Touch of Zanzil",["npcName"]="Doc Mixilpixil",["pre"]={2608},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=2609,["minLevel"]=20}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:step:6",["text"]="Doc Mixilpixil",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Touch of Zanzil still sits on you. Doc Mixilpixil works in the cellar of the SI:7 building: the stairs down are under the stairs to the upper floor, behind Jasper Fel. Target him and type /lay (nothing after it) to be examined, then wait. If he does nothing, abandon the quest, take it again and wait until he asks you to lie down."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Simple Wildflowers",["item"]=3421,["count"]=1,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance:5:1",["t"]="buy",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["locations"]={{["npcName"]="Felicia Gump",["x"]=0.6934,["y"]=0.7132999999999999,["npc"]=1303,["map"]=1453}}}