ss strikes the next melee attacker for Shadow damage and lowers its melee attack power for 2 minutes.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/touch-of-weakness-and-dark-sacrifice:step:5",["text"]="Touch of Weakness: Aelthalyste",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5658,5660,5661,5662,5663}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1458,["note"]="Aelthalyste: Touch of Weakness",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/touch-of-weakness-and-dark-sacrifice:goal:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4606,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5660}}},["npcName"]="Aelthalyste",["x"]=0.4926,["title"]="Touch of Weakness",["quest"]=5660,["y"]=0.17120000000000002}},["detail"]="Hand the letter to Aelthalyste in the Undercity's War Quarter: the zeppelin from the tower outside Orgrimmar lands in Tirisfal Glades, a short walk from the Undercity.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/touch-of-weakness-and-dark-sacrifice:step:6",["text"]="Touch of Weakness: Tai'jin's letter",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5660}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1458,["note"]="Aelthalyste: Touch of Weakness",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/touch-of-weakness-and-dark-sacrifice:goal:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4606,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5661}}},["npcName"]="Aelthalyste",["x"]=0.4926,["title"]="Touch of Weakness",["quest"]=5661,["y"]=0.17120000000000002}},["detail"]="Hand the letter to Aelthalyste in the Undercity's War Quarter: travel to Orgrimmar and take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/touch-of-weakness-and-dark-sacrifice:step:7",["text"]="Touch of Weakness: Var'jun's letter",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5661}}}},{["goals"]={{["m