n from the tower outside Orgrimmar lands in Tirisfal Glades.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/touch-of-weakness-and-dark-sacrifice:step:13",["text"]="Dark Sacrifice: Ur'kyo's letter",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5646}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1458,["note"]="Aelthalyste: Dark Sacrifice",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/touch-of-weakness-and-dark-sacrifice:goal:14:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4606,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5644}}},["npcName"]="Aelthalyste",["x"]=0.4926,["title"]="Dark Sacrifice",["quest"]=5644,["y"]=0.17120000000000002}},["detail"]="Hand the letter to Aelthalyste in the Undercity's War Quarter: travel to Orgrimmar and take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/priest/touch-of-weakness-and-dark-sacrifice:step:14",["text"]="Dark Sacrifice: Miles Welsh's letter",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={5644}}}}},["max"]=20,["name"]="Touch of Weakness and Dark Sacrifice (10-20)",["min"]=10,["availability"]="source-listed",["races"]={"Scourge"},["category"]="Class",["classes"]={"PRIEST"},["faction"]="Horde",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["zoneName"]="Undercity"},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1411,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde",["zoneName"]="Durotar",["max"]=13,["min"]=10,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Blade of Cunning (Horde) (10-13)",["faction"]="Horde",["classes"]={"ROGUE"},["category"]="Class",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:1:1",["level"]=10,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1411,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6446},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=210,["npc"]=3170,["y"]=0.43689999999999996,["x"]=0.5197999999999999,["title"]="Therzok",["npcName"]="Kaplak",["closedBy"]={1963,1885},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=1859,["minLevel"]=10}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:step:1",["text"]="Therzok",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc"}},["detail"]="At 10 Kaplak, the rogue trainer in Razor Hill, sends you to Therzok in Orgrimmar. It is only a pointer: an Orc already in Orgrimmar can skip it and take The Shattered Hand from Therzok straight away."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:2:1",["level"]=12,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:2:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6446,["npcName"]="Therzok",["x"]=0.42729999999999996,["title"]="Therzok",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc"}},["quest"]=1859,["y"]=0.5355},{["map"]=1454,["crumbs"]={1859},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:2:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6446,["y"]=0.5355,["x"]=0.42729999999999996,["title"]="The Shattered Hand",["npcName"]="Therzok",["minLevel"]=10,["qlvl"]=13,["quest"]=1963,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:step:2",["text"]="The Shattered Hand",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["detail"]="Therzok stands in the Cleft of Shadow, the canyon under the Valley of Strength. Trolls: take The Shattered Hand from him at 10."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:3:1",["level"]=12,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Tazan's Satchel",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Tazan's Satchel: Tazan",["fromId"]=6494,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="npc",["item"]=7209,["y"]=0.4429,["x"]=0.6311,["title"]="The Shattered Hand",["from"]="Tazan",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:3:2",["count"]=1,["quest"]=1963,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:step:3",["text"]="Tazan",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["detail"]="Tazan (level 13, not elite) is a troll pirate on the Merchant Coast south of Ratchet: he walks the fenced hill path between the lower pirate camp by the beached ship and the upper camp by a big tree. Fight him at the foot of the hill, away from the camps. He always drops his satchel and is back 4 1/2 minutes after a death; one satchel per kill, so two rogues need two kills. Hand the satchel in unopened: picking its lock now destroys it and you must kill him again."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:4:1",["level"]=12,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1454,["note"]="Therzok, Cleft of Shadow",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6446,["npcName"]="Therzok",["x"]=0.42729999999999996,["title"]="The Shattered Hand",["quest"]=1963,["y"]=0.5355},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:4:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6446,["y"]=0.5355,["x"]=0.42729999999999996,["title"]="The Shattered Hand",["npcName"]="Therzok",["pre"]={1963},["qlvl"]=13,["quest"]=1858,["minLevel"]=10}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:step:4",["text"]="Back to Therzok",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:5:1",["level"]=12,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1454,["itemName"]="Tazan's Key",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["fromId"]=6466,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.6803,["x"]=0.54,["item"]=7208,["from"]="Gamon",["text"]="Pick Pocket Gamon for Tazan's Key",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:5:2"},{["map"]=1454,["itemName"]="Tazan's Satchel",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:5:3",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.68,["x"]=0.54,["title"]="The Shattered Hand",["note"]="Tazan's Satchel, once you have the key",["item"]=7209,["quest"]=1858,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1454,["itemName"]="Tazan's Logbook",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:5:4",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.68,["x"]=0.54,["title"]="The Shattered Hand",["note"]="Tazan's Logbook, from the satchel",["item"]=7295,["count"]=1,["quest"]=1858,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:step:5",["text"]="Tazan's Key",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["detail"]="Therzok hands the satchel back: now open it. Gamon (level 12) kneels by the innkeeper in the inn in the Valley of Strength; stealth up and pick his pocket for Tazan's Key (do not kill him: the key almost never drops). Players often kill him, so you may wait up to 5 minutes for him. Then use the key on Tazan's Satchel in your bags. If you have trained Pick Lock, you can pick the satchel's lock instead."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1454,["note"]="Therzok, Cleft of Shadow",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6446,["npcName"]="Therzok",["x"]=0.42729999999999996,["title"]="The Shattered Hand",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=7298,["itemName"]="Blade of Cunning"}}},["quest"]=1858,["y"]=0.5355}},["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:6",["text"]="Therzok's reward",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:2:1",["level"]=10,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1420,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6467},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:7:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=210,["npc"]=2130,["y"]=0.52,["x"]=0.6175,["title"]="Mennet Carkad",["npcName"]="Marion Call",["closedBy"]={1886,1859},["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=1885,["minLevel"]=10}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:step:7",["text"]="Mennet Carkad",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="At 10 Marion Call, the rogue trainer upstairs in the Gallows' End Tavern in Brill, sends you to Mennet Carkad in the Undercity."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:8:1",["level"]=12,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1458,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:8:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6467,["npcName"]="Mennet Carkad",["x"]=0.8351000000000001,["title"]="Mennet Carkad",["quest"]=1885,["y"]=0.6911},{["map"]=1458,["crumbs"]={1885},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:8:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6467,["y"]=0.6911,["x"]=0.8351000000000001,["title"]="The Deathstalkers",["npcName"]="Mennet Carkad",["minLevel"]=10,["qlvl"]=13,["quest"]=1886,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:step:8",["text"]="The Rogues' Quarter",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="Mennet Carkad stands in the Rogues' Quarter."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:9:1",["level"]=12,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["itemName"]="Astor's Letter of Introduction",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["fromFaction"]="H",["item"]=7231,["quest"]=1886,["map"]=1421,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=6497,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.3222,["x"]=0.4971,["title"]="The Deathstalkers",["from"]="Astor Hadren",["note"]="Astor's Letter of Introduction: Astor Hadren",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:9:2"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:step:9",["text"]="Astor Hadren",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="Astor Hadren (level 13) walks the road between the Sepulcher and the Undercity, north of the Sepulcher. He looks like a friendly traveller with no quest mark. Talk to him and pick both of his answers: he turns hostile. Kill him for the letter (it always drops). Fight him away from guards, who can take the kill and leave no loot; only one rogue per kill gets the letter. He is back 5 minutes after a death."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1458,["note"]="Mennet Carkad, Rogues' Quarter",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:10:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6467,["npcName"]="Mennet Carkad",["x"]=0.8351000000000001,["title"]="The Deathstalkers",["quest"]=1886,["y"]=0.6911},{["map"]=1458,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:10:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6467,["y"]=0.6911,["x"]=0.8351000000000001,["title"]="The Deathstalkers",["npcName"]="Mennet Carkad",["pre"]={1886},["qlvl"]=13,["quest"]=1898,["minLevel"]=10}},["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:10",["text"]="Back to Mennet Carkad",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:11:1",["level"]=12,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1458,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:11:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6522,["npcName"]="Andron Gant",["x"]=0.5481,["title"]="The Deathstalkers",["quest"]=1898,["y"]=0.7633},{["map"]=1458,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:11:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6522,["y"]=0.7633,["x"]=0.5481,["title"]="The Deathstalkers",["npcName"]="Andron Gant",["pre"]={1898},["qlvl"]=13,["quest"]=1899,["minLevel"]=10},{["map"]=1458,["itemName"]="Andron's Ledger",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Andron's Ledger: Andron's Bookshelf",["fromId"]=103600,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="object",["item"]=7294,["y"]=0.7696,["x"]=0.5539999999999999,["title"]="The Deathstalkers",["from"]="Andron's Bookshelf",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:goal:11:4",["count"]=1,["quest"]=1899,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:step:11",["text"]="Andron Gant",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="Andron Gant is in the Apothecarium, in its biggest room, where two huge guards watch a small bridge. His ledger is on the bookshelf in the back room behind him, not the shelf on the wall next to him."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1458,["note"]="Mennet Carkad, Rogues' Quarter",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:12:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6467,["npcName"]="Mennet Carkad",["x"]=0.8351000000000001,["title"]="The Deathstalkers",["quest"]=1899,["y"]=0.6911},{["map"]=1458,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:12:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6467,["y"]=0.6911,["x"]=0.8351000000000001,["title"]="The Deathstalkers",["npcName"]="Mennet Carkad",["pre"]={1899},["qlvl"]=13,["quest"]=1978,["minLevel"]=10},{["map"]=1458,["note"]="Varimathras, Royal Quarter",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:12:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2425,["npcName"]="Varimathras",["x"]=0.5625,["title"]="The Deathstalkers",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=7298,["itemName"]="Blade of Cunning"}}},["quest"]=1978,["y"]=0.922}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/blade-of-cunning-horde:12",["text"]="Mennet Carkad and Varimathras",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="Mennet Carkad sends the ledger on to Varimathras, the big demon in the middle of the Hall of the Dark Lady in the Royal Quarter, past its elite guards; the way in is the passage off the Apothecarium. If you lose the ledger, take another from Andron Gant's bookshelf."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1454,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers",["zoneName"]="Orgrimmar",["max"]=20,["min"]=16,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Plundering the Plunderers (16-20)",["faction"]="Horde",["classes"]={"ROGUE"},["category"]="Class",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:1:1",["level"]=16,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1411,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={3401},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=120,["npc"]=3170,["y"]=0.43689999999999996,["x"]=0.5197999999999999,["title"]="To Orgrimmar!",["npcName"]="Kaplak",["closedBy"]={2378},["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=2380,["minLevel"]=16}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:step:1",["text"]="To Orgrimmar!",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll","Skyborne"}},["detail"]="At 16 Kaplak, the rogue trainer in Razor Hill, sends you to Shenthul in Orgrimmar."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:2:1",["level"]=16,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1458,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={3401},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:goal:2:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=120,["npc"]=6467,["y"]=0.6911,["x"]=0.8351000000000001,["title"]="Find the Shattered Hand",["npcName"]="Mennet Carkad",["closedBy"]={2380},["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=2378,["minLevel"]=16},{["map"]=1458,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:2:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6467,["npcName"]="Mennet Carkad",["x"]=0.8351000000000001,["title"]="Fenwick Thatros",["y"]=0.6911,["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=1998,["minLevel"]=16}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:step:2",["text"]="Find the Shattered Hand",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="At 16 Mennet Carkad in the Rogues' Quarter sends you to Shenthul in Orgrimmar. Take Fenwick Thatros from him too; it is done in Silverpine Forest at the end of this guide."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:3:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3401,["npcName"]="Shenthul",["x"]=0.4305,["title"]="To Orgrimmar!",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll","Skyborne"}},["quest"]=2380,["y"]=0.5374},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:3:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3401,["npcName"]="Shenthul",["x"]=0.4305,["title"]="Find the Shattered Hand",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["quest"]=2378,["y"]=0.5374},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:3:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3401,["y"]=0.5374,["x"]=0.4305,["title"]="Zando'zan",["npcName"]="Shenthul",["pre"]={2378,2380},["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=2379,["minLevel"]=16},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:3:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3402,["npcName"]="Zando'zan",["x"]=0.42729999999999996,["title"]="Zando'zan",["quest"]=2379,["y"]=0.5295000000000001},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:3:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3402,["y"]=0.5295000000000001,["x"]=0.42729999999999996,["title"]="Wrenix of Ratchet",["npcName"]="Zando'zan",["pre"]={2379},["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=2382,["minLevel"]=16}},["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:3",["text"]="Shenthul and Zando'zan",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Undead take the zeppelin from the towers outside the Undercity to Durotar. Shenthul and Zando'zan stand in the Cleft of Shadow, the canyon under the Valley of Strength. Train Pick Lock from Shenthul (or any rogue trainer) now if you lack it: this job is a lockpicking test."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:goal:4:1",["level"]=17,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1413,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:goal:4:2",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=16227,["npcName"]="Bragok",["x"]=0.6308,["location"]="Ratchet",["y"]=0.3716,["node"]=80,["area"]=392},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:4:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7161,["npcName"]="Wrenix the Wretched",["x"]=0.6307,["title"]="Wrenix of Ratchet",["quest"]=2382,["y"]=0.3632},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:4:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7161,["y"]=0.3632,["x"]=0.6307,["title"]="Plundering the Plunderers",["npcName"]="Wrenix the Wretched",["pre"]={2382},["qlvl"]=18,["quest"]=2381,["minLevel"]=16},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="E.C.A.C.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:4:4",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=7166,["npcName"]="Wrenix's Gizmotronic Apparatus",["x"]=0.6312,["item"]=7970,["note"]="E.C.A.C.: Wrenix's Gizmotronic Apparatus",["y"]=0.3632,["count"]=1},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Thieves' Tools",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:4:5",["t"]="buy",["npc"]=7166,["npcName"]="Wrenix's Gizmotronic Apparatus",["x"]=0.6312,["item"]=5060,["y"]=0.3632,["count"]=1}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:step:4",["text"]="Wrenix the Wretched",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Fly or walk to Ratchet on the Barrens coast. Wrenix the Wretched stands in a small shed near the bank, up the hill to the left before the docks. His Gizmotronic Apparatus beside him hands out what the job needs: take an E.C.A.C. and Thieves' Tools (Pick Lock does not work without the tools in your bags)."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:goal:5:1",["level"]=18,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Southsea Treasure",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Southsea Treasure: Polly, after the E.C.A.C.",["fromId"]=7168,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="npc",["item"]=7968,["y"]=0.455,["x"]=0.6478,["title"]="Plundering the Plunderers",["from"]="Polly",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:goal:5:2",["count"]=1,["quest"]=2381,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:step:5",["text"]="Southsea Treasure",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Follow the coast south from Ratchet to the first beached pirate ship, the Tide Razor, and climb aboard up its bow. On the middle deck the Buccaneer's Strongboxes come back fast: pick them until your Lockpicking is about 30 (a few are trapped with a frost nova or turn you into a rat; picking still works as a rat). Keep picking while they still give skill: the poisons job at 20 ends at a lockbox that needs about 75, and these boxes are the closest practice. Then go down to the bottom hold and pick the lock of The Jewel of the Southsea: it is empty, but opening it calls a giant level 50 Polly into the next room. Stay stealthed, put the E.C.A.C. on your action bar, target Polly and use it: the parrot shrinks to level 18. Kill it for the Southsea Treasure."},{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:6",["text"]="Back to Wrenix the Wretched",["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Wrenix the Wretched: ten Thistle Tea",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7161,["npcName"]="Wrenix the Wretched",["x"]=0.6307,["title"]="Plundering the Plunderers",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=7676,["itemName"]="Thistle Tea"}}},["quest"]=2381,["y"]=0.3632}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1421,["itemName"]="Fenwick's Head",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Fenwick's Head: Fenwick Thatros",["fromId"]=6570,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=1998,["count"]=1,["y"]=0.3394,["x"]=0.5958,["item"]=7306,["from"]="Fenwick Thatros",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:goal:7:1",["title"]="Fenwick Thatros",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:step:7",["text"]="Fenwick Thatros",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="Take the zeppelin from Orgrimmar to the Undercity and head south into Silverpine. Fenwick Thatros (level 16) stands alone on the old ferry dock on Lordamere Lake, north-east of the Sepulcher. His Uppercut knocks you back, so do not fight him at the dock's edge. He always drops his head and is back 4 1/2 minutes after a death."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:goal:8:1",["level"]=19,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1458,["note"]="Mennet Carkad, Rogues' Quarter",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:8:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6467,["npcName"]="Mennet Carkad",["x"]=0.8351000000000001,["title"]="Fenwick Thatros",["quest"]=1998,["y"]=0.6911},{["map"]=1458,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:8:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=6467,["y"]=0.6911,["x"]=0.8351000000000001,["title"]="Tools of the Trade",["npcName"]="Mennet Carkad",["pre"]={1998},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=1999,["minLevel"]=16}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:step:8",["text"]="Mennet Carkad",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="If you have no Thieves' Tools left, ask Estelle Gendry, the outfitter in the Rogues' Quarter."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:goal:9:1",["level"]=20,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1421,["itemName"]="Dalaran Status Report",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Dalaran Status Report: Ambermill Strongbox",["fromId"]=103815,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="object",["item"]=7309,["y"]=0.6524,["x"]=0.6371,["title"]="Tools of the Trade",["from"]="Ambermill Strongbox",["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:9:1",["count"]=1,["quest"]=1999,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:step:9",["text"]="Ambermill",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["detail"]="The Kirin Tor keep their reports in walled Ambermill, in south-east Silverpine. Facing the town hall, take the building on the right: the Ambermill Strongbox is in a corner room upstairs (any Lockpicking opens it; the Thieves' Tools must be in your bags). Three casters of level 19-20 guard that floor and see through stealth, one walking in and out of the strongbox room: time it or fight them one at a time."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1458,["note"]="Mennet Carkad, Rogues' Quarter",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:10:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6467,["npcName"]="Mennet Carkad",["x"]=0.8351000000000001,["title"]="Tools of the Trade",["quest"]=1999,["y"]=0.6911}},["id"]="forever/class/rogue/plundering-the-plunderers:10",["text"]="Back to Mennet Carkad",["only"]={["races"]={"Scourge"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1454,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde",["zoneName"]="Orgrimmar",["max"]=26,["min"]=20,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Poisons (Horde) (20-26)",["faction"]="Horde",["classes"]={"ROGUE"},["category"]="Class",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:1:1",["level"]=20,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1413,["x"]=0.644,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:1:2",["text"]="Tide Razor",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.45399999999999996},{["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:1:3",["t"]="task",["text"]="Lockpicking about 75: pick the Buccaneer's Strongboxes on the Tide Razor"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:step:1",["text"]="Lockpicking practice",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Gallywix's Lockbox at the end of the tower job needs Lockpicking of about 70-75. Train Pick Lock from Gest or Shenthul in the Cleft of Shadow if you lack it, carry Thieves' Tools, and pick the Buccaneer's Strongboxes on the middle deck of the Tide Razor, the beached pirate ship south of Ratchet: they come back fast. Your cap rises 5 per level."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:1:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3401,["npcName"]="Shenthul",["x"]=0.4305,["title"]="The Shattered Salute",["y"]=0.5374,["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=2460,["minLevel"]=20},{["map"]=1454,["note"]="/salute Shenthul",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:2:2",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Shenthul"}},["y"]=0.5374,["x"]=0.4305,["title"]="The Shattered Salute",["quest"]=2460},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:1:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3401,["npcName"]="Shenthul",["x"]=0.4305,["title"]="The Shattered Salute",["quest"]=2460,["y"]=0.5374},{["map"]=1454,["note"]="Deep Cover: keep the Flare Gun",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:1:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3401,["y"]=0.5374,["x"]=0.4305,["title"]="Deep Cover",["npcName"]="Shenthul",["pre"]={2460},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=2458,["minLevel"]=20}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:step:2",["text"]="The Shattered Salute",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Shenthul stands in the Cleft of Shadow, the canyon under the Valley of Strength. Take the quest and wait: he speaks three lines and salutes you. After his third line, target him and type /salute. If it does not count, abandon the quest and take it again. The tower job ahead is built around Ambush, which needs a dagger: if you have none, Kareth, the blade merchant in the Cleft of Shadow, sells a Jambiya."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Flare Gun",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:3:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.055999999999999994,["x"]=0.5539999999999999,["item"]=8051,["note"]="Flare Gun, twice, at Fizzule"},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Taskmaster Fizzule: Fizzule's Whistle",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:2:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7233,["npcName"]="Taskmaster Fizzule",["x"]=0.5544,["title"]="Deep Cover",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=8066,["itemName"]="Fizzule's Whistle"}}},["quest"]=2458,["y"]=0.0556},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:2:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7233,["y"]=0.0556,["x"]=0.5544,["title"]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable",["npcName"]="Taskmaster Fizzule",["pre"]={2458},["qlvl"]=24,["quest"]=2478,["minLevel"]=20}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:step:3",["text"]="Taskmaster Fizzule",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Fly to the Crossroads and head north to the Venture Co. tower above the Sludge Fen. Fizzule stands under a tree east of the tower, outside it, and is hostile until signalled. Target him from about 50 yards and fire the Flare Gun twice, then walk up in front of him and /salute. In any other order he attacks. Lost the Flare Gun? Abandon and retake from Shenthul."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Silixiz's Tower Key",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2478}},["item"]=8072,["quest"]=2478,["map"]=1413,["oi"]=5,["fromId"]=7287,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.059699999999999996,["x"]=0.5479999999999999,["title"]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable",["from"]="Foreman Silixiz",["text"]="Pick Pocket Foreman Silixiz for Silixiz's Tower Key",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:4:1"},{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:4:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7310,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2478}},["y"]=0.057,["x"]=0.547,["title"]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable",["target"]="Mutated Venture Co. Drone",["count"]=2,["quest"]=2478,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:4:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7308,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2478}},["y"]=0.056799999999999996,["x"]=0.5466,["title"]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable",["target"]="Venture Co. Patroller",["count"]=2,["quest"]=2478,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:4:4",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7307,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2478}},["y"]=0.057699999999999994,["x"]=0.5464,["title"]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable",["target"]="Venture Co. Lookout",["count"]=2,["quest"]=2478,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["itemName"]="Gallywix's Head",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=23},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2478}},["item"]=8074,["fromRank"]=1,["quest"]=2478,["map"]=1413,["oi"]=4,["fromId"]=7288,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.0559,["x"]=0.5475,["title"]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable",["from"]="Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix",["note"]="Gallywix's Head: Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix (elite)",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:4:5"},{["itemName"]="Cache of Zanzil's Altered Mixture",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["rank"]=1,["kind"]="elite",["near"]=true,["lvl"]=23},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2478}},["item"]=8073,["quest"]=2478,["map"]=1413,["oi"]=6,["fromId"]=129127,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.0556,["x"]=0.5476,["title"]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable",["from"]="Gallywix's Lockbox",["note"]="Cache of Zanzil's Altered Mixture: Gallywix's Lockbox",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:4:6"}},["detail"]="Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix on the top floor is a level 23 elite: easier at 23 or with a friend. Keep Fizzule's Whistle in your bags and use it on him every time you come near, or he turns hostile. First Pick Pocket Silixiz's Tower Key from Foreman Silixiz (level 22), who walks by the tower: stealth up behind him (killing him does not give it). Then clear the tower floor by floor (everything comes back after 4 1/2 minutes): Mutated Venture Co. Drones (25) on the ground floor, Patrollers on the second, Lookouts on the open third, Gallywix on top, back 10 minutes after a kill. Pick Gallywix's Lockbox beside him for the cache: it poisons you with the Touch of Zanzil, which weakens your stealth and agility until Serge Hinott cures it.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:step:4",["text"]="The Venture Co. tower, with a group",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=2478}}},{["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:5:1",["level"]=25,["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=2478}}},{["itemName"]="Silixiz's Tower Key",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=2478}},["item"]=8072,["quest"]=2478,["map"]=1413,["oi"]=5,["fromId"]=7287,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.059699999999999996,["x"]=0.5479999999999999,["title"]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable",["from"]="Foreman Silixiz",["text"]="Pick Pocket Foreman Silixiz for Silixiz's Tower Key",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:5:2"},{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:5:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7310,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=2478}},["y"]=0.057,["x"]=0.547,["title"]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable",["target"]="Mutated Venture Co. Drone",["count"]=2,["quest"]=2478,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:5:4",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7308,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=2478}},["y"]=0.056799999999999996,["x"]=0.5466,["title"]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable",["target"]="Venture Co. Patroller",["count"]=2,["quest"]=2478,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:5:5",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7307,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=2478}},["y"]=0.057699999999999994,["x"]=0.5464,["title"]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable",["target"]="Venture Co. Lookout",["count"]=2,["quest"]=2478,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["itemName"]="Gallywix's Head",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=23},["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=2478}},["item"]=8074,["fromRank"]=1,["quest"]=2478,["map"]=1413,["oi"]=4,["fromId"]=7288,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.0559,["x"]=0.5475,["title"]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable",["from"]="Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix",["note"]="Gallywix's Head: Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix (elite)",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:5:6"},{["itemName"]="Cache of Zanzil's Altered Mixture",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["rank"]=1,["kind"]="elite",["near"]=true,["lvl"]=23},["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=2478}},["item"]=8073,["quest"]=2478,["map"]=1413,["oi"]=6,["fromId"]=129127,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.0556,["x"]=0.5476,["title"]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable",["from"]="Gallywix's Lockbox",["note"]="Cache of Zanzil's Altered Mixture: Gallywix's Lockbox",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:5:7"}},["detail"]="Keep Fizzule's Whistle in your bags and use it on him every time you come near, or he turns hostile. Foreman Silixiz (level 22) walks by the tower: hug the wall, stealth up behind him and Pick Pocket the key. Killing him does not give it; if his pockets are empty, kill him and wait 4 1/2 minutes for him to come back. Inside, floor by floor (everything comes back after 4 1/2 minutes): the Mutated Venture Co. Drones (level 25) on the ground floor die to one Ambush with a dagger; the Patrollers on the second floor take half their health from a one-point Rupture; the Lookouts on the open third floor from a one-point Eviscerate. Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix waits on the top floor: a level 23 elite, back 10 minutes after a kill. Open with Ambush (about half his health), then Gouge, Evasion, a healing potion and Thistle Tea; a friend makes it easy. One head per kill. Then pick Gallywix's Lockbox beside him for the cache: it poisons you with the Touch of Zanzil, which weakens your stealth and agility until Serge Hinott cures it.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:step:5",["text"]="The Venture Co. tower, solo",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=2478}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1454,["note"]="Shenthul: Recipe: Thistle Tea",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3401,["npcName"]="Shenthul",["x"]=0.4305,["title"]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=18160,["itemName"]="Recipe: Thistle Tea"}}},["quest"]=2478,["y"]=0.5374},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:4:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3401,["y"]=0.5374,["x"]=0.4305,["title"]="Hinott's Assistance",["npcName"]="Shenthul",["pre"]={2478},["qlvl"]=26,["quest"]=2479,["minLevel"]=20}},["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:4",["text"]="Back to Shenthul",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Fly back to Orgrimmar (Ratchet or the Crossroads; dying at the tower and taking the spirit healer's way back to the Crossroads is quicker). Keep Silixiz's Tower Key afterwards. Before you leave the Cleft, buy Dust of Decay and Empty Vials from Rekkul: once Hinott teaches Poisons, each batch of Instant Poison takes one of each."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1424,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:7:1",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=2389,["npcName"]="Zarise",["x"]=0.6014,["location"]="Tarren Mill",["y"]=0.1862,["node"]=13,["area"]=272},{["map"]=1424,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:5:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2391,["npcName"]="Serge Hinott",["x"]=0.6163000000000001,["title"]="Hinott's Assistance",["quest"]=2479,["y"]=0.19190000000000002},{["map"]=1424,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:5:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2391,["y"]=0.19190000000000002,["x"]=0.6163000000000001,["title"]="Hinott's Assistance",["npcName"]="Serge Hinott",["pre"]={2479},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=2480,["minLevel"]=20},{["note"]="Wait for the cure",["title"]="Hinott's Assistance",["quest"]=2480,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:7:4",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Cure Completed"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1424,["note"]="Serge Hinott: Poisons",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:5:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2391,["npcName"]="Serge Hinott",["x"]=0.6163000000000001,["title"]="Hinott's Assistance",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=8095,["itemName"]="Hinott's Oil"}}},["quest"]=2480,["y"]=0.19190000000000002},{["map"]=1424,["itemName"]="Hinott's Oil",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:goal:7:6",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.19190000000000002,["x"]=0.6163000000000001,["item"]=8095,["note"]="Hinott's Oil: clears the Touch of Zanzil",["optional"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/rogue/poisons-horde:step:7",["text"]="Serge Hinott",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Take the zeppelin from Orgrimmar to the Undercity and follow the road south through Silverpine Forest into Hillsbrad, to Tarren Mill. Serge Hinott works in the building next to the flight path, beside Apothecary Lydon, a wagon outside. If you lost the Sample of Zanzil's Mixture, abandon and retake from Shenthul. Stay beside him for about a minute while he brews the cure; if it never finishes, abandon and retake from him. Then open Poisons from your spellbook to make Instant Poison from Rekkul's dust and vials, and use it on your weapon."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1454,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde",["zoneName"]="Orgrimmar",["max"]=40,["min"]=30,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Call of Air and the Tempest's Weapons (Horde) (30-40)",["faction"]="Horde",["classes"]={"SHAMAN"},["category"]="Class",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:1:1",["level"]=30,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={5905},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=2450,["npc"]=5892,["y"]=0.37729999999999997,["x"]=0.3796,["title"]="Call of Air",["npcName"]="Searn Firewarder",["closedBy"]={1532,96136},["qlvl"]=30,["quest"]=1531,["minLevel"]=30}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:1",["text"]="Searn Firewarder",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["detail"]="At 30 Searn Firewarder in the Valley of Wisdom sends you to Prate Cloudseer in Thousand Needles. Your level 30 air totems (Grounding, Nature Resistance) need the Air Totem she gives."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:2:1",["level"]=30,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1412,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={5905},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:2:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=2750,["npc"]=259119,["y"]=0.2257,["x"]=0.3337,["title"]="Call of Air",["npcName"]="Alaana Stormwalker",["closedBy"]={1531,1532},["qlvl"]=35,["quest"]=96136,["minLevel"]=30}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:2",["text"]="Alaana Stormwalker",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["detail"]="At 30 Skyborne shamans get their own Call of Air. Alaana Stormwalker waits where the airship from Zephras Isle lands, in northern Mulgore beside Thunder Bluff. Your level 30 air totems need the Air Totem Prate Cloudseer gives. If she has nothing for you, head up to Xanis Flameweaver in Thunder Bluff (next step): the trainers' Call of Air is open to Skyborne and gives the same totem."},{["detail"]="At 30 Xanis Flameweaver, a shaman trainer on Spirit Rise in Thunder Bluff, sends you to Prate Cloudseer in Thousand Needles. Your level 30 air totems (Grounding, Nature Resistance) need the Air Totem Prate gives. Already carry Searn Firewarder's Call of Air from Orgrimmar? It goes to Prate Cloudseer too: skip Xanis Flameweaver.",["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:3:1",["level"]=30,["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={96136}},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1531}}}},{["map"]=1456,["xp"]=2450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={5905},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:3:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5906,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={96136}},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1531}}},["y"]=0.2051,["x"]=0.2516,["title"]="Call of Air",["npcName"]="Xanis Flameweaver",["closedBy"]={1531,96136},["qlvl"]=30,["quest"]=1532,["minLevel"]=30}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:3",["text"]="Xanis Flameweaver",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={96136}},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1531}}}},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:4:1",["level"]=43,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1441,["x"]=0.535,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:4:2",["text"]="Prate Cloudseer",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.426}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:4",["text"]="Prate Cloudseer",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Fly to Freewind Post. Prate Cloudseer stands on a ledge above a cave mouth in the canyon wall north-east of the post, not inside the cave: climb the slope beside it. She also gives you an hour of faster attacks and running."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1441,["note"]="Prate Cloudseer: your Air Totem",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5905,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1531}}},["npcName"]="Prate Cloudseer",["x"]=0.5354,["title"]="Call of Air",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=5178,["itemName"]="Air Totem"}}},["quest"]=1531,["y"]=0.4265}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:5",["text"]="Continue the route",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1531}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1441,["note"]="Prate Cloudseer: your Air Totem",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5905,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1532}}},["npcName"]="Prate Cloudseer",["x"]=0.5354,["title"]="Call of Air",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=5178,["itemName"]="Air Totem"}}},["quest"]=1532,["y"]=0.4265}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:6",["text"]="Continue the route",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1532}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1441,["note"]="Prate Cloudseer: your Air Totem",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:7:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5905,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={96136}}},["npcName"]="Prate Cloudseer",["x"]=0.5354,["title"]="Call of Air",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=5178,["itemName"]="Air Totem"}}},["quest"]=96136,["y"]=0.4265}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:7",["text"]="Continue the route",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={96136}}}},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:8",["text"]="Prate Cloudseer",["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:8:1",["level"]=43,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1441,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:8:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5905,["y"]=0.4265,["x"]=0.5354,["title"]="Elemental Aid",["npcName"]="Prate Cloudseer",["pre"]={1531,1532,96136},["qlvl"]=33,["quest"]=79360,["minLevel"]=30}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:9:1",["level"]=33,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Tattered Note",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=33},["t"]="collect",["note"]="Tattered Note, from Charlga Razorflank",["y"]=0.902,["x"]=0.429,["title"]="Elemental Aid",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:9:2",["count"]=1,["item"]=274463,["quest"]=79360,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:9",["text"]="Charlga Razorflank",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Razorfen Kraul is a five-player dungeon at the southern edge of the Barrens (the arrow points at its entrance); Charlga Razorflank (level 33 elite) is its last boss. She casts Chain Bolt, Renew on her allies and Purity; the Tattered Note drops only from her."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:10:1",["level"]=42,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1441,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:5:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4722,["npcName"]="Rau Cliffrunner",["x"]=0.46140000000000003,["title"]="Elemental Aid",["quest"]=79360,["y"]=0.5171},{["map"]=1441,["npc"]=4722,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={5905,6176},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:10:3",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=270,["qlvl"]=33,["npcName"]="Rau Cliffrunner",["x"]=0.46140000000000003,["minLevel"]=30,["closedBy"]={98338},["pre"]={79360},["title"]="Eyes on the Sky",["quest"]=79364,["y"]=0.5171}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:10",["text"]="Rau Cliffrunner",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Rau Cliffrunner stands at Freewind Post."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:11",["text"]="Prate Cloudseer",["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:11:1",["level"]=43,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1441,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5905,["npcName"]="Prate Cloudseer",["x"]=0.5354,["title"]="Eyes on the Sky",["quest"]=79364,["y"]=0.4265},{["map"]=1441,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:11:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5905,["y"]=0.4265,["x"]=0.5354,["title"]="Storm, Earth, and Fire",["npcName"]="Prate Cloudseer",["pre"]={79364},["qlvl"]=43,["quest"]=79361,["minLevel"]=30}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:12:1",["level"]=43,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["itemName"]="Twisted Air Totem",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=274047,["quest"]=79361,["map"]=1443,["oi"]=4,["fromId"]=4655,["t"]="collect",["spread"]=true,["y"]=0.6035,["x"]=0.3358,["title"]="Storm, Earth, and Fire",["lvl"]=38,["count"]=5,["from"]="Maraudine Wrangler",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:12:2"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:12",["text"]="Twisted Air Totems",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Five Twisted Air Totems. The Maraudine centaurs (level 36-40) north and north-east of Shadowprey Village in western Desolace carry them; the Scouts drop one nearly every other kill. Wranglers Net and Disarm, Windchasers heal, Stormers throw Jumping Lightning: pull one at a time. Respawn about five minutes."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:13:1",["level"]=42,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1445,["itemName"]="Twisted Water Totem",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:13:2",["fromNpcsAt"]="2,1;1,2;2,5;3,4,6;3,4,6;3,4,6;3,4,6;3;3;3;3;2,5;2,5;3,4,6",["t"]="collect",["spread"]=true,["y"]=0.2137,["x"]=0.5715,["item"]=274046,["lvl"]=38,["count"]=5,["title"]="Storm, Earth, and Fire",["quest"]=79361,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:13",["text"]="Twisted Water Totems",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Five Twisted Water Totems. The Mirefin murlocs (level 35-38) north-east of Brackenwall Village in northern Dustwallow Marsh carry them."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:14:1",["level"]=42,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1418,["itemName"]="Twisted Fire Totem",["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:14:2",["t"]="collect",["count"]=5,["quest"]=79361,["y"]=0.7119,["x"]=0.4874,["title"]="Storm, Earth, and Fire",["lvl"]=43,["fromNpcsAt"]="7,9;1,2;6,8;1,2;4,3,5,8,10;4,3,5;3,5,4;4,5",["item"]=274044,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:14",["text"]="Twisted Fire Totems",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Five Twisted Fire Totems. The Stonevault troggs (Skullthumpers, Bonesnappers and Shamans, level 37-41) south of Angor Fortress in the Badlands carry them; the Shamans drop Fire Nova Totems and a Healing Ward, the Bonesnappers run for help when hurt. Respawn about five minutes."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:15:1",["level"]=43,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1435,["itemName"]="Twisted Earth Totem",["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:15:2",["fromNpcsAt"]="1,2;1,2;1,2;4,2,3;3,4,2;7,6,3,8,4,5;6,4,3,8,7,5,9;6,3,4,8,7,5,9",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.31129999999999997,["x"]=0.48460000000000003,["title"]="Storm, Earth, and Fire",["lvl"]=36,["item"]=274045,["count"]=5,["quest"]=79361,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:15",["text"]="Twisted Earth Totems",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Five Twisted Earth Totems. The Lost Ones (murlocs, level 34-39) north and north-east of Stonard in the Swamp of Sorrows carry them; most run for help when hurt."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:16",["text"]="Prate Cloudseer",["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:16:1",["level"]=43,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1441,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:11:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5905,["npcName"]="Prate Cloudseer",["x"]=0.5354,["title"]="Storm, Earth, and Fire",["quest"]=79361,["y"]=0.4265},{["map"]=1441,["npc"]=5905,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={4722},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:16:3",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=3150,["qlvl"]=40,["npcName"]="Prate Cloudseer",["x"]=0.5354,["minLevel"]=30,["closedBy"]={96135},["pre"]={79361},["title"]="Heed My Call",["quest"]=79366,["y"]=0.4265}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:17:1",["level"]=43,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1441,["itemName"]="Eye of the Tempest",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["note"]="Eye of the Tempest, from the Ravaging Tempest",["group"]={["size"]=3,["kind"]="group"},["t"]="collect",["fromId"]=216474,["count"]=1,["y"]=0.4647,["x"]=0.4531,["item"]=212792,["lvl"]=40,["from"]="Ravaging Tempest",["fromRank"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:17:2"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:17",["text"]="The steam pools",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Prate Cloudseer hands you the Corrupted Totems. Place the Corrupted Totems at the steam pools north-west of Freewind Post to call the corrupted elementals and then the Ravaging Tempest; Razormane quilboar join the fight while the ritual runs. A group quest: bring at least one or two friends. The Eye of the Tempest drops about every other kill, and every group member can loot it."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:18",["text"]="Rau Cliffrunner",["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:18:1",["level"]=42,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1441,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:13:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4722,["npcName"]="Rau Cliffrunner",["x"]=0.46140000000000003,["title"]="Heed My Call",["quest"]=79366,["y"]=0.5171},{["map"]=1441,["npc"]=4722,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={6176},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:18:3",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=3900,["qlvl"]=40,["npcName"]="Rau Cliffrunner",["x"]=0.46140000000000003,["minLevel"]=30,["closedBy"]={96016},["pre"]={79366,96135},["title"]="The Tempest's Weapons",["quest"]=79442,["y"]=0.5171}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1416,["note"]="Bath'rah the Windwatcher: the Elementalist's Guard and your weapon",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:goal:19:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6176,["npcName"]="Bath'rah the Windwatcher",["x"]=0.805,["title"]="The Tempest's Weapons",["rewards"]={["choices"]={{["item"]=280607,["itemName"]="Lightning's Grasp"},{["item"]=280605,["itemName"]="Tidebringer's Claw"},{["item"]=280604,["itemName"]="Rage of the Storm"}},["items"]={{["item"]=280696,["itemName"]="Elementalist's Guard"}}},["quest"]=79442,["y"]=0.6692}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-air-horde:step:19",["text"]="Bath'rah the Windwatcher",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Bath'rah the Windwatcher camps in the ruins in the east of Alterac Mountains: from Tarren Mill follow the river east of town north into the hills. Pick your weapon: Lightning's Grasp, Tidebringer's Claw or Rage of the Storm; the Elementalist's Guard shield comes with it."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1411,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde",["zoneName"]="Durotar",["max"]=5,["min"]=4,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Call of Earth (Horde) (4-5)",["faction"]="Horde",["classes"]={"SHAMAN"},["category"]="Class",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:1:1",["level"]=4,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1411,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={5887},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=270,["npc"]=5887,["y"]=0.6917,["x"]=0.424,["title"]="Call of Earth",["npcName"]="Canaga Earthcaller",["closedBy"]={1519,92466},["qlvl"]=4,["quest"]=1516,["minLevel"]=4}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:1",["text"]="Canaga Earthcaller",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["detail"]="Canaga Earthcaller stands just outside the Den, the cave in the middle of the Valley of Trials. The quest opens at level 4."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1411,["itemName"]="Felstalker Hoof",["oi"]=1,["count"]=2,["fromId"]=3102,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=1516,["lvl"]=4,["y"]=0.5534,["x"]=0.4301,["item"]=6640,["from"]="Felstalker",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:2:1",["title"]="Call of Earth",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:2",["text"]="Felstalker Hooves",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["detail"]="Felstalkers (level 3-4) prowl the slope below the Burning Blade Coven, the cave in the north of the valley, and just inside its mouth among the Vile Familiars. Nearly every Felstalker drops a hoof (four kills in five); they respawn in a little over three minutes."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1411,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:3:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5887,["npcName"]="Canaga Earthcaller",["x"]=0.424,["title"]="Call of Earth",["quest"]=1516,["y"]=0.6917},{["map"]=1411,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:3:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5887,["y"]=0.6917,["x"]=0.424,["title"]="Call of Earth",["npcName"]="Canaga Earthcaller",["pre"]={1516,1519},["qlvl"]=4,["quest"]=1517,["minLevel"]=4}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:3",["text"]="Canaga Earthcaller",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["detail"]="Back to Canaga Earthcaller outside the Den. She hands you the Earth Sapta: do not drink it yet."},{["detail"]="Only if the Earth Sapta is gone from your bags (drunk away from the rock, or sold): Canaga Earthcaller gives you another.",["goals"]={{["map"]=1411,["note"]="Canaga Earthcaller: a new Earth Sapta",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5887,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1517}},{["neg"]=true,["item"]=6635,["k"]="has",["n"]=1}},["y"]=0.6917,["x"]=0.424,["title"]="Earth Sapta",["npcName"]="Canaga Earthcaller",["direct"]=true,["qlvl"]=4,["quest"]=1463,["minLevel"]=4}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:4",["text"]="Lost the Earth Sapta?",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1517}},{["neg"]=true,["item"]=6635,["k"]="has",["n"]=1}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1411,["itemName"]="Earth Sapta",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:5:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.764,["x"]=0.441,["item"]=6635,["note"]="Earth Sapta, beside Spirit Rock"},{["map"]=1411,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:5:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5891,["npcName"]="Minor Manifestation of Earth",["x"]=0.4403,["title"]="Call of Earth",["quest"]=1517,["y"]=0.762},{["map"]=1411,["note"]="it hands you the Rough Quartz: keep it",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:5:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5891,["y"]=0.762,["x"]=0.4403,["title"]="Call of Earth",["npcName"]="Minor Manifestation of Earth",["pre"]={1517},["qlvl"]=4,["quest"]=1518,["minLevel"]=4}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:5",["text"]="Spirit Rock",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["detail"]="Spirit Rock sits on a ledge in the hills just south of the Den. The Hidden Path up starts at the foot of the hills south-west of the Den, between two idle peons; it climbs south-west into the hills, then bends back east to the rock. Stand right beside the stone and drink the Earth Sapta: the Minor Manifestation of Earth appears for a short while, so speak to it at once (walk almost under it if it does not answer). Coming back, you can drop down the ledge towards the Den instead of walking the path."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1411,["note"]="Canaga Earthcaller: Stoneskin Totem and your Earth Totem",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:6:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5887,["npcName"]="Canaga Earthcaller",["x"]=0.424,["title"]="Call of Earth",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=5175,["itemName"]="Earth Totem"}}},["quest"]=1518,["y"]=0.6917},{["note"]="the level 4 shaman spells",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["zone"]=1411,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:6:2",["t"]="train",["class"]=true,["locations"]={{["map"]=1411,["x"]=0.4239,["npcName"]="Shikrik",["npc"]=3157,["y"]=0.69},{["map"]=1411,["x"]=0.5442,["npcName"]="Swart",["npc"]=3173,["y"]=0.42590000000000006},{["map"]=1454,["x"]=0.3784,["npcName"]="Sian'tsu",["npc"]=3403,["y"]=0.36450000000000005},{["npcName"]="Narm Skychaser",["x"]=0.474,["y"]=0.6254,["npc"]=3066,["map"]=1412},{["map"]=1456,["x"]=0.2364,["npcName"]="Tigor Skychaser",["npc"]=3031,["y"]=0.18789999999999998},{["npcName"]="Meela Dawnstrider",["x"]=0.4458,["y"]=0.7656000000000001,["npc"]=3062,["map"]=1412},{["npcName"]="Palah Thunderhoof",["x"]=0.3264,["y"]=0.2235,["npc"]=262558,["map"]=1412},{["map"]=1435,["x"]=0.4819,["npcName"]="Haromm",["npc"]=986,["y"]=0.5794},{["npcName"]="Windshaper Boro",["x"]=0.4279,["y"]=0.23579999999999998,["npc"]=251374,["map"]=2521},{["npcName"]="Sessaria Skystride",["x"]=0.5831000000000001,["y"]=0.7851,["npc"]=252382,["map"]=2521},{["npcName"]="Aarnor Galestrike",["x"]=0.43450000000000005,["y"]=0.4487,["npc"]=254082,["map"]=2521}}}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:6",["text"]="Canaga Earthcaller",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["detail"]="Bring the Rough Quartz back to Canaga Earthcaller outside the Den. Keep the Earth Totem she gives you in your bags for good: every earth totem needs it."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:7:1",["level"]=4,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=1412,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={5888},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:7:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=270,["npc"]=5888,["y"]=0.7676999999999999,["x"]=0.4435,["title"]="Call of Earth",["npcName"]="Seer Ravenfeather",["closedBy"]={1516,92466},["qlvl"]=4,["quest"]=1519,["minLevel"]=4}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:7",["text"]="Seer Ravenfeather",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren"}},["detail"]="Seer Ravenfeather stands in Camp Narache. She may show no quest mark over her head: speak to her anyway. The quest opens at level 4."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1412,["itemName"]="Ritual Salve",["oi"]=1,["count"]=2,["fromId"]=2953,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=1519,["lvl"]=4,["y"]=0.7829999999999999,["x"]=0.5661,["item"]=6634,["from"]="Bristleback Shaman",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:8:1",["title"]="Call of Earth",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:8",["text"]="Ritual Salve",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren"}},["detail"]="The Bristleback Shamans (level 3-4) stand among the quilboar huts of Brambleblade Ravine, east of the camp, and throw the odd Lightning Bolt. Four kills in five drop a salve; they respawn in about four minutes."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1412,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:9:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5888,["npcName"]="Seer Ravenfeather",["x"]=0.4435,["title"]="Call of Earth",["quest"]=1519,["y"]=0.7676999999999999},{["map"]=1412,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:9:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5888,["y"]=0.7676999999999999,["x"]=0.4435,["title"]="Call of Earth",["npcName"]="Seer Ravenfeather",["pre"]={1516,1519},["qlvl"]=4,["quest"]=1520,["minLevel"]=4}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:9",["text"]="Seer Ravenfeather",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren"}},["detail"]="Back to the Seer in Camp Narache. She hands you the Earth Sapta: do not drink it yet."},{["detail"]="Only if the Earth Sapta is gone from your bags: the Seer gives you another.",["goals"]={{["map"]=1412,["note"]="Seer Ravenfeather: a new Earth Sapta",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:10:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5888,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1520}},{["neg"]=true,["item"]=6635,["k"]="has",["n"]=1}},["y"]=0.7676999999999999,["x"]=0.4435,["title"]="Earth Sapta",["npcName"]="Seer Ravenfeather",["direct"]=true,["qlvl"]=4,["quest"]=1462,["minLevel"]=4}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:10",["text"]="Lost the Earth Sapta?",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren"}},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1520}},{["neg"]=true,["item"]=6635,["k"]="has",["n"]=1}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1412,["itemName"]="Earth Sapta",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:11:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.8009999999999999,["x"]=0.52,["item"]=6635,["note"]="Earth Sapta, beside Kodo Rock"},{["map"]=1412,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:11:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5891,["npcName"]="Minor Manifestation of Earth",["x"]=0.5199,["title"]="Call of Earth",["quest"]=1520,["y"]=0.804},{["map"]=1412,["note"]="it hands you the Rough Quartz: keep it",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:11:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5891,["y"]=0.804,["x"]=0.5199,["title"]="Call of Earth",["npcName"]="Minor Manifestation of Earth",["pre"]={1520},["qlvl"]=4,["quest"]=1521,["minLevel"]=4}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:11",["text"]="Kodo Rock",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren"}},["detail"]="Kodo Rock is a small pillar on a low mound due east of Greatmother Hawkwind's well, east of the camp; it only shows from about fifteen yards away, and hostile boars graze around it. Stand beside it and drink the Earth Sapta, then speak to the Minor Manifestation of Earth before it fades (drink again if it does)."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1412,["note"]="Seer Ravenfeather: Stoneskin Totem and your Earth Totem",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:12:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5888,["npcName"]="Seer Ravenfeather",["x"]=0.4435,["title"]="Call of Earth",["rewards"]={["items"]={{["item"]=5175,["itemName"]="Earth Totem"}}},["quest"]=1521,["y"]=0.7676999999999999},{["note"]="the level 4 shaman spells",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["zone"]=1412,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:12:2",["t"]="train",["class"]=true,["locations"]={{["npcName"]="Meela Dawnstrider",["x"]=0.4458,["y"]=0.7656000000000001,["npc"]=3062,["map"]=1412},{["npcName"]="Narm Skychaser",["x"]=0.474,["y"]=0.6254,["npc"]=3066,["map"]=1412},{["map"]=1456,["x"]=0.22820000000000001,["npcName"]="Siln Skychaser",["npc"]=3030,["y"]=0.21109999999999998},{["npcName"]="Palah Thunderhoof",["x"]=0.3264,["y"]=0.2235,["npc"]=262558,["map"]=1412},{["map"]=1411,["x"]=0.4239,["npcName"]="Shikrik",["npc"]=3157,["y"]=0.69},{["map"]=1411,["x"]=0.5442,["npcName"]="Swart",["npc"]=3173,["y"]=0.42590000000000006},{["map"]=1454,["x"]=0.3784,["npcName"]="Sian'tsu",["npc"]=3403,["y"]=0.36450000000000005},{["map"]=1435,["x"]=0.4819,["npcName"]="Haromm",["npc"]=986,["y"]=0.5794},{["npcName"]="Windshaper Boro",["x"]=0.4279,["y"]=0.23579999999999998,["npc"]=251374,["map"]=2521},{["npcName"]="Sessaria Skystride",["x"]=0.5831000000000001,["y"]=0.7851,["npc"]=252382,["map"]=2521},{["npcName"]="Aarnor Galestrike",["x"]=0.43450000000000005,["y"]=0.4487,["npc"]=254082,["map"]=2521}}}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:12",["text"]="Seer Ravenfeather",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren"}},["detail"]="Bring the Rough Quartz back to the Seer. Keep the Earth Totem in your bags for good: every earth totem needs it."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:13:1",["level"]=3,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["map"]=2521,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={251374},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:13:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=270,["npc"]=251374,["y"]=0.23579999999999998,["x"]=0.4279,["title"]="Call of Earth",["npcName"]="Windshaper Boro",["closedBy"]={1516,1519},["qlvl"]=4,["quest"]=92466,["minLevel"]=3}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:13",["text"]="Windshaper Boro",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Windshaper Boro, the shaman trainer, stands in Thendal Village. The quest opens at level 3."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2521,["itemName"]="Signet of Akir",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:14:1",["t"]="collect",["fromNpcsAt"]="1;1;1;1;1;2,3;3,2;3,2;2,3;2;5;6;7;1;2,3;2,3;4,5",["y"]=0.2409,["x"]=0.43770000000000003,["title"]="Call of Earth",["spread"]=true,["count"]=1,["item"]=251924,["quest"]=92466,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:14",["text"]="Signet of Akir",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Any Al'Aketh cultist can carry the Signet of Akir: the Converts (level 2-3) around the standing stones just east of the village, or the Brutes and Neophytes (level 4) in the camp beyond Hanaa Nightwind, south-west of the village. Keep killing until one drops it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2521,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:15:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=251374,["npcName"]="Windshaper Boro",["x"]=0.4279,["title"]="Call of Earth",["quest"]=92466,["y"]=0.23579999999999998},{["map"]=2521,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:15:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=251374,["y"]=0.23579999999999998,["x"]=0.4279,["title"]="Call of Earth",["npcName"]="Windshaper Boro",["pre"]={1516,1519,92466},["qlvl"]=4,["quest"]=92467,["minLevel"]=3}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:15",["text"]="Windshaper Boro",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Back to Boro in Thendal Village. He hands you the Earth Sapta: do not drink it yet."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2521,["itemName"]="Earth Sapta",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:16:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.23800000000000002,["x"]=0.49700000000000005,["item"]=6635,["note"]="Earth Sapta, beside the shrine"},{["map"]=2521,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:16:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=251166,["npcName"]="Minor Manifestation of Earth",["x"]=0.49670000000000003,["title"]="Call of Earth",["quest"]=92467,["y"]=0.23800000000000002},{["map"]=2521,["note"]="it hands you the Rough Quartz: keep it",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:16:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=251166,["y"]=0.23800000000000002,["x"]=0.49670000000000003,["title"]="Call of Earth",["npcName"]="Minor Manifestation of Earth",["pre"]={92467},["qlvl"]=4,["quest"]=92468,["minLevel"]=3}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:16",["text"]="The Rise of Spirits",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["detail"]="The Rise of Spirits is the hilltop shrine north-east of Boro: the path up starts on the hill just above the clearing where the flies were. Drink the Earth Sapta beside the shrine and speak to the Minor Manifestation of Earth before it fades."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2521,["note"]="Windshaper Boro: Stoneskin Totem and your Earth Totem",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:17:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=251374,["npcName"]="Windshaper Boro",["x"]=0.4279,["title"]="Call of Earth",["quest"]=92468,["y"]=0.23579999999999998},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["zone"]=2521,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:goal:17:2",["t"]="train",["class"]=true,["locations"]={{["npcName"]="Windshaper Boro",["x"]=0.4279,["y"]=0.23579999999999998,["npc"]=251374,["map"]=2521},{["npcName"]="Aarnor Galestrike",["x"]=0.43450000000000005,["y"]=0.4487,["npc"]=254082,["map"]=2521},{["npcName"]="Sessaria Skystride",["x"]=0.5831000000000001,["y"]=0.7851,["npc"]=252382,["map"]=2521},{["map"]=1411,["x"]=0.4239,["npcName"]="Shikrik",["npc"]=3157,["y"]=0.69},{["map"]=1411,["x"]=0.5442,["npcName"]="Swart",["npc"]=3173,["y"]=0.42590000000000006},{["npcName"]="Meela Dawnstrider",["x"]=0.4458,["y"]=0.7656000000000001,["npc"]=3062,["map"]=1412},{["npcName"]="Narm Skychaser",["x"]=0.474,["y"]=0.6254,["npc"]=3066,["map"]=1412},{["npcName"]="Palah Thunderhoof",["x"]=0.3264,["y"]=0.2235,["npc"]=262558,["map"]=1412},{["map"]=1435,["x"]=0.4819,["npcName"]="Haromm",["npc"]=986,["y"]=0.5794},{["map"]=1454,["x"]=0.38799999999999996,["npcName"]="Kardris Dreamseeker",["npc"]=3344,["y"]=0.36369999999999997},{["map"]=1456,["x"]=0.22820000000000001,["npcName"]="Siln Skychaser",["npc"]=3030,["y"]=0.21109999999999998}}}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-earth-horde:step:17",["text"]="Windshaper Boro",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Bring the Rough Quartz back to Boro. Keep the Earth Totem in your bags for good: every earth totem needs it."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1413,["id"]="polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-fire-horde",["zoneName"]="The Barrens",["max"]=13,["min"]=10,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Call of Fire (Horde) (10-13)",["faction"]="Horde",["classes"]={"SHAMAN"},["category"]="Class",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-fire-horde:goal:1:1",["level"]=10,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["note"]="Swart, Razor Hill",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={5907},["npc"]=3173,["npcName"]="Swart",["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=2983,["map"]=1411,["optional"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-fire-horde:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=420,["closedBy"]={1524,1522,1523,2984},["x"]=0.5442,["title"]="Call of Fire",["y"]=0.42590000000000006,["minLevel"]=10}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-fire-horde:step:1",["text"]="Swart",["only"]={["races"]={"Orc","Troll"}},["detail"]="At 10 Swart, the shaman trainer on the east side of Razor Hill, sends you to Kranal Fiss in the Barrens. Already carry Searn Firewarder's letter from Orgrimmar? It goes to Kranal Fiss too: skip Swart."},{["goals"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-fire-horde:goal:2:1",["level"]=10,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="level"},{["note"]="Narm Skychaser, Bloodhoof Village",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={5907},["npc"]=3066,["npcName"]="Narm Skychaser",["qlvl"]=10,["quest"]=2984,["map"]=1412,["optional"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/class/shaman/call-of-fire-horde:goal:2:2",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=420,["closedBy"]={1524,1522,1523,2983},["x"]=0.474,["title"]="Call of Fire",["y"]=0.6254,["minLevel"]=10}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=t