s:step:43",["text"]="Thunder Bluff",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"}},["detail"]="Fly from the Crossroads to Thunder Bluff. Apothecary Zamah waits in the Pools of Vision, the cave under Spirit Rise: hand in the spores there first, while their time runs. Then Turak Runetotem trains you on Elder Rise."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1450,["x"]=0.563,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:44:1",["text"]="Cast Teleport: Moonglade",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.325}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:44",["text"]="Moonglade",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"},["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:45:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="A Lesson to Learn",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["quest"]=27,["y"]=0.3064},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:45:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11802,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="Lessons Anew",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["quest"]=6126,["y"]=0.3064},{["map"]=1450,["note"]="The Principal Source: Dreadmist Peak, next guide",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:45:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11802,["y"]=0.3064,["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["title"]="The Principal Source",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["pre"]={6126},["qlvl"]=14,["quest"]=6127,["minLevel"]=14},{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["y"]=0.3064,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:45:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11802,["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["npcName"]="Dendrite Starblaze",["x"]=0.5621,["limit"]=1800,["title"]="Trial of the Lake",["pre"]={27},["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=28,["minLevel"]=16},{["map"]=1450,["itemName"]="Shrine Bauble",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["fromId"]=177785,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.46399999999999997,["x"]=0.547,["item"]=15877,["from"]="Bauble Container",["note"]="Shrine Bauble, from a Bauble Container in the lake",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:45:5"},{["map"]=1450,["itemName"]="Shrine Bauble",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:45:6",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.414,["x"]=0.36,["item"]=15877,["note"]="At the Shrine of Remulos"},{["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Shrine Of Remulos"}},["title"]="Trial of the Lake",["quest"]=28,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:45:7",["t"]="complete",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1450,["note"]="Tajarri, at the Shrine of Remulos",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:45:8",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11799,["npcName"]="Tajarri",["x"]=0.3652,["title"]="Trial of the Lake",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["quest"]=28,["y"]=0.401},{["map"]=1450,["note"]="Trial of the Sea Lion, carried: one half pendant in the Sludge Fen in this guide, the other underwater off Silverpine on the way to Hillsbrad at 21; the pendant is handed in after Hillsbrad",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:45:9",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11799,["y"]=0.401,["npcName"]="Tajarri",["x"]=0.3652,["title"]="Trial of the Sea Lion",["only"]={["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["pre"]={28},["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=30,["minLevel"]=16},{["note"]="Bunthen Plainswind in Nighthaven flies druids there",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Thunder Bluff",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:45:10",["t"]="fly",["node"]=22,["area"]=1638}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:45",["text"]="Trial of the Lake",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"},["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["detail"]="Dendrite Starblaze stands upstairs in his building in Nighthaven: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart. The Shrine Baubles lie on the bed of Lake Elune'ara and fade within minutes: swim one straight to the Shrine of Remulos on the north-west shore, use it there and speak to Tajarri. Trial of the Lake runs on a timer: no teleport or Hearthstone until Tajarri has it."},{["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Ratchet",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:46:1",["t"]="fly",["node"]=80,["area"]=392}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:46",["text"]="Fly to Ratchet",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"}},["detail"]="Fly from Thunder Bluff straight on to Ratchet."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["x"]=0.515,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:47:1",["text"]="Crossroads flight master",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.304},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Ratchet",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:47:2",["t"]="fly",["node"]=80,["area"]=392}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:47",["text"]="Fly to Ratchet",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","PALADIN","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","SHAMAN","MAGE","WARLOCK"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["note"]="WANTED poster",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refres