-the-barrens:goal:70:1"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:70",["text"]="Strange Lockbox",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"},["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={30}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["x"]=0.5539999999999999,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:71:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.077},{["escort"]=true,["title"]="The Escape",["quest"]=863,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:71:2",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Escort Wizzlecrank out of the Venture Co. drill site"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:71",["text"]="The Escape",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Wizzlecrank drives his shredder out of the camp: stay with him and kill whatever attacks him. Sputtervalve takes it in Ratchet.\nCareful: The route leads west and climbs a ramp. Once you reach the top, two Venture Company mobs ambush you."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Nugget Slug",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=161752,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Nugget Slugs",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.0799,["x"]=0.555,["count"]=15,["from"]="Tool Bucket",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:72:1",["item"]=11143,["quest"]=3922,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:72",["text"]="Nugget Slugs",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The tool buckets with the slugs lie around the Venture Co. drill site in the Sludge Fen."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Cats Eye Emerald",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:73:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.0378,["x"]=0.5963,["title"]="Miner's Fortune",["lvl"]=18,["count"]=1,["item"]=5097,["quest"]=896,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:73",["text"]="Boulder Lode Mine",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Venture Co. Overseers and Enforcers at the mine in the north-east corner of the zone drop the Cats Eye Emerald."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/02-the-barrens:40:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9316,["npcName"]="Wenikee Boltbucket",["x"]=0.4905,["title"]="Nugget Slugs",["quest"]=3922,["y"]=0.1117},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Keep it: Rilli Greasygob is in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, on the Orgrimmar trip at 20",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:74:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=9316,["y"]=0.1117,["npcName"]="Wenikee Boltbucket",["x"]=0.4905,["title"]="Rilli Greasygob",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARRIOR","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","SHAMAN","MAGE","WARLOCK"}},["pre"]={3922},["qlvl"]=18,["quest"]=3923,["minLevel"]=10}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:74",["text"]="Wenikee Boltbucket",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="West from the mine to Wenikee Boltbucket's camp, then south down the road to the Crossroads."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:75:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3449,["npcName"]="Darsok Swiftdagger",["x"]=0.5162,["title"]="Serena Bloodfeather",["quest"]=876,["y"]=0.309},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:75:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3449,["y"]=0.309,["x"]=0.5162,["title"]="Letter to Jin'Zil",["npcName"]="Darsok Swiftdagger",["pre"]={876},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=1060,["minLevel"]=15},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:75:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3448,["npcName"]="Tonga Runetotem",["x"]=0.5226,["title"]="Gathering the Cure",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"},["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["quest"]=6128,["y"]=0.3193},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="He gives you the Curative Animal Salve",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:75:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3448,["y"]=0.3193,["npcName"]="Tonga Runetotem",["x"]=0.5226,["title"]="Curing the Sick",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"},["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["pre"]={6128},["qlvl"]=14,["quest"]=6129,["minLevel"]=14}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:75",["text"]="the Crossroads",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="South down the road to the Crossroads: Darsok Swiftdagger stands on the tower platform, Tonga Runetotem at the south gate."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["itemName"]="Verog's Head",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=3395,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Verog the Dervish",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.4174,["x"]=0.5306000000000001,["count"]=1,["from"]="Verog the Dervish",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:76:1",["item"]=5023,["quest"]=851,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Underwater",["oi"]=1,["id"]="forever/horde/02-the-barrens:31:1",["t"]="interact",["y"]=0.4275,["x"]=0.5561,["title"]="The Stagnant Oasis",["objName"]="Bubbling Fissure",["object"]=3737,["quest"]=877,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Sickly Gazelle: use the Curative Animal Salve on them; they roam the plains all around the Crossroads",["oi"]=1,["t"]="kill",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:76:3",["text"]="Cure Sickly Gazelle",["npc"]=12296,["quest"]=6129,["y"]=0.3897,["x"]=0.5693,["count"]=10,["spread"]=true,["target"]="Sickly Gazelle",["title"]="Curing the Sick",["only"]={["classes"]={"DRUID"},["races"]={"Tauren","Skyborne"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:76",["text"]="Verog the Dervish",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Verog the Dervish doesn't wander on his own: he comes out when you kill the Kolkar centaurs at the Stagnant Oasis, south-east of the Crossroads. Keep killing them around the oasis until he appears. Test Tonga Runetotem's seeds at the bubbling fissure on the oasis' east bank while you are there."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:77:1",["t"]="talk",["npc"]=10668,["npcName"]="Beaten Corpse",["x"]=0.493,["title"]="Lost in Battle",["y"]=0.503,["quest"]=4921,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:77",["text"]="Bristleback camps",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Bristleback quilboar camps spread over the plains north of Camp Taurajo, either side of the Gold Road. Mankrik's wife lies at their north edge, on your way south. Leave the quilboar for now: Mangletooth in Camp Taurajo wants the same camps cleared. Lakota'mani, a grey kodo (level 22), sometimes wanders here: his hoof starts a quest. Leave him alone below level 21."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Mangletooth, in the cage",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:78:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3430,["npcName"]="Mangletooth",["x"]=0.44549999999999995,["title"]="Tribes at War",["y"]=0.5926,["qlvl"]=21,["quest"]=878,["minLevel"]=14},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:78:2",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=10378,["npcName"]="Omusa Thunderhorn",["x"]=0.4445,["location"]="Camp Taurajo",["y"]=0.5915,["node"]=77,["area"]=378}