ater Oasis, with Hezrul Bloodmark after the Orgrimmar trip",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/02-the-barrens:34:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3448,["y"]=0.3193,["x"]=0.5226,["title"]="Altered Beings",["npcName"]="Tonga Runetotem",["pre"]={877},["qlvl"]=16,["quest"]=880,["minLevel"]=10},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:83:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3432,["npcName"]="Mankrik",["x"]=0.5195000000000001,["title"]="Consumed by Hatred",["quest"]=899,["y"]=0.31579999999999997},{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:83:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3432,["npcName"]="Mankrik",["x"]=0.5195000000000001,["title"]="Lost in Battle",["quest"]=4921,["y"]=0.31579999999999997},{["map"]=1413,["note"]="Mankrik offers Her Name Is Olgra once Lost in Battle is handed in",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:83:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3432,["y"]=0.31579999999999997,["x"]=0.5195000000000001,["title"]="Her Name Is Olgra",["npcName"]="Mankrik",["pre"]={4921},["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=95774,["minLevel"]=14},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:goal:83:6",["text"]="Korran's Egg Hunt waits for this guide's last Crossroads stop: its eggs come on the next The Barrens guide's walk south, at about 25.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/02-the-barrens:step:83",["text"]="The Crossroads",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="North up the Gold Road to the Crossroads: Tonga Runetotem at the south gate, Mankrik by the inn, Korran west of the north gate. Keep the Blood Shard: Mangletooth takes it on the next stop in Camp Taurajo."},{["goals"]={{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Orgrimmar",["id"]="refres