lcher",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Sepulcher is the Forsaken crypt-town in the middle of the forest. Everyone you need stands around the crypt entrance; Karos Razok, the bat handler, is just east of it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1421,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest:goal:28:1",["t"]="turnin",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={264}}},["y"]=0.4267,["x"]=0.44189999999999996,["title"]="Until Death Do Us Part",["objName"]="Yuriv's Tombstone",["only"]={["races"]={"Skyborne","Tauren"}},["quest"]=264,["object"]=24776}},["detail"]="Until Death Do Us Part is handed in at Yuriv's Tombstone, a grave a few steps south of the crypt entrance, not to a person.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest:step:28",["text"]="The Sepulcher",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={264}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1421,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest:9:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.6033,["x"]=0.4989,["title"]="Border Crossings",["objName"]="Dalaran Crate",["quest"]=477,["object"]=1627},{["map"]=1421,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest:9:2",["t"]="accept",["object"]=1627,["y"]=0.6033,["x"]=0.4989,["qlvl"]=14,["objName"]="Dalaran Crate",["pre"]={477},["minLevel"]=10,["quest"]=478,["title"]="Maps and Runes"}},["id"]="forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest:9",["text"]="Border Crossings",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Follow the road south. The Dalaran Crate sits beside it, north of Pyrewood. Careful: Dalaran Apprentices (13) stand around the crate: pull them one at a time before you open it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1421,["itemName"]="Essence of Nightlash",["oi"]=1,["count"]=1,["fromId"]=1983,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=437,["lvl"]=14,["y"]=0.21,["x"]=0.45,["item"]=3622,["from"]="Nightlash",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:fore