re of Mirkfallon Lake, north of Sun Rock.\nCareful: Pridewings around the lake can aggro as a linked group."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Mirkweed Pods",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={97538}}},["item"]=278201,["quest"]=97538,["map"]=1442,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=667362,["t"]="collect",["carriedTo"]="forever/horde/07-ashenvale",["title"]="Pigments for Paints",["y"]=0.402,["x"]=0.485,["count"]=30,["from"]="Mirkweed",["fromAlso"]="Dried Mirkweed Pile",["fromAlsoId"]=667364,["fromKind"]="object",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:goal:39:1"}},["detail"]="The Mirkweed grows on the bottom of Mirkfallon Lake, off the same southern shore: dive to the plants and the Dried Mirkweed Piles; both give pods. Watch your breath.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:step:39",["text"]="Mirkweed",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={97538}}}},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Courser Eye",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=5585,["quest"]=1058,["map"]=1442,["oi"]=3,["fromId"]=4018,["t"]="collect",["fromAlsoId"]=4019,["title"]="Jin'Zil's Forest Magic",["y"]=0.3818,["x"]=0.46759999999999996,["count"]=30,["from"]="Antlered Courser",["spread"]=true,["fromAlso"]="Great Courser",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:goal:40:1"},{["map"]=1442,["itemName"]="Stonetalon Sap",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=4020,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Jin'Zil's Forest Magic",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.195,["x"]=0.368,["count"]=5,["from"]="Sap Beast",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:goal:40:2",["item"]=5582,["quest"]=1058,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1442,["itemName"]="Twilight Whisker",["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=4067,["t"]="collect",["item"]=5584,["quest"]=1058,["y"]=0.17739999999999997,["x"]=0.3957,["title"]="Jin'Zil's Forest Magic",["from"]="Twilight Runner",[