fire elementals drop Incendrites. Bloodfury Harpies and Ambushers nest on the north side, Slayers and Roguefeathers to the south. Careful: the Burning Destroyers, Scorched Basilisks and Bloodfury Storm Witches here are level 27 and the valley floor is crowded: pull one at a time and keep to its edges."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:step:43",["text"]="Sun Rock Retreat",["goals"]={{["map"]=1442,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:goal:43:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11864,["npcName"]="Tammra Windfield",["x"]=0.4746,["title"]="New Life",["quest"]=6381,["y"]=0.5838},{["map"]=1442,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:goal:43:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11860,["npcName"]="Maggran Earthbinder",["x"]=0.47200000000000003,["title"]="Harpies Threaten",["quest"]=6282,["y"]=0.6115999999999999},{["map"]=1442,["note"]="Mor'rogal, beside Tsunaman",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:goal:43:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11861,["npcName"]="Mor'rogal",["x"]=0.4722,["title"]="Bloodfury Trinkets",["quest"]=86576,["y"]=0.6404000000000001},{["map"]=1442,["note"]="Tsunaman, up on the ledge",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:goal:43:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11862,["npcName"]="Tsunaman",["x"]=0.4736,["title"]="Elemental War",["quest"]=6393,["y"]=0.6425}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1442,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:goal:44:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=4074,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1068}}},["y"]=0.5661999999999999,["x"]=0.6409,["title"]="Shredding Machines",["target"]="XT:9",["count"]=1,["quest"]=1068,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1442,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:goal:44:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=4073,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1068}}},["y"]=0.4669,["x"]=0.672,["title"]="Shredding Machines",["target"]="XT:4",["count"]=1,["quest"]=1068,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["detail"]="Back down the Webwinder Path to Ziz Fizziks' hut, then east along the road toward Windshear Crag: XT:9 patrols the road just east of the fork, XT:4 the slopes further north-east below the crag. Both are lone shredder robots; they roam, so follow the road until you meet them.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:step:44",["text"]="Shredding Machines",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1068}}}},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Gerenzo's Mechanical Arm",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1096}}},["item"]=5736,["quest"]=1096,["map"]=1442,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=4202,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.40299999999999997,["x"]=0.645,["title"]="Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle",["from"]="Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle",["note"]="Gerenzo's Mechanical Arm, from Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:goal:45:1"}},["detail"]="On east to Windshear Crag, past where XT:4 roams: Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle (27) stands at the top of the Venture Co. tower. Clear the Venture Co. on the way up. His Mechanical Arm is for Ziz.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:step:45",["text"]="Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1096}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1442,["note"]="Place the Toxic Fogger on the Venture Co. Copter Pad",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:goal:46:1",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Venture Co. Copter Pad"},{["count"]=1,["text"]="Place the Toxic Fogger"}},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1086}}},["y"]=0.4546,["x"]=0.6644,["title"]="The Flying Machine Airport",["startItemName"]="Toxic Fogger",["startItem"]=5638,["quest"]=1086,["carriedTo"]="forever/horde/07-ashenvale"}},["detail"]="The Venture Co. Copter Pad is the platform just south-east of Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle's tower: place Zamah's Toxic Fogger on it. Zamah takes it back on the next guide's Thunder Bluff stop.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:step:46",["text"]="The Flying Machine Airport",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={1086}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1442,["note"]="Ziz Fizziks, inside",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:goal:47:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4201,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="complete",["q"]=1096}},["npcName"]="Ziz Fizziks",["x"]=0.5899,["title"]="Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle",["quest"]=1096,["y"]=0.626}},["detail"]="Back west to Ziz Fizziks' hut, on the way down to Malaka'jin.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:step:47",["text"]="Ziz Fizziks",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="complete",["q"]=1096}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1442,["note"]="Witch Doctor Jin'Zil, below ground",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:goal:48:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3995,["npcName"]="Witch Doctor Jin'Zil",["x"]=0.7454000000000001,["title"]="Jin'Zil's Forest Magic",["quest"]=1058,["y"]=0.9793999999999999}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:step:48",["text"]="Malaka'jin",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="On down the Webwinder Path to Malaka'jin."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:goal:49:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4049,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="complete",["q"]=1068}},["npcName"]="Seereth Stonebreak",["x"]=0.35259999999999997,["title"]="Shredding Machines",["quest"]=1068,["y"]=0.2788},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:goal:49:2",["text"]="The next guide flies to Zoram'gar Outpost: hearth to Camp Taurajo if your hearthstone is ready, or walk on east to the Crossroads' flight master.",["t"]="note",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="complete",["q"]=1068}}}},["detail"]="East along the road from Malaka'jin to Seereth Stonebreak's camp.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/04-the-barrens:step:49",["text"]="Seereth Stonebreak",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="complete",["q"]=1068}}}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1440,["id"]="polestar:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains",["next"]="polestar:forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills",["max"]=23,["min"]=22,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Ashenvale & Silverpine Forest (22-23)",["faction"]="Horde",["category"]="Leveling",["zoneName"]="Ashenvale",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:1:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7233,["npcName"]="Taskmaster Fizzule",["x"]=0.5544,["title"]="Deep Cover",["quest"]=2458,["y"]=0.0556},{["map"]=1413,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:1:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7233,["y"]=0.0556,["x"]=0.5544,["title"]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable",["npcName"]="Taskmaster Fizzule",["pre"]={2458},["qlvl"]=24,["quest"]=2478,["minLevel"]=20},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:1:3",["text"]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable is for level 23 or more: the tower's drones are 25 and Gallywix a 23 elite. Do it when you can, with a group, from the Class guide Poisons (Horde).",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:step:1",["text"]="Taskmaster Fizzule",["only"]={["classes"]={"ROGUE"}},["detail"]="On the way north from Seereth's camp, keep east of the road to the Venture Co. tower north of the Sludge Fen. Before you go near Fizzule, use Flare Gun to fire two flares, then target him and /salute: he attacks anyone who comes in without signalling first."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1413,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:1:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8582,["npcName"]="Kadrak",["x"]=0.48119999999999996,["title"]="Report to Kadrak",["quest"]=6541,["y"]=0.0542}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:step:2",["text"]="Kadrak",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="From Seereth's camp head north-east across the Barrens to the road north of the Crossroads; Rogues coming from Fizzule's tower head west to it. Kadrak stands on the watch tower of the Mor'shan Rampart where the road enters Ashenvale."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:step:3",["text"]="Into Ashenvale",["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["x"]=0.711,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:3:1",["text"]="The road north to Splintertree Post",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.6809999999999999}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:4:1",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=12616,["npcName"]="Vhulgra",["x"]=0.7318000000000001,["location"]="Splintertree Post",["y"]=0.6159,["node"]=61,["area"]=431},{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=12696,["npcName"]="Senani Thunderheart",["x"]=0.7378,["title"]="The Ashenvale Hunt",["quest"]=6382,["y"]=0.6146},{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:4:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=12696,["y"]=0.6146,["x"]=0.7378,["title"]="The Ashenvale Hunt",["npcName"]="Senani Thunderheart",["direct"]=true,["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=6383,["minLevel"]=20},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:4:4",["text"]="Senani Thunderheart's hunt targets Ursangous and Shadumbra are for the next Ashenvale visit, at 26; Sharptalon (31) only from level 30.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains:goal:4:5",["t"]="vendor",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["locations"]={{["npcName"]="Burkrum",["x"]=0.7354,["map"]=1440,["npc"]=6028,["y"]=0.6031},{["npcName"]="Quartermaster Kyleen",["x"]=0.894,["map"]=1440,["npc"]=222685,["y"]=0.40399999999999997},{["npcName"]="Kelm Hargunth",["x"]=0.46649999999999997,["map"]=1413,["npc"]=14754,["y"]=0.08380000000000001},{["npcName"]="Vrang Wildgore",["x"]=0.43799999999999994,["map"]=1413,["npc"]=3682,["y"]=0.12210000000000001},{["npcName"]="Ukra'nor",["x"]=0.2974,["map"]=1454,["npc"]=3349,["y"]=0.7417},{["npcName"]="Katis",["x"]=0.44179999999999997,["map"]=1454,["npc"]=5816,["y"]=0.4844},{["npcName"]="Sergeant Ba'sha",["x"]=0.4146,["map"]=1454,["npc"]=12799,["y"]=0.6859999999999999},{["npcName"]="Kareth",["x"]=0.45649999999999996,["map"]=1454,["npc"]=3331,["y"]=0.5596},{["npcName"]="Urtharo",["x"]=0.4756,["map"]=1454,["npc"]=3314,["y"]=0.6838},{["npcName"]="Kaja",["x"]=0.5215,["map"]=1454,["npc"]=3322,["y"]=0.6213000000000001},{["npcName"]="Sana",["x"]=0.5597,[