he Ruins of Stardust, where Ursangous roams: use the Empty Blue Waterskin there."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["itemName"]="Ursangous's Paw",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["fromId"]=12678,["t"]="collect",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=6383}},["y"]=0.6520999999999999,["x"]=0.39759999999999995,["item"]=16303,["from"]="Ursangous",["fromFaction"]="A",["lvl"]=25,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:14:1"},{["itemName"]="Ursangous's Paw",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:14:2",["t"]="accept",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=6383}},["title"]="Ursangous's Paw",["qlvl"]=24,["pre"]={6383},["minLevel"]=20,["quest"]=23,["item"]=16303}},["detail"]="Follow the main road east past Astranaar (Alliance: keep to the road). Ursangous, a big grizzly, roams the Ruins of Stardust south of the road, west of Mystral Lake. His paw starts the next hunt quest.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:14",["text"]="Ursangous",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=6383}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["itemName"]="Karang's Banner",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:15:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.635,["x"]=0.564,["title"]="King of the Foulweald",["item"]=16972,["quest"]=6621,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1440,["itemName"]="Murgut's Totem",["oi"]=1,["count"]=1,["fromId"]=12918,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=6621,["lvl"]=26,["y"]=0.635,["x"]=0.5643,["item"]=16976,["from"]="Chief Murgut",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:15:2",["title"]="King of the Foulweald",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:15",["text"]="King of the Foulweald",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Foulweald furbolgs hold the woods east of Mystral Lake, south of the road. Place Karang's Banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound and guard it: the furbolgs come to tear it down. Chief Murgut comes last; his totem drops in the basket."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:16:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=12858,["npcName"]="Torek",["x"]=0.6834,["escort"]=true,["title"]="Torek's Assault",["y"]=0.753,["qlvl"]=24,["quest"]=6544,["minLevel"]=20},{["escort"]=true,["title"]="Torek's Assault",["quest"]=6544,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:16:2",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Take Silverwing Outpost."}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:16",["text"]="Torek's Assault",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Keep east on the road. Torek waits south-west of the Warsong lumber camp. He and his grunts storm the Silverwing Outpost: let them take aggro and stay with Torek until Duriel Moonfire is dead."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/07-ashenvale:15:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=12867,["npcName"]="Kuray'bin",["x"]=0.7111,["title"]="Ashenvale Outrunners",["y"]=0.6812,["qlvl"]=24,["quest"]=6503,["minLevel"]=19}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:17",["text"]="Warsong lumber camp",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="From the Silverwing Outpost head north-east to the Warsong lumber camp on the road: Kuray'bin stands there."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:18:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=12856,["y"]=0.695,["x"]=0.725,["title"]="Ashenvale Outrunners",["lvl"]=24,["target"]="Ashenvale Outrunner",["count"]=9,["quest"]=6503,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:18",["text"]="Ashenvale Outrunners",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The night elf Ashenvale Outrunners (23-24) stalk the woods south and south-east of the lumber camp; they stealth, so watch for them."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/07-ashenvale:15:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=12867,["npcName"]="Kuray'bin",["x"]=0.7111,["title"]="Ashenvale Outrunners",["quest"]=6503,["y"]=0.6812}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:19",["text"]="Warsong lumber camp",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Kuray'bin at the lumber camp, on the road north to Splintertree."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:step:20",["text"]="Splintertree Post",["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/07-ashenvale:16:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=12877,["npcName"]="Ertog Ragetusk",["x"]=0.7303000000000001,["title"]="Torek's Assault",["quest"]=6544,["y"]=0.6247},{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/07-ashenvale:16:8",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=12724,["npcName"]="Pixel",["x"]=0.7306,["title"]="Satyr Horns",["y"]=0.6148,["qlvl"]=26,["quest"]=6441,["minLevel"]=21}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1440,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/07-ashenvale:goal:21:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=12696,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="turnedin",["q"]=6383}},["y"]=0.6146,["x"]=0.7378,["title"]="The Ashenvale Hunt",["npcName"]="Senani Thunderheart",["direct"]=true,["qlvl"]=20,["quest"]=6383,["minLevel"]=20}},["detail"]="Senani Thunderheart keeps the hunt board at Night Run, by the flight master: take The Ashenvale Hunt and hand it straight back. Ursangous, Sharptalon and Shadumbra drop their trophies only after it.",["id"]="refresh:forever-202611