 follow the road north to Grom'gol, the orc camp on the west side of the vale. Stay on the road: the jungle beside it is above your level."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:11:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=716,["npcName"]="Barnil Stonepot",["x"]=0.3566,["title"]="Welcome to the Jungle",["y"]=0.10529999999999999,["qlvl"]=30,["quest"]=583,["minLevel"]=28},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:11:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=715,["npcName"]="Hemet Nesingwary",["x"]=0.3566,["title"]="Welcome to the Jungle",["quest"]=583,["y"]=0.1081},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:11:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=715,["npcName"]="Hemet Nesingwary",["x"]=0.3566,["title"]="Hemet Nesingwary",["quest"]=5762,["y"]=0.1081},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:11:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=715,["npcName"]="Hemet Nesingwary",["x"]=0.3566,["title"]="Hunting in Stranglethorn",["quest"]=5763,["y"]=0.1081},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:11:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=715,["y"]=0.1081,["x"]=0.3566,["title"]="Raptor Mastery",["npcName"]="Hemet Nesingwary",["pre"]={583},["qlvl"]=34,["quest"]=194,["minLevel"]=28},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:11:6",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=717,["y"]=0.10619999999999999,["x"]=0.35619999999999996,["title"]="Tiger Mastery",["npcName"]="Ajeck Rouack",["pre"]={583},["qlvl"]=31,["quest"]=185,["minLevel"]=28},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:11:7",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=718,["y"]=0.10550000000000001,["x"]=0.3555,["title"]="Panther Mastery",["npcName"]="Sir S. J. Erlgadin",["pre"]={583},["qlvl"]=31,["quest"]=190,["minLevel"]=28},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:11:8",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Locate the hunters' camp"}},["y"]=0.1059,["x"]=0.3565,["title"]="Investigate the Camp",["quest"]=201}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:step:11",["text"]="Nesingwary's camp",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Follow the road north out of Grom'gol; Nesingwary's hunting camp sits on the hill north-east of the river. Krazek wants it investigated: walk among its tents. From here on, keep every page of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn you loot: Barnil Stonepot takes them on your next Stranglethorn visit."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Large River Crocolisk Skin",["oi"]=1,["count"]=2,["fromId"]=1150,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=575,["lvl"]=31,["y"]=0.10460000000000001,["x"]=0.3458,["item"]=4053,["from"]="River Crocolisk",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:12:1",["title"]="Supply and Demand",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1434,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:12:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=681,["y"]=0.1133,["x"]=0.3407,["title"]="Tiger Mastery",["count"]=10,["target"]="Young Stranglethorn Tiger",["quest"]=185,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1434,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:12:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=683,["count"]=10,["y"]=0.1416,["x"]=0.3503,["title"]="Panther Mastery",["lvl"]=31,["target"]="Young Panther",["quest"]=190,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Bloodscalp Tusk",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:12:4",["t"]="collect",["count"]=9,["quest"]=581,["y"]=0.1457,["x"]=0.34259999999999996,["title"]="Hunt for Yenniku",["lvl"]=34,["fromNpcsAt"]="1;8,1;9,1;9;9;2,11,6;6,2,11;6,3,2,11;2,6,3;6,2,4,7,3,5,11;6,2,3,11;4,7,5,11;7;4,5,7;5;2,6,3;8,10,1;1,10;10;10;7,4,3,11;5,7",["item"]=3901,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Pendant of Myzrael",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:12:5",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.21899999999999997,["x"]=0.3471,["item"]=4614,["lvl"]=37,["optional"]=true,["count"]=1},{["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:12:6",["t"]="accept",["title"]="Crystal in the Mountains",["itemName"]="Pendant of Myzrael",["qlvl"]=35,["minLevel"]=30,["quest"]=635,["item"]=4614}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:step:12",["text"]="Nesingwary's Expedition: kill these as you meet them",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="River Crocolisks lie along the river below the camp. Young Stranglethorn Tigers prowl west of the camp, Young Panthers east of it. Head west past the camp. Stranglethorn Raptors (33-34) hunt the clearings, and the Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins on the coast: every Bloodscalp can drop a tusk. A Pendant of Myzrael is a very rare drop from them: if one drops, read it. Careful: The troll camps have many patrolling mobs, so other trolls often join a fight."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:step:13",["text"]="Nesingwary's camp",["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:13:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=717,["npcName"]="Ajeck Rouack",["x"]=0.35619999999999996,["title"]="Tiger Mastery",["quest"]=185,["y"]=0.10619999999999999},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:13:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=717,["y"]=0.10619999999999999,["x"]=0.35619999999999996,["title"]="Tiger Mastery",["npcName"]="Ajeck Rouack",["pre"]={185},["qlvl"]=33,["quest"]=186,["minLevel"]=28},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:13:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=718,["npcName"]="Sir S. J. Erlgadin",["x"]=0.3555,["title"]="Panther Mastery",["quest"]=190,["y"]=0.10550000000000001},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:13:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=718,["y"]=0.10550000000000001,["x"]=0.3555,["title"]="Panther Mastery",["npcName"]="Sir S. J. Erlgadin",["pre"]={190},["qlvl"]=33,["quest"]=191,["minLevel"]=28}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:14:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=682,["count"]=10,["y"]=0.138,["x"]=0.364,["title"]="Tiger Mastery",["lvl"]=33,["target"]="Stranglethorn Tiger",["quest"]=186,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["itemName"]="Tumbled Crystal",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=4106,["quest"]=213,["map"]=1434,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=1096,["t"]="collect",["lvl"]=36,["y"]=0.214,["x"]=0.46299999999999997,["title"]="Hostile Takeover",["from"]="Venture Co. Geologist",["count"]=8,["note"]="Tumbled Crystals, from the geologists of the eastern camps",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:14:2"},{["map"]=1434,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:14:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=736,["y"]=0.113,["x"]=0.304,["title"]="Panther Mastery",["lvl"]=33,["target"]="Panther",["count"]=10,["quest"]=191,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:step:14",["text"]="Stranglethorn Vale: kill these as you meet them",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Stranglethorn Tigers (32) roam the hills around the camp and south of it, Panthers (32) the clearings west and south-west of it. The Venture Co. Geologists (34-36), who carry the Tumbled Crystals, work the camps by Lake Nazferiti, south-east of the camp. Careful: Venture Co. Agents (39) stand among the geologists in the western camps by the Venture Co. house: work the eastern camps, away from them."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:step:15",["text"]="Nesingwary's camp",["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:15:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=718,["npcName"]="Sir S. J. Erlgadin",["x"]=0.3555,["title"]="Panther Mastery",["quest"]=191,["y"]=0.10550000000000001},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="The Shadowmaw Panthers come much later, by Grom'gol",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:15:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=718,["y"]=0.10550000000000001,["x"]=0.3555,["title"]="Panther Mastery",["npcName"]="Sir S. J. Erlgadin",["pre"]={191},["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=192,["minLevel"]=28},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:15:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=717,["npcName"]="Ajeck Rouack",["x"]=0.35619999999999996,["title"]="Tiger Mastery",["quest"]=186,["y"]=0.10619999999999999},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:15:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=717,["y"]=0.10619999999999999,["x"]=0.35619999999999996,["title"]="Tiger Mastery",["npcName"]="Ajeck Rouack",["pre"]={186},["qlvl"]=35,["quest"]=187,["minLevel"]=28}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:16:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=1085,["y"]=0.1757,["x"]=0.34020000000000006,["title"]="Tiger Mastery",["lvl"]=35,["target"]="Elder Stranglethorn Tiger",["count"]=10,["quest"]=187,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:step:16",["text"]="Elder Stranglethorn Tigers",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Elder Stranglethorn Tigers (34-35) roam the hills south-west of the camp. Careful: Troll camps are close to the tiger area, and trolls can join a fight if you pull carelessly."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:17:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=717,["npcName"]="Ajeck Rouack",["x"]=0.35619999999999996,["title"]="Tiger Mastery",["quest"]=187,["y"]=0.10619999999999999},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Ajeck Rouack: Sin'Dall (37) waits for your next Nesingwary stop, at about 40 in forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:17:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=717,["y"]=0.10619999999999999,["x"]=0.35619999999999996,["title"]="Tiger Mastery",["npcName"]="Ajeck Rouack",["pre"]={187},["qlvl"]=37,["quest"]=188,["minLevel"]=28}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:step:17",["text"]="Nesingwary's camp",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back north to the camp."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:18:1",["t"]="accept",["y"]=0.1285,["x"]=0.315,["title"]="Anything of Value",["objName"]="Thoroughly Scavenged Supplies",["qlvl"]=35,["minLevel"]=30,["quest"]=97328,["object"]=661516}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:step:18",["text"]="Thoroughly Scavenged Supplies",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="On the walk west from Nesingwary's camp, a pile of Thoroughly Scavenged Supplies lies by the path: it starts Anything of Value, whose Stolen Shipments lie in the Ruins of Zul'Kunda on the coast ahead."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Singing Crystal Shard",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:19:1",["t"]="collect",["title"]="Singing Blue Shards",["y"]=0.0636,["x"]=0.3367,["count"]=10,["lvl"]=40,["spread"]=true,["item"]=3918,["quest"]=605,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Bloodscalp Ear",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:19:2",["t"]="collect",["count"]=15,["quest"]=189,["y"]=0.1143,["x"]=0.3141,["title"]="Bloodscalp Ears",["lvl"]=34,["fromNpcsAt"]="1;1;1,4;4;2,4;3;3;3,4;5,7,6,9;6,5,7;5,6,7,9,8;5,6,7,9;5,6,9;8,7,9;5,6,7,9,8;8;8;2,3,4",["item"]=1519,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1434,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:19:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=685,["y"]=0.1432,["x"]=0.2779,["title"]="Raptor Mastery",["lvl"]=34,["target"]="Stranglethorn Raptor",["count"]=10,["quest"]=194,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:step:19",["text"]="The Savage Coast: kill these as you meet them",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="West past the camp, Crystal Spine Basilisks (34-35) sit on the rocks; every Bloodscalp in the village beyond can drop an ear.\nLeave Sin'Dall, the level 37 tiger on the hilltop south-west of the camp, for now: he is two over you here, and the 40-50 Stranglethorn guide comes back to him.\nCareful: The raptor nest has young raptors that join the fight when you attack the adults."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:20:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=268992,["npcName"]="Zimmix Sputterspark",["x"]=0.2346,["title"]="Where's the Key?",["y"]=0.12789999999999999,["qlvl"]=35,["quest"]=97329,["minLevel"]=30},{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Stolen Shipment",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Stolen Shipments, in the ruins",["fromId"]=661518,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="object",["item"]=277953,["y"]=0.12240000000000001,["x"]=0.2425,["title"]="Anything of Value",["from"]="Stolen Shipment",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:20:2",["count"]=8,["quest"]=97328,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1434,["itemName"]="Primitive Key",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:20:3",["t"]="collect",["item"]=277957,["title"]="Where's the Key?",["y"]=0.1232,["x"]=0.2446,["count"]=1,["lvl"]=37,["fromNpcsAt"]="2,6,1;6,2,3,5,1,4,7;6,2;2,6,1;5,3,1,7;3,5,4,7;3,5,7;6,2,1,7;6,2,7;5;4,5;4;3,4,5",["note"]="Primitive Key, from the Bloodscalp Scouts, Hunters and Mystics",["quest"]=97329,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:20:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=268992,["npcName"]="Zimmix Sputterspark",["x"]=0.2346,["title"]="Where's the Key?",["quest"]=97329,["y"]=0.12789999999999999},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:20:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=268992,["y"]=0.12789999999999999,["npcName"]="Zimmix Sputterspark",["x"]=0.2346,["escort"]=true,["title"]="Zimmix's Great Escape",["pre"]={97329},["qlvl"]=35,["quest"]=97331,["minLevel"]=30},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:20:6",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Escort Zimmix Sputterspark to safety"}},["y"]=0.114,["x"]=0.268,["title"]="Zimmix's Great Escape",["quest"]=97331,["escort"]=true},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:20:7",["text"]="Escort Zimmix Sputterspark out of the ruins and keep him alive: Lozgil takes the news once he is safe.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:step:20",["text"]="Zimmix Sputterspark",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Zimmix Sputterspark is held at the east edge of the Ruins of Zul'Kunda; the Stolen Shipments lie among the ruins around him. The Bloodscalp Scouts, Hunters and Mystics (34-35) there carry his Primitive Key. Then lead him out of the ruins: Wharfmaster Lozgil in Booty Bay takes the news and the shipments.\nCareful: Bloodscalp Berserkers and Headhunters (36-37) and Witch Doctors (37, casters) hold the ruins north and west of Zimmix Sputterspark, close to the northern shipments (around 24.9,9.6): pick the shipments in the southern ruins by Zimmix Sputterspark first, and pull one at a time if you go north."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:step:21",["text"]="Nesingwary's camp",["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:21:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=715,["npcName"]="Hemet Nesingwary",["x"]=0.3566,["title"]="Raptor Mastery",["quest"]=194,["y"]=0.1081},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:21:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=715,["y"]=0.1081,["x"]=0.3566,["title"]="Raptor Mastery",["npcName"]="Hemet Nesingwary",["pre"]={194},["qlvl"]=36,["quest"]=195,["minLevel"]=28}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:22:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=686,["carriedTo"]="forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale",["y"]=0.23199999999999998,["x"]=0.324,["title"]="Raptor Mastery",["lvl"]=36,["target"]="Lashtail Raptor",["count"]=10,["quest"]=195,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1434,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:22:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=686,["count"]=15,["y"]=0.23170000000000002,["x"]=0.324,["title"]="The Defense of Grom'gol",["lvl"]=36,["target"]="Lashtail Raptor",["quest"]=568,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:step:22",["text"]="Lashtail Raptors",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="On your way back south to Grom'gol, the Lashtail Raptors (35-36) hunt the jungle between the camp and Grom'gol: they count for Hemet and for Commander Aggro'gosh. Careful: the 36s can be two over you: pull them one at a time. Carnivorous Weeds (36-38) are rooted in the jungle south of the raptors: walk around them."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:23:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2464,["npcName"]="Commander Aggro'gosh",["x"]=0.32170000000000004,["title"]="The Defense of Grom'gol",["quest"]=568,["y"]=0.289},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:23:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2464,["y"]=0.289,["x"]=0.32170000000000004,["title"]="The Defense of Grom'gol",["npcName"]="Commander Aggro'gosh",["pre"]={568},["qlvl"]=37,["quest"]=569,["minLevel"]=33},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:23:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2497,["npcName"]="Nimboya",["x"]=0.32159999999999994,["title"]="Hunt for Yenniku",["quest"]=581,["y"]=0.2772},{["map"]=1434,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:23:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2497,["y"]=0.2772,["x"]=0.32159999999999994,["title"]="Headhunting",["npcName"]="Nimboya",["pre"]={581},["qlvl"]=37,["quest"]=582,["minLevel"]=30},{["map"]=1434,["note"]="Far Seer Mok'thardin: the Shadowmaw claws and the tigress fang come at the end of this guide",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:goal:23:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2465,["npcName"]="Far Seer Mok'thardin",["x"]=0.3212,["title"]="Mok'thardin's Enchantment",["y"]=0.2924,["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=570,["minLevel"]=33}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:step:23",["text"]="Grom'gol",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Commander Aggro'gosh stands in the middle of Grom'gol, Nimboya near the zeppelin tower, Far Seer Mok'thardin beside the flight master."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/03-stranglethorn-vale:step:24",["text"]="Fly to Booty Bay",["goals"]={{["