l lives in the Swamplight Manor south-east of Witch Hill."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["itemName"]="Acidic Venom Sac",["oi"]=1,["id"]="forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:8:1",["t"]="collect",["note"]="Every Darkfang spider drops them: Lurkers, Spiders, Venomspitters and the Giant Darkfang Spiders",["y"]=0.23800000000000002,["x"]=0.563,["title"]="The Black Shield",["spread"]=true,["count"]=6,["item"]=5959,["quest"]=1322,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["itemName"]="Unpopped Darkmist Eye",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=5884,["quest"]=1206,["map"]=1445,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=4376,["t"]="collect",["fromAlsoId"]=4377,["title"]="Jarl Needs Eyes",["y"]=0.21050000000000002,["x"]=0.35729999999999995,["count"]=40,["lvl"]=39,["from"]="Darkmist Spider",["fromAlso"]="Darkmist Lurker",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:goal:14:2"},{["map"]=1445,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:goal:14:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=4834,["y"]=0.2359,["x"]=0.38049999999999995,["title"]="Theramore Spies",["count"]=9,["target"]="Theramore Infiltrator",["quest"]=1201,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:step:14",["text"]="Brackenwall Village: kill these as you meet them",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Head west back across the marsh. The Darkfang Lurkers (36-37) and Venomspitters (37-38) on the ridges north of Brackenwall drop the venom sacs. Theramore Infiltrators (35-36) sneak through the same woods: they are stealthed, so look closely.\nThe Darkmist spiders swarm the cavern mouth north-west of Brackenwall; every kind drops eyes. Work its outer edge, where the Spiders and Recluses (35-37) stand: the Lurkers and Silkspinners (37-39) deeper in are two or three over you.\nCareful: Darkfang Lurkers (level 36-37) use Sneak to stealth while out of combat and cast Poison once fighting.\nCareful: Stealthed spiders in the same area will attack you on sight.\nCareful: Darkmist Lurkers move about stealthed and use poison once in combat. The spiders stand close together, so adds are common; pulling single targets from the outer edge cuts down on them."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:step:15",["text"]="Brackenwall Village",["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:10:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4791,["npcName"]="Nazeer Bloodpike",["x"]=0.3521,["title"]="The Lost Report",["quest"]=1238,["y"]=0.3066},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:10:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4791,["npcName"]="Nazeer Bloodpike",["x"]=0.3521,["title"]="Theramore Spies",["quest"]=1201,["y"]=0.3066},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:goal:15:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4791,["y"]=0.3066,["x"]=0.3521,["title"]="The Theramore Docks",["npcName"]="Nazeer Bloodpike",["pre"]={1201},["qlvl"]=35,["quest"]=1202,["minLevel"]=30},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:10:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5087,["npcName"]="Do'gol",["x"]=0.3653,["title"]="The Black Shield",["quest"]=1322,["y"]=0.3079},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:10:6",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5087,["y"]=0.3079,["x"]=0.3653,["title"]="The Black Shield",["npcName"]="Do'gol",["pre"]={1322},["qlvl"]=37,["quest"]=1323,["minLevel"]=30},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:10:7",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4926,["npcName"]="Krog",["x"]=0.3642,["title"]="The Black Shield",["quest"]=1323,["y"]=0.3188}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:4:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4983,["y"]=0.3669,["x"]=0.4096,["title"]="Questioning Reethe",["npcName"]="Ogron",["pre"]={1269},["qlvl"]=37,["quest"]=1273,["minLevel"]=30},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:goal:16:2",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Paval Reethe"},{["count"]=1,["text"]="Question Reethe with Ogron"}},["y"]=0.381,["x"]=0.426,["title"]="Questioning Reethe",["quest"]=1273}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:step:16",["text"]="Questioning Reethe",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="On the way east, Ogron waits in the Quagmire east of the village. Follow him to Reethe and keep him alive through the fight that breaks out: Private Hallan and Theramore Skirmishers (36) join it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["note"]="Loose Dirt, now that Nazeer Bloodpike has read the report",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:11:4",["t"]="accept",["object"]=20985,["y"]=0.25920000000000004,["x"]=0.5544,["qlvl"]=35,["objName"]="Loose Dirt",["pre"]={1238},["minLevel"]=30,["quest"]=1239,["title"]="The Severed Head"},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:11:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4792,["npcName"]="\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl",["x"]=0.5544,["title"]="Jarl Needs Eyes",["quest"]=1206,["y"]=0.2627},{["note"]="only if you carry a Moonsteel Broadsword (Blacksmithing or the Auction House)",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={4792},["npc"]=4792,["npcName"]="\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl",["qlvl"]=35,["quest"]=1203,["map"]=1445,["optional"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:goal:17:3",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=3450,["closedBy"]={81570},["x"]=0.5544,["title"]="Jarl Needs a Blade",["pre"]={1206},["y"]=0.2627,["minLevel"]=30},{["map"]=1445,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:11:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4792,["npcName"]="\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl",["x"]=0.5544,["title"]="Jarl Needs a Blade",["quest"]=1203,["y"]=0.2627}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:step:17",["text"]="Swamp Eye Jarl",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="On east to the Swamplight Manor."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["itemName"]="Captain's Documents",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Underwater",["fromId"]=20925,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="object",["item"]=5882,["y"]=0.512,["x"]=0.715,["title"]="The Theramore Docks",["from"]="Captain's Footlocker",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:goal:18:1",["count"]=1,["quest"]=1202,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:step:18",["text"]="The Theramore Docks",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="South-east from the manor to Theramore Isle: the Captain's Footlocker lies on the sea floor off the docks on the isle's east side. Swim in and out and keep off the piers and the town: Theramore's guards are level 53-57, and a death here is a long run back from the spirit healer. Young Murk Threshers (40-41) circle in the water around the docks: grab the footlocker and swim straight out."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:10:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4503,["npcName"]="Mudcrush Durtfeet",["x"]=0.3515,["title"]="Hungry!",["quest"]=1177,["y"]=0.3826},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:goal:19:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4791,["npcName"]="Nazeer Bloodpike",["x"]=0.3521,["title"]="The Theramore Docks",["quest"]=1202,["y"]=0.3066},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:12:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4791,["npcName"]="Nazeer Bloodpike",["x"]=0.3521,["title"]="The Severed Head",["quest"]=1239,["y"]=0.3066},{["map"]=1445,["note"]="For Kin'weelay at Grom'gol, in forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:12:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4791,["y"]=0.3066,["x"]=0.3521,["title"]="The Troll Witchdoctor",["npcName"]="Nazeer Bloodpike",["pre"]={1239},["qlvl"]=35,["quest"]=1240,["minLevel"]=30},{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:10:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4926,["npcName"]="Krog",["x"]=0.3642,["title"]="Questioning Reethe",["quest"]=1273,["y"]=0.3188}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:step:19",["text"]="Brackenwall Village",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Head back west to Brackenwall with the head: Mudcrush Durtfeet stands at the south edge of the village where the road comes in, Nazeer Bloodpike and Krog in the village."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["x"]=0.445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["text"]="Drywallow Crocolisks",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:goal:20:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.248,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=36}}},{["map"]=1445,["note"]="grind on Drywallow Crocolisk",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/04-dustwallow-marsh:goal:20:2",["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=36}},["npcName"]="Drywallow Crocolisk",["x"]=0.4625,["lvl"]=36,["y"]=0.21739999999999998,["level"]=36,["spread"]=true,["grind"]=4341}},["detail"]="Desolace's last quests are 36-39. Still below 36 after Brackenwall's hand-ins? The Drywallow Crocolisks (35-36) along the river east of the village are the closest at your level: kill them until level 36."