efresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:20:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2792,["npcName"]="Gor'mul",["x"]=0.7264,["title"]="Hammerfall",["y"]=0.3393,["qlvl"]=34,["quest"]=655,["minLevel"]=29},{["map"]=1417,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:20:2",["t"]="getfp",["npc"]=2851,["npcName"]="Urda",["x"]=0.7302,["location"]="Hammerfall",["y"]=0.327,["node"]=17,["area"]=321},{["map"]=1417,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:20:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=15126,["y"]=0.2967,["x"]=0.7337,["title"]="Defiler's Basic Care Package",["npcName"]="Rutherford Twing",["direct"]=true,["qlvl"]=34,["quest"]=8263,["minLevel"]=25},{["map"]=1417,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:20:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2703,["npcName"]="Zengu",["x"]=0.738,["title"]="Trollbane",["quest"]=638,["y"]=0.3396},{["map"]=1417,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:20:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2771,["npcName"]="Drum Fel",["x"]=0.7424,["title"]="The Hammer May Fall",["quest"]=676,["y"]=0.3392},{["map"]=1417,["crumbs"]={676},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:20:6",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2771,["y"]=0.3392,["x"]=0.7424,["title"]="Call to Arms",["npcName"]="Drum Fel",["minLevel"]=30,["qlvl"]=32,["quest"]=677,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1417,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:20:7",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=2706,["npcName"]="Tor'gan",["x"]=0.7472,["title"]="Hammerfall",["quest"]=655,["y"]=0.3629},{["map"]=1417,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:20:8",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2706,["y"]=0.3629,["x"]=0.7472,["title"]="Raising Spirits",["npcName"]="Tor'gan",["pre"]={655},["qlvl"]=34,["quest"]=672,["minLevel"]=29},{["map"]=1417,["note"]="Doctor Gregory Victor, at the south gate. If Doctor Gregory Victor offers nothing, another player may be running his First Aid quest Triage: he can be busy for a few minutes. Wait, then talk to him again.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:20:9",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=12920,["npcName"]="Doctor Gregory Victor",["x"]=0.7341,["title"]="Silky Sutures",["y"]=0.3689,["qlvl"]=36,["quest"]=97539,["minLevel"]=30}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:20",["text"]="Hammerfall",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The orc stronghold at the eastern end of the road. Urda, the wind rider master, stands by the gate.\nRutherford Twing offers the Defiler's Basic Care Package only once you are Friendly with the Defilers (Arathi Basin): skip it if he doesn't offer it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1417,["crumbs"]={638},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:21:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=2703,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=639}},["y"]=0.3396,["x"]=0.738,["title"]="Sigil of Strom",["npcName"]="Zengu",["minLevel"]=32,["qlvl"]=37,["quest"]=639,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["detail"]="Zengu's Sigil of Strom drops from the elite Syndicate (35-38) in Stromgarde's ruins, the west of the highlands. Great XP if you have a group for it: the route passes Stromgarde on its way to the inner circle.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:21",["text"]="Stromgarde quests for a group",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=639}}},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Mote of Myzrael",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=4435,["quest"]=642,["map"]=1417,["oi"]=1,["fromAlsoId"]=2573,["fromId"]=2572,["fromAlso"]="Drywhisker Surveyor",["t"]="collect",["spread"]=true,["y"]=0.3488,["x"]=0.7748999999999999,["title"]="The Princess Trapped",["from"]="Drywhisker Kobold",["lvl"]=36,["count"]=12,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:22:1"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:22",["text"]="Drywhisker Gorge",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="North-east of Hammerfall the Drywhisker kobolds mine the gorge; the Kobolds at the mouth and the Diggers and Surveyors deeper in all drop the Motes of Myzrael.\nCareful: Every kobold type runs off for help when low on health (Kobolds at 30%, Surveyors and Diggers at 15%), which can pull more of them."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1417,["note"]="Below ground",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:23:1",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.3095,["x"]=0.8431000000000001,["title"]="The Princess Trapped",["objName"]="Iridescent Shards",["quest"]=642,["object"]=2701},{["map"]=1417,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:23:2",["t"]="accept",["object"]=2701,["y"]=0.3095,["x"]=0.8431000000000001,["qlvl"]=38,["objName"]="Iridescent Shards",["pre"]={642},["minLevel"]=30,["quest"]=651,["title"]="Stones of Binding"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:23",["text"]="Iridescent Shards",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Iridescent Shards lie at the far end of the gorge."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1417,["itemName"]="Cresting Key",["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=2691,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Stones of Binding",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.29719999999999996,["x"]=0.667,["count"]=1,["from"]="Stone of East Binding",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:24:1",["item"]=4484,["quest"]=651,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:24",["text"]="The Stone of East Binding",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Each Circle of Binding is a ring of standing stones; the key sits on the stone at its heart. The eastern circle is on the hills north-west of Hammerfall.\nCareful: Each center stone is guarded by around three elementals near level 39 that attack together if you click the stone without clearing them: Burning Exiles at West, Thundering Exiles at Outer, Cresting Exiles at East."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1417,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:25:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2556,["count"]=10,["y"]=0.637,["x"]=0.723,["title"]="Call to Arms",["lvl"]=35,["target"]="Witherbark Headhunter",["quest"]=677,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1417,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:25:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2554,["count"]=10,["y"]=0.6475,["x"]=0.7303000000000001,["title"]="Call to Arms",["lvl"]=33,["target"]="Witherbark Axe Thrower",["quest"]=677,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1417,["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:25:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=2555,["count"]=8,["y"]=0.6462,["x"]=0.7373999999999999,["title"]="Call to Arms",["lvl"]=34,["target"]="Witherbark Witch Doctor",["quest"]=677,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:25",["text"]="Witherbark Village",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="South of Hammerfall, the Witherbark trolls hold the village in the hills. Axe Throwers guard the outer huts; the Witch Doctors and Headhunters hold the heart of the village. Careful: All three troll types flee for help at 15% health, which can pull more trolls from the nearby camps."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Highland Raptor Eye",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=4512,["quest"]=672,["map"]=1417,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=2559,["t"]="collect",["fromAlsoId"]=2560,["title"]="Raising Spirits",["y"]=0.5628,["x"]=0.6709999999999999,["count"]=10,["from"]="Highland Strider",["spread"]=true,["fromAlso"]="Highland Thrasher",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:26:1"},{["itemName"]="Surgical Spidersilk",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=278225,["quest"]=97539,["map"]=1417,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=2563,["t"]="collect",["fromAlsoId"]=2565,["title"]="Silky Sutures",["y"]=0.505,["x"]=0.695,["count"]=12,["from"]="Plains Creeper",["note"]="Surgical Spidersilk, from Plains Creepers",["fromAlso"]="Giant Plains Creeper",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:26:2"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:step:26",["text"]="Highland raptors and Plains Creepers",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="On the way back north, Highland Striders roam the hills all around Hammerfall and drop the eyes, and south of it the Plains Creepers (32-33) spin their webs in the grass; they carry the spidersilk."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1417,["note"]="Doctor Gregory Victor, at the south gate. If he won't take the silk, another player may be running Triage: wait a few minutes and talk to him again.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands:goal:27:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=12920,["npcName"]="Doctor Gregory Victor",["x"]=0.7341,["title"]=