ate from the port goes to Krom'rosh, in the middle of the fort.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:9",["text"]="Krom'rosh",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={95062}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Gaseous Gold",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:10:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=263367,["soloWhen"]={{["q"]=96063,["k"]="available",["minLevel"]=36}},["npcName"]="Sleebo Fizzlespout",["x"]=0.6809999999999999,["title"]="Gaseous Gold",["y"]=0.486,["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=96063,["minLevel"]=36}},["detail"]="East of Rog'mar, on the hill above the road to Powderfuse Port: Sleebo Fizzlespout has his workshop there. The gas vents are in the marsh south-west of it, on your first hunt for Neza Bloodsnout.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:10",["text"]="Sleebo Fizzlespout's workshop",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["q"]=96063,["k"]="available",["minLevel"]=36}}},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Plains Buzzard Feather",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=271793,["quest"]=96107,["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=263343,["t"]="collect",["spread"]=true,["y"]=0.5021,["x"]=0.6726000000000001,["title"]="Feathers for Fletching",["lvl"]=38,["count"]=6,["from"]="Low Plains Buzzard",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:11:1"},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Picked Carcass: A Feast for Buzzards",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:11:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=263316,["npcName"]="Picked Carcass",["x"]=0.617,["title"]="A Feast for Buzzards",["y"]=0.588,["qlvl"]=38,["quest"]=96103,["minLevel"]=36},{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Marsh Gas Vial",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=649232,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Gaseous Gold",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.589,["x"]=0.622,["count"]=8,["from"]="Marsh Gas Vial",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:11:3",["item"]=272004,["quest"]=96063,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:11",["text"]="The plains and the marsh",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="South-east of Rog'mar the plains run down to Terral's Watch. The Low Plains Buzzards circle everywhere; a picked carcass lies in the grass (its skull starts A Feast for Buzzards), and the marsh vents are just past it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:12:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=263367,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={96063}}},["npcName"]="Sleebo Fizzlespout",["x"]=0.6809999999999999,["title"]="Gaseous Gold",["quest"]=96063,["y"]=0.486},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="Rock 'em and Sock 'em",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:12:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=263367,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={96063}}},["y"]=0.486,["x"]=0.6809999999999999,["title"]="Rock 'em and Sock 'em",["npcName"]="Sleebo Fizzlespout",["pre"]={96063},["qlvl"]=40,["quest"]=96067,["minLevel"]=36},{["map"]=2548,["note"]="the stress test: beat G45-B4G beside the workshop",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:12:3",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Fight G45-B4G in a stress test of Sleebo's engine."}},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={96063}}},["y"]=0.486,["x"]=0.682,["title"]="Rock 'em and Sock 'em",["quest"]=96067},{["map"]=2548,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:12:4",["t"]="turnin",