Neza Bloodsnout",["x"]=0.605,["title"]="Snargl's Snout",["quest"]=94533,["y"]=0.478}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:31",["text"]="Neza Bloodsnout",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94533}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="the WANTED! poster",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:32:1",["t"]="accept",["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=95992}},["y"]=0.47,["x"]=0.595,["title"]="WANTED: Ghostmaw",["objName"]="WANTED!",["qlvl"]=42,["minLevel"]=38,["quest"]=95992,["object"]=645164}},["detail"]="Ghostmaw is an elite (level 42) who hunts along the river south-west of Rog'mar, by the Farholde camp you go to next: grouping up is advised. The poster hangs in the middle of the fort.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:32",["text"]="WANTED: Ghostmaw",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=95992}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Hearty Stew",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:33:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.37,["x"]=0.608,["title"]="A Serving of Strength",["item"]=265066,["quest"]=94481,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:33",["text"]="The training grounds",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="North of the fort the Rog'mar Trainees drill: use Gorg's Hearty Stew on them.\nCareful: Ghostmaw, an elite (level 42), can come up from the river south of the fort: let him pass."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:34",["text"]="Gorg",["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:34:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=256655,["npcName"]="Gorg",["x"]=0.5865,["title"]="A Serving of Strength",["quest"]=94481,["y"]=0.4457}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Makeshift Stickin' Spear",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:35:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.5710000000000001,["x"]=0.519,["title"]="Stick 'Em",["note"]="Tan'jani's spears, on the Freshwater Crocolisks",["item"]=271639,["quest"]=95955,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:35:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=270667,["count"]=8,["y"]=0.5958,["x"]=0.4604,["title"]="Show Them How It's Done",["lvl"]=39,["target"]="Farholde Priest",["quest"]=94483,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=2548,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:35:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=257926,["y"]=0.6409999999999999,["x"]=0.451,["title"]="Show Them How It's Done",["lvl"]=39,["target"]="Farholde Scout",["count"]=12,["quest"]=94483,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:35",["text"]="The river and the Farholde camp",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="South-west of Rog'mar the river runs between the farms: impale the Freshwater Crocolisks with Tan'jani's spears. The Alliance trains its scouts and priests at a camp on the far bank. Cavalry Scout Alturin, the Alliance elite, rides the road just east of the camp: pull the scouts and priests away from it.\nCareful: Ghostmaw, an elite (level 42), hunts along this river: if he comes your way, back off and let him pass."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Ghostmaw's Fang",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["kind"]="elite",["rank"]=1,["lvl"]=42},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=95992}},["item"]=271828,["fromRank"]=1,["quest"]=95992,["map"]=2548,["oi"]=1,["