hip, up the ridge: the Rotflesh Mushrooms grow among the rocks, close to the Twilight ogres' camp. The Mature Paletusks on the ridge give entrails too."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["itemName"]="Beast Entrails",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:80:1",["t"]="collect",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["item"]=268632,["k"]="has",["n"]=15}},["y"]=0.498,["x"]=0.787,["title"]="It Takes Guts",["count"]=15,["item"]=268632,["quest"]=95261,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["detail"]="South-east back towards the port: the shore crawlers on the beach north of the docks are the quickest entrails. Gul'gash wanders down to this beach too.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:80",["text"]="Finish the Beast Entrails",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["item"]=268632,["k"]="has",["n"]=15}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:81:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259961,["npcName"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz",["x"]=0.7945,["title"]="See Ya, Scallywags!",["quest"]=95165,["y"]=0.5271},{["map"]=2548,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:81:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=259961,["npcName"]="Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz",["x"]=0.7945,["title"]="Admiral Lamora",["quest"]=95124,["y"]=0.5271},{["map"]=2548,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:81:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=260231,["npcName"]="Argo Brinewhistle",["x"]=0.7995,["title"]="It Takes Guts",["quest"]=95261,["y"]=0.5249},{["map"]=2548,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:81:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=260231,["note"]="The Monster Surfaces: a 