="Break Their Chains",["quest"]=94748}},["detail"]="The cult's camps fill the valley south and west of Da'grosh. Free the captive Rog'mar Scouts as you find them. Twilight Enforcers (elites, level 45) patrol through the camps: watch where they walk before each pull. Overlord Kilgar and Executioner Morg (elites, 46) hold the fortress at the valley's head: pull the cultists away from them. Sergeant Riftan's Alliance camp sits at the valley's south end, and its Farholde Lookouts (level 46) attack the Horde: stay north of it.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:88",["text"]="The Twilight camps",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={94745,94748}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["note"]="recruit five Ogre Miners",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:89:1",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=5,["text"]="Ogre Miners recruited"}},["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={95432}}},["y"]=0.349,["x"]=0.26899999999999996,["title"]="Rise Up!",["quest"]=95432}},["detail"]="North of the camps the cult works ogre miners in a mine: talk five of them into rising up against their masters.\nCareful: Twilight Enforcers (elites, level 45) walk past the mine's mouth on their way through the camps. Wait for one to pass before you go in.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:step:89",["text"]="The ogre mine",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={95432}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=2548,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riverglades:goal:90:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=260993,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={95432}}},["npcName"]="Crag'rog",["x"]=0.2766,["title"]="Rise Up!",["quest"]=95432,["y"]=0.3654}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/01b-riv