 of Onyxia lie in the dragon caves in the Wyrmbog's south-east, guarded by the scalebanes; smash five."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["x"]=0.375,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["text"]="Firemane Scout",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:31:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.6829999999999999,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=1173},{["frac"]=0.37,["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=45}}},{["map"]=1445,["frac"]=0.37,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:31:2",["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=1173},{["frac"]=0.37,["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=45}},["npcName"]="Firemane Scout",["x"]=0.368,["note"]="grind on Firemane Scout",["lvl"]=42,["y"]=0.69,["level"]=45,["spread"]=true,["grind"]=4329}},["detail"]="Overlord Mok'Morokk's challenge, back in Brackenwall, needs a group of three. Alone, grind the Firemane scouts here on the Wyrmbog's northern edge to level 45.37 before you ride back north, so you don't come back down for it. Or, with a group, run the Zul'Farrak dungeon instead.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:step:31",["text"]="Level 45.37",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["neg"]=true,["k"]="group",["q"]=1173},{["frac"]=0.37,["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=45}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["note"]="Draz'Zilb, below ground",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:19:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4501,["npcName"]="Draz'Zilb",["x"]=0.3715,["title"]="The Brood of Onyxia",["quest"]=1172,["y"]=0.3309}},["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:19",["text"]="Brackenwall Village",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride back north to Brackenwall."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:33:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=4500,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=1173}},["y"]=0.3141,["x"]=0.3629,["title"]="Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk",["npcName"]="Overlord Mok'Morokk",["pre"]={1172},["qlvl"]=45,["quest"]=1173,["minLevel"]=38},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["title"]="Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Drive Overlord Mok'Morokk from Brackenwall Village"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:33:2",["t"]="complete",["quest"]=1173,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=1173}}},{["map"]=1445,["note"]="Draz'Zilb, below ground",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:33:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=4501,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=1173}},["npcName"]="Draz'Zilb",["x"]=0.3715,["title"]="Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk",["quest"]=1173,["y"]=0.3309}},["detail"]="These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk needs a group of 3. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.\nOverlord Mok'Morokk is elite: grouping up is advised. Beat him down until he gives up, then report to Draz'Zilb.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:step:33",["text"]="Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="group",["q"]=1173}}},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:step:34",["text"]="Fly to Camp Mojache",["goals"]={{["map"]=1445,["x"]=0.35600000000000004,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:34:1",["text"]="Brackenwall Village flight master",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.318},{["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["location"]="Camp Mojache",["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:21:1",["t"]="fly",["node"]=42,["area"]=1099}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Encrusted Minerals",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=9589,["quest"]=3128,["map"]=1444,["oi"]=2,["fromId"]=5276,["t"]="collect",["fromAlsoId"]=5278,["title"]="Natural Materials",["y"]=0.475,["x"]=0.68,["count"]=6,["lvl"]=45,["from"]="Sprite Dragon",["fromAlso"]="Sprite Darter",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:35:1"},{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Splintered Log",["oi"]=1,["count"]=2,["fromId"]=7584,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=3128,["lvl"]=46,["y"]=0.47200000000000003,["x"]=0.54,["item"]=9590,["from"]="Wandering Forest Walker",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:35:2",["title"]="Natural Materials",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:step:35",["text"]="Sprite darters and forest walkers",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The sprite darters flit over the grove just west of the camp and carry the Encrusted Minerals; the Wandering Forest Walkers, a little further west, carry the Splintered Logs.\nCareful: a Vale Screamer (level 60) flies over the forest west of the camp: keep clear of it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Resilient Sinew",["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:36:1",["t"]="collect",["title"]="Natural Materials",["y"]=0.6082,["x"]=0.5492,["count"]=20,["lvl"]=46,["spread"]=true,["item"]=9591,["quest"]=3128,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Metallic Fragments",["oi"]=4,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:36:2",["t"]="collect",["count"]=40,["quest"]=3128,["y"]=0.6082,["x"]=0.5492,["title"]="Natural Materials",["lvl"]=46,["fromNpcsAt"]="1;1,2;1;1;2;2,1;2,3;2,3;3,2;3,4,2;3,2,4;4,3;4,2,3,8;3;1;8;8;6,7;8;8;2,3;3,4;3,4,5;7,6;6;7,6;6,7;7",["item"]=9592,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:step:36",["text"]="Frayfeather hippogryphs",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="South of the vale the Frayfeather hippogryphs roost on the slopes; nearly every one drops sinew and metallic fragments."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:25:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14637,["npcName"]="Zorbin Fandazzle",["x"]=0.4481,["title"]="Zapped Giants",["y"]=0.43420000000000003,["qlvl"]=48,["quest"]=7003,["minLevel"]=45},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:25:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=14637,["npcName"]="Zorbin Fandazzle",["x"]=0.4481,["title"]="Fuel for the Zapping",["y"]=0.43420000000000003,["qlvl"]=48,["quest"]=7721,["minLevel"]=45}},["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:25",["text"]="Zorbin Fandazzle",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride north-west to the Forgotten Coast; Zorbin Fandazzle waits on the dock."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Yeh'kinya's Bramble",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:38:1",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.38,["x"]=0.45,["title"]="Screecher Spirits",["carriedTo"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris",["item"]=10699,["quest"]=3520,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1444,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:38:2",["t"]="talk",["npc"]=8612,["npcName"]="Screecher Spirit",["x"]=0.46,["title"]="Screecher Spirits",["carriedTo"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris",["y"]=0.37689999999999996,["quest"]=3520,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:step:38",["text"]="Rogue Vale screechers",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Rogue Vale opens just north of Zorbin Fandazzle's dock. Kill a Rogue Vale Screecher, use Yeh'kinya's Bramble on its body before you loot it, then talk to the spirit that rises: it is friendly. Three spirits in all."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Water Elemental Core",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=18958,["quest"]=7721,["map"]=1444,["oi"]=1,["fromAlsoId"]=5462,["fromId"]=5461,["fromAlso"]="Sea Spray",["t"]="collect",["lvl"]=49,["y"]=0.486,["x"]=0.44939999999999997,["title"]="Fuel for the Zapping",["from"]="Sea Elemental",["note"]="Water Elemental Core, from the Sea Sprays",["count"]=10,["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:39:1"},{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:39:2",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.49079999999999996,["x"]=0.4412,["title"]="Zapped Giants",["note"]="Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker, on the Wave and Deep Striders in the water",["item"]=18904,["quest"]=7003,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Miniaturization Residue",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:39:3",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.49079999999999996,["x"]=0.4412,["title"]="Zapped Giants",["count"]=15,["spread"]=true,["item"]=18956,["quest"]=7003,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:step:39",["text"]="Forgotten Coast: kill these as you meet them",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Sea Sprays (47-48) wash along the shore just south of the dock: they drop the Water Elemental Cores as well as the Sea Elementals (48-49) do. The Wave and Deep Striders (47-49) wade in the water off the same beach: zap them with Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker first, and shrunken they lose their elite strength. Leave the Land Walkers and Cliff Giants (48-50) of the northern hills for your next Feralas visit.\nThe Ultra-Shrinker lasts two hours: hand both quests back to Zorbin Fandazzle before you leave the coast."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:27:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14637,["npcName"]="Zorbin Fandazzle",["x"]=0.4481,["title"]="Zapped Giants",["quest"]=7003,["y"]=0.43420000000000003},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:27:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14637,["npcName"]="Zorbin Fandazzle",["x"]=0.4481,["title"]="Fuel for the Zapping",["quest"]=7721,["y"]=0.43420000000000003}},["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:27",["text"]="Zorbin Fandazzle",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Zorbin Fandazzle on the dock."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Rage Scar Yeti Hide",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=18947,["quest"]=7734,["map"]=1444,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=7848,["t"]="collect",["fromAlsoId"]=5296,["title"]="Improved Quality",["y"]=0.3079,["x"]=0.518,["count"]=10,["lvl"]=46,["from"]="Lurking Feral Scar",["fromAlso"]="Rage Scar Yeti",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:41:1"},{["map"]=1444,["itemName"]="Perfect Yeti Hide",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:41:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.3079,["x"]=0.518,["item"]=18972,["lvl"]=46,["note"]="Perfect Yeti Hide, a rare drop",["optional"]=true},{["itemName"]="Perfect Yeti Hide",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:30:3",["t"]="accept",["optional"]=true,["title"]="Perfect Yeti Hide",["qlvl"]=48,["pre"]={2822},["minLevel"]=40,["quest"]=7738,["item"]=18972}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:step:41",["text"]="Rage Scar yetis",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="On the way back south-east from the coast, the Rage Scar yetis live around the caves in the hills by the road. Any of them can also drop a Perfect Yeti Hide, which starts a quest of its own."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:step:42",["text"]="Camp Mojache",["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["note"]="Jangdor Swiftstrider, inside",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:31:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7854,["npcName"]="Jangdor Swiftstrider",["x"]=0.7443000000000001,["title"]="Improved Quality",["quest"]=7734,["y"]=0.4291},{["map"]=1444,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:31:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7854,["npcName"]="Jangdor Swiftstrider",["x"]=0.7443000000000001,["title"]="Perfect Yeti Hide",["quest"]=7738,["y"]=0.4291},{["map"]=1444,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:29:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8115,["npcName"]="Witch Doctor Uzer'i",["x"]=0.7442,["title"]="Natural Materials",["quest"]=3128,["y"]=0.4336},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/03-feralas:goal:42:4",["text"]="Talo Thornhoof's Northspring harpies (48-50) wait for your Feralas visit at about 51: keep the quest.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1446,["id"]="polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris",["next"]="polestar:forever/horde/40-50/05-the-hinterlands",["max"]=49,["min"]=48,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="Tanaris & Searing Gorge (48-49)",["faction"]="Horde",["category"]="Leveling",["zoneName"]="Tanaris",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:1",["text"]="Feralas",["goals"]={{["map"]=1444,["x"]=0.754,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["y"]=0.44299999999999995,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:1:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Camp Mojache",["area"]=1099}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:foreve