["title"]="Divino-matic Rod",["quest"]=2768,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:8:4"}},["detail"]="Zul'Farrak is a dungeon for a group of five; its quests here are level 45 to 47. Its gate lies about 400 yards north of the troll camp's water hole.\nInside: the Scarabs drop the shells, every Sandfury troll can drop Troll Temper, and Sergeant Bly carries the Divino-matic Rod.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:8",["text"]="Zul'Farrak",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["map"]=209,["k"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={2865,2768,3042}}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:4:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7724,["npcName"]="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser",["x"]=0.5021,["title"]="Gadgetzan Water Survey",["quest"]=992,["y"]=0.2748},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:4:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7724,["y"]=0.2748,["x"]=0.5021,["title"]="Noxious Lair Investigation",["npcName"]="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser",["pre"]={992},["qlvl"]=47,["quest"]=82,["minLevel"]=39}},["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:4",["text"]="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back east to Fizzledowser on the west side of Gadgetzan; Marvon Rivetseeker is south from there."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["map"]=209,["kind"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7876,["soloWhen"]={{["map"]=209,["k"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},{["k"]="complete",["q"]=2865}},["npcName"]="Tran'rek",["x"]=0.5157,["title"]="Scarab Shells",["y"]=0.2676,["quest"]=2865,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:10:1"}},["detail"]="Your Zul'Farrak scarab shells: Tran'rek, beside the wind rider master.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:10",["text"]="Tran'rek",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["map"]=209,["k"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},{["k"]="complete",["q"]=2865}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["map"]=209,["kind"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7407,["soloWhen"]={{["map"]=209,["k"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},{["k"]="complete",["q"]=2768}},["npcName"]="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle",["x"]=0.5246,["title"]="Divino-matic Rod",["y"]=0.2851,["quest"]=2768,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:11:1"}},["detail"]="The Divino-matic Rod: Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle, by the water tower.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:11",["text"]="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["map"]=209,["k"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},{["k"]="complete",["q"]=2768}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["map"]=209,["kind"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7804,["soloWhen"]={{["map"]=209,["k"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},{["k"]="complete",["q"]=3042}},["npcName"]="Trenton Lighthammer",["x"]=0.5141,["title"]="Troll Temper",["y"]=0.2875,["quest"]=3042,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:12:1"}},["detail"]="The Troll Temper: Trenton Lighthammer, a short walk from the flight master.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:12",["text"]="Trenton Lighthammer",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["map"]=209,["k"]="dungeon",["name"]="Zul'Farrak"},{["k"]="complete",["q"]=3042}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:6:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7771,["npcName"]="Marvon Rivetseeker",["x"]=0.5271,["title"]="Gahz'ridian",["y"]=0.4592,["qlvl"]=48,["quest"]=3161,["minLevel"]=43}},["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:6",["text"]="Marvon Rivetseeker",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="West along the road south; Marvon Rivetseeker camps by the ruins at the Broken Pillar. Put on his Gahz'ridian Detector: it shows the buried ornaments, here and around the Dunemaul Compound."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["itemName"]="Gahz'ridian Ornament",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=140971,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Gahz'ridian",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.45299999999999996,["x"]=0.523,["count"]=30,["from"]="Gahz'ridian",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:14:1",["item"]=8443,["quest"]=3161,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:14",["text"]="Gahz'ridian ornaments",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Dig up the Gahz'ridian ornaments around the Broken Pillar and north of the Dunemaul Compound. Leave the ogres for now: Gor'marok the Ravager is 49 and the Brutes 46-48; the Dunemaul Compound comes at the end of 40-50/06, at about 52."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Centipaar Insect Parts",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=8587,["quest"]=82,["map"]=1446,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=5458,["t"]="collect",["fromAlsoId"]=5459,["y"]=0.4268,["x"]=0.3575,["title"]="Noxious Lair Investigation",["from"]="Centipaar Worker",["count"]=5,["fromAlso"]="Centipaar Tunneler",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:7:1"}},["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:7",["text"]="The Noxious Lair",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="West, the Centipaar insects swarm around their hives; any of them drops the parts.\nCareful: Centipaar Swarmers cast Silithid Swarm both in and out of combat, which brings small adds that interrupt you. The Sandreavers are 49-50: take the Workers and Tunnelers."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["itemName"]="OOX-17/TN Distress Beacon",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:16:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.2789,["x"]=0.4484,["item"]=8623,["lvl"]=45,["note"]="OOX-17/TN Distress Beacon, a rare drop",["spread"]=true,["optional"]=true},{["map"]=1446,["itemName"]="Laden Dew Gland",["oi"]=1,["count"]=1,["fromId"]=5481,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=2605,["lvl"]=48,["y"]=0.6609999999999999,["x"]=0.292,["item"]=8428,["from"]="Thistleshrub Dew Collector",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:16:2",["title"]="The Thirsty Goblin",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:16",["text"]="Thistleshrub Valley: kill these as you meet them",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="West of the compound the cactus creatures fill the valley; only the Dew Collectors (47-48) carry a dew gland. Most mobs in Tanaris can drop OOX-17/TN's distress beacon, rarely: keep it if you see one.\nCareful: The other thistleshrub mobs in the area are level 48-50 and wander a lot, so you can easily pull extra mobs: take the Dew Collectors at the valley's edge, and leave Tran'rek's Gnarled Thistleshrubs and Rootshapers for the Broken Pillar ride into Un'Goro at about 51."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:17:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5955,["minLevel"]=40,["npcName"]="Tooga",["x"]=0.3,["escort"]=true,["y"]=0.65,["limit"]=1800,["qlvl"]=50,["quest"]=1560,["title"]="Tooga's Quest"},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:17:2",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Lead Tooga to Torta"}},["y"]=0.25670000000000004,["x"]=0.6658,["title"]="Tooga's Quest",["quest"]=1560,["escort"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:17",["text"]="Tooga's escort",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Tooga waits in the valley. Walk him all the way to his wife Torta in Steamwheedle Port, north-east across the desert: stay close, slow down for him and fight off what attacks him. Do not mount or hearth out of his reach. Yeh'kinya stands in the port too."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:18",["text"]="Steamwheedle Port",["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["note"]="Torta, Steamwheedle Port",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:10:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=6015,["npcName"]="Torta",["x"]=0.6658,["title"]="Tooga's Quest",["quest"]=1560,["y"]=0.25670000000000004},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:10:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8579,["npcName"]="Yeh'kinya",["x"]=0.6698999999999999,["title"]="Screecher Spirits",["quest"]=3520,["y"]=0.2236}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Wastewander Water Pouch",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=8483,["quest"]=379,["map"]=1446,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=5617,["t"]="collect",["fromAlsoId"]=5616,["title"]="Slake That Thirst",["y"]=0.23399999999999999,["x"]=0.6,["count"]=5,["lvl"]=42,["from"]="Wastewander Shadow Mage",["fromAlso"]="Wastewander Thief",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:19:1"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:19",["text"]="Slake That Thirst",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Careful: Shadow Mages (level 42-43) call a Voidwalker while out of combat and attack with Immolate and Shadow Bolt. Thieves can Disarm you, Rogues move around in Sneak, and Assassins use Execute once you are at 20% health or less."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:20",["text"]="Gadgetzan",["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:20:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7407,["npcName"]="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle",["x"]=0.5246,["title"]="Slake That Thirst",["quest"]=379,["y"]=0.2851},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:20:2",["text"]="Keep the Model 4711-FTZ Power Source Bilgewhizzle gave you: it starts Tanaris Field Sampling, a two-hour timer, so use it on the way back north from Scrimshank's hive.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:21",["text"]="Gadgetzan",["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:11:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7564,["npcName"]="Marin Noggenfogger",["x"]=0.5181,["title"]="The Thirsty Goblin",["quest"]=2605,["y"]=0.2866},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:11:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7564,["y"]=0.2866,["x"]=0.5181,["title"]="In Good Taste",["npcName"]="Marin Noggenfogger",["pre"]={2605},["qlvl"]=49,["quest"]=2606,["minLevel"]=44},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:21:3",["text"]="Keep Tran'rek's Thistleshrub Valley: its Rootshapers (49-50) come with the Dunemaul Compound at the Broken Pillar, on the way into Un'Goro at about 51.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:11:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7583,["npcName"]="Sprinkle",["x"]=0.5106,["title"]="In Good Taste",["quest"]=2606,["y"]=0.2687},{["map"]=1446,["note"]="the Violet Tragan grows in the Hinterlands, around level 48",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:11:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7583,["y"]=0.2687,["x"]=0.5106,["title"]="Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient",["npcName"]="Sprinkle",["pre"]={2606},["qlvl"]=49,["quest"]=2641,["minLevel"]=44},{["map"]=1446,["note"]="Alchemist Pestlezugg, inside",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:11:7",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5594,["npcName"]="Alchemist Pestlezugg",["x"]=0.5089,["title"]="Noxious Lair Investigation",["quest"]=82,["y"]=0.2696},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:11:8",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7724,["y"]=0.2748,["x"]=0.5021,["title"]="The Scrimshank Redemption",["npcName"]="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser",["pre"]={82},["qlvl"]=48,["quest"]=10,["minLevel"]=39},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:21:8",["text"]="Andi Lynn's Dunemaul Compound stays in your log for the Broken Pillar at about 52.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:12",["text"]="Marvon Rivetseeker",["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:12:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7771,["npcName"]="Marvon Rivetseeker",["x"]=0.5271,["title"]="Gahz'ridian",["quest"]=3161,["y"]=0.4592}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["itemName"]="Scrimshank's Surveying Gear",["oi"]=1,["note"]="Below ground",["fromId"]=144053,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="object",["item"]=8593,["y"]=0.7120000000000001,["x"]=0.56,["title"]="The Scrimshank Redemption",["from"]="Scrimshank's Surveying Gear",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:23:1",["count"]=1,["quest"]=10,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:23",["text"]="Scrimshank's gear",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Further south, Junior Surveyor Scrimshank's gear lies at the mouth of a Centipaar hive.\nCareful: One bug guards the gear. Many bugs patrol the tunnels, some of them level 50, so fights often pull extra adds."},{["goals"]={{["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:14:1",["t"]="accept",["title"]="Find OOX-17/TN!",["itemName"]="OOX-17/TN Distress Beacon",["qlvl"]=48,["minLevel"]=43,["quest"]=351,["item"]=8623},{["map"]=1446,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:14:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7784,["npcName"]="Homing Robot OOX-17/TN",["x"]=0.6023,["title"]="Find OOX-17/TN!",["quest"]=351,["y"]=0.6472},{["map"]=1446,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:24:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7784,["y"]=0.6472,["npcName"]="Homing Robot OOX-17/TN",["x"]=0.6023,["escort"]=true,["title"]="Rescue OOX-17/TN!",["pre"]={351},["qlvl"]=48,["quest"]=648,["minLevel"]=43},{["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:24:4",["t"]="complete",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Escort OOX-17/TN to Steamwheedle Port"}},["title"]="Rescue OOX-17/TN!",["carriedTo"]="forever/horde/40-50/06-azshara",["quest"]=648,["escort"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:24",["text"]="OOX-17/TN",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Only with the distress beacon: OOX-17/TN sits south-east of Scrimshank's hive. Escort it north to Steamwheedle Port; its reward waits with Oglethorpe in Booty Bay.\nCareful: The escort has two ambushes. Three level 47 scorpids attack near the start. Near the end, by the beach, three Wastewander humans attack: one mage and two assassins, around level 44."},{["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Model 4711-FTZ Power Source",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:25:1",["t"]="accept",["note"]="Use the Model 4711-FTZ Power Source",["qlvl"]=46,["title"]="Tanaris Field Sampling",["limit"]=7200,["pre"]={379},["minLevel"]=38,["quest"]=654,["item"]=8524},{["map"]=1446,["itemName"]="Acceptable Hyena Sample",["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:25:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.316,["x"]=0.502,["title"]="Tanaris Field Sampling",["count"]=8,["item"]=9441,["quest"]=654,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1446,["itemName"]="Acceptable Basilisk Sample",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:25:3",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.31,["x"]=0.494,["title"]="Tanaris Field Sampling",["count"]=8,["item"]=9440,["quest"]=654,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1446,["itemName"]="Acceptable Scorpid Sample",["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:25:4",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.312,["x"]=0.532,["title"]="Tanaris Field Sampling",["count"]=8,["item"]=9438,["quest"]=654,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:25",["text"]="Tanaris Field Sampling",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back north, just south of Gadgetzan, use the Model 4711-FTZ Power Source now: the two-hour timer starts. The Blisterpaw Hyenas, Glasshide Basilisks and Scorpid Hunters share the dunes here. Each can drop an untested sample: use it, and it either passes as an acceptable one or is lost. Keep killing until you have eight of each."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:26",["text"]="Gadgetzan",["goals"]={{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:26:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7407,["npcName"]="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle",["x"]=0.5246,["title"]="Tanaris Field Sampling",["quest"]=654,["y"]=0.2851},{["map"]=1446,["note"]="for Apothecary Zinge in the Undercity, around level 52",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:26:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7407,["y"]=0.2851,["x"]=0.5246,["title"]="Return to Apothecary Zinge",["npcName"]="Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle",["pre"]={654},["qlvl"]=46,["quest"]=864,["minLevel"]=38},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:15:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7724,["npcName"]="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser",["x"]=0.5021,["title"]="The Scrimshank Redemption",["quest"]=10,["y"]=0.2748},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:15:3",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7724,["y"]=0.2748,["x"]=0.5021,["title"]="Insect Part Analysis",["npcName"]="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser",["pre"]={10},["qlvl"]=48,["quest"]=110,["minLevel"]=39},{["map"]=1446,["note"]="Alchemist Pestlezugg, inside",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:15:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5594,["npcName"]="Alchemist Pestlezugg",["x"]=0.5089,["title"]="Insect Part Analysis",["quest"]=110,["y"]=0.2696},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:15:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5594,["y"]=0.2696,["x"]=0.5089,["title"]="Insect Part Analysis",["npcName"]="Alchemist Pestlezugg",["pre"]={110},["qlvl"]=48,["quest"]=113,["minLevel"]=39},{["map"]=1446,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:15:6",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=7724,["npcName"]="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser",["x"]=0.5021,["title"]="Insect Part Analysis",["quest"]=113,["y"]=0.2748},{["map"]=1446,["note"]="for Zilzibin Drumlore in Orgrimmar, around level 50",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:15:7",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=7724,["y"]=0.2748,["x"]=0.5021,["title"]="Rise of the Silithid",["npcName"]="Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser",["pre"]={113},["qlvl"]=48,["quest"]=32,["minLevel"]=39}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/ho