Fingers",["lvl"]=49,["target"]="Heavy War Golem",["count"]=20,["quest"]=7723,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:33",["text"]="The Cauldron's slavers and golems",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride south from Thorium Point into the Cauldron: the Dark Iron Taskmasters and Slavers drive the slaves on the paths, and the Heavy War Golems patrol the floor below Velarok Windblade. Careful: the biggest golems are 49: pull them one at a time."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:34:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8479,["npcName"]="Velarok Windblade",["x"]=0.3906,["title"]="Divine Retribution",["y"]=0.3899,["qlvl"]=48,["quest"]=3441,["minLevel"]=40}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:34",["text"]="Velarok Windblade",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Velarok Windblade stands alone south of Thorium Point, at the edge of the Cauldron. Listen to his story."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:35",["text"]="Divine Retribution",["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:35:1",["t"]="talk",["npc"]=8479,["npcName"]="Velarok Windblade",["x"]=0.391,["title"]="Divine Retribution",["y"]=0.39,["quest"]=3441,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:36",["text"]="Velarok Windblade",["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:36:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8479,["npcName"]="Velarok Windblade",["x"]=0.3906,["title"]="Divine Retribution",["quest"]=3441,["y"]=0.3899},{["map"]=1427,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:36:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8479,["y"]=0.3899,["x"]=0.3906,["title"]="The Flawless Flame",["npcName"]="Velarok Windblade",["pre"]={3441},["qlvl"]=48,["quest"]=3442,["minLevel"]=40}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["itemName"]="Grimesilt Outhouse Key",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:37:1",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.3786,["x"]=0.3914,["item"]=11818,["lvl"]=48,["note"]="Grimesilt Outhouse Key, a rare drop",["spread"]=true,["optional"]=true},{["map"]=1427,["itemName"]="Heart of Flame",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:37:2",["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.36729999999999996,["x"]=0.4069,["title"]="The Flawless Flame",["count"]=4,["spread"]=true,["item"]=10509,["quest"]=3442,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1427,["itemName"]="Golem Oil",["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:37:3",["t"]="collect",["title"]="The Flawless Flame",["y"]=0.3861,["x"]=0.4249,["count"]=4,["lvl"]=49,["spread"]=true,["item"]=10511,["quest"]=3442,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1427,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:37:4",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=5858,["y"]=0.33340000000000003,["x"]=0.3801,["title"]="Fiery Menace!",["count"]=20,["target"]="Searing Lava Spider",["quest"]=7724,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1427,["note"]="Below ground",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:37:5",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=9318,["y"]=0.2826,["x"]=0.4338,["title"]="Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It",["lvl"]=49,["target"]="Incendosaur",["count"]=20,["quest"]=7727,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["itemName"]="Secret Plans: Fiery Flux",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["rank"]=1,["kind"]="elite",["near"]=true,["lvl"]=50},["item"]=18922,["quest"]=7722,["map"]=1427,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=179826,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.35700000000000004,["x"]=0.405,["title"]="What the Flux?",["from"]="Secret Plans: Fiery Flux",["note"]="Below ground: the plans, on the The Slag Pit's upper ledge",["count"]=1,["fromKind"]="object",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:37:6"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:37",["text"]="Searing Gorge: kill these as you meet them",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Heavy War Golems patrol the Cauldron below Velarok Windblade and drop the oil; the Magma and Blazing Elementals drifting among them drop the hearts. The Dark Iron Taskmasters and Slavers drive the slaves on the paths; a Slaver may drop the Grimesilt Outhouse Key: keep it.\nThe Searing Lava Spiders roam the plateaus and lava pools in the south-west of the gorge.\nThe Slag Pit opens in the north of the Cauldron. Incendosaurs swim in its lava pools: pull them to the edge. The secret plans lie on the pit's upper ledge.\nCareful: Dark Iron Slavers (level 45-46) call for help from allies within 15 yd when pulled, cast Net from up to 15 yd, and use Rend in melee. The biggest Incendosaurs and Lava Spiders are 49: pull them one at a time."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:38",["text"]="Velarok Windblade",["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:38:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8479,["npcName"]="Velarok Windblade",["x"]=0.3906,["title"]="The Flawless Flame",["quest"]=3442,["y"]=0.3899},{["map"]=1427,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:38:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8479,["y"]=0.3899,["x"]=0.3906,["title"]="Forging the Shaft",["npcName"]="Velarok Windblade",["pre"]={3442},["qlvl"]=48,["quest"]=3443,["minLevel"]=40}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:32:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14626,["npcName"]="Taskmaster Scrange",["x"]=0.3897,["title"]="JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition",["quest"]=7729,["y"]=0.2751},{["map"]=1427,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:32:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14627,["npcName"]="Hansel Heavyhands",["x"]=0.3858,["title"]="Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It",["quest"]=7727,["y"]=0.2781},{["map"]=1427,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:32:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14627,["npcName"]="Hansel Heavyhands",["x"]=0.3858,["title"]="Fiery Menace!",["quest"]=7724,["y"]=0.2781},{["map"]=1427,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:32:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14627,["npcName"]="Hansel Heavyhands",["x"]=0.3858,["title"]="Curse These Fat Fingers",["quest"]=7723,["y"]=0.2781},{["map"]=1427,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:32:6",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14624,["npcName"]="Master Smith Burninate",["x"]=0.38799999999999996,["title"]="What the Flux?",["quest"]=7722,["y"]=0.2851}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:39",["text"]="Thorium Point",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride back north to Thorium Point, just past Velarok Windblade."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["itemName"]="Thorium Plated Dagger",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:40:1",["t"]="collect",["count"]=8,["quest"]=3443,["y"]=0.2783,["x"]=0.39909999999999995,["title"]="Forging the Shaft",["lvl"]=48,["fromNpcsAt"]="1,6;5;6,5;6,5;1,6,5;1,5,4,6;7;7,5;7;1,6,5;7;3,8;9;2,3;5,6;1,5,6;1,5,6;1,5,6;1,5,6",["item"]=10551,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1427,["itemName"]="Smithing Tuyere",["oi"]=1,["count"]=1,["fromId"]=5840,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=7728,["lvl"]=47,["y"]=0.4833,["x"]=0.40009999999999996,["item"]=18959,["from"]="Dark Iron Steamsmith",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:40:2",["title"]="STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:40",["text"]="The Steamsmiths' furnaces",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Dark Iron Steamsmiths work the furnaces in the middle of the Cauldron; half of them carry a Thorium Plated Dagger, one in ten the Smithing Tuyere. Slaves, Slavers and Taskmasters carry daggers too."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:41",["text"]="Velarok Windblade",["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:41:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8479,["npcName"]="Velarok Windblade",["x"]=0.3906,["title"]="Forging the Shaft",["quest"]=3443,["y"]=0.3899},{["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:27:2",["text"]="His next request needs the Symbol of Ragnaros from elite cultists: leave it.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["itemName"]="Lookout's Spyglass",["oi"]=2,["spread"]=true,["fromId"]=8566,["t"]="collect",["quest"]=7728,["count"]=1,["y"]=0.5192,["x"]=0.3371,["item"]=18960,["from"]="Dark Iron Lookout",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:goal:42:1",["title"]="STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass",["fromKind"]="npc",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:42",["text"]="Dark Iron Lookouts",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Dark Iron Lookouts stand on the ridges around the sentry towers south of the Cauldron; about one in ten carries the Lookout's Spyglass."},{["goals"]={{["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:31:1",["t"]="accept",["title"]="The Key to Freedom",["itemName"]="Grimesilt Outhouse Key",["qlvl"]=47,["minLevel"]=43,["quest"]=4451,["item"]=11818},{["map"]=1427,["optional"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:31:2",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.6217,["x"]=0.6559,["title"]="The Key to Freedom",["objName"]="Wooden Outhouse",["quest"]=4451,["object"]=173265}},["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:31",["text"]="The Key to Freedom",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Only with the Grimesilt Outhouse Key: back east to the Wooden Outhouse at the dig site."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:step:44",["text"]="Thorium Point",["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/40-50/04-tanaris:32:4",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=14626,["npcName"]="Taskmaster Scrange",["x"]=0.3897,["title"]="STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass",["quest"]=7728,["y"]=0.2751}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1425,["id"]="polestar:forever/horde/40-50/05-the-hinterlands",["next"]="polestar:forever/horde/40-50/06-azshara",["max"]=51,["min"]=49,["availability"]="source-listed",["name"]="The Hinterlands & Blasted Lands (49-51)",["faction"]="Horde",["category"]="Leveling",["zoneName"]="The Hinterlands",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["steps"]={{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/40-50/05-the-hinterlands:step:1",["text"]="Fly to Tarren Mill",["goals"]={{["map"]=1427,["x"]=0.348,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/h