Plaguelands. The Scarlet Crusade's tents stand just past Felstone Farm, between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears. Torch the command tent with the Box of Incendiaries and plant the Scourge banner. Careful: the Scarlets around the tents reach 54 and the Invokers cast: come in from the side nearest the command tent and leave the others be."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["note"]="Upstairs",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/01-un-goro-crater:goal:60:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10778,["npcName"]="Janice Felstone",["x"]=0.384,["title"]="Better Late Than Never",["y"]=0.5405,["qlvl"]=52,["quest"]=5021,["minLevel"]=50},{["map"]=1422,["note"]="Janice's Parcel, beside the house; inside",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/01-un-goro-crater:goal:60:2",["t"]="turnin",["y"]=0.5524,["x"]=0.3873,["title"]="Better Late Than Never",["objName"]="Janice's Parcel",["quest"]=5021,["object"]=175894},{["map"]=1422,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/01-un-goro-crater:goal:60:3",["t"]="accept",["object"]=175894,["y"]=0.5524,["x"]=0.3873,["qlvl"]=52,["objName"]="Janice's Parcel",["pre"]={5021},["minLevel"]=50,["quest"]=5023,["title"]="Better Late Than Never"},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/01-un-goro-crater:goal:60:4",["text"]="Keep the parcel: Royal Overseer Bauhaus is in the Undercity. The next guide starts with Mulgris Deepriver by the Writhing Haunt, south-east of here.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/01-un-goro-crater:step:60",["text"]="Janice Felstone",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back a few steps west to Felstone Farm, the first farm along the road; Janice Felstone waits in the house."}}},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"