"refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/04-azshara:step:22",["text"]="Ruins of Eldarath: Some Rune",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride south to the northern edge of the Ruins of Eldarath. The Spitelash Sirens and Myrmidons (50-52) there carry Kim'jael's rune; it doesn't drop often, so work your way along the edge until it does."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/04-azshara:goal:23:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8420,["npcName"]="Kim'jael",["x"]=0.5345,["title"]="Kim'jael's \"Missing\" Equipment",["quest"]=5534,["y"]=0.2182}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/04-azshara:step:23",["text"]="Kim'jael",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back north to Kim'jael with the rune, then south-west along the road."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/04-azshara:goal:24:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=235903,["npcName"]="Ekkal",["x"]=0.42,["title"]="The Legashi Threat",["quest"]=86746,["y"]=0.38880000000000003}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/04-azshara:step:24",["text"]="Ekkal",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="South-west along the road: Ekkal takes the satyrs."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1447,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/04-azshara:goal:25:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=8576,["npcName"]="Ag'tor Bloodfist",["x"]=0.22260000000000002,["title"]="An Explosive Gambit",["quest"]=91500,["y"]=0.5147999999999999},{["map"]=1447,["note"]="Ag'tor Bloodfist: Revenge Exacted, for Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/04-azshara:goal:25:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=8576,["y"]=0.5147999999999999,["x"]=0.22260000000000002,["title"]="Revenge E