 Hill",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride north up the road from Tarren Mill. Marlene Redpath's house stands by the road at Sorrow Hill, and Joseph Redpath's monument is in the graveyard behind it."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["note"]="Upstairs",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:goal:14:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10667,["npcName"]="Chromie",["x"]=0.3946,["title"]="A Strange Historian",["quest"]=5153,["y"]=0.6676000000000001},{["map"]=1422,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:goal:14:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=10667,["y"]=0.6676000000000001,["x"]=0.3946,["title"]="The Annals of Darrowshire",["npcName"]="Chromie",["pre"]={5153},["qlvl"]=56,["quest"]=5154,["minLevel"]=50}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:step:14",["text"]="Chromie",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride north-west into Andorhal. Chromie waits in the ruined inn on the west side of town; the skeletons inside are 54-57, so keep to the edges."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1422,["itemName"]="Annals of Darrowshire",["oi"]=1,["group"]={["rank"]=1,["kind"]="elite",["near"]=true,["lvl"]=59},["fromId"]=176150,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="object",["item"]=12900,["y"]=0.695,["x"]=0.434,["title"]="The Annals of Darrowshire",["from"]="Musty Tome",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:goal:15:1",["count"]=1,["quest"]=5154,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:step:15",["text"]="The Annals of Darrowshire",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The Annals lie among the Musty Tomes in Andorhal's town hall; open them until you find the right one.\nCareful: a Fallen Hero, a level 58-59 elite, can stand in Andorhal, as at many