the Pestilent Scar, among Blighted Horrors and Plague Monstrosities."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1423,["x"]=0.523,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["y"]=0.5820000000000001,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:goal:28:1",["t"]="goto",["text"]="Corin's Crossing",["area"]=2264},{["map"]=1423,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:goal:28:2",["t"]="talk",["npc"]=11064,["npcName"]="Darrowshire Spirit",["x"]=0.5172,["title"]="Defenders of Darrowshire",["y"]=0.5832,["text"]="Free Darrowshire Spirits: talk to them",["quest"]=5211,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["itemName"]="Living Rot",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=15447,["spread"]=true,["map"]=1423,["fromId"]=8531,["fromNpcsAt"]="2,6,3,4,1,5;1,2,3,6;4;5;4;2,5;4,5;2;4;4;4;4;2,3,4,5,6;2,6,1,3,4;2,1,4,5,6;4;4;4;4;2,5;4;4,2;4,2;4;2,4,5;4;4",["fromAlsoId"]=8541,["from"]="Gibbering Ghoul",["y"]=0.5832,["x"]=0.5172,["count"]=7,["lvl"]=58,["fromAlso"]="Hate Shrieker",["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="npc",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:goal:28:3"},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:goal:28:4",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Coagulated Rot"}},["title"]="To Kill With Purpose",["startItemName"]="Mortar and Pestle",["startItem"]=15454,["t"]="complete",["quest"]=6022,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/05-eastern-plaguelands:step:28",["text"]="Corin's Crossing",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride south to Corin's Crossing, on the road. Living Rot spoils within ten minutes: kill the town's Scourge quickly and grind the seven pieces with the Mortar and Pestle at once.\nCareful: Unseen Servants call for help within 25 yd once they drop to 40% health. Out of combat they also turn invisible with Greater Invisibility. If 