"]=1126,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:step:5",["text"]="Hive in the Tower",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back to Southwind and climb the tower. Stirring the hive at the top brings out Hive'Ashi Ambushers; one carries the Encrusted Silithid Object."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:step:6",["text"]="The Spirits of Southwind",["goals"]={{["itemName"]="Reliquary of Purity",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=22201,["quest"]=5527,["map"]=1451,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=179565,["t"]="collect",["carriedTo"]="forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood",["y"]=0.5535,["x"]=0.6323,["title"]="A Reliquary of Purity",["from"]="Dusty Reliquary",["count"]=1,["note"]="Inside",["fromKind"]="object",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:goal:6:1"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1451,["x"]=0.645,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["text"]="Dredge Strikers",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:goal:7:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.41,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=57}}},{["map"]=1451,["note"]="grind on Dredge Striker",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/06-silithus:goal:7:2",["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=57}},["npcName"]="Dredge Striker",["x"]=0.6403,["lvl"]=56,["y"]=0.44079999999999997,["level"]=57,["spread"]=true,["grind"]=11740}},["detail"]="The Dredge Crushers (57-58) of the south-east are two over you below 57. First top up to 57 on the Dredge Strikers (55-56) on the sands east of Cenarion Hold, where Sand Skitterers and Stonelash Scorpids (54-56) roam among them, away from the Silithid Darters of the northern sands. Or, with a group, run the Blackrock Spire dungeon (Lower) or the Scholomance dungeon instead.",["id"]="refresh:forever-202