g Past Secrets",["quest"]=6845,["y"]=0.451},{["id"]="forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:11:3",["text"]="Rabine Saturna's Shards of the Felvine needs Dire Maul. Skip it.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:step:23",["text"]="Umber",["goals"]={{["map"]=1450,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:23:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11939,["y"]=0.35600000000000004,["npcName"]="Umber",["x"]=0.44880000000000003,["title"]="Under the Chitin Was...",["direct"]=true,["pre"]={6845},["qlvl"]=57,["quest"]=1185,["minLevel"]=54}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:step:24",["text"]="Winterspring",["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["x"]=0.313,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:24:1",["text"]="Donova Snowden",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.452}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["note"]="From Krakle in Un'Goro",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:25:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9298,["npcName"]="Donova Snowden",["x"]=0.3127,["title"]="The New Springs",["quest"]=980,["y"]=0.45159999999999995},{["map"]=1452,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:25:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=9298,["y"]=0.45159999999999995,["x"]=0.3127,["title"]="Strange Sources",["npcName"]="Donova Snowden",["pre"]={980},["qlvl"]=56,["quest"]=4842,["minLevel"]=51},{["map"]=1452,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:25:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9298,["npcName"]="Donova Snowden",["x"]=0.3127,["title"]="Toxic Horrors",["quest"]=5086,["y"]=0.45159999999999995},{["map"]=1452,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:25:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=9298,["y"]=0.45159999999999995,["x"]=0.3127,["title"]="Winterfall Runners",["npcName"]="Donova Snowden",["pre"]={5086},["qlvl"]=57,["quest"]=5087,["minLevel"]=52}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:step:25",["text"]="Donova Snowden",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Back into the Timbermaw tunnel and take the Winterspring exit; Donova Snowden camps by the hot springs just outside."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["itemName"]="Winterfall Crate",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=10916,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Winterfall Runners",["fromKind"]="npc",["y"]=0.3448,["x"]=0.27899999999999997,["count"]=1,["from"]="Winterfall Runner",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:26:1",["item"]=12829,["quest"]=5087,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:step:26",["text"]="Winterfall Runners",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The runners walk the road from Timbermaw Hold toward Winterfall Village in small groups; wait by the road near Donova Snowden and kill them as they pass. Each one carries a crate.\nCareful: Turning in spawns three or four level 56-57 Winterfall ambushers that attack you; you can escape them while mounted, in stealth or with Feign Death, and they then gather by the lake so you can take the next quest."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:step:27",["text"]="Salfa",["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:27:1",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=11556,["npcName"]="Salfa",["x"]=0.2773,["title"]="Winterfall Activity",["y"]=0.345,["qlvl"]=58,["quest"]=8464,["minLevel"]=45},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:27:2",["text"]="Winterfall Activity's village is north-east of Everlook, on this guide's way back from Darkwhisper Gorge.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["note"]="Below ground",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:28:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11557,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="complete",["q"]=6031}},["npcName"]="Meilosh",["x"]=0.6568999999999999,["title"]="Runecloth",["quest"]=6031,["y"]=0.0281}},["detail"]="With 30 Runecloth in your bags: follow the road north to Timbermaw Hold; Meilosh trades just inside the entrance.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:step:28",["text"]="Meilosh",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="complete",["q"]=6031}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1448,["note"]="Kernda walks around here: look inside the circle on the map",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:29:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11558,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={8470}}},["npcName"]="Kernda",["x"]=0.655,["title"]="Deadwood Ritual Totem",["quest"]=8470,["y"]=0.0352}},["detail"]="The Deadwood totem from Felpaw Village, if Kernda didn't take it then: she waits at the tunnel mouth of Timbermaw Hold and speaks to you from Neutral with the Timbermaw, which the Deadwood furbolgs of Felwood brought you to.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:step:29",["text"]="Kernda",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["k"]="onquest",["q"]={8470}}}},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:step:30",["text"]="Winterspring",["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["x"]=0.598,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:30:1",["text"]="Darkwhisper Gorge",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.743}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["x"]=0.598,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:31:1",["text"]="Darkwhisper Gorge",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.742},{["title"]="Strange Sources",["objs"]={{["count"]=1,["text"]="Discover Darkwhisper Gorge"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:31:2",["t"]="complete",["quest"]=4842,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:step:31",["text"]="Darkwhisper Gorge",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride east, then south down Frostwhisper Gorge. The Frostmaul giants there are elite level 59: keep to the middle and keep moving. The strange source is at the mouth of Darkwhisper Gorge, at the south end."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["x"]=0.601,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["text"]="Rabid Shardtooth",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:32:1",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.7120000000000001,["soloWhen"]={{["frac"]=0.9,["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=59}}},{["map"]=1452,["frac"]=0.9,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:32:2",["t"]="level",["soloWhen"]={{["frac"]=0.9,["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=59}},["npcName"]="Rabid Shardtooth",["x"]=0.6006,["note"]="grind on Rabid Shardtooth",["lvl"]=60,["y"]=0.7149,["level"]=59,["spread"]=true,["grind"]=7446}},["detail"]="Top up here to level 59.9 before the hand-ins at Winterspring: they take you to level 60. The Rabid Shardtooths (59) of Frostwhisper Gorge, just north of the strange source, give far more experience than the furbolgs by Timbermaw Hold. Or, with a group, run the Scholomance dungeon or the Stratholme dungeon instead.",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:step:32",["text"]="Level 59.9",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["soloWhen"]={{["frac"]=0.9,["op"]="<",["k"]="level",["n"]=59}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:33:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=10978,["y"]=0.386,["x"]=0.615,["title"]="Are We There, Yeti?",["text"]="Scare Legacki with Umi's Mechanical Yeti",["target"]="Legacki",["count"]=1,["quest"]=5163,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:step:33",["text"]="Are We There, Yeti?",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride north to Everlook."},{["id"]="forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:15",["text"]="Everlook",["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:15:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=10305,["npcName"]="Umi Rumplesnicker",["x"]=0.6088,["title"]="Are We There, Yeti?",["quest"]=5163,["y"]=0.3762}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:35:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7440,["count"]=8,["y"]=0.3497,["x"]=0.6595,["title"]="Winterfall Activity",["lvl"]=56,["target"]="Winterfall Den Watcher",["quest"]=8464,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1452,["oi"]=3,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:35:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7438,["y"]=0.37070000000000003,["x"]=0.6666,["title"]="Winterfall Activity",["lvl"]=58,["target"]="Winterfall Ursa",["count"]=8,["quest"]=8464,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1452,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:35:3",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=7439,["y"]=0.3566,["x"]=0.6759000000000001,["title"]="Winterfall Activity",["lvl"]=57,["target"]="Winterfall Shaman",["count"]=8,["quest"]=8464,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:step:35",["text"]="Winterfall Village",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="The furbolg village fills the valley north-east of Everlook. Kill Shamans first; they heal. High Chief Winterfall (59, elite) and Xandivious (62) are in the cave at the back: stay out."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:36:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9298,["npcName"]="Donova Snowden",["x"]=0.3127,["title"]="Strange Sources",["quest"]=4842,["y"]=0.45159999999999995},{["map"]=1452,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:36:2",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=9298,["npcName"]="Donova Snowden",["x"]=0.3127,["title"]="Winterfall Runners",["quest"]=5087,["y"]=0.45159999999999995},{["id"]="forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:14:3",["text"]="Donova Snowden next sends you after High Chief Winterfall, an elite in his cave. Skip it.",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["t"]="note"}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:step:36",["text"]="Donova Snowden",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Ride back west along the road to Frostfire Hot Springs."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:37:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=11556,["npcName"]="Salfa",["x"]=0.2773,["title"]="Winterfall Activity",["quest"]=8464,["y"]=0.345}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:step:37",["text"]="Salfa",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="North of Donova, at the tunnel's Winterspring exit."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1452,["x"]=0.316,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood:goal:38:1",["text"]="Frostfire W