ny of them drops a Searing Collar. Gazz'uz, a level 14 warlock, stands deep inside and drops the Eye of Burning Shadow.\nCareful: voidwalkers fight beside the Burning Blade cultists in Skull Rock and Gazz'uz (14) waits at the back with his own: pull one cultist at a time near the entrance for the collars. The Eye of Burning Shadow is optional: leave Gazz'uz unless you are 13 or have a friend."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1411,["itemName"]="Tablet of Verga",["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=58595,["t"]="collect",["title"]="Creature of the Void",["fromKind"]="object",["y"]=0.09759999999999999,["x"]=0.5162,["count"]=1,["from"]="Burning Blade Stash",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/orc/01-durotar:goal:84:1",["item"]=6535,["quest"]=1501,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/orc/01-durotar:step:84",["text"]="Tablet of Verga",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARLOCK"}},["detail"]="The Burning Blade Stash stands in Skull Rock, among the cultists you just fought."},{["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/orc/01-durotar:step:85",["text"]="Margoz",["goals"]={{["map"]=1411,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/orc/01-durotar:goal:85:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3208,["npcName"]="Margoz",["x"]=0.5640999999999999,["title"]="Skull Rock",["quest"]=827,["y"]=0.2004},{["map"]=1411,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/orc/01-durotar:goal:85:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=3208,["y"]=0.2004,["x"]=0.5640999999999999,["title"]="Neeru Fireblade",["npcName"]="Margoz",["pre"]={827},["qlvl"]=12,["quest"]=829,["minLevel"]=4}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1411,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/orc/01-durotar:goal:86:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3142,["npcName"]="Orgnil Soulscar",["x"]=0.5