Grimshot",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.185}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/troll/01-durotar:step:93",["text"]="Orgrimmar",["only"]={["classes"]={"HUNTER"}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1454,["note"]="Ormak Grimshot: Beast Training",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/troll/01-durotar:goal:94:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=3352,["npcName"]="Ormak Grimshot",["x"]=0.6605,["title"]="Training the Beast",["quest"]=6081,["y"]=0.18530000000000002}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/troll/01-durotar:step:94",["text"]="Ormak Grimshot",["only"]={["classes"]={"HUNTER"}},["detail"]="Follow the road north from Far Watch Post to Orgrimmar's main gate, just west of Skull Rock. Ormak Grimshot stands with the hunter trainers in the Valley of Honor."},{["detail"]="While you're here: learn Staves from Hanashi (Valley of Honor, 10 silver); a Hunter's melee weapon is mostly its stats, and two-handers carry the most.",["goals"]={{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/troll/01-durotar:goal:95:1",["t"]="train",["npc"]=2704,["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="money",["n"]=1000},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="skill",["name"]="Staves",["skillLine"]=136,["n"]=1}},["npcName"]="Hanashi",["x"]=0.8153,["y"]=0.1963}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/troll/01-durotar:step:95",["text"]="Hanashi",["only"]={["classes"]={"HUNTER"}},["soloWhen"]={{["op"]=">=",["k"]="money",["n"]=1000},{["neg"]=true,["k"]="skill",["name"]="Staves",["skillLine"]=136,["n"]=1}}},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1454,["x"]=0.556,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/troll/01-durotar:goal:96:1",["text"]="Orgrimmar's Valley of Strength",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.723}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/troll/01-durotar:step:96",["text"]="To Orgrimmar",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="Follow the road north from Far Watch Post to Orgrimmar's main gate. The next guide starts in Orgrimmar: Neeru Fireblade takes the cultists' quest, the trainers teach your new ranks, and the zeppelin leaves from the towers outside the gate for Tirisfal Glades and Silverpine Forest. The Barrens come after Silverpine."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/troll/01-durotar:goal:97:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5875,["npcName"]="Gan'rul Bloodeye",["x"]=0.4825,["title"]="Creature of the Void",["quest"]=1501,["y"]=0.45280000000000004},{["map"]=1454,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/troll/01-durotar:goal:97:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=5875,["y"]=0.45280000000000004,["x"]=0.4825,["title"]="The Binding",["npcName"]="Gan'rul Bloodeye",["pre"]={1501},["qlvl"]=11,["quest"]=1504,["minLevel"]=10},{["map"]=1454,["itemName"]="Glyphs of Summoning",["item"]=7464,["x"]=0.493,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/troll/01-durotar:goal:97:3",["t"]="use",["y"]=0.5,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1454,["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/troll/01-durotar:goal:97:4",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=5676,["y"]=0.5,["x"]=0.493,["title"]="The Binding",["target"]="Summoned Voidwalker",["count"]=1,["quest"]=1504,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1454,["note"]="Gan'rul Bloodeye: Summon Voidwalker",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/troll/01-durotar:goal:97:5",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=5875,["npcName"]="Gan'rul Bloodeye",["x"]=0.4825,["title"]="The Binding",["quest"]=1504,["y"]=0.45280000000000004}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/troll/01-durotar:step:97",["text"]="The Binding",["only"]={["classes"]={"WARLOCK"}},["detail"]="Gan'rul Bloodeye stands in the Cleft of Shadow, the canyon under the Valley of Strength. Hand him the Tablet of Verga, then use the Glyphs of Summoning on the summoning circle beside him and defeat the voidwalker to bind it.\nCareful: the voidwalker you summon hits hard and it is the fight Warlocks die to most in Orgrimmar: start at full health and mana, send your imp in, keep Corruption and Immolate on it, and use a healthstone if you have one."}},["max"]=12,["name"]="Durotar (1-12)",["min"]=1,["availability"]="source-listed",["races"]={"Troll"},["faction"]="Horde",["category"]="Leveling",["zoneName"]="Durotar",["refreshRevision"]="forever-20261117-b753c783",["next"]="polestar:forever/horde/03-silverpine-forest"},{["revision"]="b753c783be39ccf9c91a94b1bfcb67ce01932d52",["source"]="Polestar GPL-3.0; simulation-derived Forever route",["zone"]=1420,["id"]="polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades",["steps"]={{["goals"]={{["map"]=1420,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["endNpcs"]={1569},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:goal:1:1",["t"]="accept",["xp"]=40,["npc"]=1568,["y"]=0.7165,["x"]=0.30219999999999997,["title"]="Rude Awakening",["npcName"]="Undertaker Mordo",["closedBy"]={364},["qlvl"]=1,["quest"]=363,["minLevel"]=1}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:step:1",["text"]="Undertaker Mordo",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="You rise in the crypt at the south end of Deathknell. Undertaker Mordo waits just outside."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1420,["note"]="Inside",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:2:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=1569,["npcName"]="Shadow Priest Sarvis",["x"]=0.3084,["title"]="Rude Awakening",["quest"]=363,["y"]=0.662},{["map"]=1420,["crumbs"]={363},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/