h to Garren's Haunt, the Rot Hide camp on the hill south of the shore. Maggot Eye (level 11) stands in the hut: clear the gnolls around him first.\nCareful: Gnoll guards stand outside the hut and can join the fight. If you slip past them and fight him inside, he fights alone."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1420,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:goal:79:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=267008,["npcName"]="Leonid Barthalomew the Revered",["x"]=0.22030000000000002,["title"]="Bandarion Keep",["quest"]=96899,["y"]=0.4473},{["map"]=1420,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:goal:79:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=267008,["y"]=0.4473,["x"]=0.22030000000000002,["title"]="A Righteous Cause",["npcName"]="Leonid Barthalomew the Revered",["pre"]={96899},["qlvl"]=12,["quest"]=96896,["minLevel"]=10},{["map"]=1420,["note"]="Listen to Leonid and Danitha Morr, then talk to him again",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:goal:79:3",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=267008,["npcName"]="Leonid Barthalomew the Revered",["x"]=0.22030000000000002,["title"]="A Righteous Cause",["quest"]=96896,["y"]=0.4473},{["map"]=1420,["preAll"]={96896,96899},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:goal:79:4",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=246389,["y"]=0.4725,["x"]=0.21960000000000002,["title"]="As Above, So Below",["npcName"]="Hilda the Breaker",["qlvl"]=12,["quest"]=99152,["minLevel"]=10},{["map"]=1420,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:goal:79:5",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=259190,["y"]=0.46490000000000004,["x"]=0.20170000000000002,["title"]="The One That Got Away",["npcName"]="Ephram Barbaro",["pre"]={96896},["qlvl"]=12,["quest"]=99153,["minLevel"]=10}},["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:step:79",["text"]="Leonid Barthalomew the Revered",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["detail"]="West from Garren's Haunt past Agamand Mills to the Whispering Forest. Leonid stands just north of Hilda the Breaker's camp.\nHilda the Breaker and Ephram Barbaro camp at the forest's edge just south of Leonid. Every class can take both quests once A Righteous Cause is handed in (level 10). They send you into the cellar under Shadowvale, the next stop."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1420,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:goal:80:1",["t"]="turnin",["npc"]=246349,["npcName"]="Breton Samuels",["x"]=0.21850000000000003,["title"]="A Second Home",["quest"]=91282,["y"]=0.4523},{["map"]=1420,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:goal:80:2",["t"]="accept",["npc"]=246349,["npcName"]="Breton Samuels",["x"]=0.21850000000000003,["title"]="Murlocs at the Gates",["y"]=0.4523,["qlvl"]=11,["quest"]=91285,["minLevel"]=7}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:step:80",["text"]="Paladin: Bandarion Keep",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["detail"]="Breton Samuels waits at the keep's gate beside Leonid."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1420,["note"]="Vile Fin Attackers",["oi"]=1,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:goal:81:1",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=250283,["count"]=8,["y"]=0.4974,["x"]=0.2384,["title"]="Murlocs at the Gates",["lvl"]=11,["target"]="Vile Fin Attacker",["quest"]=91285,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["map"]=1420,["note"]="Vile Fin Seers",["oi"]=2,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:goal:81:2",["t"]="kill",["npc"]=250282,["count"]=8,["y"]=0.49729999999999996,["x"]=0.24359999999999998,["title"]="Murlocs at the Gates",["lvl"]=10,["target"]="Vile Fin Seer",["quest"]=91285,["spread"]=true,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true}},["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:step:81",["text"]="Paladin: Murlocs at the Gates",["only"]={["classes"]={"PALADIN"}},["detail"]="The Vile Fin murlocs lurk on the bluffs just east of the keep and in the camps around the lake to the south-west, on the way down to Shadowvale."},{["goals"]={{["map"]=1420,["x"]=0.129,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:goal:82:1",["text"]="the basement under the ruined house",["t"]="goto",["y"]=0.657},{["itemName"]="Bottle of Whispering Elixir",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["group"]={["rank"]=1,["kind"]="elite",["near"]=true,["lvl"]=13},["item"]=268801,["quest"]=95314,["map"]=1420,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=630871,["t"]="collect",["y"]=0.664,["x"]=0.11800000000000001,["title"]="That Shadowvale Green Elixir",["from"]="Bottle",["note"]="Below ground",["count"]=8,["fromKind"]="object",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:goal:82:2"},{["map"]=1420,["itemName"]="Glowing Crystal Fragment",["oi"]=1,["note"]="the Glowing Crystal Fragment, at the basement's south end",["fromId"]=694895,["t"]="collect",["fromKind"]="object",["item"]=286269,["y"]=0.6943,["x"]=0.0974,["title"]="The One That Got Away",["from"]="Glowing Crystal Fragment",["id"]="refresh:forever-20261117-b753c783:polestar:forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades:goal:82:3",["count"]=1,["quest"]=99153,["sourceRouteConditions"]=true},{["itemName"]="Faintly Glowing Bone",["sourceRouteConditions"]=true,["item"]=286259,["quest"]=99152,["map"]=1420,["oi"]=1,["fromId"]=260432,["t"]="collect",["note"]="the Shadowvale Lurchers and Mystics drop the bones; below groun